starter: []
rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If multiple cards are drawn at once, this card triggers once for each card drawn.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'In a multi-player game, it affects all opponents.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it’s not a card drawn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a creature doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Portent of Betrayal tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Portent of Betrayal can target any creature, even one that\'s untapped or one you already control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Enchantment creatures with bestow from the Theros block aren’t Aura cards in your library. You can’t find one with Heliod’s Pilgrim.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "A chapter ability doesn\'t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter\'s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won\'t trigger again."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn\'t use the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Because a Saga isn\'t sacrificed until after its last ability has resolved, you still control the creature you took with The Akroan War\'s first ability while the last ability is resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Each symbol on the left of a Saga\'s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability\'s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If The Akroan War leaves the battlefield before its first ability resolves, you won\'t gain control of the creature at all."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a creature can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player\'s control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, the player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If the creature you took with The Akroan War\'s first ability has an ability that triggers when you sacrifice The Akroan War, you control the resulting trigger. If it has an ability that triggers when The Akroan War is put into a graveyard “from anywhere,” check whether that ability should trigger only after the creature\'s former controller has regained control of it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won\'t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities, the Saga\'s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn\'t use the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Removing lore counters won\'t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger. If lore counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "A creature entering the battlefield at the same time as Renata won\'t get an additional +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don\'t count toward your devotion to any color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a creature you control would normally enter the battlefield with no +1/+1 counters on it, Renata\'s second ability causes it to enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it\'s still on the battlefield at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you put an Aura on an opponent\'s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don\'t count toward your devotion to any color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Renata\'s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "A spell or ability that counters spells can still target spells that can\'t be countered. When that spell or ability resolves, the uncounterable spell won\'t be countered, but any additional effects of the countering spell or ability will still happen."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Destiny Spinner\'s activated ability doesn\'t untap the land that becomes a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Destiny Spinner\'s first ability applies only while it\'s on the battlefield. While it\'s a spell, it can be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you activate Destiny Spinner\'s ability more than once in a turn, the value of X may be different each time. If you choose the same land as the target more than once, the most recent effect (and most recent value of X) applies."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you control no enchantments at the time Destiny Spinner\'s activated ability resolves, the land becomes a 0/0 creature and is put into its owner\'s graveyard unless another effect is raising its toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Destiny Spinner\'s activated ability resolves. Once that happens, the creature\'s base power and toughness won\'t change later in the turn even if the number of enchantments you control changes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "After an escaped spell resolves, it returns to its owner\'s graveyard if it\'s not a permanent spell. If it is a permanent spell, it enters the battlefield and will return to its owner\'s graveyard if it dies later. Perhaps it will escape again—good underworld security is so hard to come by these days."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "An opponent loses 3 life if they discard a land card or if they can\'t discard a card at all."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "As the second ability resolves, first the next opponent in turn order (or, if it\'s an opponent\'s turn, the opponent whose turn it is) chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then each other opponent in turn order does the same. All the chosen cards are discarded at the same time, and then the appropriate players lose 3 life each."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Escape\'s permission doesn\'t change when you may cast the spell from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a card has multiple abilities giving you permission to cast it, such as two escape abilities or an escape ability and a flashback ability, you choose which one to apply. The others have no effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a card with escape is put into your graveyard during your turn, you\'ll be able to cast it right away if it\'s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with its escape permission, you can\'t choose to apply any other alternative costs or to cast it without paying its mana cost. If it has any additional costs, you must pay those."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Kroxa\'s first ability causes you to sacrifice it if you didn\'t cast it, or if it was cast using any permission other than an escape ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Kroxa\'s second ability triggers when it enters the battlefield, even if it didn\'t escape."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Once you begin casting a spell with escape, it immediately moves to the stack. Players can\'t take any other actions until you\'re done casting the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an escape cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was and no matter whether an alternative cost was paid."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "After an escaped spell resolves, it returns to its owner\'s graveyard if it\'s not a permanent spell. If it is a permanent spell, it enters the battlefield and will return to its owner\'s graveyard if it dies later. Perhaps it will escape again—good underworld security is so hard to come by these days."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Escape\'s permission doesn\'t change when you may cast the spell from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a card has multiple abilities giving you permission to cast it, such as two escape abilities or an escape ability and a flashback ability, you choose which one to apply. The others have no effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a card has no mana cost, its escape cost is an unpayable cost, so you can\'t cast it for that cost."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a card with escape is put into your graveyard during your turn, you\'ll be able to cast it right away if it\'s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a spell you\'re casting with escape has an additional cost of discarding cards or sacrificing permanents, you may exile cards discarded or sacrificed this way to pay that part of its escape cost."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with its escape permission, you can\'t choose to apply any other alternative costs or to cast it without paying its mana cost. If it has any additional costs, you must pay those."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you\'re casting an adventurer card or split card with escape, you choose how you wish to cast it, then pay the appropriate cost (for the Adventure, the creature, or the half of the split card you chose) plus exiling three cards."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Once you begin casting a spell with escape, it immediately moves to the stack. Players can\'t take any other actions until you\'re done casting the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an escape cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was and no matter whether an alternative cost was paid."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "After an escaped spell resolves, it returns to its owner\'s graveyard if it\'s not a permanent spell. If it is a permanent spell, it enters the battlefield and will return to its owner\'s graveyard if it dies later. Perhaps it will escape again—good underworld security is so hard to come by these days."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Escape\'s permission doesn\'t change when you may cast the spell from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a card has multiple abilities giving you permission to cast it, such as two escape abilities or an escape ability and a flashback ability, you choose which one to apply. The others have no effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a card with escape is put into your graveyard during your turn, you\'ll be able to cast it right away if it\'s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with its escape permission, you can\'t choose to apply any other alternative costs or to cast it without paying its mana cost. If it has any additional costs, you must pay those."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Once you begin casting a spell with escape, it immediately moves to the stack. Players can\'t take any other actions until you\'re done casting the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an escape cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was and no matter whether an alternative cost was paid."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'You draw three cards, even if you discard no cards.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "After an escaped spell resolves, it returns to its owner\'s graveyard if it\'s not a permanent spell. If it is a permanent spell, it enters the battlefield and will return to its owner\'s graveyard if it dies later. Perhaps it will escape again—good underworld security is so hard to come by these days."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Escape\'s permission doesn\'t change when you may cast the spell from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a card has multiple abilities giving you permission to cast it, such as two escape abilities or an escape ability and a flashback ability, you choose which one to apply. The others have no effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a card with escape is put into your graveyard during your turn, you\'ll be able to cast it right away if it\'s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with its escape permission, you can\'t choose to apply any other alternative costs or to cast it without paying its mana cost. If it has any additional costs, you must pay those."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Once you begin casting a spell with escape, it immediately moves to the stack. Players can\'t take any other actions until you\'re done casting the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an escape cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was and no matter whether an alternative cost was paid."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Among abilities, only activated and triggered abilities use the stack. Activated abilities are written in the form “[Cost]: [Effect].” Triggered abilities use the word “when,” “whenever,” or “at.” They\'re often written as “[Trigger condition], [effect].” Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder texts, and some keyword abilities are triggered abilities and will have “when,” “whenever,” or “at” in their reminder texts."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "As Whirlwind Denial resolves, first the opponent whose turn it is (or, if it\'s your turn, the next opponent in turn order) chooses which spells and/or abilities to pay for, then pays that amount. Then each other opponent in turn order does the same. Then all spells and abilities that weren\'t paid for are countered at the same time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, damage previously dealt to a creature with indestructible may cause it to be destroyed if Shadowspear\'s second ability resolves during that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a permanent enters the battlefield under an opponent\'s control with hexproof or indestructible after Shadowspear\'s second ability resolves, it won\'t lose that ability unless you activate Shadowspear\'s second ability again. The same is true if an opponent\'s permanent gains indestructible or hexproof after Shadowspear\'s second ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "You can activate Shadowspear\'s second ability whether or not it\'s equipped to a creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don\'t count toward your devotion to any color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it\'s still on the battlefield at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you put an Aura on an opponent\'s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don\'t count toward your devotion to any color."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'The amount of life you gain is the total amount of life lost, not simply the value of X.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If Nadir Kraken leaves the battlefield after its ability has triggered, you can still pay {1} and get a Tentacle, even though you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on Nadir Kraken."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "While resolving Nadir Kraken\'s ability, you can\'t pay {1} multiple times to create multiple Tentacles or to give it multiple +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "You choose whether to pay {1} after drawing the card and seeing what it is. If you draw multiple cards, you see them all before deciding how many of the resulting triggers you\'ll pay {1} for."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a creature can\'t block Treeshaker Chimera for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn\'t block. If there\'s a cost associated with having it block, the player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to block in that case either. If there\'s a cost associated with having it block Treeshaker Chimera, but not to block other attacking creatures, that creature is free to block one of those other creatures or to not block at all."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a creature is required to block two or more different creatures, its controller chooses which one that creature blocks.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The second mode of Heliod\'s Intervention causes the player to gain one amount of life equal to twice X. It doesn\'t cause the player to gain X life then gain X life again."}]', "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A Gold token is a colorless Gold artifact token with “Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.”'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities, the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger. If lore counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Any nonland permanents that come under the target player’s control after the second chapter ability resolves will untap as normal.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Nonland permanents target opponent controls that are already tapped when the second chapter ability resolves won’t be tapped again, but they won’t untap during their controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities, the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger. If lore counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The control-change effect of the third chapter ability lasts indefinitely. It doesn’t wear off during the cleanup step. In a multiplayer game, it does expire if you leave the game.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The second chapter ability keeps the permanents tapped even if Kiora Bests the Sea God leaves the battlefield before that player’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The second chapter ability targets the player but not their permanents. Permanents with hexproof may be tapped this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If X is greater than the number of cards in your library while resolving the third chapter ability, you look at your entire library and put it back in any order. You still gain life equal to the full value of X.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities, the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger. If lore counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The card that you exile for the first two chapter abilities may be one of the cards that you just put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'While resolving the first two chapter abilities, you can’t exile multiple cards to create multiple Zombies.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a creature on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if you leave the game after this Saga’s second chapter ability resolves but before your next turn begins, its effect lasts until your next turn would have begun. It neither expires immediately nor lasts indefinitely.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities, the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger. If lore counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The effect of the second chapter lasts until your next turn even if this Saga leaves the battlefield before then.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases (such as that of this Saga’s second chapter), then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You choose which kind of counter to put on the returned permanent after it has entered the battlefield. You may put a +1/+1 counter on a planeswalker or a loyalty counter on a creature, but this isn’t normally going to have any effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target as the final chapter ability resolves, no creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities, the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger. If lore counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The value of X for the first three chapters is determined only as each chapter ability resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won’t change later in the turn even if the number of lore counters on The Triumph of Anax changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the third chapter ability somehow resolves with no name chosen for the second chapter ability, it creates a delayed triggered ability that can’t possibly trigger, even if you cast a spell with no name.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities, the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger. If lore counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A chapter ability doesn’t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter’s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won’t trigger again.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Each symbol on the left of a Saga’s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability’s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won’t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities, the Saga’s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Removing lore counters won’t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger. If lore counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "An Aura spell that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve doesn\'t resolve and is instead put into its owner\'s graveyard. It doesn\'t enter the battlefield, so constellation abilities don\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If Setessan Champion leaves the battlefield after its ability has triggered, you still draw a card even though you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on Setessan Champion."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "An Aura spell that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve doesn\'t resolve and is instead put into its owner\'s graveyard. It doesn\'t enter the battlefield, so constellation abilities don\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.\'}]', "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An Aura spell that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve doesn’t resolve and is instead put into its owner’s graveyard. It doesn’t enter the battlefield, so constellation abilities don’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Eutropia can be the target of its own triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Eutropia’s ability can target a creature that already has flying. It still gets a +1/+1 counter. Multiple instances of flying on the same creature are redundant.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an enchantment creature enters the battlefield under your control, Eutropia’s ability can target that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An Aura spell that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve doesn’t resolve and is instead put into its owner’s graveyard. It doesn’t enter the battlefield, so constellation abilities don’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Protean Thaumaturge copies a creature that’s copying something else, it will become whatever the target is copying.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an effect begins to apply to Protean Thaumaturge before it becomes a copy of another creature, that effect will continue to apply.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an enchantment creature enters the battlefield under your control, Protean Thaumaturge’s ability can target it.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If something becomes a copy of Protean Thaumaturge, it also has the constellation ability.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Protean Thaumaturge copies the printed values of the target creature, plus any copy effects that have been applied to it. It won’t copy counters on that creature or effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on. Notably, it won’t copy effects that made the target creature become a creature.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Protean Thaumaturge’s ability causes it to become a copy indefinitely. It doesn’t expire during the cleanup step or if the target creature leaves the battlefield after the ability has resolved.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An Aura spell that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve doesn’t resolve and is instead put into its owner’s graveyard. It doesn’t enter the battlefield, so constellation abilities don’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an enchantment creature enters the battlefield under your control, Pious Wayfarer’s ability can target it.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An Aura spell that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve doesn’t resolve and is instead put into its owner’s graveyard. It doesn’t enter the battlefield, so constellation abilities don’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Multiple instances of double strike on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An Aura spell that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve doesn’t resolve and is instead put into its owner’s graveyard. It doesn’t enter the battlefield, so constellation abilities don’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Multiple instances of flying on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An Aura spell that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve doesn’t resolve and is instead put into its owner’s graveyard. It doesn’t enter the battlefield, so constellation abilities don’t trigger.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'A creature removed from combat by Labyrinth of Skophos remains tapped if it was tapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a blocking creature is removed from combat, the creature it blocked remains blocked. Unless that creature has trample, it won\'t deal combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Once creatures attack or block, they remain attacking or blocking creatures through the end of combat step unless removed from combat (by Labyrinth of Skophos or a similar effect).\'}]', "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A noncreature enchantment with a +1/+1 counter on it will be unaffected by that counter until it becomes a creature, at which time it will get +1/+1 for that counter.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won’t be counted when determining this.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Counters put on a God remain on it while it’s not a creature, even if they have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Heliod’s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Heliod can be the target of its own triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Heliod’s triggered ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Daxos, Blessed by the Sun or 3 life from Cling to Dust. If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something or “equal to the number” of something, that life is gained as one event and Heliod’s ability triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won’t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a creature is dealt lethal damage at the same time that you gain life, it can’t receive a counter from Heliod’s ability in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The abilities of Gods function as long as they’re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they’re creatures.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It’s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It’s always a creature spell while it’s on the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A number is chosen randomly for Haktos before it enters the battlefield. There’s no point at which players can target it before it has gained the appropriate protection abilities.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell’s converted mana cost. If a card or permanent in any other zone has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Haktos has protection from each possible converted mana cost other than the chosen value, not just protection from the two options that weren’t randomly chosen.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Haktos can’t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player’s control that turn), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, you aren’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Haktos somehow has no choice made for its ability, its last ability grants it no protection abilities.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a token that isn’t a copy of another object is 0. A token that is a copy of another object has the same converted mana cost as that object.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The card you return with Acolyte of Affliction\'s ability may be one that you just put into your graveyard with its ability. This is because the ability doesn\'t target the card that you\'ll return."}]', "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A spell or ability that counters spells can still target spells you control with converted mana cost 5 or greater. When that spell or ability resolves, your spell won’t be countered, but any additional effects of the countering spell or ability will still happen.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell’s converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Thryx enters the battlefield while a spell with converted mana cost 5 or greater that you cast is on the stack, that spell can’t be countered, even though you don’t get the {1} discount.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Players can’t attempt to remove Thryx to raise the cost of a spell you wish to cast, but they can remove it to allow their spells and abilities to counter your spells.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Thryx’s last ability doesn’t apply to itself while it’s a spell.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Thryx). The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'After an escaped spell resolves, it returns to its owner’s graveyard if it’s not a permanent spell. If it is a permanent spell, it enters the battlefield and will return to its owner’s graveyard if it dies later. Perhaps it will escape again—good underworld security is so hard to come by these days.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As the triggered ability resolves, first the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s an opponent’s turn, the opponent whose turn it is) chooses a creature they control, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Escape’s permission doesn’t change when you may cast the spell from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card has multiple abilities giving you permission to cast it, such as two escape abilities or an escape ability and a flashback ability, you choose which one to apply. The others have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card with escape is put into your graveyard during your turn, you’ll be able to cast it right away if it’s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with its escape permission, you can’t choose to apply any other alternative costs or to cast it without paying its mana cost. If it has any additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once you begin casting a spell with escape, it immediately moves to the stack. Players can’t take any other actions until you’re done casting the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying (such as an escape cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was and no matter whether an alternative cost was paid.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'After an escaped spell resolves, it returns to its owner’s graveyard if it’s not a permanent spell. If it is a permanent spell, it enters the battlefield and will return to its owner’s graveyard if it dies later. Perhaps it will escape again—good underworld security is so hard to come by these days.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Cling to Dust can target one of the five cards you’ll exile to pay its escape cost. In this case, the spell won’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Escape’s permission doesn’t change when you may cast the spell from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card has multiple abilities giving you permission to cast it, such as two escape abilities or an escape ability and a flashback ability, you choose which one to apply. The others have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card with escape is put into your graveyard during your turn, you’ll be able to cast it right away if it’s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the exiled card is a creature card that’s also another card type (such as an enchantment creature), you gain 3 life. You don’t also draw a card.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target card is an illegal target by the time Cling to Dust tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve. You won’t gain 3 life or draw a card.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with its escape permission, you can’t choose to apply any other alternative costs or to cast it without paying its mana cost. If it has any additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once you begin casting a spell with escape, it immediately moves to the stack. Players can’t take any other actions until you’re done casting the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying (such as an escape cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was and no matter whether an alternative cost was paid.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'After an escaped spell resolves, it returns to its owner’s graveyard if it’s not a permanent spell. If it is a permanent spell, it enters the battlefield and will return to its owner’s graveyard if it dies later. Perhaps it will escape again—good underworld security is so hard to come by these days.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Escape’s permission doesn’t change when you may cast the spell from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Chainweb Aracnir leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much damage it deals.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card has multiple abilities giving you permission to cast it, such as two escape abilities or an escape ability and a flashback ability, you choose which one to apply. The others have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card with escape is put into your graveyard during your turn, you’ll be able to cast it right away if it’s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with its escape permission, you can’t choose to apply any other alternative costs or to cast it without paying its mana cost. If it has any additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once you begin casting a spell with escape, it immediately moves to the stack. Players can’t take any other actions until you’re done casting the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying (such as an escape cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was and no matter whether an alternative cost was paid.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'After an escaped spell resolves, it returns to its owner’s graveyard if it’s not a permanent spell. If it is a permanent spell, it enters the battlefield and will return to its owner’s graveyard if it dies later. Perhaps it will escape again—good underworld security is so hard to come by these days.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Escape’s permission doesn’t change when you may cast the spell from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Underworld Rage-Hound can’t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player’s control that turn), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card has multiple abilities giving you permission to cast it, such as two escape abilities or an escape ability and a flashback ability, you choose which one to apply. The others have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card with escape is put into your graveyard during your turn, you’ll be able to cast it right away if it’s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with its escape permission, you can’t choose to apply any other alternative costs or to cast it without paying its mana cost. If it has any additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once you begin casting a spell with escape, it immediately moves to the stack. Players can’t take any other actions until you’re done casting the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying (such as an escape cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was and no matter whether an alternative cost was paid.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'After an escaped spell resolves, it returns to its owner’s graveyard if it’s not a permanent spell. If it is a permanent spell, it enters the battlefield and will return to its owner’s graveyard if it dies later. Perhaps it will escape again—good underworld security is so hard to come by these days.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Escape’s permission doesn’t change when you may cast the spell from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card has multiple abilities giving you permission to cast it, such as two escape abilities or an escape ability and a flashback ability, you choose which one to apply. The others have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card with escape is put into your graveyard during your turn, you’ll be able to cast it right away if it’s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an amount of damage would be dealt to Polukranos greater than the number of +1/+1 counters on it, all of that damage is prevented, and all of those counters are removed. In most cases, this will result in Polukranos having 0 toughness, so it will be put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If damage that can’t be prevented is dealt to Polukranos, the damage is dealt and you’ll simultaneously remove that many +1/+1 counters from it, all before the game checks for lethal damage.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target when Polukranos’s activated ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. If Polukranos is no longer on the battlefield, the target creature won’t deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with its escape permission, you can’t choose to apply any other alternative costs or to cast it without paying its mana cost. If it has any additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once you begin casting a spell with escape, it immediately moves to the stack. Players can’t take any other actions until you’re done casting the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying (such as an escape cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was and no matter whether an alternative cost was paid.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'After an escaped spell resolves, it returns to its owner’s graveyard if it’s not a permanent spell. If it is a permanent spell, it enters the battlefield and will return to its owner’s graveyard if it dies later. Perhaps it will escape again—good underworld security is so hard to come by these days.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Escape’s permission doesn’t change when you may cast the spell from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card has multiple abilities giving you permission to cast it, such as two escape abilities or an escape ability and a flashback ability, you choose which one to apply. The others have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card with escape is put into your graveyard during your turn, you’ll be able to cast it right away if it’s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you activate a loyalty ability of Elspeth, she’s put into your graveyard, and she escapes all in the same turn, she’ll be a new permanent. You can activate one of her loyalty abilities even though she’s represented by the same card.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with its escape permission, you can’t choose to apply any other alternative costs or to cast it without paying its mana cost. If it has any additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once you begin casting a spell with escape, it immediately moves to the stack. Players can’t take any other actions until you’re done casting the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying (such as an escape cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was and no matter whether an alternative cost was paid.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'After an escaped spell resolves, it returns to its owner’s graveyard if it’s not a permanent spell. If it is a permanent spell, it enters the battlefield and will return to its owner’s graveyard if it dies later. Perhaps it will escape again—good underworld security is so hard to come by these days.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Escape’s permission doesn’t change when you may cast the spell from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card has multiple abilities giving you permission to cast it, such as two escape abilities or an escape ability and a flashback ability, you choose which one to apply. The others have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card with escape is put into your graveyard during your turn, you’ll be able to cast it right away if it’s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with its escape permission, you can’t choose to apply any other alternative costs or to cast it without paying its mana cost. If it has any additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once you begin casting a spell with escape, it immediately moves to the stack. Players can’t take any other actions until you’re done casting the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Sleep of the Dead can target a creature that’s already tapped. That creature won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying (such as an escape cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was and no matter whether an alternative cost was paid.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'After an escaped spell resolves, it returns to its owner’s graveyard if it’s not a permanent spell. If it is a permanent spell, it enters the battlefield and will return to its owner’s graveyard if it dies later. Perhaps it will escape again—good underworld security is so hard to come by these days.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Escape’s permission doesn’t change when you may cast the spell from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card has multiple abilities giving you permission to cast it, such as two escape abilities or an escape ability and a flashback ability, you choose which one to apply. The others have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card with escape is put into your graveyard during your turn, you’ll be able to cast it right away if it’s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with its escape permission, you can’t choose to apply any other alternative costs or to cast it without paying its mana cost. If it has any additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once you begin casting a spell with escape, it immediately moves to the stack. Players can’t take any other actions until you’re done casting the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying (such as an escape cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was and no matter whether an alternative cost was paid.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Uro’s effect doesn’t count as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if it’s not your turn or if you’ve already played your land for the turn.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Uro’s first ability causes you to sacrifice it if you didn’t cast it, or if it was cast using any permission other than an escape ability.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Uro’s second ability triggers when it enters the battlefield, even if it didn’t escape.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'After an escaped spell resolves, it returns to its owner’s graveyard if it’s not a permanent spell. If it is a permanent spell, it enters the battlefield and will return to its owner’s graveyard if it dies later. Perhaps it will escape again—good underworld security is so hard to come by these days.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Escape’s permission doesn’t change when you may cast the spell from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card has multiple abilities giving you permission to cast it, such as two escape abilities or an escape ability and a flashback ability, you choose which one to apply. The others have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card with escape is put into your graveyard during your turn, you’ll be able to cast it right away if it’s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with its escape permission, you can’t choose to apply any other alternative costs or to cast it without paying its mana cost. If it has any additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once you begin casting a spell with escape, it immediately moves to the stack. Players can’t take any other actions until you’re done casting the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying (such as an escape cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was and no matter whether an alternative cost was paid.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a creature becomes the target of a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a spell targets Tectonic Giant more than once, its ability triggers only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you don\'t play the exiled card that you chose, it remains in exile with the card you didn\'t choose."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Playing an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t play it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Tectonic Giant doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "You choose which of the exiled cards you\'ll be able to play while the ability is resolving. You can\'t wait to pick one later. The other card remains in exile."}]', "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a creature becomes the target of an ability resolves before the ability that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that ability is countered or if the creature is no longer a legal target.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If either Skophos Maze-Warden or the creature targeted by Labyrinth of Skophos has left the battlefield, the other won’t deal or be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you cast a spell that targets Treacherous Blessing, you choose whether you lose 1 life before or after you sacrifice it. You lose 1 life even if you sacrifice it first.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when you cast a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you cast a spell that targets this creature multiple times, this ability triggers just once.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'This ability doesn’t trigger if you copy a spell that targets it, or if a spell’s targets are changed to target it.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'This effect affects only creatures you control at the time the ability resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +1/+0.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when you cast a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you have more than one opponent, this ability can trigger once during each of those opponents’ turns.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, each opposing team loses 2 life and you scry 1.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, this ability triggers no more than once during each opposing team’s turn.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'This ability triggers only on your very first spell during an opponent’s turn, not the first spell after the card is on the battlefield. If you cast a spell before it’s on the battlefield (including if you cast this card somehow during an opponent’s turn), the ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You scry 1 just once, no matter how many opponents are dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when you cast a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you have more than one opponent, this ability can trigger once during each of those opponents’ turns.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, this ability triggers no more than once during each opposing team’s turn.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'This ability triggers only on your very first spell during an opponent’s turn, not the first spell after the card is on the battlefield. If you cast a spell before it’s on the battlefield (including if you cast this card somehow during an opponent’s turn), the ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An equipped creature is one with one or more Equipment attached. A creature that’s also an Equipment isn’t an equipped creature.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You can’t spend mana generated by Dalakos’s first ability to activate abilities of artifact cards that aren’t on the battlefield or to pay costs in triggered abilities of artifacts.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An opponent’s spell that targets a single creature or enchantment you control more than once costs only {1} more to cast. An opponent’s spell that targets multiple creatures and/or enchantments you control costs {1} more for each of them.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Callaphe’s last ability applies to itself as well as other creatures and enchantments you control.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Callaphe’s last ability gives only one instance of the ability to creatures you control that are also enchantments.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The ability that defines Callaphe’s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Any effect that exiles a card exiles it face up unless that effect specifies otherwise.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Ashiok’s second ability returns a token to its owner’s hand, that player can’t exile that token from their hand. They must exile a card from their hand if possible.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Thrill of Possibility, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you wish to cast any exiled cards, you do so as part of the resolution of Ashiok’s last ability. You can’t wait to cast them later. Timing permissions based on a card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spells and/or permanents you control from Ashiok’s last ability are exiled.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The card exiled while resolving Ashiok’s second ability may be the one that was returned to its owner’s hand.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You may cast any face-up cards your opponents own from exile while resolving Ashiok’s last ability, not just those exiled by Ashiok’s second ability or by Ashiok’s Nightmare tokens.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Any effects that modify the target creature’s power and/or toughness without setting them to a specific number or value will apply after its base power and toughness are set, regardless of the order in which those effects were created. The same is true of counters that modify its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Taranika’s triggered ability can target a creature that’s already untapped. It still becomes 4/4 and gains indestructible.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Taranika’s triggered ability isn’t optional. If your only other creatures are bigger than 4/4, you’ll have to shrink one for the turn.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Untapping an attacking creature doesn’t remove it from combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If something becomes a copy of the token, the copy is also a 1/1 and a Nightmare.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the copied creature had {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the copied creature was copying something else, then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the token is a copy of a creature whose power and toughness are defined by an ability (usually printed as */* or similar), the token doesn’t copy the ability that defines its power and toughness. It remains a 1/1 creature.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that creature is copying something else; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that creature was tapped or untapped, whether it had any counters on it or Auras or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that had changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The token copies the creature as it last existed on the battlefield before it died, not as it existed in the graveyard before it was exiled.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won’t be counted when determining this.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Counters put on a God remain on it while it’s not a creature, even if they have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Erebos’s last ability can target the creature you’ll sacrifice to pay its cost. In this case, the ability won’t resolve, but Erebos’s triggered ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won’t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If one or more creatures you control die at the same time as Erebos, its triggered ability triggers for each of those creatures.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The abilities of Gods function as long as they’re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they’re creatures.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It’s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It’s always a creature spell while it’s on the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'While resolving Erebos’s triggered ability, you can’t pay more than 2 life to draw more than one card.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won’t be counted when determining this.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Counters put on a God remain on it while it’s not a creature, even if they have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Athreos and a creature with a coin counter on it are both put into graveyards and/or exiled at the same time, the other creature will be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Athreos leaves the battlefield, creatures with coin counters on them keep them. The counters won’t have any meaning or effect unless another Athreos is on the battlefield later.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Athreos somehow gets a coin counter on itself, its last ability will return it when it dies or is exiled.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won’t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a creature with a coin counter on it is put into a graveyard or exile but leaves that zone before Athreos’s last ability resolves, that card stays in its new zone, even if that zone is also a graveyard or exile. You don’t return it to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a creature with a coin counter on it stops being a creature, it keeps its coin counter, but Athreos’s last ability won’t trigger when that permanent dies or is exiled unless it’s a creature again by that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a creature you don’t own has a coin counter on it, that permanent will return to the battlefield under your control when it dies or is exiled while you control Athreos. In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any creatures you control from Athreos’s ability are exiled.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a token with a coin counter on it dies or is exiled, Athreos’s last ability triggers, but won’t return it to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an effect exiles a creature with a coin counter on it and immediately returns it to the battlefield, Athreos’s last ability triggers but will have no effect. If an effect exiles a creature with a coin counter on it and would return it to the battlefield at a later time, Athreos’s last ability will return that card to the battlefield and it won’t be returned later.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'In a two-player game, if both players control an Athreos when a creature with a coin counter on it dies, the nonactive player (the one whose turn it isn’t) will return the creature under their control. If that happens in a multiplayer game, the nonactive player closest to the right of the player whose turn it is will return the creature under their control.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The abilities of Gods function as long as they’re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they’re creatures.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The creature returns to the battlefield without a coin counter on it.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It’s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It’s always a creature spell while it’s on the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Your devotion to two colors is the number of mana symbols among mana costs of permanents you control that are the first color, the second, or both. If an effect counts your devotion to two colors, a hybrid symbol that is both of those colors is counted just once.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won’t be counted when determining this.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Counters put on a God remain on it while it’s not a creature, even if they have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won’t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you gain control of a creature “until end of turn,” you’ll control it during your end step.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The abilities of Gods function as long as they’re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they’re creatures.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It’s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It’s always a creature spell while it’s on the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'When an effect returns the exiled card “under your control,” you control it indefinitely after that. In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any creatures you control from Thassa’s effect but don’t own are exiled.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won’t be counted when determining this.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Counters put on a God remain on it while it’s not a creature, even if they have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won’t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target card in a graveyard is an illegal target by the time Klothys’s last ability tries to resolve, the ability won’t resolve. You won’t add mana, gain life, or deal damage.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you exile a land card that has another card type (such as an artifact land), you add one mana, but you won’t gain life or deal damage.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you exile a nonland card, you gain only 2 life, no matter how many opponents are dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Klothys’s last ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life and you gain 2 life.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The abilities of Gods function as long as they’re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they’re creatures.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It’s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It’s always a creature spell while it’s on the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Your devotion to two colors is the number of mana symbols among mana costs of permanents you control that are the first color, the second, or both. If an effect counts your devotion to two colors, a hybrid symbol that is both of those colors is counted just once.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won’t be counted when determining this.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Counters put on a God remain on it while it’s not a creature, even if they have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won’t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you don’t put the revealed noncreature card into your graveyard, it remains on top of your library.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The abilities of Gods function as long as they’re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they’re creatures.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It’s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It’s always a creature spell while it’s on the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won’t be counted when determining this.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Counters put on a God remain on it while it’s not a creature, even if they have no effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won’t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The abilities of Gods function as long as they’re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they’re creatures.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It’s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It’s always a creature spell while it’s on the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'As the last ability resolves, first you choose a card in hand without revealing it, then each other player in turn order does the same. Then all the chosen cards are discarded at the same time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes an opponent to draw one or more cards, wait until that spell or ability has finished resolving to determine whether Enemy of Enlightenment dies for having 0 toughness. If that spell or ability also causes cards to leave that player’s hand, Enemy of Enlightenment may briefly be a 0/0 creature without dying.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If any player can’t discard a card, skip that player and each other player discards a card.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The ability that modifies the power and toughness of Enemy of Enlightenment applies only while it’s on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Grasping Giant doesn’t become unblocked when the creatures blocking it are exiled. Unless it gains trample, it won’t deal combat damage.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Grasping Giant leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the blocking creature won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If more than one creature blocks Grasping Giant, its ability triggers once for each of those creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an Aura is being put onto the battlefield at the same time as an enchantment creature, that Aura can’t enchant that creature.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an Aura is put onto the battlefield without being cast, the Aura’s controller-to-be chooses what it will enchant as it comes back onto the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent’s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains in its current zone.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target enchantment you control leaves the battlefield or otherwise becomes an illegal target before Calix’s second ability resolves, the target permanent you don’t control won’t be exiled.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Because Inevitable End grants the ability to the enchanted creature, the triggered ability triggers at the beginning of the upkeep of the controller of the enchanted creature, and that player chooses a creature to sacrifice. They might not sacrifice the enchanted creature right away, but it’s certain that they’ll have to do so eventually.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Players may take actions before the triggered ability granted by Inevitable End resolves, but they can’t take any actions during a turn before that turn’s upkeep begins to try to stop the ability from triggering.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Because Skola Grovedancer’s ability triggers when land cards are put into your graveyard “from anywhere,” Skola Grovedancer must be on the battlefield immediately after a land card is put there in order to trigger. This means that if Skola Grovedancer dies at the same time as a land you control, its ability won’t trigger.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Daxos may become lethal if your devotion to white decreases during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don\'t count toward your devotion to any color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it\'s still on the battlefield at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If another creature you control enters the battlefield at the same time as Daxos, you gain 1 life for that creature. Similarly, if another creature you control dies at the same time as Daxos, you gain 1 life for that creature. However, in the unusual case that Daxos dies at the same time that another creature enters the battlefield or vice versa, you won\'t gain 1 life for that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you put an Aura on an opponent\'s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don\'t count toward your devotion to any color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Daxos\'s toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2023-04-14\', \'text\': \'If you control a battle and an opponent is its protector, you still control the battle, and mana symbols in its mana cost count toward your devotion.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Tymaret may become lethal if your devotion to black decreases during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don\'t count toward your devotion to any color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it\'s still on the battlefield at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you put an Aura on an opponent\'s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don\'t count toward your devotion to any color."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Tymaret\'s toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature may become lethal if Ichthyomorphosis becomes attached to it during that turn.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Effects that modify a creature’s power and/or toughness will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Ichthyomorphosis may enchant a permanent that is only temporarily a creature, such as a Vehicle. If this happens, Ichthyomorphosis will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action once the creature stops being a creature.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Ichthyomorphosis overwrites all colors and creature types the enchanted creature has. It’s just a blue Fish. The creature keeps any supertypes (such as legendary) it has, as well as any other card types it has (such as enchantment).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Ichthyomorphosis overwrites all previous effects that set the creature’s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Ichthyomorphosis becomes attached to a creature will overwrite this effect.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the affected creature gains an ability after Ichthyomorphosis becomes attached to it, it will keep that ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Because modes are performed sequentially, an Aura returned to the battlefield with Rise to Glory can enchant a creature returned to the battlefield with Rise to Glory.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an Aura is put onto the battlefield without being cast, the Aura’s controller-to-be chooses what it will enchant as it comes back onto the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent’s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains in its current zone.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Blood Aspirant can be sacrificed to pay for the cost of its own last ability.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Blood Aspirant’s first ability is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn’t allow you to sacrifice a permanent whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of sacrificing permanents, such as its second ability.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Blood Aspirant’s last ability tries to resolve, the ability won’t resolve. The creature can block as normal. If the target is legal but not dealt damage (most likely because of a prevention effect), it can’t block this turn.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you sacrifice a permanent as part of casting a spell or activating an ability, Blood Aspirant’s first ability will resolve before that spell or ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Elspeth’s last ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +X/+X or gain flying.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as Elspeth’s last ability resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won’t change later in the turn even if your devotion to white changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Anax dies at the same time as another nontoken creature you control, its ability triggers for each of them.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you create a token that’s a copy of Anax, its last ability triggers when it dies.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The ability that defines Anax’s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine whether you create two tokens, check the power of the creature that died immediately before it died.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If your devotion to blue is zero at the time the triggered ability of Thassa’s Oracle resolves, you don’t look at or move any cards in your library. If you have no cards in your library, you win the game.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Klothys’s Design affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +X/+X.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as Klothys’s Design resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won’t change later in the turn even if your devotion to green changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Nyx Lotus’s second ability is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re casting a spell, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can’t try to change by how much Daybreak Chimera’s cost is reduced.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The cost reduction ability reduces only the generic mana in Daybreak Chimera’s cost. The colored mana must still be paid.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Daybreak Chimera). The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re casting a spell, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can’t try to change by how much Drag to the Underworld’s cost is reduced.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The cost reduction ability reduces only the generic mana in Drag to the Underworld’s cost. The colored mana must still be paid.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Drag to the Underworld). The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as the triggered ability resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won’t change later in the turn even if your devotion to black changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as the triggered ability resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won’t change later in the turn even if your devotion to blue changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as the triggered ability resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won’t change later in the turn even if your devotion to green changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Colorless and generic mana symbols ({C}, {0}, {1}, {2}, {X}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it’s still on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you put an Aura on an opponent’s permanent, you still control the Aura, and mana symbols in its mana cost count towards your devotion.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don’t count toward your devotion to any color.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Creatures and planeswalkers don’t necessarily have to be dealt lethal damage by Underworld Fires to be exiled. After being dealt damage, if they would die for any reason that turn, they’ll be exiled instead.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Dawn Evangel’s ability can target the card whose death caused the ability to trigger if that card’s converted mana cost is 2 or less.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Dawn Evangel’s ability triggers when any player’s creature dies, so long as that creature had an Aura you controlled attached to it.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Dawn Evangel dies at the same time as another creature enchanted by an Aura you control, its ability triggers.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Dawn Evangel dies while enchanted by an Aura you control, its ability triggers.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card in a graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Devourer of Memory’s triggered ability grants it just +1/+1 each time cards are put into your graveyard from your library, no matter how many cards are put there at once.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once Devourer of Memory has been blocked, resolving its triggered ability (perhaps by activating its activated ability) won’t change or undo that block.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Dream Trawler’s second triggered ability resolves before blockers are declared. This normally causes its first triggered ability to trigger, which also resolves before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You can activate Dream Trawler’s last ability even if it’s already tapped. It still gains hexproof until end of turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Dreamshaper Shaman can be sacrificed to pay for the cost of its own triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If there are no nonland cards remaining in your library, you just randomize your library and continue playing.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'While resolving Dreamshaper Shaman’s ability, you can’t pay {2}{R} more than once or sacrifice multiple permanents.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You can’t pay {2}{R} and not sacrifice a nonland permanent, or vice versa. The cost must be paid in full or not at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Dryad of the Ilysian Grove’s first ability is cumulative if you control more than one. It’s also cumulative with other effects that let you play additional lands, such as the one from Escape to the Wilds.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Each land you control will have the land types Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest. They’ll also have the mana ability of each basic land type (for example, Forests have “{T}: Add {G}.”). They’ll still have their other subtypes and abilities.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Giving a land additional basic land types doesn’t change its name or whether it’s legendary or basic.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Eidolon of Obstruction doesn’t replace the loyalty cost of activating a loyalty ability or cause it to cost more loyalty to activate. It just adds a mana component to the ability’s activation cost.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Loyalty abilities cost just {1} more to activate, no matter how much loyalty they cost to activate.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Entrancing Lyre’s activated ability can target a creature that’s already tapped. That creature won’t untap for as long as Entrancing Lyre remains tapped.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Entrancing Lyre becomes untapped before its activated ability resolves, the target creature is tapped, but it can untap as usual. This is true even if Entrancing Lyre becomes tapped again before the activated ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Entrancing Lyre leaves the battlefield, it’s no longer tapped, so the creature is free to untap as usual.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Entrancing Lyre’s ability tries to resolve, the ability won’t resolve. The creature isn’t tapped and can untap as usual.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target creature’s power is increased after Entrancing Lyre’s ability has resolved, it remains affected and won’t untap as usual.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once Entrancing Lyre is no longer tapped, the creature won’t immediately become untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Final Flare has no extra effect if you sacrifice an enchantment creature.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature or enchantment to cast Final Flare; you can’t cast it without sacrificing a permanent, and you can’t sacrifice additional permanents.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Gravebreaker Lamia’s last ability doesn’t give you permission to cast cards from your graveyard. You need something else allowing you to do so, such as the escape keyword ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Hyrax Tower Scout’s ability can target an untapped creature, including Hyrax Tower Scout itself, if there are no tapped creatures you wish to untap.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Altar of the Pantheon loses its abilities, you’ll still get a bonus to your devotion. This is because its effect is applied before any effect that would make it lose its abilities.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The last ability of Altar of the Pantheon is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. You’ll immediately add mana to your mana pool and gain 1 life, if applicable.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You gain just 1 life, no matter how many Gods, Demigods, and/or legendary enchantments you control beyond the first.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Your devotion to two colors (for example, your devotion to red and green) is increased by one, not by two or three.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Ashiok’s Erasure has exiled a split card, your opponents can’t cast a spell with the same name as either half of that card.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Ashiok’s Erasure has exiled an adventurer card, your opponents can’t cast spells with the same name as the creature, but may cast their Adventures.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Ashiok’s Erasure leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield ability has resolved, its last ability triggers and resolves with no effect, then its enters-the-battlefield ability exiles the target spell for the rest of the game.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If there is no exiled card (perhaps because the exiled spell was a copy of a spell or was a commander spell that moved to the command zone in the Commander variant), or if the exiled card leaves exile somehow, Ashiok’s Erasure won’t stop players from casting spells.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The exiled spell isn’t countered, but it won’t resolve. This works against spells that can’t be countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Aspect of Manticore leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield triggered ability resolves, the creature it last enchanted before it left gains first strike until end of turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Dreadful Apathy leaves the battlefield while its last ability is on the stack, the permanent that’s exiled is the one Dreadful Apathy enchanted before leaving the battlefield, even if that permanent is no longer a creature.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The creature that’s exiled is the creature Dreadful Apathy enchants as its last ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Gallia leaves the battlefield, Satyrs you control lose haste. If they haven’t been under your control since the turn began and don’t otherwise have haste, they can’t attack this turn. If they’ve already attacked, they remain attacking creatures.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once three or more creatures you control have attacked, you’ll be given the option to discard a card at random, even if some or all of those attackers leave the battlefield before Gallia’s triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'While resolving Gallia’s last ability, you can’t discard multiple cards to draw more than two cards.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You can’t choose to discard a card at random if you have no cards in hand. If you have one card in hand, you may discard it at random, even though that’s not very random.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Hateful Eidolon dies at the same time as one or more enchanted creatures, its last ability triggers for each of those creatures. This includes Hateful Eidolon itself if it’s enchanted.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an Aura you control is destroyed at the same time as the creature it enchants, Hateful Eidolon’s triggered ability counts that Aura to determine whether it triggers and how many cards you’ll draw.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Hydra’s Growth leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield triggered ability resolves, the creature it last enchanted before it left gets the +1/+1 counter.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To double the number of +1/+1 counters on a creature, put a number of +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number it already has. Other cards that interact with putting counters on it will interact with this effect accordingly.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Minion’s Return enchants a token creature, that creature won’t return to the battlefield when it dies. Choose your minions wisely.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the creature you control from Minion’s Return is exiled if you don’t own it.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If One with the Stars enchants an enchantment that has no other card types, the enchanted permanent won’t be affected.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'One with the Stars may enchant a permanent that is only temporarily a creature, such as a Vehicle. If this happens, One with the Stars’s effect causes the enchanted permanent to remain an enchantment even after the temporary effect expires.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The enchanted permanent keeps its abilities but has no power or toughness. If one of its abilities refers to them, it uses 0.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The enchanted permanent loses any subtypes associated with the card types it lost. It keeps any supertypes, such as legendary.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Starlit Mantle leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield triggered ability resolves, the creature it last enchanted before it left gains hexproof until end of turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Underworld Sentinel leaves the battlefield without dying, the exiled creature cards are exiled for the rest of the game. If Underworld Sentinel returns to the battlefield later, it’ll be a new object with no memory of the creatures it exiled previously.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s Underworld Sentinel and it then dies, you’ll put the exiled cards onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any permanents you control from Underworld Sentinel but don’t own are exiled.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Underworld Sentinel can attack even if there’s no creature card in your graveyard to exile.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If Warbriar Blessing leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield triggered ability resolves, the creature it last enchanted before it left will be the one to fight.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target when Warbriar Blessing\'s triggered ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. If the enchanted creature is no longer on the battlefield, the target creature won\'t deal or be dealt damage."}]', "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Wings of Hubris becomes attached to a creature you don’t control, you can activate the ability to make that creature unblockable, but you won’t be able to sacrifice the creature at the beginning of the next end step.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you gain control of a creature “until end of turn,” you control it during your end step. If you use Wings of Hubris to make this creature fly too close to the sun, you’ll sacrifice it.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a creature can’t block Nessian Boar for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having it block, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to block in that case either. If there’s a cost associated with having it block Nessian Boar, but not to block other attacking creatures, that creature is free to block one of those other creatures or to not block at all.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a creature is required to block two or more different creatures, its controller chooses which one that creature blocks.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Nessian Boar’s second ability resolves before combat damage is dealt, and players have priority to cast spells (such as the cards the defending player just drew) after the ability has resolved but before combat damage is dealt.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Nessian Boar’s second ability triggers for each creature blocking it.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a creature dealt damage by Incendiary Oracle would die after Incendiary Oracle has left the battlefield, that creature dies and isn’t exiled instead.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a creature dealt damage by Incendiary Oracle would die at the same time as Incendiary Oracle, that creature is exiled instead.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a creature is dealt lethal damage at the same time that Demon of Loathing deals combat damage to its controller, that player can’t sacrifice that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a creature is enchanted by two or more Heliod’s Punishments, it has only the activated ability of the one that most recently became attached. Activating that ability removes a task counter from only that one.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the affected creature gains an ability after Heliod’s Punishment becomes attached to it, it will keep that ability.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature has an ability that defines a * in its power or toughness, that * is 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a creature with deathtouch blocks the equipped creature and is then destroyed, the equipped creature remains blocked. Unless the equipped creature has trample, it won’t deal combat damage to the player or planeswalker it’s attacking.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once a creature without deathtouch has blocked or become blocked by the equipped creature, causing the other creature to gain deathtouch won’t cause the ability granted by Mirror Shield to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The ability Mirror Shield grants triggers and resolves before combat damage is dealt. That creature won’t deal combat damage to the equipped creature or be dealt damage by it.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a nontoken permanent is a copy of Bronzehide Lion, it returns from its owner’s graveyard as an Aura with the two abilities granted by Bronzehide Lion and none of its normal abilities. If it has any enters-the-battlefield replacement effects, those won’t apply. The Aura keeps its name, colors, and any supertypes it may have.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a token is a copy of Bronzehide Lion, it won’t return from its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you control but don’t own Bronzehide Lion, you’ll return it to the battlefield when it dies, not its owner. It’ll enchant a creature you control.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You choose a creature you control for Bronzehide Lion to enchant as it returns to the battlefield. If there’s nothing it can legally enchant, it remains in its owner’s graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If all six of the revealed cards are land cards, your opponent doesn’t exile anything. You put all six cards into your hand.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Thrill of Possibility, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If your opponent wishes to cast the card, they do so as part of the resolution of Allure of the Unknown. They can’t wait to cast it later. Timing permissions based on a card’s type are ignored.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an Aura is put onto the battlefield without being cast, the Aura’s controller-to-be chooses what it will enchant as it comes back onto the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent’s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains in its current zone.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once the exiled permanent returns, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If an Aura becomes attached to Siona that causes another player to gain control of it, that player will control the triggered ability that creates a Soldier.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If an Aura becomes attached to Siona that causes it to lose all abilities, Siona\'s last ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If an Aura becomes attached to a noncreature permanent you control that causes it to become a creature, Siona\'s last ability triggers. If an Aura becomes attached to a creature you don\'t control that causes it to become a creature you do control, Siona\'s last ability triggers. If an Aura becomes attached to a creature you control that causes it to no longer be a creature or to no longer be under your control, Siona\'s last ability doesn\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Siona\'s last ability triggers both whenever an Aura enters the battlefield attached to a creature you control and whenever an Aura on the battlefield attached to a different object becomes attached to a creature you control. It doesn\'t trigger if an effect tries to attach an Aura to the creature it already enchants."}]', "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an Aura can’t be attached to a creature you control, you can’t return it to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an effect exiles an Aura returned this way, that effect exiles it, not Storm Herald’s effect. If that effect returns the Aura to the battlefield, it won’t be affected by Storm Herald’s effect anymore.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Only Auras that were returned to the battlefield will be exiled at the beginning of your next end step. Any that you choose to leave in your graveyard will remain.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Storm Herald itself is among the creatures that may be enchanted by the returning Auras.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an Aura is put onto the battlefield without being cast, the Aura’s controller-to-be chooses what it will enchant as it comes back onto the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent’s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains in its current zone.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an ability triggers “whenever you tap” something for mana and produces mana, that triggered mana ability won’t be affected by Nyxbloom Ancient.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Nyxbloom Ancient doesn’t produce any mana itself. Rather, it causes permanents you tap for mana to produce more mana. If the mana ability of that permanent puts any restrictions or riders on the mana it produces, that will apply to all the mana it produces this way.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The effects of multiple Nyxbloom Ancients are cumulative. For example, if you have two Nyxbloom Ancients on the battlefield, you’ll get nine times the original amount and type of mana.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You’re “tapping a permanent for mana” only if you’re activating a mana ability of that permanent that includes the {T} symbol in its cost. A mana ability produces mana as part of its effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an effect exiles a card from a graveyard and allows a player to cast it, that player may do so. The spell is cast from exile, not a graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Look at the card as it exists in your graveyard to determine whether it can enter the battlefield. For example, Sculpting Steel (a noncreature card in the graveyard) can be put onto the battlefield as a copy of a creature, but Phyrexian Metamorph (a creature card in the graveyard) can’t be put onto the battlefield, even if it would copy a noncreature artifact. A Theros Beyond Death God creature card can’t be put onto the battlefield regardless of your devotion to its colors.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Players can still play lands from graveyards if an effect allows them to do so.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an enchantment on the battlefield or a creature card in a library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'While resolving Enigmatic Incarnation’s ability, you can’t sacrifice multiple enchantments to get multiple creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If any of the targeted creatures is an illegal target by the time Wrap in Flames resolves, it won’t be dealt damage and will be able to block. The other targeted creatures will still be affected.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The “can’t block” effect applies to each of the targeted creatures—and to only those creatures—even if Wrap in Flames deals no damage to one or more of them (due to a prevention effect, for example) or if Wrap in Flames deals damage to a different creature (due to a redirection effect).'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If damage that can’t be prevented is dealt to Ironscale Hydra, the damage is dealt and you’ll simultaneously put a +1/+1 counter on it, before the game checks for lethal damage.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You put only one +1/+1 counter on Ironscale Hydra per creature whose combat damage is prevented, no matter how much damage would have been dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the chosen target is an illegal target by the time Fateful End tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve. You won’t scry 1.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the creature Aspect of Lamprey would enchant is an illegal target by the time the Aura spell resolves, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield, so its ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the creature Iroas’s Blessing would enchant is an illegal target by the time the Aura spell resolves, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield, so its ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the creature Mantle of the Wolf would enchant is an illegal target by the time the Aura spell resolves, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. It’s put into your graveyard from the stack, not the battlefield, so its ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature can’t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player’s control that turn), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Chain to Memory tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve. You won’t scry 2.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Phalanx Tactics tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve. No creatures get +1/+1.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Triumphant Surge tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve. You won’t gain 3 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target when Pheres-Band Brawler’s ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. If Pheres-Band Brawler is no longer on the battlefield, the target creature won’t deal or be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target creature or planeswalker is an illegal target by the time Eat to Extinction tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve. You won’t look at or move the top card of your library.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you don’t put the top card of your library into your graveyard, it remains on top of your library.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If there are no nonland cards in their hand and no cards in their graveyard, then you just lose 1 life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If you choose a card from their graveyard, it may be a land card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "No player may take actions between the time you choose a card and the time it\'s exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "You must choose a card to exile if able. If there are no nonland cards in the opponent\'s hand, you must exile a card from their graveyard, and vice versa."}]', "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you choose the first mode and the target creature is an illegal target by the time Erebos’s Intervention tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve. You won’t gain X life.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you control two Wardens of the Chained, each will fulfill the other’s condition and both will be able to attack.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once Warden of the Chained is attacking, ’it will remain attacking even if you no longer control another creature with power 4 or greater.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you don’t control a creature with power 4 or greater as your combat phase begins, Nessian Hornbeetle’s ability doesn’t trigger. If you don’t control one as the ability resolves, it has no effect. It doesn’t have to be the same creature at both times, however.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Nessian Hornbeetle’s ability only gives it one +1/+1 counter, no matter how many creatures with power 4 or greater you control beyond the first.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you don’t control a creature with power 4 or greater as your combat phase begins, Stampede Rider’s ability doesn’t trigger. If you don’t control one as the ability resolves, it has no effect. It doesn’t have to be the same creature at both times, however.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once Stampede Rider’s ability has given it +1/+1, it won’t lose that bonus if you no longer control a creature with power 4 or greater later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Stampede Rider gets only +1/+1 from its ability, no matter how many creatures with power 4 or greater you control beyond the first.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Ilysian Caryatid’s activated ability is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, each opposing team loses 2 life and you gain 1 life.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Lampad of Death’s Vigil can be sacrificed to pay the cost of its own ability.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You gain only 1 life, no matter how many opponents lose life.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'In a game using the shared team turns option (a Two-Headed Giant game, for example), Flummoxed Cyclops’s ability triggers if two or more players each attack with only one creature.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once two or more creatures your opponents control have attacked, Flummoxed Cyclops won’t be able to block, even if all but one of those attackers leave the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any permanents you control from Ashiok’s second ability are exiled, and the control effect of Ashiok’s last ability ends.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The effect of Ashiok’s last ability lasts indefinitely. It doesn’t expire as the turn ends or if Ashiok leaves the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Inspire Awe doesn’t modify the characteristics of creatures, so check immediately before damage would be dealt whether a creature is enchanted or also an enchantment in order to determine if its combat damage should be prevented.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You scry 2 while Inspire Awe is resolving, not after damage is prevented.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of double strike on the same creature are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The triggered ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain double strike."}]', "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Multiple instances of first strike on the same creature are redundant.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The first ability of Slaughter-Priest of Mogis is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn’t allow you to sacrifice a permanent whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of sacrificing permanents, such as its second ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant. On the other hand, multiple instances of the triggered ability trigger separately if a creature is enchanted by more than one Staggering Insight.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Multiple instances of menace on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Multiple instances of vigilance or lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'No player may take any actions between the time each qualifying player draws a card and the time all creatures are destroyed.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Shatter the Sky destroys all creatures, even if no player draws a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once Nyx Herald’s ability resolves, the creature keeps +1/+1 and trample even if it stops being enchanted later in the turn (or, in some unusual cases, stops being an enchantment).'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once a creature has blocked Temple Thief, causing that creature to become enchanted (or, in some rare cases, causing it to become an enchantment creature) won’t cause Temple Thief to become unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re casting a spell, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can’t try to change by how much Brine Giant’s cost is reduced.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The cost reduction ability reduces only the generic mana in Brine Giant’s cost. The colored mana must still be paid.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Brine Giant). The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once you no longer control a Reflection, Alirios doesn’t immediately become untapped. It’ll be untapped during your next untap step.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Spells and abilities can untap Alirios, even if it doesn’t untap during your untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Soulreaper of Mogis can be sacrificed to pay the cost of its own ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The ability that modifies the power of Swimmer in Nightmares applies only while it’s on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The first ability of Swimmer in Nightmares gives it just +3/+0, no matter how many graveyards beyond the first have ten cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'The opponent may split the cards into one pile of three and one pile of zero. The pile of three cards could be the face-up pile or the face-down pile. Sometimes your opponents seem very friendly, but keep in mind which god Atris serves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "You choose just one target opponent to look at the top three cards of your library and put them into piles. Other players can\'t look, but they may attempt to offer advice without knowing what cards are there. The player who looks may also tell other players truths about those cards, or half-truths, or outright lies."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to reveal the cards in the face-down pile if you put it into your hand."}]', "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The second mode of Nylea’s Intervention has it deal damage to each creature with flying equal to twice X. It doesn’t deal X damage to them then deal X damage again.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The second mode of Purphoros’s Intervention has it deal damage to the target equal to twice X. It doesn’t deal X damage then deal X damage again.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Whether the target creature is enchanted or an enchantment is checked only while Karametra’s Blessing is resolving. If it becomes enchanted or stops being enchanted later (or, in some unusual cases, becomes or ceases to be an enchantment later) it won’t gain or lose hexproof and indestructible.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'While resolving Aphemia’s triggered ability, you can’t exile more than one enchantment card to get more than one Zombie token.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You choose whether to exile an enchantment card and which one to exile while Aphemia’s triggered ability is resolving. If Aphemia dies in response to its own triggered ability, it could be the card you exile.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'While resolving Relentless Pursuit, you could put no cards, a creature card, a land card, or a creature card and a land card into your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'You can discard either one enchantment card or two cards which may or may not be enchantments. If you really want to, you can discard two enchantment cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Furious Rise\'s ability has you exile only one card, no matter how many creatures with power 4 or greater you control beyond the first."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Furious Rise\'s effect doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can\'t play it unless you have land plays available."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If Furious Rise leaves the battlefield before you play the most recently exiled card, you can play that card for as long as it remains exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with power 4 or greater as your end step begins, Furious Rise\'s ability doesn\'t trigger. If you don\'t control one as the ability resolves, it has no effect. It doesn\'t have to be the same creature at both times, however."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Playing an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t play it multiple times."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the creature Setessan Training would enchant is an illegal target by the time the Aura spell resolves, the entire spell doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Banishing Light leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target permanent won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If an Aura is exiled this way, its owner chooses what it will enchant as it returns to the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn\'t target anything (so it could be attached to a permanent with shroud, for example), but the Aura\'s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can\'t legally be attached to anything, it remains in exile for the rest of the game."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target land is an illegal target by the time Field of Ruin\'s ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. No players search for a basic land card or shuffles. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), each player does search and shuffle."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "You must discard exactly one card to cast Thrill of Possibility; you can\'t cast it without discarding a card, and you can\'t discard additional cards."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Erebos\' Eingreifen", \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -X/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du erhältst X Lebenspunkte dazu.\\n• Schicke bis zu zweimal X Karten deiner Wahl aus Friedhöfen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bringe einen Tod, dem keiner entrinnen kann."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476599&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd1a4048-ff95-4330-91a1-25fb36fc26b8\', \'multiverseId\': 476599}, \'multiverseid\': 476599}, {\'name\': \'Intervención de Erebos\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• La criatura objetivo obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno. Ganas X vidas.\\n• Exilia hasta el doble de X cartas objetivo de los cementerios.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Traigo una muerte que nadie podrá eludir".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'088106b9-9566-4e2e-b15c-228cb4874d20\', \'multiverseId\': 476853}, \'multiverseid\': 476853}, {\'name\': "Intervention d\'Érébos", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• La créature ciblée gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Vous gagnez X points de vie.\\n• Exilez jusqu\'à deux fois X cartes ciblées depuis des cimetières.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« J\'apporte une mort à laquelle nul ne peut échapper. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477107&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc2188c3-89a6-4b49-839c-fe67cc14f57b\', \'multiverseId\': 477107}, \'multiverseid\': 477107}, {\'name\': \'Intervento di Erebos\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Una creatura bersaglio prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno. Guadagni X punti vita.\\n• Esilia fino al doppio di X carte bersaglio dai cimiteri.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Porto una morte a cui nessuno potrà sfuggire."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0552f395-627d-4197-9a0c-2324e2bc059b\', \'multiverseId\': 477361}, \'multiverseid\': 477361}, {\'name\': \'エレボスの介入\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。あなたはＸ点のライフを得る。\\n• 墓地から最大Ｘの２倍の枚数のカードを対象とし、それらを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「我は死をもたらそう。何者も脱出できない死を。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b3be3fe-1a42-4ab2-aa04-e41d047cb3ba\', \'multiverseId\': 477615}, \'multiverseid\': 477615}, {\'name\': \'에레보스의 개입\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -X/-X를 받는다. 당신은 생명 X점을 얻는다.\\n• 무덤들에서 최대 X의 두 배만큼의 카드들을 목표로 정한다. 그 카드들을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"나는 그 누구도 도망칠 수 없는 죽음을 가져온다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b9487a7-aa01-4171-b906-fed871d2c79e\', \'multiverseId\': 477869}, \'multiverseid\': 477869}, {\'name\': \'Intervenção de Érebo\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• A criatura alvo recebe -X/-X até o final do turno. Você ganha X pontos de vida.\\n• Exile até duas vezes X cards alvo de cemitérios.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu trago uma morte da qual ninguém pode escapar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbca99e7-2372-45b3-b533-74fa5ce1e706\', \'multiverseId\': 478123}, \'multiverseid\': 478123}, {\'name\': \'Вмешательство Эреба\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Целевое существо получает -Х/-Х до конца хода. Вы получаете X жизней.\\n• Изгоните не более X целевых карт в двойном размере из кладбищ.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я несу смерть, от которой не ускользнуть никому».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f88b7f27-a1d1-465f-8fa2-04b201018833\', \'multiverseId\': 478377}, \'multiverseid\': 478377}, {\'name\': \'厄睿柏斯的干预\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•目标生物得-X/-X直到回合结束。你获得X点生命。\\n•将至多两倍于X数量的目标牌从坟墓场放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我取下苍生性命，纵英杰亦不能逃。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'695e6dc9-a7ac-44fd-bbda-e0c2f92b72e9\', \'multiverseId\': 478631}, \'multiverseid\': 478631}, {\'name\': \'厄睿柏斯的干預\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•目標生物得-X/-X直到回合結束。你獲得X點生命。\\n•將至多兩倍於X數量的目標牌從墳墓場放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我取下蒼生性命，縱英傑亦不能逃。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25e58b90-a019-42b5-aa4e-3dd6e5e773e0\', \'multiverseId\': 478885}, \'multiverseid\': 478885}]', '[{\'name\': "Iroas\' Segen", \'text\': "Verzaubert eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst\\nWenn Iroas\' Segen ins Spiel kommt, fügt er einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl, die bzw. den ein Gegner kontrolliert, 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Der Segen liegt nicht in der Stärke selbst, sondern in dem Wissen darum, wie man sie einsetzt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476647&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2973b073-b596-4635-9923-4705434e683b\', \'multiverseId\': 476647}, \'multiverseid\': 476647}, {\'name\': \'Bendición de Iroas\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que controlas.\\nCuando la Bendición de Iroas entre al campo de batalla, hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo que controla un oponente.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'La bendición no es la fuerza en sí misma, sino la inteligencia para saber cómo usarla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc11d33c-cb42-43cb-b304-d598757ebe37\', \'multiverseId\': 476901}, \'multiverseid\': 476901}, {\'name\': "Bénédiction d\'Iroas", \'text\': "Enchanter : une créature que vous contrôlez\\nQuand la Bénédiction d\'Iroas arrive sur le champ de bataille, elle inflige 4 blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker, qu\'un adversaire contrôle.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "La bénédiction n\'est pas la force en elle-même, mais le fait de savoir comment l\'utiliser.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477155&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d811c67-4ef9-48a0-a32c-ba66148b80f8\', \'multiverseId\': 477155}, \'multiverseid\': 477155}, {\'name\': \'Benedizione di Iroas\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura che controlli\\nQuando la Benedizione di Iroas entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 4 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio controllati da un avversario.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "La benedizione non è la forza in sé, ma l\'accortezza di saperla usare.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7d6633a-35b7-4628-bdf4-6d9f2469e6d5\', \'multiverseId\': 477409}, \'multiverseid\': 477409}, {\'name\': \'イロアスの恩寵\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー）\\nイロアスの恩寵が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしている、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。イロアスの恩寵はそれに４点のダメージを与える。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'その恩寵そのものは力ではないが、それの使い方を知っていることは力になる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8017187-6af4-401d-a005-818e40e29719\', \'multiverseId\': 477663}, \'multiverseid\': 477663}, {\'name\': \'이로아스의 축복\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물에게 부여\\n이로아스의 축복이 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 이로아스의 축복은 그 목표에게 피해 4점을 입힌다.\\n부여된 생물은 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'축복은 힘 그 자체가 아니라, 그것을 어떻게 사용하는 지에 대한 지식이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5478db1-a43f-43ab-84b2-7d7de93e3033\', \'multiverseId\': 477917}, \'multiverseid\': 477917}, {\'name\': \'Bênção de Iroas\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que você controla\\nQuando Bênção de Iroas entra no campo de batalha, ela causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo que um oponente controla.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'A bênção não é a força em si, mas o conhecimento de como usá-la.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a31b07b0-31b1-4a8d-8110-a9d75dc4afc6\', \'multiverseId\': 478171}, \'multiverseid\': 478171}, {\'name\': \'Благословение Ироя\', \'text\': "Зачаровать существо под вашим контролем\\nКогда Благословение Ироя выходит на поле битвы, оно наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу или planeswalker\'у под контролем оппонента.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Благословение — это не сама сила, а понимание того, как ее использовать.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ee495ff-1d49-4566-b3cd-55965d96f318\', \'multiverseId\': 478425}, \'multiverseid\': 478425}, {\'name\': \'伊洛安斯的祝福\', \'text\': \'结附于由你操控的生物\\n当伊洛安斯的祝福进战场时，它向目标由对手操控的生物或鹏洛客造成4点伤害。\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'这份祝福并非赐你力量，而是赐你学会如何发力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee7d2a9c-c272-44cb-8c77-1dab204eb97b\', \'multiverseId\': 478679}, \'multiverseid\': 478679}, {\'name\': \'伊洛安斯的祝福\', \'text\': \'結附於由你操控的生物\\n當伊洛安斯的祝福進戰場時，它向目標由對手操控的生物或鵬洛客造成4點傷害。\\n所結附的生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'這份祝福並非賜你力量，而是賜你學會如何發力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa82c80e-5b74-4863-9037-c966007f48a6\', \'multiverseId\': 478933}, \'multiverseid\': 478933}]', '[{\'name\': "Klothys\' Plan", \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+X, wobei X gleich deiner Hingabe zu Grün ist. (Jedes {G} in den Manakosten von bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhöht deine Hingabe zu Grün um eins.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Göttin des Schicksals gewährt ihren Anhängern Visionen, die mehr enthüllen als der schärfste Blick.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476681&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd56bf8f-9b9a-4349-b757-7800e14a6e59\', \'multiverseId\': 476681}, \'multiverseid\': 476681}, {\'name\': \'Designio de Klothys\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es tu devoción al verde. (Cada {G} en los costes de maná de los permanentes que controlas cuenta para tu devoción al verde.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La diosa del destino otorga a sus acólitos una visión mucho mayor de lo que abarcan los ojos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ece3086-6d88-4f66-a81e-038c19a132f8\', \'multiverseId\': 476935}, \'multiverseid\': 476935}, {\'name\': \'Dessein de Klothys\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant votre dévotion au vert. (Chaque {G} dans les coûts de mana des permanents que vous contrôlez compte pour votre dévotion au vert.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'La déesse de la destinée accorde à ses fidèles une vision extra-sensorielle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477189&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1e5d4fc-5804-4257-ad7e-f2d077217033\', \'multiverseId\': 477189}, \'multiverseid\': 477189}, {\'name\': \'Disegno di Klotys\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli prendono +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è pari alla tua devozione al verde. (La tua devozione al verde è la somma dei {G} nel costo di mana dei permanenti che controlli.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La dea del destino dona ai suoi seguaci una visione che va oltre la semplice vista.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24cddea3-d7cb-42dc-ae99-8fdab6c53ed0\', \'multiverseId\': 477443}, \'multiverseid\': 477443}, {\'name\': \'クローティスの企図\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたの緑への信心に等しい。（あなたの緑への信心とは、あなたがコントロールしているパーマネントのマナ・コストに含まれる{G}の総数である。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'運命の神は視覚よりも深い幻視を信徒へ与える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11404653-e06a-4d89-b484-45fb6f677f38\', \'multiverseId\': 477697}, \'multiverseid\': 477697}, {\'name\': \'클로티스의 설계\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +X/+X를 받는다. X는 당신의 녹색 신앙심이다. (당신이 조종하는 지속물의 마나 비용에 있는 각 {G}마다 당신의 녹색 신앙심이 1씩 증가한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'운명의 신은 그녀의 추종자들에게 눈으로 볼 수 있는 것보다 더 많은 것을 보여 준다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ce601ee-cf4f-421f-adf3-17e61671463b\', \'multiverseId\': 477951}, \'multiverseid\': 477951}, {\'name\': \'Plano de Clotis\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla recebem +X/+X até o final do turno, sendo X sua devoção ao verde. (Cada {G} nos custos de mana de permanentes que você controla conta para sua devoção ao verde.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A deusa do destino concede a seus seguidores uma visão mais profunda do que aquilo que se pode enxergar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78a8551d-9c67-4927-a722-c9313ea02752\', \'multiverseId\': 478205}, \'multiverseid\': 478205}, {\'name\': \'Замысел Клотис\', \'text\': \'Существа под вашим контролем получают +Х/+X до конца хода, где Х — ваша Преданность зеленому. (Каждый символ {G} в мана-стоимости перманентов под вашим контролем идет в счет вашей Преданности зеленому.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Богиня судьбы дарует своим последователям видение куда глубже, чем зрение смертных.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7e53f70-48d8-4dda-a247-b30abdc92bf3\', \'multiverseId\': 478459}, \'multiverseid\': 478459}, {\'name\': \'克洛缇丝的构想\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为你的绿色献力。（由你操控之永久物的法术力费用当中每含有一个{G}，你的绿色献力就加一。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'命运神会让追随者窥探未来预示，其间景象远超双眼所见。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bda8497-920c-4674-b93b-d5f19cc8127b\', \'multiverseId\': 478713}, \'multiverseid\': 478713}, {\'name\': \'克洛緹絲的構想\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+X/+X直到回合結束，X為你的綠色獻力。（由你操控之永久物的魔法力費用當中每含有一個{G}，你的綠色獻力就加一。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'命運神會讓追隨者窺探未來預示，其間景象遠超雙眼所見。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01dd227b-98af-47d7-8778-be1deb9ec5a5\', \'multiverseId\': 478967}, \'multiverseid\': 478967}]', '[{\'name\': "Mogis\' Gunst", \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/-1.\\nBefreiung — {2}{B}, schicke zwei andere Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Befreiungskosten wirken.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Der wutgekrönte Mogis belohnt bereitwillig die Tugend der Brutalität.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476612&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f02659a3-edaa-41df-a5eb-1d3109920b88\', \'multiverseId\': 476612}, \'multiverseid\': 476612}, {\'name\': \'Favor de Mogis\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/-1.\\nEscapatoria—{2}{B}, exiliar otras dos cartas de tu cementerio. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de escapatoria.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Mogis, el iracundo, premia la virtud de la brutalidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8690dd7-b25a-4705-a026-57e23d40ea9a\', \'multiverseId\': 476866}, \'multiverseid\': 476866}, {\'name\': \'Faveur de Mogis\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/-1.\\nÉchappée — {2}{B}, exilez deux autres cartes de votre cimetière. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût d\'échappée.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'Mogis, le souverain de la rage, est prompt à récompenser la brutalité.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477120&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0347e9b-92e3-4743-a91c-e28a010471b5\', \'multiverseId\': 477120}, \'multiverseid\': 477120}, {\'name\': \'Favore di Mogis\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/-1.\\nFuga—{2}{B}, Esilia altre due carte dal tuo cimitero. (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di fuga.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Mogis, dalla corona di rabbia, ricompensa prontamente la virtù della brutalità.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5efeaf61-02b4-4bcf-bc34-96cd2d901b5e\', \'multiverseId\': 477374}, \'multiverseid\': 477374}, {\'name\': \'モーギスの好意\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/－１の修整を受ける。\\n脱出―{2}{B}, あなたの墓地から他のカード２枚を追放する。（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれの脱出コストで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'怒りの王モーギスは粗暴の美徳を速やかに讃える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f7e634c-694a-4c69-8cc9-5974bdb162bb\', \'multiverseId\': 477628}, \'multiverseid\': 477628}, {\'name\': \'모기스의 은혜\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +2/-1을 받는다.\\n탈출—{2}{B}, 당신의 무덤에서 다른 카드 두 장을 추방한다. (당신은 이 카드의 탈출 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'분노의 왕관을 쓴 모기스는 잔인함의 미덕을 보면 빠르게 보상해 준다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96295839-ec2a-4e83-b9fb-79474e79d38e\', \'multiverseId\': 477882}, \'multiverseid\': 477882}, {\'name\': \'Proteção de Mogis\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/-1.\\nEscapatória — {2}{B}, exile dois outros cards de seu cemitério. (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de escapatória.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Mogis, com sua coroa de fúria, recompensa rapidamente a virtude da brutalidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe12ddf7-e018-4e52-8c45-de7b5d670e19\', \'multiverseId\': 478136}, \'multiverseid\': 478136}, {\'name\': \'Благоволение Могия\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/-1.\\nПобег — {2}{B}, изгоните две другие карты из вашего кладбища. (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Побега.)\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Увенчанный яростью Могий быстро награждает за добродетель жестокости.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a62483c-d773-4646-a092-57dda8aa1a2e\', \'multiverseId\': 478390}, \'multiverseid\': 478390}, {\'name\': \'墨癸斯的眷顾\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/-1。\\n逸脱～{2}{B}，从你的坟墓场放逐两张其他牌。（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其逸脱费用。）\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'怒冕墨癸斯很快就让暴力美德得到嘉奖。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fba07ef-ca33-4333-9956-757245d487f7\', \'multiverseId\': 478644}, \'multiverseid\': 478644}, {\'name\': \'墨癸斯的眷顧\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+2/-1。\\n逸脫～{2}{B}，從你的墳墓場放逐兩張其他牌。（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其逸脫費用。）\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'怒冕墨癸斯很快就讓暴力美德得到嘉獎。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60211450-0017-494b-8732-0856cf2404e3\', \'multiverseId\': 478898}, \'multiverseid\': 478898}]', '[{\'name\': "Purphoros\' Eingreifen", \'text\': "Bestimme eines —\\n• Erzeuge einen X/1 roten Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein mit Eile, der Trampelschaden verursacht. Opfere ihn zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.\\n• Purphoros\' Eingreifen fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl zweimal X Schadenspunkte zu.", \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bringe ein Feuer, in dem die ganze Welt neu geschmiedet wird."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476656&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9b284ee-a664-418b-a3c1-076be334bd03\', \'multiverseId\': 476656}, \'multiverseid\': 476656}, {\'name\': \'Intervención de Purforos\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Crea una ficha de criatura Elemental roja X/1 con las habilidades de arrollar y prisa. Sacrifícala al comienzo del próximo paso final.\\n• La Intervención de Purforos hace el doble de X puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Traigo un fuego que moldeará el mundo de nuevo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee4a7b97-7be4-43e1-a020-b01cefe66c27\', \'multiverseId\': 476910}, \'multiverseid\': 476910}, {\'name\': \'Intervention de Purphoros\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Créez un jeton de créature X/1 rouge Élémental avec le piétinement et la célérité. Sacrifiez-le au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\\n• L\'Intervention de Purphoros inflige deux fois X blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« J\'apporte un feu pour reforger le monde. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477164&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a435556-f9b8-4df6-94eb-3ea2f5a1df40\', \'multiverseId\': 477164}, \'multiverseid\': 477164}, {\'name\': \'Intervento di Purforos\', \'text\': "Scegli uno —\\n• Crea una pedina creatura Elementale X/1 rossa con travolgere e rapidità. Sacrificala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.\\n• L\'Intervento di Purforos infligge danni pari al doppio di X a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Porto un fuoco per riforgiare il mondo intero."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2259e9b9-e7a0-422b-9a3a-8b8f32ff4403\', \'multiverseId\': 477418}, \'multiverseid\': 477418}, {\'name\': \'パーフォロスの介入\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• トランプルと速攻を持つ赤のＸ/１のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それを生け贄に捧げる。\\n• クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。パーフォロスの介入はそれにＸの２倍の点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「我は火をもたらそう。世界全体を作り直す炎を。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74f7d9ac-0942-4fba-ad43-c4ff3b67202c\', \'multiverseId\': 477672}, \'multiverseid\': 477672}, {\'name\': \'퍼포로스의 개입\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 돌진 및 신속을 가진 X/1 적색 정령 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 다음 종료단 시작에 그 생물을 희생한다.\\n• 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 퍼포로스의 개입은 그 목표에게 X의 두 배만큼 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"나는 모든 세계를 재구성할 불을 가져온다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24ab7812-c8b1-403b-8837-24440ba73db1\', \'multiverseId\': 477926}, \'multiverseid\': 477926}, {\'name\': \'Intervenção de Púrforo\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Crie uma ficha de criatura vermelha X/1 do tipo Elemental com atropelar e ímpeto. Sacrifique-a no início da próxima etapa final.\\n• Intervenção de Púrforo causa duas vezes X pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu trago a chama para refundir o mundo inteiro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d2ed42a-b68f-4ae6-8be0-d9c3a28c14db\', \'multiverseId\': 478180}, \'multiverseid\': 478180}, {\'name\': \'Вмешательство Пирфора\', \'text\': "Выберите одно —\\n• Создайте одну фишку существа X/1 красный Элементаль с Пробивным ударом и Ускорением. Пожертвуйте ее в начале следующего заключительного шага.\\n• Вмешательство Пирфора наносит X повреждений в двойном размере целевому существу или planeswalker\'у.", \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Я несу огонь, чтобы перековать весь мир».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0647f6bf-1c57-4e8c-93b8-0f9346285585\', \'multiverseId\': 478434}, \'multiverseid\': 478434}, {\'name\': \'普罗烽斯的干预\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•派出一个X/1红色，具践踏与敏捷异能的元素衍生生物。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它牺牲。\\n•普罗烽斯的干预对目标生物或鹏洛客造成两倍于X数量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我引下熊熊烈火，纵现世亦能重铸。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46bbd110-9094-49ed-a7c7-645c774eebaa\', \'multiverseId\': 478688}, \'multiverseid\': 478688}, {\'name\': \'普羅烽斯的干預\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•派出一個X/1紅色，具踐踏與敏捷異能的元素衍生生物。在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它犧牲。\\n•普羅烽斯的干預對目標生物或鵬洛客造成兩倍於X數量的傷害。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我引下熊熊烈火，縱現世亦能重鑄。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecbdede8-381c-4feb-840d-9bf98e1b2b5e\', \'multiverseId\': 478942}, \'multiverseid\': 478942}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aasplündernde Harpyie\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Aasplündernde Harpyie ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Gegners ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Harpyie\', \'flavor\': \'Die Toten zu entweihen ist für Harpyien eine beliebte Methode, ihre fauligen Sammlungen zu erweitern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476619&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e83d2b67-f36f-42a4-8d7a-e9e53ed0fa30\', \'multiverseId\': 476619}, \'multiverseid\': 476619}, {\'name\': \'Arpía carroñera\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Arpía carroñera entre al campo de batalla, exilia la carta objetivo del cementerio de un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arpía\', \'flavor\': \'Para las arpías, profanar a los muertos es una buena forma de expandir sus repugnantes colecciones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1ed809f-649d-4194-af32-18eb159d00ed\', \'multiverseId\': 476873}, \'multiverseid\': 476873}, {\'name\': \'Harpie nécrophage\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand la Harpie nécrophage arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une carte ciblée depuis le cimetière d\'un adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : harpie\', \'flavor\': "Pour les harpies, la profanation des morts est un moyen pratique d\'élargir leurs infâmes collections.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477127&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'518d3107-fc19-4451-be40-e3730d00e65a\', \'multiverseId\': 477127}, \'multiverseid\': 477127}, {\'name\': \'Arpia Saprofaga\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Arpia Saprofaga entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia una carta bersaglio dal cimitero di un avversario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Arpia\', \'flavor\': \'Per le arpie, profanare i morti è un pratico metodo per ampliare le loro macabre collezioni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1652d2a5-f010-4896-bc64-c25fbbaf179c\', \'multiverseId\': 477381}, \'multiverseid\': 477381}, {\'name\': \'死体あさりのハーピー\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n死体あさりのハーピーが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手の墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハーピー\', \'flavor\': \'ハーピーにとっては、死者の冒涜が悪趣味なコレクションを増やす手軽な手段である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d58ef00-dd64-433c-9617-8c04993b3a9e\', \'multiverseId\': 477635}, \'multiverseid\': 477635}, {\'name\': \'청소하는 하피\', \'text\': \'비행\\n청소하는 하피가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대의 무덤에 있는 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 하피\', \'flavor\': \'망자들을 훼손하는 일은 하피들이 그들의 추악한 수집품을 늘려 나가는 편리한 방법이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f4d4ac9-a66c-44d8-98bb-5ff5eb1a778e\', \'multiverseId\': 477889}, \'multiverseid\': 477889}, {\'name\': \'Harpia Necrófaga\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Harpia Necrófaga entrar no campo de batalha, exile o card alvo do cemitério de um oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Harpia\', \'flavor\': \'Para as harpias, profanar os mortos é um modo conveniente de expandir suas vis coleções.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54dd574a-4171-4c47-a06a-c8f2b94f309a\', \'multiverseId\': 478143}, \'multiverseid\': 478143}, {\'name\': \'Гарпия-Падальщица\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Гарпия-Падальщица выходит на поле битвы, изгоните целевую карту из кладбища оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гарпия\', \'flavor\': \'Осквернять мертвых — для гарпий удобный способ пополнять свои тошнотворные коллекции.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4d22b5a-9772-45c2-94a0-718f47653dd5\', \'multiverseId\': 478397}, \'multiverseid\': 478397}, {\'name\': \'拾荒哈痞\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当拾荒哈痞进战场时，将目标牌从对手的坟墓场放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～哈痞\', \'flavor\': \'亵渎亡者，是哈痞增加自己秽物收藏的快捷方式。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32cc9845-b081-4c53-9433-ae23c0e283df\', \'multiverseId\': 478651}, \'multiverseid\': 478651}, {\'name\': \'拾荒哈痞\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當拾荒哈痞進戰場時，將目標牌從對手的墳墓場放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～哈痞\', \'flavor\': \'褻瀆亡者，是哈痞增加自己穢物收藏的快捷方式。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9990e54-b315-4167-8289-98d786ac9d57\', \'multiverseId\': 478905}, \'multiverseid\': 478905}]', '[{\'name\': \'Absturz\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine fliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Pfeil von Nyleas Bogen verfehlt nie sein Ziel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476699&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5361c239-9dbb-4cd1-a219-b573c89f4f14\', \'multiverseId\': 476699}, \'multiverseid\': 476699}, {\'name\': \'En picado\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Las flechas del arco de Nylea nunca fallan su objetivo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'756d170d-d782-4b35-826a-c9eef85180e7\', \'multiverseId\': 476953}, \'multiverseid\': 476953}, {\'name\': \'Tomber à pic\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature avec le vol ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Une flèche décochée par l\'arc de Nyléa ne rate jamais sa cible.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477207&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61b776dd-30dc-43bc-b1cb-6653637b8cc4\', \'multiverseId\': 477207}, \'multiverseid\': 477207}, {\'name\': \'Cadere a Picco\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Una freccia scagliata dall\'arco di Nylea non manca mai il bersaglio.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'957f58bc-622c-4b35-8d72-7ce7226cde02\', \'multiverseId\': 477461}, \'multiverseid\': 477461}, {\'name\': \'垂直落下\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ナイレアの弓が放つ矢は決して狙いを外さない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33d586aa-7980-443e-b87e-58b1d877a98b\', \'multiverseId\': 477715}, \'multiverseid\': 477715}, {\'name\': \'급추락\', \'text\': \'비행을 가진 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'닐리아의 활에서 쏘아진 화살은 그 목표를 놓치는 일이 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a686112-b07e-4d2c-8c1f-0e895cb859c9\', \'multiverseId\': 477969}, \'multiverseid\': 477969}, {\'name\': \'Tombar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Uma flecha do arco de Nileia jamais erra o alvo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cb2be97-cee5-478d-9958-7a07a5ea5f4d\', \'multiverseId\': 478223}, \'multiverseid\': 478223}, {\'name\': \'Стремительное Падение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Стрела из лука Нилеи всегда попадает в цель.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65b4ae4e-bf14-43c6-837f-7aef327dd997\', \'multiverseId\': 478477}, \'multiverseid\': 478477}, {\'name\': \'铅直落下\', \'text\': \'消灭目标具飞行异能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'倪勒娅神弓射出的箭从不错失目标。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a81c906-b74f-4fe7-9be9-420aaddef2d6\', \'multiverseId\': 478731}, \'multiverseid\': 478731}, {\'name\': \'鉛直落下\', \'text\': \'消滅目標具飛行異能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'倪勒婭神弓射出的箭從不錯失目標。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01c88d61-3817-4b62-94fa-92818c50f5fa\', \'multiverseId\': 478985}, \'multiverseid\': 478985}]', '[{\'name\': \'Achtlose Zelebrantin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Achtlose Zelebrantin stirbt, fügt sie einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl, die bzw. den ein Gegner kontrolliert, 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Satyr, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Renata war wie hypnotisiert vom Tanz des Satyrs, der freudige Gleichgültigkeit, verwegene Anmut und strahlendes Unglück in sich vereinte."\\n—Luphea von Setessa, *Chroniken*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476634&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a08b52e-7c20-43a5-bfdd-5d60f261ecad\', \'multiverseId\': 476634}, \'multiverseid\': 476634}, {\'name\': \'Celebrante descuidada\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Celebrante descuidada muera, hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Renata se quedó fascinada al ver la danza de la sátira, que mezclaba una alegre indiferencia con una gracia temeraria y el más puro desastre".\\n—Lufea de Setessa, *Historias*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aa581f9-b244-4ce6-8713-e36c9a8ca36e\', \'multiverseId\': 476888}, \'multiverseid\': 476888}, {\'name\': \'Officiante imprudente\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Officiante imprudente meurt, elle inflige 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker, qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : satyre et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Rénata était captivée par la danse de la satyre, mêlant indifférence joyeuse, grâce téméraire et désastre radieux. »\\n—Luphéa de Setessa, *Histoires*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477142&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dece8a8a-14f1-4bcf-868a-1ac408cadba0\', \'multiverseId\': 477142}, \'multiverseid\': 477142}, {\'name\': \'Celebrante Spensierata\', \'text\': \'Quando la Celebrante Spensierata muore, infligge 2 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio controllati da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Satiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Renata era rapita dalla danza di gioiosa indifferenza, noncurante grazia e radiosa rovina del satiro."\\n—Lufea di Setessa, *Storie*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37f04a69-fee2-4e0d-bef3-76c6aae500f8\', \'multiverseId\': 477396}, \'multiverseid\': 477396}, {\'name\': \'軽率な祝賀者\', \'text\': \'軽率な祝賀者が死亡したとき、対戦相手がコントロールしている、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。これはそれに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サテュロス・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「レナータはサテュロスの明るく無邪気なダンスに魅了された。そこには無謀な優美と華麗な惨事があった。」\\n――セテッサのルフェア、「*歴史*」より\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cbce3d3-37b7-4ad2-af44-c7d6f6c55853\', \'multiverseId\': 477650}, \'multiverseid\': 477650}, {\'name\': \'조심성 없는 사제\', \'text\': \'조심성 없는 사제가 죽을 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 조심성 없는 사제는 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 사티로스 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'"레나타는 유쾌한 무관심과, 무모한 우아함, 밝은 재앙을 아우르는 사티로스의 춤에 매료되었다."\\n—세테사의 루피아, *역사서*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f96785f-ef6c-461b-9c6e-ad24309c7509\', \'multiverseId\': 477904}, \'multiverseid\': 477904}, {\'name\': \'Celebrante Incauta\', \'text\': \'Quando Celebrante Incauta morre, ela causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo que um oponente controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Renata ficou hipnotizada pela dança da sátira, alegremente indiferente, graciosamente temerária e desastrosamente brilhante."\\n— Lufeia de Setessa, *Histórias*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d593e46-8fe1-48b2-83dc-4ebf76f6448d\', \'multiverseId\': 478158}, \'multiverseid\': 478158}, {\'name\': \'Беспечная Кутила\', \'text\': "Когда Беспечная Кутила умирает, она наносит 2 повреждения целевому существу или planeswalker\'у под контролем оппонента.", \'type\': \'Существо — Сатир Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Ренату заворожил танец сатира — в нем было радостное безразличие, безрассудная грация и яркое предчувствие беды».\\n— Луфея из Сетессы, *«Истории»*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'559c9697-e5f7-401d-9c71-4cb320afb32f\', \'multiverseId\': 478412}, \'multiverseid\': 478412}, {\'name\': \'无忌主祭\', \'text\': \'当无忌主祭死去时，它向目标由对手操控的生物或鹏洛客造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～羊蹄人／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「羊蹄人的舞蹈在冷漠中流露欢欣，在美善中夹杂无情，在灾难中体现希望，瑞娜塔就此沉迷其中。」\\n～瑟特萨的吕菲娅，《史典》**\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe01e2a6-17fe-4ca5-a6fe-fc3583c6234e\', \'multiverseId\': 478666}, \'multiverseid\': 478666}, {\'name\': \'無忌主祭\', \'text\': \'當無忌主祭死去時，它向目標由對手操控的生物或鵬洛客造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～羊蹄人／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「羊蹄人的舞蹈在冷漠中流露歡欣，在美善中夾雜無情，在災難中體現希望，瑞娜塔就此沉迷其中。」\\n～瑟特薩的呂菲婭，《史典》**\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e670159-26ed-4d23-94ad-6133c3f372f3\', \'multiverseId\': 478920}, \'multiverseid\': 478920}]', '[{\'name\': \'Albtraumtaucher\', \'text\': \'Der Albtraumtaucher erhält +3/+0, solange sich zehn oder mehr Karten in einem einzigen Friedhof befinden.\\nDer Albtraumtaucher kann nicht geblockt werden, solange du einen Ashiok Planeswalker kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nachtmahr, Meervolk\', \'flavor\': \'Ashioks Diener ergründen die Tiefen der Ozeane und der Psyche.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479190&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3e96742-7112-48d1-9c62-5e25077be33a\', \'multiverseId\': 479190}, \'multiverseid\': 479190}, {\'name\': \'Nadador de pesadillas\', \'text\': \'El Nadador de pesadillas obtiene +3/+0 mientras haya diez o más cartas en un mismo cementerio.\\nEl Nadador de pesadillas no puede ser bloqueado mientras controles un planeswalker Ashiok.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritón pesadilla\', \'flavor\': \'Los secuaces de Ashiok sondan tanto las profundidades del océano como la psique.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfe5bc19-4281-4e46-a508-25815d795077\', \'multiverseId\': 479208}, \'multiverseid\': 479208}, {\'name\': \'Nageur des cauchemars\', \'text\': "Le Nageur des cauchemars gagne +3/+0 tant qu\'il y a au moins dix cartes dans un cimetière unique.\\nLe Nageur des cauchemars ne peut pas être bloqué tant que vous contrôlez un planeswalker Ashiok.", \'type\': \'Créature : cauchemar et ondin\', \'flavor\': "Les serviteurs d\'Ashiok sondent les profondeurs de l\'océan et de la psyché.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479226&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'257f0693-c0c4-4894-bbf5-a40eddf8b022\', \'multiverseId\': 479226}, \'multiverseid\': 479226}, {\'name\': \'Nuotatore negli Incubi\', \'text\': \'Il Nuotatore negli Incubi prende +3/+0 fintanto che ci sono dieci o più carte in un singolo cimitero.\\nIl Nuotatore negli Incubi non può essere bloccato fintanto che controlli un planeswalker Ashiok.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tritone Incubo\', \'flavor\': "I servitori di Ashiok sondano le profondità dell\'oceano e della psiche.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c33ff1c4-d2a3-4019-889d-bfa3be342ada\', \'multiverseId\': 479244}, \'multiverseid\': 479244}, {\'name\': \'悪夢を泳ぐ者\', \'text\': \'墓地１つにカードが10枚以上あるかぎり、悪夢を泳ぐ者は＋３/＋０の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがアショク・プレインズウォーカーをコントロールしているかぎり、悪夢を泳ぐ者はブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナイトメア・マーフォーク\', \'flavor\': \'アショクの下僕たちは、錘を垂らして海洋や精神の深さを測る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cacc288-7eaf-44c3-810e-af283d29fe7b\', \'multiverseId\': 479262}, \'multiverseid\': 479262}, {\'name\': \'악몽 속을 헤엄치는 자\', \'text\': \'어느 한 무덤에 카드가 열 장 이상 있는 한 악몽 속을 헤엄치는 자는 +3/+0을 받는다.\\n악몽 속을 헤엄치는 자는 당신이 아시오크 플레인즈워커를 조종하는 한 방어될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 나이트메어 인어\', \'flavor\': \'아시오크의 하수인들은 바다와 정신의 극단을 보여준다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9f35abc-8d04-48aa-9de9-6502c803fe15\', \'multiverseId\': 479280}, \'multiverseid\': 479280}, {\'name\': \'Nadador de Pesadelos\', \'text\': \'Nadador de Pesadelos recebe +3/+0 enquanto houver dez ou mais cards em um único cemitério.\\nNadador de Pesadelos não pode ser bloqueado enquanto você controlar um planeswalker Ashiok.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pesadelo Tritão\', \'flavor\': \'Os lacaios de Ashiok exploram as profundezas do oceano e da psiquê.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db0ecb3d-6fe5-4e80-a69f-592ef16ab292\', \'multiverseId\': 479298}, \'multiverseid\': 479298}, {\'name\': \'Ныряльщик в Кошмары\', \'text\': "Ныряльщик в Кошмары получает +3/+0, пока на одном кладбище есть не менее десяти карт.\\nНыряльщик в Кошмары не может быть заблокирован, пока вы контролируете planeswalker\'а Ашиока.", \'type\': \'Существо — Кошмар Мерфолк\', \'flavor\': \'Приспешники Ашиока погружаются в глубины океана и разума.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffe8b564-b63b-4f0e-9e1a-d512782ad78a\', \'multiverseId\': 479316}, \'multiverseid\': 479316}, {\'name\': \'梦魇潜探客\', \'text\': \'只要某个坟墓场中有十张或更多牌，梦魇潜探客便得+3/+0。\\n只要你操控安梭苛鹏洛客，梦魇潜探客便不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～梦魇／人鱼\', \'flavor\': \'安梭苛的手下既能畅游深洋，也能究索心灵。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d6570e9-10e7-4a94-b061-8e0bd135f910\', \'multiverseId\': 479334}, \'multiverseid\': 479334}, {\'name\': \'夢魘潛探客\', \'text\': \'只要某個墳墓場中有十張或更多牌，夢魘潛探客便得+3/+0。\\n只要你操控安梭苛鵬洛客，夢魘潛探客便不能被阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～夢魘人魚\', \'flavor\': \'安梭苛的手下既能暢遊深洋，也能究索心靈。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5238a267-d67a-4c5b-8826-06eeda1d25b0\', \'multiverseId\': 479352}, \'multiverseid\': 479352}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alirios der Schmachtende\', \'text\': \'Alirios der Schmachtende kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nAlirios enttappt nicht während deines Enttappsegments, falls du eine Reflexion kontrollierst.\\nWenn Alirios ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 3/2 blauen Reflexion-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch\', \'flavor\': \'„Warum sollte ich jemals meinen Blick abwenden wollen?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476547&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e68530c-a121-4289-9d40-11891dfd865a\', \'multiverseId\': 476547}, \'multiverseid\': 476547}, {\'name\': \'Alirios, cautivado\', \'text\': \'Alirios, cautivado entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nAlirios no se endereza durante tu paso de enderezar si controlas un Reflejo.\\nCuando Alirios entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Reflejo azul 3/2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Por qué alguien querría apartar la mirada?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bb15919-d8d8-4e39-bf24-c29f86149bd4\', \'multiverseId\': 476801}, \'multiverseid\': 476801}, {\'name\': \'Alirios, en extase\', \'text\': \'Alirios, en extase arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nAlirios ne se dégage pas pendant votre étape de dégagement si vous contrôlez un reflet.\\nQuand Alirios arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 3/2 bleue Reflet.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain\', \'flavor\': \'« Pourquoi détournerais-je le regard ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477055&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4d1502e-3139-4bc1-94ac-29747ed708fb\', \'multiverseId\': 477055}, \'multiverseid\': 477055}, {\'name\': \'Alirios, Estasiato\', \'text\': \'Alirios, Estasiato entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nAlirios non STAPpa durante il tuo STAP se controlli un Riflesso.\\nQuando Alirios entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Riflesso 3/2 blu.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Perché mai dovrei voler distogliere lo sguardo?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fbadc1b-29c9-4fd7-9b12-8637c41ee3e6\', \'multiverseId\': 477309}, \'multiverseid\': 477309}, {\'name\': \'魅了された者、アリリオス\', \'text\': \'魅了された者、アリリオスはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたが反射をコントロールしているなら、魅了された者、アリリオスはあなたのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\\n魅了された者、アリリオスが戦場に出たとき、青の３/２の反射・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間\', \'flavor\': \'「目を離したいなんて思うだろうか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9238b22b-377d-4703-b6e0-8cd394fe7148\', \'multiverseId\': 477563}, \'multiverseid\': 477563}, {\'name\': \'도취된 자, 알리리오스\', \'text\': \'도취된 자, 알리리오스는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n당신이 형상을 조종한다면 알리리오스는 당신의 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\\n알리리오스가 전장에 들어올 때, 3/2 청색 형상 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간\', \'flavor\': \'"왜 내가 잠시라도 다른 곳을 보려고 하겠어?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9326d4d-9896-4a35-ac0c-698b4b742266\', \'multiverseId\': 477817}, \'multiverseid\': 477817}, {\'name\': \'Alírio, Extasiado\', \'text\': \'Alírio, Extasiado, entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nAlírio não é desvirado durante sua etapa de desvirar se você controla um Reflexo.\\nQuando Alírio entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura azul 3/2 do tipo Reflexo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Por que eu desejaria desviar o olhar?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f6867d1-87b9-4cd1-86f0-15e923a1a3b8\', \'multiverseId\': 478071}, \'multiverseid\': 478071}, {\'name\': \'Алирий, Завороженный\', \'text\': \'Алирий, Завороженный выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nАлирий не разворачивается во время вашего шага разворота, если вы контролируете Отражение.\\nКогда Алирий выходит на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку существа 3/2 синее Отражение.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек\', \'flavor\': \'«Разве можно отвести взгляд от такой красоты?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'706b391d-db46-46d7-8f00-8cc7a1de98ab\', \'multiverseId\': 478325}, \'multiverseid\': 478325}, {\'name\': \'映影痴阿里流士\', \'text\': \'映影痴阿里流士须横置进战场。\\n如果你操控映影，则阿里流士于你的重置步骤中不能重置。\\n当阿里流士进战场时，派出一个3/2蓝色映影衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类\', \'flavor\': \'「还有什么值得我移开目光？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1b52983-2788-4e27-a994-6f836f8f874c\', \'multiverseId\': 478579}, \'multiverseid\': 478579}, {\'name\': \'映影癡阿里流士\', \'text\': \'映影癡阿里流士須橫置進戰場。\\n如果你操控映影，則阿里流士於你的重置步驟中不能重置。\\n當阿里流士進戰場時，派出一個3/2藍色映影衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類\', \'flavor\': \'「還有什麼值得我移開目光？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f659feaa-2551-4dc1-a91c-0ad8ac238432\', \'multiverseId\': 478833}, \'multiverseid\': 478833}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alseide der Lebensfülle\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\n{1}, opfere den Alseiden der Lebensfülle: Eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges Schutz vor einer Farbe, die du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Nymphe\', \'flavor\': \'„Von der Morgenröte geküsst, nährt er das goldene Korn."\\n—Psemilla, meletische Poetin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476506&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6904063-8b20-40e6-afd2-826aef99dd32\', \'multiverseId\': 476506}, \'multiverseid\': 476506}, {\'name\': \'Alseide de la riqueza vital\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\\n{1}, sacrificar el Alseide de la riqueza vital: La criatura o encantamiento objetivo que controlas gana protección contra el color de tu elección hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': \'"Por el amanecer besado / nutre el grano dorado".\\n—Psemila, poeta meletiana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bf29eae-5dc8-4b33-9a7a-057de835434c\', \'multiverseId\': 476760}, \'multiverseid\': 476760}, {\'name\': \'Alséide du don de vie\', \'text\': "Lien de vie\\n{1}, sacrifiez l\'Alséide du don de vie : La créature ciblée ou l\'enchantement ciblé que vous contrôlez acquiert la protection contre la couleur de votre choix jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : nymphe\', \'flavor\': "« Embrassé par l\'aurore, il fait pousser le blé doré. »\\n—Psémilla, poétesse mélétisienne", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477014&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91d5515c-0fd8-47aa-9d2b-7600ee19d380\', \'multiverseId\': 477014}, \'multiverseid\': 477014}, {\'name\': "Alseide dell\'Abbondanza Vitale", \'text\': "Legame vitale\\n{1}, Sacrifica l\'Alseide dell\'Abbondanza Vitale: Una creatura o un incantesimo bersaglio che controlli ha protezione da un colore a tua scelta fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': \'"Baciato dall\\\'alba, nutre il grano dorato."\\n—Psemilla, poetessa di Meletis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6af61ff5-944b-4ce1-afa8-436ce3ee6a51\', \'multiverseId\': 477268}, \'multiverseid\': 477268}, {\'name\': \'命の恵みのアルセイド\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\n{1}, 命の恵みのアルセイドを生け贄に捧げる：あなたがコントロールしている、クリーチャー１体かエンチャント１つを対象とする。色１色を選ぶ。ターン終了時まで、それはプロテクション（その選ばれた色）を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ニンフ\', \'flavor\': \'「暁の口付ける者、彼は黄金の穂を滋養する。」\\n――メレティスの詩人、プセミラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15a97f97-2554-4eeb-8f9c-877af2afff44\', \'multiverseId\': 477522}, \'multiverseid\': 477522}, {\'name\': \'생명의 풍요함의 알세이드\', \'text\': \'생명연결\\n{1}, 생명의 풍요함의 알세이드를 희생한다: 당신이 조종하는 생물 또는 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표는 턴종료까지 당신이 선택한 색으로부터 보호를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 님프\', \'flavor\': \'"새벽의 입맞춤을 받은 그는 황금빛 곡식을 풍요롭게 한다."\\n—멜레티스 시인, 세밀라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bd91c8a-da55-4aae-a9cd-1fdc63d7e3cd\', \'multiverseId\': 477776}, \'multiverseid\': 477776}, {\'name\': \'Alseíde da Dádiva da Vida\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida\\n{1}, sacrifique Alseíde da Dádiva da Vida: A criatura ou o encantamento alvo que você controla ganha proteção contra a cor à sua escolha até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': \'"Ao beijo da aurora, ele nutre o grão d\\\'ouro."\\n— Psemília, poetisa meletiana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e188044-47f5-4b6e-8344-f501c64d4e07\', \'multiverseId\': 478030}, \'multiverseid\': 478030}, {\'name\': \'Альсеид Щедрости Жизни\', \'text\': \'Цепь жизни\\n{1}, пожертвуйте Альсеида Щедрости Жизни: целевое существо или чары под вашим контролем получают Защиту от выбранного вами цвета до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Нимфа\', \'flavor\': \'«Он, поцелованный зарей, растит золотое жито».\\n— Псемилла, мелетидская поэтесса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd81a140-548f-4f9f-9f93-a36dbc2a2cd5\', \'multiverseId\': 478284}, \'multiverseid\': 478284}, {\'name\': \'丰穰蔻灵\', \'text\': \'系命\\n{1}，牺牲丰穰蔻灵：选择一种颜色。目标由你操控的生物或结界获得反该色保护异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界生物 ～宁芙\', \'flavor\': \'「他挥洒晨光，滋养世间谷物。」\\n～迈勒提斯诗人普塞弥拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd0c17a6-1150-4e2a-ac76-f899c46d341c\', \'multiverseId\': 478538}, \'multiverseid\': 478538}, {\'name\': \'豐穰蔻靈\', \'text\': \'繫命\\n{1}，犧牲豐穰蔻靈：選擇一種顏色。目標由你操控的生物或結界獲得反該色保護異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'結界生物 ～寧芙\', \'flavor\': \'「他揮灑晨光，滋養世間穀物。」\\n～邁勒提斯詩人普塞彌拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8052bcb5-fb5e-4d67-bbd3-aefe6d0709f3\', \'multiverseId\': 478792}, \'multiverseid\': 478792}]', "[{'name': 'Altar des Pantheons', 'text': 'Deine Hingabe zu jeder Farbe und jeder Kombination von Farben ist um eins erhöht.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Falls du einen Gott, einen Halbgott oder eine legendäre Verzauberung kontrollierst, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476736&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17130b3b-d861-420e-a3b3-5677796e261a', 'multiverseId': 476736}, 'multiverseid': 476736}, {'name': 'Altar del panteón', 'text': 'Tu devoción a cada color y a cada combinación de colores aumenta en uno.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color. Si controlas una Deidad, un Semidiós o un encantamiento legendario, ganas 1 vida.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476990&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1a4bf51-b973-4447-abf8-f9e0fedd70eb', 'multiverseId': 476990}, 'multiverseid': 476990}, {'name': 'Autel du panthéon', 'text': 'Votre dévotion à chaque couleur et à chaque combinaison de couleurs est augmentée de un.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. Si vous contrôlez un dieu, un demi-dieu ou un enchantement légendaire, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477244&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff7c5ec9-1459-49db-b6c9-8910f51d7897', 'multiverseId': 477244}, 'multiverseid': 477244}, {'name': 'Altare del Pantheon', 'text': 'La tua devozione a ogni colore e ogni combinazione di colori aumenta di uno.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore. Se controlli un Dio, un Semidio o un incantesimo leggendario, guadagni 1 punto vita.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477498&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a44f409c-43cd-4e44-87e2-24a2b9b844ad', 'multiverseId': 477498}, 'multiverseid': 477498}, {'name': '万神殿の祭壇', 'text': 'あなたの、各色や色の各組み合わせへの信心はそれぞれ１多くなる。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。あなたが神か亜神か伝説のエンチャントをコントロールしているなら、あなたは１点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477752&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07041786-88c4-44bf-8c54-54c37bad2066', 'multiverseId': 477752}, 'multiverseid': 477752}, {'name': '신계의 제단', 'text': '당신의 각 색 및 각 색조합 신앙심이 1 증가한다.\\n{T}: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다. 당신이 신, 반신, 또는 전설적 부여마법을 조종한다면, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.', 'type': '마법물체', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478006&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba311f45-acd9-42f5-81af-763a181e5f60', 'multiverseId': 478006}, 'multiverseid': 478006}, {'name': 'Altar do Panteão', 'text': 'Sua devoção a cada cor e a cada combinação de cores aumenta em um.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor. Se você controla um Deus, Semideus ou encantamento lendário, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478260&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '185d8f3e-04e8-4ebb-a89e-66eb380f4642', 'multiverseId': 478260}, 'multiverseid': 478260}, {'name': 'Алтарь Пантеона', 'text': 'Ваша Преданность каждому цвету и каждому сочетанию цветов увеличивается на один.\\n{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета. Если у вас под контролем есть Бог, Полубог или легендарные чары, вы получаете 1 жизнь.', 'type': 'Артефакт', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478514&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75f1b662-e716-4d47-b905-73d6ba87d0a8', 'multiverseId': 478514}, 'multiverseid': 478514}, {'name': '诸神祭坛', 'text': '你每种颜色和每种颜色组合的献力都加一。\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。如果你操控神、半神或传奇结界，则你获得1点生命。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478768&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5d56c00-63e9-4080-9c0b-2511e669e3a1', 'multiverseId': 478768}, 'multiverseid': 478768}, {'name': '諸神祭壇', 'text': '你每種顏色和每種顏色組合的獻力都加一。\\n{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。如果你操控神、半神或傳奇結界，則你獲得1點生命。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479022&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c15a761-c0ab-4d9d-8d99-7c2af7562a2d', 'multiverseId': 479022}, 'multiverseid': 479022}]", '[{\'name\': \'Amulett des Reisenden\', \'text\': \'{1}, opfere das Amulett des Reisenden: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Vision von zu Hause und ein Schimmer der Hoffnung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476745&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a028df0e-6f43-493f-a89d-6fb172db82d2\', \'multiverseId\': 476745}, \'multiverseid\': 476745}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto del viajero\', \'text\': \'{1}, sacrificar el Amuleto del viajero: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Un recuerdo del hogar y un rayo de esperanza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e0daa95-8fe2-46df-a4cc-897dc81a93f2\', \'multiverseId\': 476999}, \'multiverseid\': 476999}, {\'name\': \'Amulette du voyageur\', \'text\': "{1}, sacrifiez l\'Amulette du voyageur : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Un aperçu de la maison, et une lueur d\'espoir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477253&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95b20fe0-57db-43c9-90b2-d7441c9bce8d\', \'multiverseId\': 477253}, \'multiverseid\': 477253}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto del Viaggiatore\', \'text\': "{1}, Sacrifica l\'Amuleto del Viaggiatore: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Una visione di casa e un barlume di speranza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff9e2214-2d86-44f2-a77e-d6052e04b9af\', \'multiverseId\': 477507}, \'multiverseid\': 477507}, {\'name\': \'旅行者の護符\', \'text\': \'{1}, 旅行者の護符を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'故郷の幻視と僅かな希望。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f996ea9-1ea5-4b60-9ec7-210d3f8a234c\', \'multiverseId\': 477761}, \'multiverseid\': 477761}, {\'name\': \'여행자의 부적\', \'text\': \'{1}, 여행자의 부적을 희생한다: 당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개하고, 당신의 손으로 가져간 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'고향의 모습을 보여 주며, 희망을 엿보게 해 준다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28b42467-abc8-4a06-92d9-63e5b1fc59ac\', \'multiverseId\': 478015}, \'multiverseid\': 478015}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto do Viajante\', \'text\': \'{1}, sacrifique Amuleto do Viajante: Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e, depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Uma visão de casa, um vislumbre de esperança.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73d2cec6-34c0-4e23-aedb-c803fab1d4c5\', \'multiverseId\': 478269}, \'multiverseid\': 478269}, {\'name\': \'Амулет Путешественника\', \'text\': \'{1}, пожертвуйте Амулет Путешественника: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Видение дома и смутный проблеск надежды.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f64acea-bed6-4127-9876-cdb3d379e999\', \'multiverseId\': 478523}, \'multiverseid\': 478523}, {\'name\': \'旅人护身符\', \'text\': \'{1}，牺牲旅人护身符：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'家园一景，希望所存。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1664bf09-2bd5-418b-8428-f81b895df624\', \'multiverseId\': 478777}, \'multiverseid\': 478777}, {\'name\': \'旅人護身符\', \'text\': \'{1}，犧牲旅人護身符：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'家園一景，希望所存。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a43e4ee-bcec-492f-acde-da3aabd47e81\', \'multiverseId\': 479031}, \'multiverseid\': 479031}]', '[{\'name\': \'An Staub klammern\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte war, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu. Anderenfalls ziehst du eine Karte.\\nBefreiung — {3}{B}, schicke fünf andere Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Befreiungskosten wirken.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Im trostlosen Tizerus zerbröckelt alle Hoffnung in deinen Händen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476592&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fa22937-c6fd-4a9b-b025-001df9f31258\', \'multiverseId\': 476592}, \'multiverseid\': 476592}, {\'name\': \'Aferrarse al polvo\', \'text\': \'Exilia la carta objetivo de un cementerio. Si era una carta de criatura, ganas 3 vidas. De lo contrario, robas una carta.\\nEscapatoria—{3}{B}, exiliar otras cinco cartas de tu cementerio. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de escapatoria.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'En el lúgubre Tizerus, todas las esperanzas a las que te aferrabas se desvanecen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aab37258-6bd6-4e77-ae1a-38e75cc96e44\', \'multiverseId\': 476846}, \'multiverseid\': 476846}, {\'name\': "S\'agripper à la poussière", \'text\': "Exilez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière. Si c\'était une carte de créature, vous gagnez 3 points de vie. Sinon, vous piochez une carte.\\nÉchappée — {3}{B}, exilez cinq autres cartes de votre cimetière. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût d\'échappée.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Dans la désolation du Tizère, tout espoir s\'effrite dans le creux de votre main.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477100&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'004b38c4-fb75-4f43-8ad3-97f4d740f944\', \'multiverseId\': 477100}, \'multiverseid\': 477100}, {\'name\': \'Aggrapparsi alla Polvere\', \'text\': \'Esilia una carta bersaglio da un cimitero. Se era una carta creatura, guadagni 3 punti vita. Altrimenti, pesca una carta.\\nFuga—{3}{B}, Esilia altre cinque carte dal tuo cimitero. (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di fuga.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Nella desolazione di Tizerus, ogni speranza si sgretola tra le dita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b297822-b958-4001-ab65-783c7f4a3088\', \'multiverseId\': 477354}, \'multiverseid\': 477354}, {\'name\': \'塵へのしがみつき\', \'text\': \'墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、あなたは３点のライフを得る。そうでないなら、あなたはカードを１枚引く。\\n脱出―{3}{B}, あなたの墓地から他のカード５枚を追放する。（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれの脱出コストで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'荒涼としたティゼルスでは、すべての希望は手にする前に崩れてしまう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'291417f1-c194-4007-944a-fd11c97cedf9\', \'multiverseId\': 477608}, \'multiverseid\': 477608}, {\'name\': \'먼지를 붙잡다\', \'text\': \'무덤에 있는 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 추방한다. 그 카드가 생물 카드였다면, 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다. 그렇지 않으면, 당신은 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n탈출—{3}{B}, 당신의 무덤에서 다른 카드 다섯 장을 추방한다. (당신은 이 카드의 탈출 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'황량한 티제루스에서는, 모든 희망이 손아귀 안에서 부스러져내린다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62011196-29cc-47ff-a61b-d9b8095b8cd3\', \'multiverseId\': 477862}, \'multiverseid\': 477862}, {\'name\': \'Agarrar-se ao Pó\', \'text\': \'Exile o card alvo de um cemitério. Se for um card de criatura, você ganha 3 pontos de vida. Caso contrário, você compra um card.\\nEscapatória — {3}{B}, exile cinco outros cards de seu cemitério. (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de escapatória.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Na desolação do Tízero, toda esperança se esfacela por entre os dedos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b73f505c-1487-440b-ad50-d4f04c6dccf4\', \'multiverseId\': 478116}, \'multiverseid\': 478116}, {\'name\': \'Цепляться за Прах\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевую карту из кладбища. Если это была карта существа, вы получаете 3 жизни. В противном случае вы берете карту.\\nПобег — {3}{B}, изгоните пять других карт из вашего кладбища. (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Побега.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'В безрадостном Тизерии все надежды рассыпаются при одном прикосновении.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aa39cc8-bdac-47dc-8a51-e8fd293c74ef\', \'multiverseId\': 478370}, \'multiverseid\': 478370}, {\'name\': \'执持化尘\', \'text\': \'将目标牌从坟墓场放逐。如果该牌是生物牌，则你获得3点生命。若否，你抓一张牌。\\n逸脱～{3}{B}，从你的坟墓场放逐五张其他牌。（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其逸脱费用。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'在阴黯的提泽拉司境内，所有希望都会在你掌心化作尘埃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9a41a51-5a94-4a02-b8b8-d397c0e4e15c\', \'multiverseId\': 478624}, \'multiverseid\': 478624}, {\'name\': \'執持化塵\', \'text\': \'將目標牌從墳墓場放逐。如果該牌是生物牌，則你獲得3點生命。若否，你抽一張牌。\\n逸脫～{3}{B}，從你的墳墓場放逐五張其他牌。（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其逸脫費用。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'在陰闇的提澤拉司境內，所有希望都會在你掌心化作塵埃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cb5ec4a-9862-4ca6-97ac-b1caa0bd0272\', \'multiverseId\': 478878}, \'multiverseid\': 478878}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anax der Schmiedegestählte\', \'text\': \'Anax\\\' Stärke ist gleich deiner Hingabe zu Rot. (Jedes {R} in den Manakosten von bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhöht deine Hingabe zu Rot um eins.)\\nImmer wenn Anax oder eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 roten Satyr-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur kann nicht blocken." Falls die Kreatur Stärke 4 oder mehr hatte, erzeuge stattdessen zwei solcher Spielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Halbgott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476630&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'771cca27-c963-4aff-8e03-4e4d4e95d324\', \'multiverseId\': 476630}, \'multiverseid\': 476630}, {\'name\': \'Anax, endurecido en la forja\', \'text\': \'La fuerza de Anax es igual a tu devoción al rojo. (Cada {R} en los costes de maná de los permanentes que controlas cuenta para tu devoción al rojo.)\\nSiempre que Anax u otra criatura que no sea ficha que controlas muera, crea una ficha de criatura Sátiro roja 1/1 con "Esta criatura no puede bloquear". Si la fuerza de la criatura era de 4 o más, en vez de eso, crea dos de esas fichas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento legendaria — Semidiós\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aab258e9-ab5f-4d12-8bbc-785ca3e146b3\', \'multiverseId\': 476884}, \'multiverseid\': 476884}, {\'name\': \'Anax, endurci dans les Forges\', \'text\': "La force d\'Anax est égale à votre dévotion au rouge. (Chaque {R} dans les coûts de mana des permanents que vous contrôlez compte pour votre dévotion au rouge.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Anax ou qu\'une autre créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Satyre avec « Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer ». Si la force de la créature était supérieure ou égale à 4, créez deux de ces jetons à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : demi-dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477138&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f62ac3b-a55c-4536-9b6f-3a01d19ba55e\', \'multiverseId\': 477138}, \'multiverseid\': 477138}, {\'name\': \'Anax, Temprato nella Forgia\', \'text\': \'La forza di Anax è pari alla tua devozione al rosso. (La tua devozione al rosso è la somma dei {R} nel costo di mana dei permanenti che controlli.)\\nOgniqualvolta Anax o un\\\'altra creatura non pedina che controlli muore, crea una pedina creatura Satiro 1/1 rossa con "Questa creatura non può bloccare". Se la forza della creatura era pari o superiore a 4, crea invece due di quelle pedine.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo Leggendaria — Semidio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05354071-0d71-4ec1-81d4-da6d026329d4\', \'multiverseId\': 477392}, \'multiverseid\': 477392}, {\'name\': \'鍛冶で鍛えられしアナックス\', \'text\': \'鍛冶で鍛えられしアナックスのパワーは、あなたの赤への信心に等しい。（あなたの赤への信心とは、あなたがコントロールしているパーマネントのマナ・コストに含まれる{R}の総数である。）\\n鍛冶で鍛えられしアナックスか、他の、あなたがコントロールしていてトークンでないクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、「このクリーチャーではブロックできない。」を持つ赤の１/１のサテュロス・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。そのクリーチャーのパワーが４以上であったなら、代わりにそのトークンを２体生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 亜神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88ed8bc0-8498-464d-9774-69ab27706aaa\', \'multiverseId\': 477646}, \'multiverseid\': 477646}, {\'name\': \'주조소에서 단련된 자, 아낙스\', \'text\': \'아낙스의 공격력은 당신의 적색 신앙심과 같다. (당신이 조종하는 지속물의 마나 비용에 있는 각 {R}마다 당신의 적색 신앙심이 1씩 증가한다.)\\n아낙스 또는 당신이 조종하는 토큰이 아닌 다른 생물이 죽을 때마다, "이 생물은 방어할 수 없다."를 가진 1/1 적색 사티로스 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 그 생물의 공격력이 4 이상이었다면, 대신 그 토큰 두 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 부여마법 생물 — 반신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad4b36c7-0789-4292-873f-0dc4c803fab0\', \'multiverseId\': 477900}, \'multiverseid\': 477900}, {\'name\': \'Anax, Temperado na Forja\', \'text\': \'O poder de Anax é igual a sua devoção ao vermelho. (Cada {R} nos custos de mana de permanentes que você controla conta para sua devoção ao vermelho.)\\nToda vez que Anax ou outra criatura que você controla que não seja uma ficha morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura vermelha 1/1 do tipo Sátiro com "Esta criatura não pode bloquear." Se o poder da criatura era igual ou superior a 4, em vez disso, crie duas dessas fichas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento Lendária — Semideus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bfb3b41-7a3d-4f67-9ca9-21cf76edc5e9\', \'multiverseId\': 478154}, \'multiverseid\': 478154}, {\'name\': \'Анакс, Закаленный в Кузне\', \'text\': \'Сила Анакса равна вашей Преданности красному. (Каждый символ {R} в мана-стоимости перманентов под вашим контролем идет в счет вашей Преданности красному.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Анакс или другое не являющееся фишкой существо под вашим контролем умирает, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 красный Сатир со способностью «Это существо не может блокировать». Если сила существа была равна 4 или больше, вместо этого создайте две такие фишки.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары Существо — Полубог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a5995d9-1bc4-43eb-8001-db805607e9be\', \'multiverseId\': 478408}, \'multiverseid\': 478408}, {\'name\': \'熔锻锤炼的阿那克斯\', \'text\': \'阿那克斯的力量等同于你的红色献力。（由你操控之永久物的法术力费用当中每含有一个{R}，你的红色献力就加一。）\\n每当阿那克斯或另一个由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去时，派出一个1/1红色羊蹄人衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能进行阻挡。」若该生物的力量等于或大于4，则改为派出两个此类衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界生物 ～半神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab826dd9-fb97-4500-8498-81f97cb87198\', \'multiverseId\': 478662}, \'multiverseid\': 478662}, {\'name\': \'熔鍛錘煉的阿那克斯\', \'text\': \'阿那克斯的力量等同於你的紅色獻力。（由你操控之永久物的魔法力費用當中每含有一個{R}，你的紅色獻力就加一。）\\n每當阿那克斯或另一個由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去時，派出一個1/1紅色羊蹄人衍生生物，且具有「此生物不能進行阻擋。」若該生物的力量等於或大於4，則改為派出兩個此類衍生物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇結界生物 ～半神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'431df422-0b2e-4aee-aaca-92e958aaf8bd\', \'multiverseId\': 478916}, \'multiverseid\': 478916}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angsteinflößende Apathie\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht angreifen oder blocken.\\n{2}{W}: Schicke die verzauberte Kreatur ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Diejenigen, deren Leben uninspiriert war, sind im Tode zur elenden Eintönigkeit von Phylias verdammt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476516&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'057e69fe-8797-4b3f-8eee-eec1bf5608d9\', \'multiverseId\': 476516}, \'multiverseid\': 476516}, {\'name\': \'Apatía terrorífica\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada no puede atacar ni bloquear.\\n{2}{W}: Exilia la criatura encantada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Aquellos cuyas vidas fueron poco inspiradas están condenados al tedio miserable de Fylias en su muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5911d668-d5ae-4eff-8fca-7d31c090e897\', \'multiverseId\': 476770}, \'multiverseid\': 476770}, {\'name\': \'Apathie effroyable\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer.\\n{2}{W} : Exilez la créature enchantée.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "À leur mort, ceux dont la vie avait été dénuée d\'inspiration sont condamnés à la misérable monotonie de Phylias.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477024&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bffa33b-d1c5-42a4-8515-f5a1a63f5c2e\', \'multiverseId\': 477024}, \'multiverseid\': 477024}, {\'name\': \'Apatia Terrificante\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata non può attaccare o bloccare.\\n{2}{W}: Esilia la creatura incantata.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Coloro che in vita furono mediocri sono condannati al miserabile tedio di Fylias nella morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eea43110-b4d8-45aa-8823-c5ad110c1723\', \'multiverseId\': 477278}, \'multiverseid\': 477278}, {\'name\': \'凄絶な無気力\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーでは攻撃もブロックもできない。\\n{2}{W}：エンチャントしているクリーチャーを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'前向きでない一生を送った者は、死後にピュリアスの悲惨な退屈に送られる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b5fa223-18fa-4bcf-ad7d-91082a2038fc\', \'multiverseId\': 477532}, \'multiverseid\': 477532}, {\'name\': \'지독한 무관심\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 공격하거나 방어할 수 없다.\\n{2}{W}: 부여된 생물을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'감동받지 못한 삶을 산 사람들은 죽은 후 필리아스의 비참한 지루함을 겪게 되어 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'098aab80-6262-4e2f-a13d-0a0d79a79e33\', \'multiverseId\': 477786}, \'multiverseid\': 477786}, {\'name\': \'Apatia Pavorosa\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada não pode atacar nem bloquear.\\n{2}{W}: Exile a criatura encantada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Na morte, aqueles que viveram vidas medíocres são condenados ao tédio miserável de Fílias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36d6016d-ba61-46f9-ad54-a6576019b114\', \'multiverseId\': 478040}, \'multiverseid\': 478040}, {\'name\': \'Страшная Апатия\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо не может атаковать или блокировать.\\n{2}{W}: изгоните зачарованное существо.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Те, кто не знал воодушевления в жизни, обречены на тоскливую скуку Филия после смерти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'744af558-edda-46c5-8fac-c1a34dcbe0ce\', \'multiverseId\': 478294}, \'multiverseid\': 478294}, {\'name\': \'可怖漠然\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物不能进行攻击或阻挡。\\n{2}{W}：放逐所结附的生物。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'活着虚度光阴的人，死后必会坠入虚妄境费拉司继续蹉跎岁月。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7a3882e-ba3f-4e07-9693-d3fd3a98e5d8\', \'multiverseId\': 478548}, \'multiverseid\': 478548}, {\'name\': \'可怖漠然\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物不能進行攻擊或阻擋。\\n{2}{W}：放逐所結附的生物。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'活著虛度光陰的人，死後必會墜入虛妄境費拉司繼續蹉跎歲月。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'620f2012-b795-4817-b458-e10bf5125009\', \'multiverseId\': 478802}, \'multiverseid\': 478802}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aphemia, Missklang der Toten\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments kannst du eine Verzauberungskarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schicken. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Harpyie\', \'flavor\': \'„Sing, meine Schöne. Sing für den Tod und für die Toten."\\n—Ashiok\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476589&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd895463-ef1c-462a-a1f4-a13b3be9143c\', \'multiverseId\': 476589}, \'multiverseid\': 476589}, {\'name\': \'Afemia, la Cacofónica\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, puedes exiliar una carta de encantamiento de tu cementerio. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento legendaria — Arpía\', \'flavor\': \'"Canta, encanto. Canta por la muerte y para los muertos".\\n—Ashiok\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0346d627-0147-4dee-9131-3a98f4d2832d\', \'multiverseId\': 476843}, \'multiverseid\': 476843}, {\'name\': \'Aphémie, la Cacophonie\', \'text\': "Vol\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, vous pouvez exiler une carte d\'enchantement de votre cimetière. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : harpie\', \'flavor\': \'« Chante, ma beauté. Chante pour la mort, et pour les morts. »\\n—Ashiok\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477097&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00c1898a-c995-48ce-a397-ec54dae49d78\', \'multiverseId\': 477097}, \'multiverseid\': 477097}, {\'name\': \'Afemia, la Cacofonia\', \'text\': "Volare\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, puoi esiliare una carta incantesimo dal tuo cimitero. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo Leggendaria — Arpia\', \'flavor\': \'"Canta, splendore. Canta per la morte e per i morti."\\n—Ashiok\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fb82c19-a59a-46c0-9df5-4f791cb69e1b\', \'multiverseId\': 477351}, \'multiverseid\': 477351}, {\'name\': \'騒音のアフィミア\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたはあなたの墓地からエンチャント・カード１枚を追放してもよい。そうしたなら、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — ハーピー\', \'flavor\': \'「歌え、美しい者よ。死のために、死者のために。」\\n――アショク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af13a396-87fe-4ba6-9165-d9a25e933e88\', \'multiverseId\': 477605}, \'multiverseid\': 477605}, {\'name\': \'불쾌한 화음, 아피미아\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신은 당신의 무덤에 있는 부여마법 카드 한 장을 추방할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 2/2 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 부여마법 생물 — 하피\', \'flavor\': \'"노래하거라, 예쁜 아이야. 죽음을 위해, 그리고 죽은 자들을 위해."\\n—아시오크\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b18af86-1f09-423f-959e-7805e2ec71e8\', \'multiverseId\': 477859}, \'multiverseid\': 477859}, {\'name\': \'Afêmia, a Cacofonia\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNo início de sua etapa final, você pode exilar um card de encantamento de seu cemitério. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha de criatura preta 2/2 do tipo Zumbi.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento Lendária — Harpia\', \'flavor\': \'"Cante, belezura. Cante pela morte e pelos mortos."\\n— Ashiok\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91f66322-292a-455d-9b4a-1d10340fd41f\', \'multiverseId\': 478113}, \'multiverseid\': 478113}, {\'name\': \'Афемия, Какофония\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага вы можете изгнать карту чар из вашего кладбища. Если вы это делаете, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 черный Зомби.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары Существо — Гарпия\', \'flavor\': \'«Пой, моя красавица. Пой для смерти и для мертвых».\\n— Ашиок\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84f311a9-2e50-4ac5-afe4-7e144c9ca57f\', \'multiverseId\': 478367}, \'multiverseid\': 478367}, {\'name\': \'乱调娥菲弥娅\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，你可以从你的坟墓场放逐一张结界牌。若你如此作，则派出一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界生物 ～哈痞\', \'flavor\': \'「美人啊，放声歌唱吧。为死亡而歌，为逝者而唱。」\\n～安梭苛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32c99083-6ffc-4929-90c9-a982ed1c0198\', \'multiverseId\': 478621}, \'multiverseid\': 478621}, {\'name\': \'亂調娥菲彌婭\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n在你的結束步驟開始時，你可以從你的墳墓場放逐一張結界牌。若你如此作，則派出一個2/2黑色殭屍衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇結界生物 ～哈痞\', \'flavor\': \'「美人啊，放聲歌唱吧。為死亡而歌，為逝者而唱。」\\n～安梭苛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76b93a51-9cde-42f2-a91c-82ddf59d213d\', \'multiverseId\': 478875}, \'multiverseid\': 478875}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arasta die Endlos-Weberin\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkt, erzeuge einen 1/2 grünen Spinne-Kreaturenspielstein mit Reichweite.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Ihr Netz spannt sich von Nyx zur Welt der Sterblichen und darüber hinaus bis in die Unterwelt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476670&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7b55069-a356-4b77-93d6-c2f758d01359\', \'multiverseId\': 476670}, \'multiverseid\': 476670}, {\'name\': \'Arasta de la Tela Infinita\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nSiempre que un oponente lance un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, crea una ficha de criatura Araña verde 1/2 con la habilidad de alcance.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento legendaria — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'Sus telarañas, que crecen de su propio pelo, se extienden de Nyx al mundo de los mortales y penetran en el Inframundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6fa3abf-997f-4cd8-ae8c-313da691a368\', \'multiverseId\': 476924}, \'multiverseid\': 476924}, {\'name\': \'Arasta de la Toile sans fin\', \'text\': "Portée\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, créez un jeton de créature 1/2 verte Araignée avec la portée.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : araignée\', \'flavor\': "Ses toiles, tissées à partir de ses propres cheveux, s\'étendent de Nyx jusqu\'au monde des mortels en passant par le Monde souterrain.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477178&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c21f039-d28e-47d4-8385-5fe5c66f73ec\', \'multiverseId\': 477178}, \'multiverseid\': 477178}, {\'name\': \'Arasta della Ragnatela Infinita\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario lancia una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, crea una pedina creatura Ragno 1/2 verde con raggiungere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo Leggendaria — Ragno\', \'flavor\': "Le sue tele, filate dai suoi stessi capelli, si estendono da Nyx al mondo mortale e perfino nell\'Ade.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'746aa0e2-33ef-40c0-be8f-c960d7f6ec73\', \'multiverseId\': 477432}, \'multiverseid\': 477432}, {\'name\': \'終わりなき巣網のアラスタ\', \'text\': \'到達\\n対戦相手がインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、到達を持つ緑の１/２の蜘蛛・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は自分の髪で巣網を紡ぐ。それはニクスから定命の世界へ、さらには死の国までも到達する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42af424a-7016-4510-b85e-c56e32cdc598\', \'multiverseId\': 477686}, \'multiverseid\': 477686}, {\'name\': \'끝없는 그물의 아라스타\', \'text\': \'대공\\n상대가 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때마다, 대공을 가진 1/2 녹색 거미 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 부여마법 생물 — 거미\', \'flavor\': \'그녀가 자신의 실로 직접 짠 거미줄은, 닉스로부터 필멸의 세계로 뻗어 심지어 저승까지 연결된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08282e7c-fc0f-44ca-8464-2dd77d086033\', \'multiverseId\': 477940}, \'multiverseid\': 477940}, {\'name\': \'Arasta da Teia Infinita\', \'text\': \'Alcance\\nToda vez que um oponente conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, crie uma ficha de criatura verde 1/2 do tipo Aranha com alcance.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento Lendária — Aranha\', \'flavor\': \'Suas teias, tecidas de seus próprios cabelos, estendem-se de Nyx ao mundo mortal, e até mesmo ao Submundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dba21edb-8ac3-4d1c-9435-5c818353e765\', \'multiverseId\': 478194}, \'multiverseid\': 478194}, {\'name\': \'Араста Бесконечной Паутины\', \'text\': \'Захват\\nКаждый раз, когда оппонент разыгрывает мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, создайте одну фишку существа 1/2 зеленый Паук с Захватом.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары Существо — Паук\', \'flavor\': \'Тенета, что она плетет из собственных волос, проникают из Никса и в мир смертных, и даже в Подземное царство.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92b9a175-2cca-43dc-8e63-c166d2289797\', \'multiverseId\': 478448}, \'multiverseid\': 478448}, {\'name\': \'无尽缠丝阿拉斯塔\', \'text\': \'延势\\n每当任一对手施放瞬间或法术咒语时，派出一个1/2绿色，具延势异能的蜘蛛衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界生物 ～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'她以万千青丝织成重重罗网，从尼兹直垂凡间，乃至深入冥界。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43cac041-7605-4cd3-80c3-10fd93be1a5f\', \'multiverseId\': 478702}, \'multiverseid\': 478702}, {\'name\': \'無盡纏絲阿拉斯塔\', \'text\': \'延勢\\n每當任一對手施放瞬間或巫術咒語時，派出一個1/2綠色，具延勢異能的蜘蛛衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇結界生物 ～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'她以萬千青絲織成重重羅網，從尼茲直垂凡間，乃至深入冥界。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00b55409-fe35-4d77-88e6-98d1c68d3c9b\', \'multiverseId\': 478956}, \'multiverseid\': 478956}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archon der Fallenden Sterne\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Archon der Fallenden Sterne stirbt, kannst du eine Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Archon fiel wie ein Stern vom Himmel und traf am Horizont auf die aufgehende Sonne."\\n—Die Kosmogonie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476507&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93218646-a934-4fbe-88ca-bf4ae6b5cb3f\', \'multiverseId\': 476507}, \'multiverseid\': 476507}, {\'name\': \'Arconte de las estrellas caídas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Arconte de las estrellas caídas muera, puedes regresar la carta de encantamiento objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'"El arconte cayó como si de una estrella se tratase, fundiéndose con el sol naciente en el límite del horizonte".\\n—La Cosmogonía\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'badad206-32b8-448f-80fe-a161a0d21878\', \'multiverseId\': 476761}, \'multiverseid\': 476761}, {\'name\': \'Archonte des étoiles descendantes\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Archonte des étoiles descendantes meurt, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille une carte d\'enchantement ciblée depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : archonte\', \'flavor\': "« Tel une étoile filante, l\'archonte fendit le ciel pour rejoindre le soleil levant à l\'horizon. »\\n—La Cosmogonie", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477015&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b638eaa6-b9fc-46fd-8d43-2f1e3a69904e\', \'multiverseId\': 477015}, \'multiverseid\': 477015}, {\'name\': \'Arconte delle Stelle Cadenti\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Arconte delle Stelle Cadenti muore, puoi rimettere sul campo di battaglia una carta incantesimo bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'arconte cadde dal cielo come una stella, incontrando il sole nascente all\\\'orizzonte."\\n—*La Cosmogonia*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1cb6bfd-3395-4c10-87ec-05b9aeef15e3\', \'multiverseId\': 477269}, \'multiverseid\': 477269}, {\'name\': \'流星の執政官\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n流星の執政官が死亡したとき、あなたの墓地からエンチャント・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': \'「執政官は星のように空から落ちて、水平線の際で昇る太陽と出会った。」\\n――「宇宙論」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9edc9b66-dcc8-4d43-8428-77cb55f5baa3\', \'multiverseId\': 477523}, \'multiverseid\': 477523}, {\'name\': \'떨어지는 별의 집정관\', \'text\': \'비행\\n떨어지는 별의 집정관이 죽을 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 부여마법 카드를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 카드를 전장으로 되돌릴 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 집정관\', \'flavor\': \'"집정관은 마치 별처럼 하늘에서 떨어져내려, 지평선의 가장자리에서 떠오르는 태양과 마주쳤다."\\n—우주론\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa6091bb-abbf-4577-8beb-f81d6774ee55\', \'multiverseId\': 477777}, \'multiverseid\': 477777}, {\'name\': \'Arconte das Estrelas Cadentes\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Arconte das Estrelas Cadentes morre, você pode devolver o card de encantamento alvo de seu cemitério ao campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'"O arconte caiu dos céus como uma estrela, encontrando o sol nascente na linha do horizonte."\\n— Cosmogonia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce81bf0c-9f08-40c4-b753-26dec801f049\', \'multiverseId\': 478031}, \'multiverseid\': 478031}, {\'name\': \'Архонт Падающих Звезд\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Архонт Падающих Звезд умирает, вы можете вернуть целевую карту чар из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Архонт\', \'flavor\': \'«Архонт упал, подобно звезде с неба, встречая восходящее солнце на горизонте».\\n— «Космогония»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55665a89-bcc6-4896-ae91-ed824778ea79\', \'multiverseId\': 478285}, \'multiverseid\': 478285}, {\'name\': \'星落统领\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当星落统领死去时，你可以将目标结界牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～统领\', \'flavor\': \'「统领如流星从苍穹坠落，会旭日于天际。」\\n～《天地起源论》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d04191d8-eafd-4ca4-b6db-dd61eaabd6d3\', \'multiverseId\': 478539}, \'multiverseid\': 478539}, {\'name\': \'星落統領\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當星落統領死去時，你可以將目標結界牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～統領\', \'flavor\': \'「統領如流星從蒼穹墜落，會旭日於天際。」\\n～《天地起源論》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'066b7fb7-5bd3-4d07-ab07-e943cec9056a\', \'multiverseId\': 478793}, \'multiverseid\': 478793}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archon der Sonnengnade\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nPegasus-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Lebensverknüpfung.\\nKonstellation — Immer wenn eine Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Pegasus-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08b56113-c386-4d12-8442-c9e523f76486\', \'multiverseId\': 476508}, \'multiverseid\': 476508}, {\'name\': \'Arconte de la gracia solar\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vínculo vital.\\nLas criaturas Pegaso que controlas tienen la habilidad de vínculo vital.\\nConstelación — Siempre que un encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Pegaso blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42133f73-f339-4d21-a44c-cf0380539d14\', \'multiverseId\': 476762}, \'multiverseid\': 476762}, {\'name\': \'Archonte de la grâce solaire\', \'text\': "Vol, lien de vie\\nLes créatures Pégase que vous contrôlez ont le lien de vie.\\nConstellation — À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Pégase avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : archonte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477016&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68091dce-f1f8-4f69-8a46-25686d604cba\', \'multiverseId\': 477016}, \'multiverseid\': 477016}, {\'name\': \'Arconte della Grazia Solare\', \'text\': \'Volare, legame vitale\\nLe creature Pegaso che controlli hanno legame vitale.\\nCostellazione — Ogniqualvolta un incantesimo entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, crea una pedina creatura Pegaso 2/2 bianca con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32c394dd-ab4a-48d7-8eb2-567dd58935d7\', \'multiverseId\': 477270}, \'multiverseid\': 477270}, {\'name\': \'太陽の恵みの執政官\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂\\nあなたがコントロールしているペガサス・クリーチャーは絆魂を持つ。\\n星座 ― エンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、飛行を持つ白の２/２のペガサス・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2545606f-ec2f-41b8-81f1-851572b424e6\', \'multiverseId\': 477524}, \'multiverseid\': 477524}, {\'name\': \'태양의 은총의 집정관\', \'text\': \'비행, 생명연결\\n당신이 조종하는 페가수스 생물들은 생명연결을 가진다.\\n성좌 — 부여마법이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 비행을 가진 2/2 백색 페가수스 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 집정관\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b0a7e4f-0fa6-43d8-b959-20117d86cb5d\', \'multiverseId\': 477778}, \'multiverseid\': 477778}, {\'name\': \'Arconte da Graça do Sol\', \'text\': \'Voar, vínculo com a vida\\nAs criaturas do tipo Pégaso que você controla têm vínculo com a vida.\\nConstelação — Toda vez que um encantamento entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 2/2 do tipo Pégaso com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c073135-0e8d-40bf-8397-6c65e560c334\', \'multiverseId\': 478032}, \'multiverseid\': 478032}, {\'name\': \'Архонт Милости Солнца\', \'text\': \'Полет, Цепь жизни\\nСущества-Пегасы под вашим контролем имеют Цепь жизни.\\nСозвездие — Каждый раз, когда чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 белый Пегас с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Архонт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e1c67eb-8259-4c31-b823-f7d1e2add152\', \'multiverseId\': 478286}, \'multiverseid\': 478286}, {\'name\': \'阳华统领\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命\\n由你操控的飞马生物具有系命异能。\\n星彩～每当一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，派出一个2/2白色，具飞行异能的飞马衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～统领\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'273de738-67cf-44f5-b1b9-4b9c01f56994\', \'multiverseId\': 478540}, \'multiverseid\': 478540}, {\'name\': \'陽華統領\', \'text\': \'飛行，繫命\\n由你操控的飛馬生物具有繫命異能。\\n星彩～每當一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，派出一個2/2白色，具飛行異能的飛馬衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～統領\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bedd7bff-99af-452d-acaa-4f8f9ba5bd67\', \'multiverseId\': 478794}, \'multiverseid\': 478794}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arena-Trickser\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deinen ersten Zauberspruch im Zug eines Gegners wirkst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Arena-Trickser.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Es reicht nicht, deinen Gegner zu überraschen. Du musst auch die Menge begeistern."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476631&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'683071d6-b031-455e-ad5e-d37bc796b18e\', \'multiverseId\': 476631}, \'multiverseid\': 476631}, {\'name\': \'Embaucador de la arena\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances tu primer hechizo durante el turno de cada oponente, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Embaucador de la arena.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'"No basta con sorprender a tu oponente. También tienes que contentar al público".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8eb2428-d323-4600-82aa-a08e384bb97c\', \'multiverseId\': 476885}, \'multiverseid\': 476885}, {\'name\': "Escroc de l\'arène", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez votre premier sort pendant le tour de chaque adversaire, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Escroc de l\'arène.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Il ne suffit pas de surprendre ton adversaire. Tu dois aussi faire plaisir au public. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477139&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b7daa48-aa93-4504-adb6-8727ba5d0180\', \'multiverseId\': 477139}, \'multiverseid\': 477139}, {\'name\': "Truffatore dell\'Arena", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta lanci la tua prima magia durante il turno di ogni avversario, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Truffatore dell\'Arena.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non è sufficiente sorprendere l\\\'avversario. Bisogna anche divertire la folla."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cbc2b73-ca2d-4825-b732-8c8a154e35db\', \'multiverseId\': 477393}, \'multiverseid\': 477393}, {\'name\': \'闘技場のペテン師\', \'text\': \'対戦相手の各ターン内で初めてあなたが呪文を唱えるたび、闘技場のペテン師の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「相手を驚かすだけじゃあ十分とは言えねえ。観客に喜んでもらわなくちゃな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c4a7a7e-8aa6-48cf-a024-302443f65661\', \'multiverseId\': 477647}, \'multiverseid\': 477647}, {\'name\': \'투기장 사기꾼\', \'text\': \'당신이 각 상대의 턴 동안 당신의 첫 번째 주문을 발동할 때마다, 투기장 사기꾼에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'"상대를 놀라게 하는 걸로는 충분하지 않아. 관객을 즐겁게 해 주기도 해야지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b1ec373-b165-49fb-89ae-fdec3c467409\', \'multiverseId\': 477901}, \'multiverseid\': 477901}, {\'name\': \'Trapaceiro da Arena\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar sua primeira mágica durante o turno de cada oponente, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Trapaceiro da Arena.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Não basta surpreender o oponente. Você também tem que encantar o público."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ff3554c-fb07-4f12-b52a-2ed86f4e6acf\', \'multiverseId\': 478155}, \'multiverseid\': 478155}, {\'name\': \'Гладиатор-Жулик\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете ваше первое заклинание во время хода каждого из оппонентов, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Гладиатора-Жулика.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Просто удивить соперника будет недостаточно. Надо привести в восторг толпу».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e042ff8-686e-40fd-a6ea-0a9b0a0461b0\', \'multiverseId\': 478409}, \'multiverseid\': 478409}, {\'name\': \'斗技场诈术师\', \'text\': \'每当你施放每个对手回合中你的第一个咒语时，在斗技场诈术师上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「光吓到对手还不够。你还得乐到观众。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f8405d5-98c6-48a2-9aec-a56839bcd27c\', \'multiverseId\': 478663}, \'multiverseid\': 478663}, {\'name\': \'鬥技場詐術師\', \'text\': \'每當你施放每個對手回合中你的第一個咒語時，在鬥技場詐術師上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「光嚇到對手還不夠。你還得樂到觀眾。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a99c070-52e0-48a9-8b5c-8ee0b8a93a89\', \'multiverseId\': 478917}, \'multiverseid\': 478917}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ashiok, Bildhauer der Angst\', \'text\': \'+2: Ziehe eine Karte. Jeder Spieler legt die obersten zwei Karten seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.\\n−5: Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\\n−11: Übernimm die Kontrolle über alle Kreaturen, die ein Gegner deiner Wahl kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479189&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fc10293-c8cd-4c80-bc5b-a4237a80ef97\', \'multiverseId\': 479189}, \'multiverseid\': 479189}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, artista de temores\', \'text\': \'+2: Roba una carta. Cada jugador pone las dos primeras cartas de su biblioteca en su cementerio.\\n−5: Pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control la carta de criatura objetivo de un cementerio.\\n−11: Gana el control de todas las criaturas que controla el oponente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d92384ff-4363-424d-acc5-7a3486fd0a7c\', \'multiverseId\': 479207}, \'multiverseid\': 479207}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, sculpteur de terreurs\', \'text\': "+2 : Piochez une carte. Chaque joueur met les deux cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.\\n-5 : Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature ciblée depuis un cimetière.\\n-11 : Acquérez le contrôle de toutes les créatures que l\'adversaire ciblé contrôle.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479225&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa44d8ec-05b6-471f-b7f9-0cb966a128e9\', \'multiverseId\': 479225}, \'multiverseid\': 479225}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, Scultore di Paure\', \'text\': \'+2: Pesca una carta. Ogni giocatore mette nel proprio cimitero le prime due carte del proprio grimorio.\\n-5: Metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura bersaglio da un cimitero.\\n-11: Prendi il controllo di tutte le creature controllate da un avversario bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a331f78-4f45-4327-b013-67d37ee93012\', \'multiverseId\': 479243}, \'multiverseid\': 479243}, {\'name\': \'恐怖を彫る者、アショク\', \'text\': \'+2：カードを１枚引く。各プレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚自分の墓地に置く。\\n-5：墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。\\n-11：対戦相手１人を対象とし、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャーすべてのコントロールを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — アショク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce2acca1-8440-448e-ba2d-42064eaffcf6\', \'multiverseId\': 479261}, \'multiverseid\': 479261}, {\'name\': \'공포 조각가, 아시오크\', \'text\': \'+2: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다. 각 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위 카드 두 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다.\\n−5: 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 조종하에 전장에 놓는다.\\n-11: 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대가 조종하는 모든 생물의 조종권을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 아시오크\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'320f329b-d10a-492a-a844-8a1f87319640\', \'multiverseId\': 479279}, \'multiverseid\': 479279}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, Escultor de Medos\', \'text\': \'+2: Compre um card. Cada jogador coloca os dois cards do topo do próprio grimório no próprio cemitério.\\n−5: Coloque o card de criatura alvo de um cemitério no campo de batalha sob o seu controle.\\n−11: Ganhe o controle de todas as criaturas que o oponente alvo controla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79f87e88-38ff-407b-ab81-66f2c98b71e1\', \'multiverseId\': 479297}, \'multiverseid\': 479297}, {\'name\': \'Ашиок, Скульптор Страхов\', \'text\': \'+2: возьмите карту. Каждый игрок кладет две верхние карты своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.\\n−5: положите целевую карту существа из кладбища на поле битвы под вашим контролем.\\n—11: получите контроль над всеми существами под контролем целевого оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Ашиок\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d75e0fb0-8488-4861-99cf-76c3eaebddb0\', \'multiverseId\': 479315}, \'multiverseid\': 479315}, {\'name\': \'恐惧塑师安梭苛\', \'text\': \'+2：抓一张牌。每位牌手各将其牌库顶的两张牌置入其坟墓场。\\n−5：将目标生物牌在你的操控下从坟墓场放进战场。\\n−11：获得由目标对手操控之所有生物的操控权。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～安梭苛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2ebef4e-70b0-4b70-bdb6-0b9d83c6a5fb\', \'multiverseId\': 479333}, \'multiverseid\': 479333}, {\'name\': \'恐懼塑師安梭苛\', \'text\': \'+2：抽一張牌。每位玩家各將其牌庫頂的兩張牌置入其墳墓場。\\n−5：將目標生物牌在你的操控下從墳墓場放進戰場。\\n−11：獲得由目標對手操控之所有生物的操控權。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～安梭苛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6eddc6e-b649-4be0-976b-61592f9975ec\', \'multiverseId\': 479351}, \'multiverseid\': 479351}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ashiok, Muse des Albtraums\', \'text\': \'+1: Erzeuge einen 2/3 blauen und schwarzen Nachtmahr-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift oder blockt, schickt jeder Gegner die obersten zwei Karten seiner Bibliothek ins Exil."\\n−3: Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück. Dann schickt jener Spieler eine Karte aus seiner Hand ins Exil.\\n−7: Du kannst bis zu drei aufgedeckte Karten, die deine Gegner besitzen, aus dem Exil wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476713&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dea69525-2c8f-4ed4-9e26-867d861ba7f5\', \'multiverseId\': 476713}, \'multiverseid\': 476713}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, inspiración de pesadillas\', \'text\': \'+1: Crea una ficha de criatura Pesadilla azul y negra 2/3 con "Siempre que esta criatura ataque o bloquee, cada oponente exilia las dos primeras cartas de su biblioteca".\\n−3: Regresa el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra a la mano de su propietario. Luego, ese jugador exilia una carta de su mano.\\n−7: Puedes lanzar hasta tres cartas del exilio boca arriba de las que tus oponentes sean propietarios sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3b91848-52b1-4ef8-96c7-64ad9fdc7d68\', \'multiverseId\': 476967}, \'multiverseid\': 476967}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, muse des cauchemars\', \'text\': "+1 : Créez un jeton de créature 2/3 bleue et noire Cauchemar avec « À chaque fois que cette créature attaque ou bloque, chaque adversaire exile les deux cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque. »\\n-3 : Renvoyez le permanent non-terrain ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire, puis ce joueur exile une carte de sa main.\\n-7 : Vous pouvez lancer jusqu\'à trois cartes face visible que vos adversaires possèdent depuis l\'exil sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477221&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d765d5e-46f8-4bc2-afdc-fbf9cf67c3ac\', \'multiverseId\': 477221}, \'multiverseid\': 477221}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, Ispiratore di Incubi\', \'text\': \'+1: Crea una pedina creatura Incubo 2/3 blu e nera con "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca o blocca, ogni avversario esilia le prime due carte del proprio grimorio".\\n-3: Fai tornare un permanente non terra bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario, poi quel giocatore esilia una carta dalla sua mano.\\n-7: Puoi lanciare dall\\\'esilio fino a tre carte a faccia in su che possiedono i tuoi avversari senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc09ea18-5b57-4bab-98d5-54dd145a0f78\', \'multiverseId\': 477475}, \'multiverseid\': 477475}, {\'name\': \'悪夢の詩神、アショク\', \'text\': \'+1：「このクリーチャーが攻撃するかブロックするたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚追放する。」を持ち青であり黒である２/３のナイトメア・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n-3：土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。その後、そのプレイヤーは自分の手札からカード１枚を追放する。\\n-7：あなたは、追放領域から対戦相手がオーナーである表向きのカード最大３枚を、それらのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — アショク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9d78ea9-f2a7-441e-9cf4-860e4916bb55\', \'multiverseId\': 477729}, \'multiverseid\': 477729}, {\'name\': \'악몽의 뮤즈, 아시오크\', \'text\': \'+1: "이 생물이 공격하거나 방어할 때마다, 각 상대는 자신의 서고 맨 위 카드 두 장을 추방한다."를 가진 2/3 청색 및 흑색 나이트메어 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n−3: 대지가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린 후, 그 플레이어는 자신의 손에서 카드 한 장을 추방한다.\\n−7: 당신은 추방 영역에서 당신의 상대들이 소유한 앞면 상태의 카드들을 최대 세 장까지 그 카드들의 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 아시오크\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9c09a24-0dac-4824-bcc8-5c8bb3dc7299\', \'multiverseId\': 477983}, \'multiverseid\': 477983}, {\'name\': \'Ashiok, Inspiração do Pesadelo\', \'text\': \'+1: Crie uma ficha de criatura azul e preta 2/3 do tipo Pesadelo com "Toda vez que esta criatura ataca ou bloqueia, cada oponente exila os dois cards do topo do próprio grimório."\\n−3: Devolva a permanente alvo que não seja um terreno para a mão de seu dono. Em seguida, aquele jogador exila um card da própria mão.\\n−7: Você pode conjurar até três cards exilados com a face voltada para cima que seus oponentes possuam sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Ashiok\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f388d47-4883-4379-8c77-640ca36cf441\', \'multiverseId\': 478237}, \'multiverseid\': 478237}, {\'name\': \'Ашиок, Муза Кошмаров\', \'text\': \'+1: создайте одну фишку существа 2/3 синий и черный Кошмар со способностью «Каждый раз, когда это существо атакует или блокирует, каждый оппонент изгоняет две верхние карты своей библиотеки».\\n−3: верните целевой не являющийся землей перманент в руку его владельца, затем тот игрок изгоняет карту из своей руки.\\n−7: вы можете разыграть из изгнания не более трех принадлежащих вашим оппонентам карт, лежащих рубашкой вниз, без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Ашиок\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aa4331b-8d2c-4f98-aef9-fafcd4c41cba\', \'multiverseId\': 478491}, \'multiverseid\': 478491}, {\'name\': \'梦魇缪司安梭苛\', \'text\': \'+1：派出一个2/3，蓝黑双色的梦魇衍生生物，且具有「每当此生物攻击或阻挡时，每位对手各放逐其牌库顶的两张牌。」\\n−3：将目标非地永久物移回其拥有者手上，然后该牌手从他手上放逐一张牌。\\n−7：你可以从放逐区施放至多三张由对手拥有且牌面朝上的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～安梭苛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b5ac09-2c1b-4479-98ca-23cf25c14c2c\', \'multiverseId\': 478745}, \'multiverseid\': 478745}, {\'name\': \'夢魘繆司安梭苛\', \'text\': \'+1：派出一個2/3，藍黑雙色的夢魘衍生生物，且具有「每當此生物攻擊或阻擋時，每位對手各放逐其牌庫頂的兩張牌。」\\n−3：將目標非地永久物移回其擁有者手上，然後該玩家從他手上放逐一張牌。\\n−7：你可以從放逐區施放至多三張由對手擁有且牌面朝上的牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～安梭苛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ade3fb1-36d5-4947-a4c9-f17e4520c9f5\', \'multiverseId\': 478999}, \'multiverseid\': 478999}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ashioks Löschung\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn Ashioks Löschung ins Spiel kommt, schicke einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\nDeine Gegner können keine Zaubersprüche wirken, die denselben Namen haben wie die ins Exil geschickte Karte.\\nWenn Ashioks Löschung das Spiel verlässt, bringe die ins Exil geschickte Karte auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476548&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d54b972d-545f-4af1-b709-7d8cafc9092e\', \'multiverseId\': 476548}, \'multiverseid\': 476548}, {\'name\': \'Amnesia de Ashiok\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando la Amnesia de Ashiok entre al campo de batalla, exilia el hechizo objetivo.\\nTus oponentes no pueden lanzar hechizos con el mismo nombre que la carta exiliada.\\nCuando la Amnesia de Ashiok deje el campo de batalla, regresa la carta exiliada a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb06f67f-4fe5-4731-8cf4-4ad408b9005a\', \'multiverseId\': 476802}, \'multiverseid\': 476802}, {\'name\': \'Effacement selon Ashiok\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand l\'Effacement selon Ashiok arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez le sort ciblé.\\nVos adversaires ne peuvent pas lancer de sorts ayant le même nom que la carte exilée.\\nQuand l\'Effacement selon Ashiok quitte le champ de bataille, renvoyez la carte exilée dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477056&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f7b787f-8c72-4229-95c2-f69588fbbd9b\', \'multiverseId\': 477056}, \'multiverseid\': 477056}, {\'name\': \'Cancellazione di Ashiok\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando la Cancellazione di Ashiok entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia una magia bersaglio.\\nI tuoi avversari non possono lanciare magie con lo stesso nome della carta esiliata.\\nQuando la Cancellazione di Ashiok lascia il campo di battaglia, fai tornare la carta esiliata in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7498ed4b-558a-47a8-9e04-0cbb6309bf2e\', \'multiverseId\': 477310}, \'multiverseid\': 477310}, {\'name\': \'アショクの消去\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nアショクの消去が戦場に出たとき、呪文１つを対象とし、それを追放する。\\n対戦相手は、その追放されているカードと同じ名前を持つ呪文を唱えられない。\\nアショクの消去が戦場を離れたとき、その追放されているカードをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d767918-9a21-4911-ab3f-9ebe3ea5bcc6\', \'multiverseId\': 477564}, \'multiverseid\': 477564}, {\'name\': \'아시오크의 소거\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n아시오크의 소거가 전장에 들어올 때, 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 추방한다.\\n당신의 상대들은 추방된 카드와 같은 이름을 가진 주문을 발동할 수 없다.\\n아시오크의 소거가 전장을 떠날 때, 추방된 카드를 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a39aea9-0061-41f1-84c2-9efaa2e985ee\', \'multiverseId\': 477818}, \'multiverseid\': 477818}, {\'name\': \'Apagamento de Ashiok\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Apagamento de Ashiok entrar no campo de batalha, exile a mágica alvo.\\nSeus oponentes não podem conjurar mágicas com o mesmo nome que o card exilado.\\nQuando Apagamento de Ashiok deixar o campo de batalha, devolva o card exilado para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d261b27-529b-4c1c-91c8-4f4273a5a8f9\', \'multiverseId\': 478072}, \'multiverseid\': 478072}, {\'name\': \'Стирание Ашиока\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКогда Стирание Ашиока выходит на поле битвы, изгоните целевое заклинание.\\nВаши оппоненты не могут разыгрывать заклинания с таким же именем, как у изгнанной карты.\\nКогда Стирание Ашиока покидает поле битвы, верните изгнанную карту в руку ее владельца.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03220d1b-1ead-46b5-9e7f-1027df6ba446\', \'multiverseId\': 478326}, \'multiverseid\': 478326}, {\'name\': \'安梭苛的抹消\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当安梭苛的抹消进战场时，放逐目标咒语。\\n所有对手都不能施放与所放逐的牌同名之咒语。\\n当安梭苛的抹消离开战场时，将所放逐的牌移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'497a5b0d-f1f2-4c11-abe4-986405bc3a0c\', \'multiverseId\': 478580}, \'multiverseid\': 478580}, {\'name\': \'安梭苛的抹消\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n當安梭苛的抹消進戰場時，放逐目標咒語。\\n所有對手都不能施放與所放逐的牌同名之咒語。\\n當安梭苛的抹消離開戰場時，將所放逐的牌移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e73c60a-4593-478d-96be-71f89cda3df1\', \'multiverseId\': 478834}, \'multiverseid\': 478834}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ashioks Vorbotin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn Ashioks Vorbotin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek und/oder deinen Friedhof nach einer Karte namens Ashiok, Bildhauer der Angst, durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du auf diese Weise deine Bibliothek durchsuchst, mische sie danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Jeder Traum ist eine Tür."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479192&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d23dfb24-592f-4144-be8e-50753c2411d2\', \'multiverseId\': 479192}, \'multiverseid\': 479192}, {\'name\': \'Heraldo de Ashiok\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando la Heraldo de Ashiok entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca y/o cementerio una carta llamada Ashiok, artista de temores, mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano. Si buscas en tu biblioteca de esta manera, barájala.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Cada sueño es una puerta".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce8ad84a-99e1-40d6-babe-15e61e793b15\', \'multiverseId\': 479210}, \'multiverseid\': 479210}, {\'name\': "Précurseur d\'Ashiok", \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand le Précurseur d\'Ashiok arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque et/ou votre cimetière une carte appelée Ashiok, sculpteur de terreurs, la révéler, et la mettre dans votre main. Si vous cherchez dans votre bibliothèque de cette manière, mélangez-la.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Chaque rêve est une porte. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479228&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1c93182-e05c-4b00-b4d9-c810966d7d88\', \'multiverseId\': 479228}, \'multiverseid\': 479228}, {\'name\': \'Precorritrice di Ashiok\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando la Precorritrice di Ashiok entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio e/o il tuo cimitero per una carta chiamata Ashiok, Scultore di Paure, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Se passi in rassegna il tuo grimorio in questo modo, rimescolalo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni sogno è una porta aperta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b847f60-4c4d-434c-831a-6270ee2a224e\', \'multiverseId\': 479246}, \'multiverseid\': 479246}, {\'name\': \'アショクの先駆け\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nアショクの先駆けが戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーや墓地から「恐怖を彫る者、アショク」という名前のカード１枚を探し、公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。これによりあなたがあなたのライブラリーからカードを探したなら、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「夢はどれも出入り口なのよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0c5c8e6-0a44-4bb1-9891-c84913f2376e\', \'multiverseId\': 479264}, \'multiverseid\': 479264}, {\'name\': \'아시오크의 선봉\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n아시오크의 선봉이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고 및/또는 무덤에서 공포 조각가, 아시오크인 카드 한 장을 찾아, 공개한 후, 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 당신이 이런 식으로 당신의 서고를 찾아보았다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"모든 꿈이 출입구다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'118a7a62-308a-49d0-9995-859ca8929d86\', \'multiverseId\': 479282}, \'multiverseid\': 479282}, {\'name\': \'Pioneira de Ashiok\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Pioneira de Ashiok entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar em seu grimório e/ou cemitério um card com o nome Ashiok, Escultor de Medos, revelá-lo e colocá-lo em sua mão. Se procurar em seu grimório desta maneira, embaralhe-o.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Todo sonho é uma porta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'447f38ff-2a56-40a2-9853-954001ce8ea1\', \'multiverseId\': 479300}, \'multiverseid\': 479300}, {\'name\': \'Предвестница Ашиока\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКогда Предвестница Ашиока выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке и (или) на вашем кладбище карту с именем Ашиок, Скульптор Страхов, показать ее и положить в вашу руку. Если вы ищете таким образом в вашей библиотеке, перетасуйте ее.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Каждый сон — это дверь».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a21ea97a-2e92-435f-b2cb-adb25c7a4430\', \'multiverseId\': 479318}, \'multiverseid\': 479318}, {\'name\': \'安梭苛的先驱\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当安梭苛的先驱进战场时，你可以从你的牌库和／或坟墓场中搜寻一张名称为恐惧塑师安梭苛的牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上。如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则将它洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「每个梦境都是通路。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ee10baf-19d1-4608-b754-53439793eaef\', \'multiverseId\': 479336}, \'multiverseid\': 479336}, {\'name\': \'安梭苛的先驅\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n當安梭苛的先驅進戰場時，你可以從你的牌庫和／或墳墓場中搜尋一張名稱為恐懼塑師安梭苛的牌，展示該牌，並將它置於你手上。如果你以此法搜尋你的牌庫，則將它洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「每個夢境都是通路。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8507b23a-ead8-4683-b683-0123f21bc8da\', \'multiverseId\': 479354}, \'multiverseid\': 479354}]', '[{\'name\': \'Athreos der Verhüllte\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nSolange deine Hingabe zu Weiß und Schwarz weniger als sieben beträgt, ist Athreos keine Kreatur.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments legst du eine Münzenmarke auf eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur mit einer Münzenmarke stirbt oder ins Exil geschickt wird, bringe sie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479157&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71b0a65c-f000-489c-bc0b-05f01c83edac\', \'multiverseId\': 479157}, \'multiverseid\': 479157}, {\'name\': \'Atreos, cubierto con sudario\', \'text\': \'Indestructible.\\nMientras tu devoción al blanco y al negro sea menor que siete, Atreos no es una criatura.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, pon un contador de moneda sobre otra criatura objetivo.\\nSiempre que una criatura con un contador de moneda sobre ella muera o vaya al exilio, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo tu control.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento legendaria — Deidad\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf0f1237-5c40-4fcd-a87e-8a824b4cf908\', \'multiverseId\': 479158}, \'multiverseid\': 479158}, {\'name\': "Athréos, voilé d\'un linceul", \'text\': "Indestructible\\nTant que votre dévotion au blanc et au noir est inférieure à sept, Athréos n\'est pas une créature.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, mettez un marqueur « pièce » sur une autre créature ciblée.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature avec un marqueur « pièce » sur elle meurt ou est mise en exil, renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479159&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd700012-3049-4b46-bb68-beb6315f0dca\', \'multiverseId\': 479159}, \'multiverseid\': 479159}, {\'name\': \'Atreo, Velato dal Sudario\', \'text\': "Indistruttibile\\nFintanto che la tua devozione al bianco e al nero è inferiore a sette, Atreo non è una creatura.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, metti un segnalino moneta su un\'altra creatura bersaglio.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura con un segnalino moneta muore o viene messa in esilio, rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo Leggendaria — Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4208d53f-9bb2-4527-b5b0-4bdcab0ec46f\', \'multiverseId\': 479160}, \'multiverseid\': 479160}, {\'name\': \'埋葬布を纏う者、エイスリオス\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\nあなたの白と黒への信心が７未満であるかぎり、埋葬布を纏う者、エイスリオスはクリーチャーではない。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、他のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に硬貨カウンターを１個置く。\\n硬貨カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体が死亡するか追放領域に置かれるたび、そのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d985b547-871a-4850-92fb-c7be4817146c\', \'multiverseId\': 479161}, \'multiverseid\': 479161}, {\'name\': \'수의에 가려진 자, 에스리오스\', \'text\': \'무적\\n당신의 백흑 신앙심이 7 미만인 한, 에스리오스는 생물이 아니다.\\n당신의 종료단 시작에, 다른 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 동전 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n동전 카운터를 가진 생물이 죽거나 추방될 때마다, 그 카드를 당신의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 부여마법 생물 — 신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ef22ced-d88c-404b-8c38-6f2e152d8487\', \'multiverseId\': 479162}, \'multiverseid\': 479162}, {\'name\': \'Atreos, Velado pelo Sudário\', \'text\': \'Indestrutível\\nEnquanto sua devoção ao branco e ao preto for menor que sete, Atreos não será uma criatura.\\nNo início da sua etapa final, coloque um marcador de moeda em outra criatura alvo.\\nToda vez que uma criatura com um marcador de moeda morrer ou for colocada no exílio, devolva aquele card ao campo de batalha sob seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento Lendária — Deus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c3cdfc4-86fe-4f70-895e-185873a0c03e\', \'multiverseId\': 479163}, \'multiverseid\': 479163}, {\'name\': \'Атрей, Укрытый Пеленой\', \'text\': \'Неразрушимость\\nПока ваша Преданность белому и черному меньше семи, Атрей не является существом.\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага положите один жетон монеты на другое целевое существо.\\nКаждый раз, когда существо с жетоном монеты на нем умирает или попадает в изгнание, верните ту карту на поле битвы под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары Существо — Бог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07d3b453-fed5-458b-8aad-58404d995e24\', \'multiverseId\': 479164}, \'multiverseid\': 479164}, {\'name\': \'灵帷雅睿欧斯\', \'text\': \'不灭\\n只要你的白黑两色献力小于七，雅睿欧斯便不是生物。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，在另一个目标生物上放置一个钱币指示物。\\n每当一个其上有钱币指示物的生物死去或进入放逐区时，将该牌在你的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界生物 ～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d72d1af-90dd-471a-8920-361dd9d92eb6\', \'multiverseId\': 479165}, \'multiverseid\': 479165}, {\'name\': \'靈帷雅睿歐斯\', \'text\': \'不滅\\n只要你的白黑兩色獻力小於七，雅睿歐斯便不是生物。\\n在你的結束步驟開始時，在另一個目標生物上放置一個錢幣指示物。\\n每當一個其上有錢幣指示物的生物死去或進入放逐區時，將該牌在你的操控下移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'傳奇結界生物 ～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74fb71c8-a0ca-4dda-aecd-775457fa069a\', \'multiverseId\': 479166}, \'multiverseid\': 479166}]', '[{\'name\': \'Atris, Orakel der Halbwahrheiten\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nWenn Atris, Orakel der Halbwahrheiten, ins Spiel kommt, schaut sich ein Gegner deiner Wahl die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an und teilt sie in einen verdeckten und einen aufgedeckten Haufen auf. Nimm die Karten des einen Haufens auf deine Hand und lege die anderen auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476714&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'637820f0-206e-44b4-ad9c-fff7e287d901\', \'multiverseId\': 476714}, \'multiverseid\': 476714}, {\'name\': \'Atris, oráculo de las medias verdades\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nCuando Atris, oráculo de las medias verdades entre al campo de batalla, el oponente objetivo mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca y las divide en un montón boca abajo y un montón boca arriba. Pon un montón en tu mano y el otro en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcf2aa5c-9a5a-4378-89c7-e6d11d009036\', \'multiverseId\': 476968}, \'multiverseid\': 476968}, {\'name\': \'Atris, oracle des demi-vérités\', \'text\': "Menace\\nQuand Atris, oracle des demi-vérités arrive sur le champ de bataille, l\'adversaire ciblé regarde les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque et les sépare dans un tas face cachée et un tas face visible. Mettez un tas dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477222&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'175703e0-1ffd-4dcb-beb2-b9f71cea7001\', \'multiverseId\': 477222}, \'multiverseid\': 477222}, {\'name\': \'Atris, Oracolo delle Mezze Verità\', \'text\': "Minacciare\\nQuando Atris, Oracolo delle Mezze Verità entra nel campo di battaglia, un avversario bersaglio guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio e le separa in una pila a faccia in giù e una pila a faccia in su. Aggiungi alla tua mano una pila e metti l\'altra nel tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6795e63b-11e0-4145-b905-6acc551f736f\', \'multiverseId\': 477476}, \'multiverseid\': 477476}, {\'name\': \'半真実の神託者、アトリス\', \'text\': \'威迫\\n半真実の神託者、アトリスが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはあなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見て、それらを裏向きの束１つと表向きの束１つに分ける。一方の束をあなたの手札に加え、もう一方をあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55415e4b-3f7e-43e0-a0bc-9a9460e35edd\', \'multiverseId\': 477730}, \'multiverseid\': 477730}, {\'name\': \'반쪽 진실의 예언자, 아트리스\', \'text\': \'호전적\\n반쪽 진실의 예언자, 아트리스가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 보고 그 카드들을 뒷면이 보이는 더미와 앞면이 보이는 더미로 나눈다. 그중 한 더미를 당신의 손으로 가져가고 다른 더미는 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 참모\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4b68c15-eca3-40c3-81b8-daa60bb24084\', \'multiverseId\': 477984}, \'multiverseid\': 477984}, {\'name\': \'Átris, Oráculo de Meias-verdades\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nQuando Atris, Oráculo de Meias-verdades, entra no campo de batalha, o oponente alvo olha os três cards do topo do teu grimório e os separa em um monte com a face voltada para baixo e outro com a face voltada para cima. Você coloca um monte na própria mão e o outro no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d7b65ee-2eb7-459f-bc31-6b8e20945cf9\', \'multiverseId\': 478238}, \'multiverseid\': 478238}, {\'name\': \'Атрис, Оракул Полуправды\', \'text\': \'Угроза\\nКогда Атрис, Оракул Полуправды выходит на поле битвы, целевой оппонент смотрит три верхние карты вашей библиотеки и делит их на стопку рубашкой вверх и стопку рубашкой вниз. Положите одну стопку в вашу руку, а другую — на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Советник\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'955a34b8-cba1-4c65-b612-7995b6b377a2\', \'multiverseId\': 478492}, \'multiverseid\': 478492}, {\'name\': \'虚实先知阿提理斯\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n当虚实先知阿提理斯进战场时，目标对手检视你牌库顶的三张牌，并分成牌面朝下与牌面朝上各一堆。将其中一堆置于你手上，另一堆则置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5d1e30b-024b-4fc7-b54a-b93cd491a949\', \'multiverseId\': 478746}, \'multiverseid\': 478746}, {\'name\': \'虛實先知阿提理斯\', \'text\': \'威懾\\n當虛實先知阿提理斯進戰場時，目標對手檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌，並分成牌面朝下與牌面朝上各一堆。將其中一堆置於你手上，另一堆則置入你的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／參謀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c51f04c8-898b-4193-aa7b-494b78e25edf\', \'multiverseId\': 479000}, \'multiverseid\': 479000}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufflackern des Schicksals\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl ins Exil und bringe sie dann unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Eine unendlich lange Reise in unendlich kurzer Zeit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476521&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88026e95-a27d-492a-970d-293c880a0c1f\', \'multiverseId\': 476521}, \'multiverseid\': 476521}, {\'name\': \'Instante del destino\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura o encantamiento objetivo, luego regrésalo al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Un viaje infinito en un tiempo infinitesimal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb063244-97ee-4b89-beae-a044c82930a6\', \'multiverseId\': 476775}, \'multiverseid\': 476775}, {\'name\': \'Vacillement du destin\', \'text\': \'Exilez une créature ciblée ou un enchantement ciblé, puis renvoyez-le sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Un voyage infini d\'une durée infinitésimale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477029&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54392969-83b2-4483-a6f0-076979acf36a\', \'multiverseId\': 477029}, \'multiverseid\': 477029}, {\'name\': \'Fremito del Fato\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura o un incantesimo bersaglio, poi rimetti quel permanente sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Un viaggio infinito in un lasso di tempo infinitesimale.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d170d12-0bfd-4af9-9ba6-ddecf87489c6\', \'multiverseId\': 477283}, \'multiverseid\': 477283}, {\'name\': \'運命のちらつき\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。その後、それをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'無限の旅に出る無限小の時間。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef924993-b7f1-4042-8b37-d25a5f22c3e2\', \'multiverseId\': 477537}, \'multiverseid\': 477537}, {\'name\': \'운명의 깜빡임\', \'text\': \'생물 또는 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 추방한 후, 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'찰나의 시간 동안의 무한한 여행.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e520cbd8-5d5d-4db5-9f24-2afff63cd2fb\', \'multiverseId\': 477791}, \'multiverseid\': 477791}, {\'name\': \'Bruxuleio do Destino\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura ou o encantamento alvo e, depois, devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Uma jornada infinita em tempo infinitesimal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c05f9f1-ef1c-403a-a342-65fa646db451\', \'multiverseId\': 478045}, \'multiverseid\': 478045}, {\'name\': \'Проблеск Судьбы\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевое существо или чары, затем верните его (их) на поле битвы под контролем его (их) владельца.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Бесконечно долгое путешествие за бесконечно малое время.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9966f96-580e-44a5-9f2c-4c12a67ce8ac\', \'multiverseId\': 478299}, \'multiverseid\': 478299}, {\'name\': \'明灭命运\', \'text\': \'放逐目标生物或结界，然后将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'无穷短时间内的一次无限长旅行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fdf3ca3-fa11-42ba-9cba-a73d2204eff3\', \'multiverseId\': 478553}, \'multiverseid\': 478553}, {\'name\': \'明滅命運\', \'text\': \'放逐目標生物或結界，然後將它在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'無窮短時間內的一次無限長旅行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13c3ec51-953e-48de-9708-d5dbe048b3ad\', \'multiverseId\': 478807}, \'multiverseid\': 478807}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg zum Ruhm\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines oder beides —\\n• Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\n• Bringe eine Aura-Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Held stirbt und eine Legende wird geboren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476730&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8cf9d53-0427-4719-af24-e477564d289f\', \'multiverseId\': 476730}, \'multiverseid\': 476730}, {\'name\': \'Ascenso a la gloria\', \'text\': \'Elige uno o ambos:\\n• Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\n• Regresa la carta de Aura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Un héroe muere, pero se alza una leyenda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a23e9ce9-3906-4d57-a128-6dbd4857c37f\', \'multiverseId\': 476984}, \'multiverseid\': 476984}, {\'name\': \'Ascension vers la gloire\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un ou les deux —\\n• Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\\n• Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte d\'aura ciblée depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Un héros meurt, et une légende naît.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477238&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a1241ca-647d-4294-a644-6b8026901e5e\', \'multiverseId\': 477238}, \'multiverseid\': 477238}, {\'name\': \'Ascendere alla Gloria\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno o entrambi —\\n• Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\n• Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta Aura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Muore un eroe, nasce una leggenda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'240c110e-5e42-493c-aeef-9736eda93c4e\', \'multiverseId\': 477492}, \'multiverseid\': 477492}, {\'name\': \'栄光への目覚め\', \'text\': \'以下から１つまたは両方を選ぶ。\\n• あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。\\n• あなたの墓地からオーラ・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'英雄が死に、伝説が生まれる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f74ae02-1389-4331-aa0a-8f45be4b75f2\', \'multiverseId\': 477746}, \'multiverseid\': 477746}, {\'name\': \'영광스러운 귀환\', \'text\': \'하나 혹은 둘 다를 선택한다 —\\n• 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 전장으로 되돌린다.\\n• 당신의 무덤에 있는 마법진 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'영웅이 죽고, 전설이 떠오른다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64039736-b2a9-4cdd-a3c6-70c506840540\', \'multiverseId\': 478000}, \'multiverseid\': 478000}, {\'name\': \'Alçar-se à Glória\', \'text\': \'Escolha um ou ambos —\\n• Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\\n• Devolva o card de Aura alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Morre um herói, nasce uma lenda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a21726-313c-4684-a302-7cdba0813ee5\', \'multiverseId\': 478254}, \'multiverseid\': 478254}, {\'name\': \'Возвышение к Славе\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно или оба —\\n• Верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\\n• Верните целевую карту Ауры из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Герой умирает, и рождается легенда.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fde2405-a3be-4c7c-8ce1-b8428b1b1be0\', \'multiverseId\': 478508}, \'multiverseid\': 478508}, {\'name\': \'重生争耀\', \'text\': \'选择一项或都选～\\n•将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n•将目标灵气牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'英雄殒命，传奇诞生。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8624700d-72ef-448e-a780-f59eebf9eb7e\', \'multiverseId\': 478762}, \'multiverseid\': 478762}, {\'name\': \'重生爭耀\', \'text\': \'選擇一項或都選～\\n•將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\\n•將目標靈氣牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'英雄殞命，傳奇誕生。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0519df5d-5bf8-4d0d-af88-165222308993\', \'multiverseId\': 479016}, \'multiverseid\': 479016}]', '[{\'name\': \'Augen des Wachpostens\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und hat Wachsamkeit.\\nBefreiung — {W}, schicke zwei andere Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Befreiungskosten wirken.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476541&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b081f944-01f8-4a4b-9030-b369666f7fd0\', \'multiverseId\': 476541}, \'multiverseid\': 476541}, {\'name\': \'Ojos de centinela\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene la habilidad de vigilancia.\\nEscapatoria—{W}, exiliar otras dos cartas de tu cementerio. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de escapatoria.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ae0d06f-da8c-4630-8dc4-5fde6b90ff05\', \'multiverseId\': 476795}, \'multiverseid\': 476795}, {\'name\': \'Yeux de la sentinelle\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a la vigilance.\\nÉchappée — {W}, exilez deux autres cartes de votre cimetière. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût d\'échappée.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477049&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'379a7e6e-0905-4544-af3a-6a06dd9f56ef\', \'multiverseId\': 477049}, \'multiverseid\': 477049}, {\'name\': \'Occhi della Sentinella\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha cautela.\\nFuga—{W}, Esilia altre due carte dal tuo cimitero. (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di fuga.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da89472b-1979-4f0e-a4ad-9b4a7a8b456e\', \'multiverseId\': 477303}, \'multiverseid\': 477303}, {\'name\': \'歩哨の目\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け警戒を持つ。\\n脱出―{W}, あなたの墓地から他のカード２枚を追放する。（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれの脱出コストで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a95d294-e0a7-4b96-b20c-4115dff967ca\', \'multiverseId\': 477557}, \'multiverseid\': 477557}, {\'name\': \'감시병의 눈\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +1/+1을 받고 경계를 가진다.\\n탈출—{W}, 당신의 무덤에서 다른 카드 두 장을 추방한다. (당신은 이 카드의 탈출 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25bf3d48-976a-4ecd-8413-5b0b6c7196f1\', \'multiverseId\': 477811}, \'multiverseid\': 477811}, {\'name\': \'Olhos de Sentinela\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e tem vigilância.\\nEscapatória — {W}, exile dois outros cards de seu cemitério. (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de escapatória.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'417911b0-3b5a-41d1-852e-1606cb4e93cd\', \'multiverseId\': 478065}, \'multiverseid\': 478065}, {\'name\': \'Глаза Часового\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1 и имеет Бдительность.\\nПобег — {W}, изгоните две другие карты из вашего кладбища. (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Побега.)\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bca8e01-ce86-4131-be9c-814f88d1d6e2\', \'multiverseId\': 478319}, \'multiverseid\': 478319}, {\'name\': \'哨卫之眼\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1且具有警戒异能。\\n逸脱～{W}，从你的坟墓场放逐两张其他牌。（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其逸脱费用。）\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e5916f4-f8fc-4759-97e6-029a7b78dbb3\', \'multiverseId\': 478573}, \'multiverseid\': 478573}, {\'name\': \'哨衛之眼\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+1/+1且具有警戒異能。\\n逸脫～{W}，從你的墳墓場放逐兩張其他牌。（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其逸脫費用。）\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0b7699c-1b77-449f-b2d8-2c291c17120e\', \'multiverseId\': 478827}, \'multiverseid\': 478827}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bannendes Licht\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Bannende Licht ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil, bis das Bannende Licht das Spiel verlässt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Auserwählte griff nach einem Stein und Heliod legte ihr die Sonne in die Hand.\\n—*Die Theriaden*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476509&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'951b235d-10f7-495c-9bc4-725d5f9aa400\', \'multiverseId\': 476509}, \'multiverseid\': 476509}, {\'name\': \'Luz de destierro\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Luz de destierro entre al campo de batalla, exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla un oponente hasta que la Luz de destierro deje el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'La Campeona tomó una piedra y Heliod puso el sol en su mano.\\n—*La Theríada*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b86056aa-ccba-4271-9229-f0944edd1d9e\', \'multiverseId\': 476763}, \'multiverseid\': 476763}, {\'name\': \'Lumière de bannissement\', \'text\': "Quand la Lumière de bannissement arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à ce que la Lumière de bannissement quitte le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'La championne voulut ramasser une pierre, Héliode plaça le soleil dans sa main.\\n—*La Thériade*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477017&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a03d8f1-7021-499d-9fd4-cd245afabc17\', \'multiverseId\': 477017}, \'multiverseid\': 477017}, {\'name\': \'Luce Esiliatrice\', \'text\': \'Quando la Luce Esiliatrice entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario finché la Luce Esiliatrice non lascia il campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'La Campionessa stese la mano per afferrare una pietra, ed Eliod le porse il sole.\\n—*La Theriade*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'951cf193-a093-4092-85f3-c0959b008986\', \'multiverseId\': 477271}, \'multiverseid\': 477271}, {\'name\': \'払拭の光\', \'text\': \'払拭の光が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。払拭の光が戦場を離れるまでそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'女勇者は石に手を伸ばした。ヘリオッドは太陽を彼女の手に委ねた。\\n――*「テーリアス」*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac39a889-ed72-444e-a150-7e3cfd0025ed\', \'multiverseId\': 477525}, \'multiverseid\': 477525}, {\'name\': \'추방의 빛\', \'text\': \'추방의 빛이 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 대지가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 추방의 빛이 전장을 떠날 때까지 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'용사는 돌을 향해 손을 뻗었고, 헬리아드는 그녀의 손 위에 태양을 올려놓았다.\\n—*테리아드*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91d40560-3eb2-4254-8d04-73118eba5a0d\', \'multiverseId\': 477779}, \'multiverseid\': 477779}, {\'name\': \'Luz Banidora\', \'text\': \'Quando Luz Banidora entrar no campo de batalha, exile a permanente alvo que não seja terreno que um oponente controla até que Luz Banidora deixe o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'A Campeã procurou uma pedra e Heliode pôs o sol em suas mãos.\\n— *A Teríada*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3525b23-9d8e-4e23-a86f-f26103098210\', \'multiverseId\': 478033}, \'multiverseid\': 478033}, {\'name\': \'Изгоняющий Свет\', \'text\': \'Когда Изгоняющий Свет выходит на поле битвы, изгоните целевой не являющийся землей перманент под контролем оппонента до тех пор, пока Изгоняющий Свет не покинет поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Поборница потянулась за камнем, и Гелиод положил солнце ей в руку.\\n— *«Териада»*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f3d5046-c0f9-49e3-8676-aa1a267bb6ff\', \'multiverseId\': 478287}, \'multiverseid\': 478287}, {\'name\': \'驱逐明光\', \'text\': \'当驱逐明光进战场时，放逐目标由对手操控的非地永久物，直到驱逐明光离开战场为止。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'天尊伸手想要去拿石块，赫利欧德则将整个太阳递到她掌心。\\n～*《塞洛亚特》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0181f523-7272-42fd-8544-5cabeee92638\', \'multiverseId\': 478541}, \'multiverseid\': 478541}, {\'name\': \'驅逐明光\', \'text\': \'當驅逐明光進戰場時，放逐目標由對手操控的非地永久物，直到驅逐明光離開戰場為止。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'天尊伸手想要去拿石塊，赫利歐德則將整個太陽遞到她掌心。\\n～*《塞洛亞特》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7df69550-b73f-43f9-b2b5-e3a6392266ef\', \'multiverseId\': 478795}, \'multiverseid\': 478795}]', '[{\'name\': \'Begräbnisritual\', \'text\': \'Du ziehst zwei Karten, verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte und legst die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Totenmasken helfen den kürzlich Verstorbenen, der Erosion von Gedächtnis und Identität in der Unterwelt zu widerstehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476602&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1497ac0-4e2d-4ca3-aebd-c5234d19b16f\', \'multiverseId\': 476602}, \'multiverseid\': 476602}, {\'name\': \'Ritos funerarios\', \'text\': \'Robas dos cartas, pierdes 2 vidas y pones las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Las máscaras funerarias ayudan a los fallecidos a resistir la erosión de la memoria y la identidad en el Inframundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c393aac1-ffad-42fc-a69e-75c9a39b1256\', \'multiverseId\': 476856}, \'multiverseid\': 476856}, {\'name\': \'Rites funéraires\', \'text\': \'Vous piochez deux cartes, perdez 2 points de vie, et mettez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les masques funéraires aident ceux qui viennent de mourir à résister à l\'érosion de leurs souvenirs et de leur identité dans le Monde souterrain.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477110&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff78f921-87e9-4a67-a6b7-0df53be42d8b\', \'multiverseId\': 477110}, \'multiverseid\': 477110}, {\'name\': \'Riti Funebri\', \'text\': \'Pesca due carte, perdi 2 punti vita e metti nel tuo cimitero le prime due carte del tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Le maschere funebri consentono ai nuovi defunti di resistere all\'erosione della memoria e dell\'identità nell\'Ade.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac8023c2-5ae7-4719-b0b7-1d6bef1b34a7\', \'multiverseId\': 477364}, \'multiverseid\': 477364}, {\'name\': \'葬儀\', \'text\': \'あなたはカードを２枚引き、２点のライフを失い、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚あなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'葬式の仮面は、死んだばかりの者が死の国で記憶と自己の衰えに抵抗する助けとなる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c22f039-93df-4ddb-a00a-c882be6b92c1\', \'multiverseId\': 477618}, \'multiverseid\': 477618}, {\'name\': \'장례 의식\', \'text\': \'당신은 카드 두 장을 뽑고, 생명 2점을 잃으며, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 두 장을 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'장례 가면은 새로이 죽은 사람들이 저승에서 기억과 정체성의 침식에 저항하는 일을 돕는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f6b2c3f-ea05-4b53-a68f-2dda18dc6c2b\', \'multiverseId\': 477872}, \'multiverseid\': 477872}, {\'name\': \'Ritos Funerários\', \'text\': \'Você compra dois cards, perde 2 pontos de vida e coloca os dois cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Máscaras funerárias ajudam os recém-mortos a resistir à erosão da memória e da identidade no Submundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f55bcbbe-f387-4395-9a1c-e85ccb24b788\', \'multiverseId\': 478126}, \'multiverseid\': 478126}, {\'name\': \'Похоронные Обряды\', \'text\': \'Вы берете две карты, теряете 2 жизни и кладете две верхние карты вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Погребальные маски помогают новопреставившимся сопротивляться стиранию памяти и личности в Подземном царстве.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aecc2a0-12b5-4556-b50a-0227ce6826b7\', \'multiverseId\': 478380}, \'multiverseid\': 478380}, {\'name\': \'送葬仪式\', \'text\': \'你抓两张牌，失去2点生命，并将你牌库顶的两张牌置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'亡者身边的葬仪面具，能帮助他们在刚入冥界之时抵御此处对记忆和身分的侵蚀。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62ba886e-34ed-412c-8ed9-7d8812a5255a\', \'multiverseId\': 478634}, \'multiverseid\': 478634}, {\'name\': \'送葬儀式\', \'text\': \'你抽兩張牌，失去2點生命，並將你牌庫頂的兩張牌置入你的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'亡者身邊的葬儀面具，能幫助他們在剛入冥界之時抵禦此處對記憶和身分的侵蝕。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93dde096-fe03-4fd9-87b8-97c175818b00\', \'multiverseId\': 478888}, \'multiverseid\': 478888}]', '[{\'name\': \'Begünstigte des Iroas\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn eine Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält die Begünstigte des Iroas Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Verheißung des Sieges erfüllt mein Herz. Für Angst bleibt kein Platz."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476520&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f5b05b3-a72d-4f1e-aecb-aa074f0d6b95\', \'multiverseId\': 476520}, \'multiverseid\': 476520}, {\'name\': \'Favorita de Iroas\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que un encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la Favorita de Iroas gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La promesa de la victoria llena mi corazón. La duda no tiene cabida".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b439af5-9ac6-4672-8a0c-6e02b4a34515\', \'multiverseId\': 476774}, \'multiverseid\': 476774}, {\'name\': "Protégée d\'Iroas", \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, la Protégée d\'Iroas acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« La promesse de la victoire emplit mon cœur. Il n\'y a pas de place pour la peur. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477028&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cc49662-58b0-47d9-8afc-5e7b5f789f17\', \'multiverseId\': 477028}, \'multiverseid\': 477028}, {\'name\': \'Favorita di Iroas\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta un incantesimo entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, la Favorita di Iroas ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La promessa della vittoria colma il mio cuore. Non c\\\'è spazio per il timore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4081a41f-bb89-45f9-88ad-672ed820b5ba\', \'multiverseId\': 477282}, \'multiverseid\': 477282}, {\'name\': \'イロアスの寵児\', \'text\': \'星座 ― エンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、イロアスの寵児は二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「私の心は勝利の誓いで満たされている。恐れが入り込む余地などない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5284897e-9ba8-4066-ad14-8a5820bd9f87\', \'multiverseId\': 477536}, \'multiverseid\': 477536}, {\'name\': \'이로아스의 총애를 받는 자\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 부여마법이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 이로아스의 총애를 받는 자는 턴종료까지 이단공격을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"승리의 약속이 내 가슴을 가득 채운다. 두려움이 끼어들 곳은 없다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57c6f8d0-eda7-4e79-b8fd-c6c76d1c8822\', \'multiverseId\': 477790}, \'multiverseid\': 477790}, {\'name\': \'Protegida de Iroas\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que um encantamento entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Protegida de Iroas ganha golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"A promessa da vitória preenche meu coração. Não há espaço para o medo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be229bf0-ffbd-461d-b803-f62479354d4a\', \'multiverseId\': 478044}, \'multiverseid\': 478044}, {\'name\': \'Избранница Ироя\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Избранница Ироя получает Двойной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Предчувствие победы заполняет мое сердце. В нем нет места страху».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ac7af1f-52b8-4683-99c1-e931cf065704\', \'multiverseId\': 478298}, \'multiverseid\': 478298}, {\'name\': \'伊洛安斯恩眷兵\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，伊洛安斯恩眷兵获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「胜利许诺充盈内心，毫无怯惧容身之地。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b194c1b-b4fd-41da-8deb-a133a13e6a25\', \'multiverseId\': 478552}, \'multiverseid\': 478552}, {\'name\': \'伊洛安斯恩眷兵\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，伊洛安斯恩眷兵獲得連擊異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「勝利許諾充盈內心，毫無怯懼容身之地。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'458ff384-a9d4-489c-8fee-7f2125440404\', \'multiverseId\': 478806}, \'multiverseid\': 478806}]', '[{\'name\': \'Berauschende Lyra\', \'text\': \'Du kannst bestimmen, die Berauschende Lyra während deines Enttappsegments nicht zu enttappen.\\n{X}, {T}: Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke X oder weniger. Sie enttappt nicht während des Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers, solange die Berauschende Lyra getappt bleibt.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ihre Saiten sind eigenwillige Fäden des Schicksals.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476738&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdec8664-3b10-4a1f-881e-2a6bfcbaf377\', \'multiverseId\': 476738}, \'multiverseid\': 476738}, {\'name\': \'Lira cautivadora\', \'text\': \'Puedes elegir no enderezar la Lira cautivadora durante tu paso de enderezar.\\n{X}, {T}: Gira la criatura objetivo con fuerza de X o menos. No se endereza durante el paso de enderezar de su controlador mientras la Lira cautivadora permanezca girada.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Sus cuerdas son los hilos caprichosos del destino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebf15aac-d2ec-4171-aaf9-a14d4bf06dd2\', \'multiverseId\': 476992}, \'multiverseid\': 476992}, {\'name\': \'Lyre enchanteresse\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez choisir de ne pas dégager la Lyre enchanteresse pendant votre étape de dégagement.\\n{X}, {T} : Engagez une créature ciblée de force inférieure ou égale à X. Elle ne se dégage pas pendant l\'étape de dégagement de son contrôleur tant que la Lyre enchanteresse reste engagée.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Ses cordes sont d\'imprévisibles fils du destin.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477246&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33bdf56e-09db-4361-8257-34540f2c2194\', \'multiverseId\': 477246}, \'multiverseid\': 477246}, {\'name\': \'Lira Ammaliante\', \'text\': \'Puoi scegliere di non STAPpare la Lira Ammaliante durante il tuo STAP.\\n{X}, {T}: TAPpa una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a X. Non STAPpa durante lo STAP del suo controllore fintanto che la Lira Ammaliante rimane TAPpata.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Le sue corde sono i fili mutevoli del fato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c94ca972-3be1-4fee-bbbd-51e9b278e2a1\', \'multiverseId\': 477500}, \'multiverseid\': 477500}, {\'name\': \'幻惑する竪琴\', \'text\': \'あなたは、あなたのアンタップ・ステップに幻惑する竪琴をアンタップしないことを選んでもよい。\\n{X}, {T}：パワーがＸ以下のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。幻惑する竪琴がタップ状態であり続けているかぎり、それはそれのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'その絃は気紛れな運命の糸。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03edf052-c556-4eb0-8cf4-1900ccc51f4a\', \'multiverseId\': 477754}, \'multiverseid\': 477754}, {\'name\': \'넋을 빼앗는 리라\', \'text\': \'당신은 당신의 언탭단에 넋을 빼앗는 리라를 언탭하지 않을 수 있다.\\n{X}, {T}: 공격력이 X 이하인 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다. 그 생물은 넋을 빼앗는 리라가 탭된 채로 있는 한 그 조종자의 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'그것의 현은 다루기 힘든 운명의 끈들로 되어 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca14c2dd-4d1d-4682-99f9-3806af2bb288\', \'multiverseId\': 478008}, \'multiverseid\': 478008}, {\'name\': \'Lira Hipnotizante\', \'text\': \'Você pode escolher não desvirar Lira Hipnotizante durante sua etapa de desvirar.\\n{X}, {T}: Vire a criatura alvo com poder igual ou inferior a X. Ela não desvira durante a etapa de desvirar de seu controlador enquanto Lira Hipnotizante permanecer virada.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Seus fios são linhas esfiapadas do destino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81499c51-3e3e-4255-b439-9ecde44935c4\', \'multiverseId\': 478262}, \'multiverseid\': 478262}, {\'name\': \'Чарующая Лира\', \'text\': \'Вы можете решить не разворачивать Чарующую Лиру во время вашего шага разворота.\\n{X}, {T}: поверните целевое существо с силой не более X. Оно не разворачивается во время шага разворота контролирующего его игрока, пока Чарующая Лира остается повернутой.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Ее струны — это непредсказуемые нити судьбы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65c982d1-efbc-4e7b-a697-d1af8480dcc7\', \'multiverseId\': 478516}, \'multiverseid\': 478516}, {\'name\': \'摄魂竖琴\', \'text\': \'你可以选择于你的重置步骤中不重置摄魂竖琴。\\n{X}，{T}：横置目标力量等于或小于X的生物。于摄魂竖琴持续横置的时段内，该生物于其操控者的重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'这把琴以命运的任性脉络为弦。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00223d56-cf4a-4ca4-a59c-177543a1d4cb\', \'multiverseId\': 478770}, \'multiverseid\': 478770}, {\'name\': \'攝魂豎琴\', \'text\': \'你可以選擇於你的重置步驟中不重置攝魂豎琴。\\n{X}，{T}：橫置目標力量等於或小於X的生物。於攝魂豎琴持續橫置的時段內，該生物於其操控者的重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'這把琴以命運的任性脈絡為弦。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65861a2a-5009-4593-8d45-7e5fe257e707\', \'multiverseId\': 479024}, \'multiverseid\': 479024}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bevorstehendes Verhängnis\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+3 und greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\\nWenn die verzauberte Kreatur stirbt, fügt das Bevorstehende Verhängnis dem Beherrscher der Kreatur 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Tue dich gütlich, denn deine nächste Mahlzeit könnte deine letzte sein!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476644&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4197a128-fdc8-4a32-b473-44a57075dbc1\', \'multiverseId\': 476644}, \'multiverseid\': 476644}, {\'name\': \'Fatalidad inminente\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+3 y ataca cada combate si puede.\\nCuando la criatura encantada muera, la Fatalidad inminente hace 3 puntos de daño al controlador de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Bebamos, pues esta fiesta siempre puede ser la última!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'857e1e0e-5363-4e45-90a2-3cb0c5be1610\', \'multiverseId\': 476898}, \'multiverseid\': 476898}, {\'name\': \'Fatalité imminente\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+3 et attaque à chaque combat si possible.\\nQuand la créature enchantée meurt, la Fatalité imminente inflige 3 blessures au contrôleur de cette créature.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Festoie bien, car ton prochain repas pourrait être le dernier ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477152&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec28c3db-d81d-4806-824d-eed428dd8864\', \'multiverseId\': 477152}, \'multiverseid\': 477152}, {\'name\': \'Fato Incombente\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+3 e attacca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo.\\nQuando la creatura incantata muore, il Fato Incombente infligge 3 danni al controllore di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Saziatevi a volontà, perché il vostro prossimo pasto potrebbe essere l\\\'ultimo!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2f1ea0a-cde8-46b0-9b6b-43d39885a3d0\', \'multiverseId\': 477406}, \'multiverseid\': 477406}, {\'name\': \'さし迫った破滅\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受け、各戦闘で、可能なら攻撃する。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、さし迫った破滅はそのクリーチャーのコントローラーに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「腹いっぱい食おうじゃないか、これが最後の食事になるかも知れないからな！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a8ea6a9-5f37-4c5a-be7a-f27ddaf4d635\', \'multiverseId\': 477660}, \'multiverseid\': 477660}, {\'name\': \'닥쳐오는 파멸\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +3/+3을 받고 가능하면 매 전투마다 공격한다.\\n부여된 생물이 죽을 때, 닥쳐오는 파멸은 그 생물의 조종자에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"많이 먹어 두어라, 네 다음 식사가 마지막이 될 테니!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59e314e3-8fd7-4f29-bf85-d0f33b8363a2\', \'multiverseId\': 477914}, \'multiverseid\': 477914}, {\'name\': \'Ruína Iminente\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +3/+3 e ataca a cada combate se estiver apta.\\nQuando a criatura encantada morre, Ruína Iminente causa 3 pontos de dano ao controlador daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Banqueteiem-se, pois sua próxima refeição pode ser a última!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'888f3600-29fc-4f92-92e8-215f12faf687\', \'multiverseId\': 478168}, \'multiverseid\': 478168}, {\'name\': \'Нависающий Рок\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +3/+3 и атакует в каждом бою, если может.\\nКогда зачарованное существо умирает, Нависающий Рок наносит 3 повреждения игроку, контролирующему то существо.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Пируй, ибо каждая трапеза может стать для тебя последней!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e30951b4-34e2-4f01-90ca-acab0ea5a7f7\', \'multiverseId\': 478422}, \'multiverseid\': 478422}, {\'name\': \'悲剧临头\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+3/+3，且每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击。\\n当所结附的生物死去时，悲剧临头对该生物的操控者造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「下顿也许就是最后一顿，现在尽情吃喝吧！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a6d2576-ec27-49a8-a317-0801974791a8\', \'multiverseId\': 478676}, \'multiverseid\': 478676}, {\'name\': \'悲劇臨頭\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+3/+3，且每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊。\\n當所結附的生物死去時，悲劇臨頭對該生物的操控者造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「下頓也許就是最後一頓，現在盡情吃喝吧！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'757d38e1-a614-4ebf-a1a3-001e52f12697\', \'multiverseId\': 478930}, \'multiverseid\': 478930}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blick in die Freiheit\', \'text\': \'Ziehe eine Karte.\\nBefreiung — {2}{U}, schicke fünf andere Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Befreiungskosten wirken.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Freiheit besteht darin, einen einzelnen Pfad zu akzeptieren."\\n—Nyklos, meletischer Philosoph\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476555&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c1c95b1-3258-47ba-9ab9-f11bb9acc5e9\', \'multiverseId\': 476555}, \'multiverseid\': 476555}, {\'name\': \'Vislumbrar la libertad\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta.\\nEscapatoria—{2}{U}, exiliar otras cinco cartas de tu cementerio. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de escapatoria.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La libertad consiste en aceptar solo un camino".\\n—Nyklos, filósofo meletiano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b943265-bec1-42ea-a17b-cee6b501692f\', \'multiverseId\': 476809}, \'multiverseid\': 476809}, {\'name\': \'Aperçu de liberté\', \'text\': "Piochez une carte.\\nÉchappée — {2}{U}, exilez cinq autres cartes de votre cimetière. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût d\'échappée.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« La liberté réside dans l\'acceptation d\'un chemin unique. »\\n—Nyklos, philosophe mélétisien", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477063&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bd7103e-44c6-49dd-8475-420bc8f927d2\', \'multiverseId\': 477063}, \'multiverseid\': 477063}, {\'name\': \'Barlume di Libertà\', \'text\': \'Pesca una carta.\\nFuga—{2}{U}, Esilia altre cinque carte dal tuo cimitero. (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di fuga.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La libertà consiste nell\\\'accettare un singolo percorso."\\n—Nyklos, filosofo di Meletis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6ed6a6e-1c18-4976-9c7e-d7fc41601720\', \'multiverseId\': 477317}, \'multiverseid\': 477317}, {\'name\': \'垣間見た自由\', \'text\': \'カードを１枚引く。\\n脱出―{2}{U}, あなたの墓地から他のカード５枚を追放する。（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれの脱出コストで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「自由は、単一の道を受け入れた先にある。」\\n――メレティスの哲人、ニクロス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0027aef-fa47-4708-9bd8-49a10f3f55cd\', \'multiverseId\': 477571}, \'multiverseid\': 477571}, {\'name\': \'짧은 자유\', \'text\': \'카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n탈출—{2}{U}, 당신의 무덤에서 다른 카드 다섯 장을 추방한다. (당신은 이 카드의 탈출 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"길이 하나라는 것을 받아들이면 비로소 자유가 있다."\\n—멜레티스 철학자, 니클로스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c3d9253-e5e8-4945-aab5-bf70c808409b\', \'multiverseId\': 477825}, \'multiverseid\': 477825}, {\'name\': \'Vislumbre de Liberdade\', \'text\': \'Compre um card.\\nEscapatória — {2}{U}, exile cinco outros cards de seu cemitério. (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de escapatória.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"A liberdade está na aceitação de um só caminho."\\n— Niclo, filósofo meletiano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5387fb8-8029-4db5-80e4-249f592dcf1a\', \'multiverseId\': 478079}, \'multiverseid\': 478079}, {\'name\': \'Видение Свободы\', \'text\': \'Возьмите карту.\\nПобег — {2}{U}, изгоните пять других карт из вашего кладбища. (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Побега.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Свобода — в том, чтобы принять свой единственный путь».\\n— Никлос, мелетидский философ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b302129-1aee-445a-8bbe-50eb8c865d23\', \'multiverseId\': 478333}, \'multiverseid\': 478333}, {\'name\': \'瞥视自由\', \'text\': \'抓一张牌。\\n逸脱～{2}{U}，从你的坟墓场放逐五张其他牌。（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其逸脱费用。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「认定方向一往无前，便能求得自由出路。」\\n～迈勒提斯哲人倪克洛斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea7f31e0-1dc3-4606-829f-eb3ef0dde1ae\', \'multiverseId\': 478587}, \'multiverseid\': 478587}, {\'name\': \'瞥視自由\', \'text\': \'抽一張牌。\\n逸脫～{2}{U}，從你的墳墓場放逐五張其他牌。（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其逸脫費用。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「認定方向一往無前，便能求得自由出路。」\\n～邁勒提斯哲人倪克洛斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e67fd98d-3686-481d-80b6-52cca8a8b9a3\', \'multiverseId\': 478841}, \'multiverseid\': 478841}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutrausch-Aspirant\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine bleibende Karte opferst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Blutrausch-Aspiranten.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, opfere eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung: Der Blutrausch-Aspirant fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Sie kann in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Satyr, Berserker\', \'flavor\': \'Vom Fest zum Blutbad ist es nur ein kleiner Schritt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476633&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'270a6f6f-4253-4c03-81cc-7dd38ee9b577\', \'multiverseId\': 476633}, \'multiverseid\': 476633}, {\'name\': \'Aspirante a la sangre\', \'text\': \'Siempre que sacrifiques un permanente, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Aspirante a la sangre.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura o un encantamiento: El Aspirante a la sangre hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo. Esa criatura no puede bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Berserker sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'De la juerga al baño de sangre solo hay un paso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62caca62-8555-49b7-936f-f924261927a0\', \'multiverseId\': 476887}, \'multiverseid\': 476887}, {\'name\': \'Aspirant de sang\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous sacrifiez un permanent, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Aspirant de sang.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature ou un enchantement : L\'Aspirant de sang inflige 1 blessure à une créature ciblée. Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : satyre et berserker\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'y a qu\'un pas entre festivités et bain de sang.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477141&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29a323db-2577-44d4-9d63-8f4b3bbe8201\', \'multiverseId\': 477141}, \'multiverseid\': 477141}, {\'name\': \'Aspirante Sanguinario\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta sacrifichi un permanente, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Aspirante Sanguinario.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura o un incantesimo: L\'Aspirante Sanguinario infligge 1 danno a una creatura bersaglio. Quella creatura non può bloccare in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Berserker Satiro\', \'flavor\': \'Da un baccanale a un bagno di sangue, il passo è breve.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe4d8fe3-ea13-4a92-9551-c82ec540c67b\', \'multiverseId\': 477395}, \'multiverseid\': 477395}, {\'name\': \'血の野心家\', \'text\': \'あなたが他のパーマネントを１つ生け贄に捧げるたび、血の野心家の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n{1}{R}, {T}, クリーチャー１体かエンチャント１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。血の野心家はそれに１点のダメージを与える。このターン、そのクリーチャーではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サテュロス・狂戦士\', \'flavor\': \'悪ふざけと大虐殺は紙一重。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4118a186-8095-4ac3-992b-008619228601\', \'multiverseId\': 477649}, \'multiverseid\': 477649}, {\'name\': \'피의 지망생\', \'text\': \'당신이 지속물을 희생할 때마다, 피의 지망생에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, 생물 또는 부여마법 한 개를 희생한다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 피의 지망생은 그 생물에게 피해 1점을 입힌다. 그 생물은 이 턴에 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 사티로스 광전사\', \'flavor\': \'축제와 대학살극에는 아주 사소한 차이만 있을 뿐이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bc3a5ba-757c-4e9d-a616-bc679cc9ebb5\', \'multiverseId\': 477903}, \'multiverseid\': 477903}, {\'name\': \'Aspirante a Sanguinário\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você sacrificar uma permanente, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Aspirante a Sanguinário.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, sacrifique uma criatura ou um encantamento: Aspirante a Sanguinário causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo. Aquela criatura não pode bloquear neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro Amoque\', \'flavor\': \'Da festança ao banho de sangue é um pulo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d80283a1-7fb0-40d9-bd9a-5a578511d3bc\', \'multiverseId\': 478157}, \'multiverseid\': 478157}, {\'name\': \'Жаждущий Крови\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы жертвуете перманент, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Жаждущего Крови.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, пожертвуйте существо или чары: Жаждущий Крови наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу. То существо не может блокировать в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сатир Берсерк\', \'flavor\': \'От пирушки до кровавой резни совсем небольшой шаг.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0595efd6-6f1d-4254-9315-277206f3dd31\', \'multiverseId\': 478411}, \'multiverseid\': 478411}, {\'name\': \'鲜血求索客\', \'text\': \'每当你牺牲一个永久物时，在鲜血求索客上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{1}{R}，{T}，牺牲一个生物或结界：鲜血求索客对目标生物造成1点伤害。该生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～羊蹄人／狂战士\', \'flavor\': \'从狂欢盛宴到血色浸染不过一步之遥。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ed0e7f9-d753-4dfe-9325-de6899d9948b\', \'multiverseId\': 478665}, \'multiverseid\': 478665}, {\'name\': \'鮮血求索客\', \'text\': \'每當你犧牲一個永久物時，在鮮血求索客上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n{1}{R}，{T}，犧牲一個生物或結界：鮮血求索客對目標生物造成1點傷害。該生物本回合不能進行阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～羊蹄人／狂戰士\', \'flavor\': \'從狂歡盛宴到血色浸染不過一步之遙。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'934a2d87-d289-4904-af81-519870dcd305\', \'multiverseId\': 478919}, \'multiverseid\': 478919}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brackwasser-Riese\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Verzauberung, die du kontrollierst, {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Die Orakel von Meletis konnten weder seinen Aufstieg aus den Tiefen vorhersehen noch die Zerstörung, die er hinterlassen würde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476549&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b913719-c30e-4e84-930f-65f702942a4f\', \'multiverseId\': 476549}, \'multiverseid\': 476549}, {\'name\': \'Gigante del océano\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada encantamiento que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Los oráculos de Meletis no predijeron su ascensión desde las profundidades ni la destrucción que conllevaría su despertar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bfb1e82-6184-414e-9f8f-cbd77d3e3a37\', \'multiverseId\': 476803}, \'multiverseid\': 476803}, {\'name\': \'Géant des embruns\', \'text\': \'Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque enchantement que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': "Les oracles de Mélétis n\'avaient prévu ni son apparition des profondeurs, ni la destruction qu\'il laisserait dans son sillage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477057&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d628a51-2a67-4888-9f00-c51f6f45f6af\', \'multiverseId\': 477057}, \'multiverseid\': 477057}, {\'name\': \'Gigante del Mare\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni incantesimo che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Gli oracoli di Meletis non predissero il suo affioramento dagli abissi, né la distruzione che avrebbe lasciato dietro di sé.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3de1b6e0-971d-4d58-99e6-336ae69e871e\', \'multiverseId\': 477311}, \'multiverseid\': 477311}, {\'name\': \'塩水の巨人\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールしているエンチャント１つにつき{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'メレティスの神託者たちは、それが深海から上がってくることも目覚めによって起こる破壊のことも、予見しなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'949e9c9d-fe7c-42b8-bb9f-226e1c55a18d\', \'multiverseId\': 477565}, \'multiverseid\': 477565}, {\'name\': \'소금물 거인\', \'text\': \'이 주문은 당신이 조종하는 부여마법 한 개당 발동하는 데 {1}이 덜 든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거인\', \'flavor\': \'멜레티스의 예언자들은 그것이 심해로부터 솟구쳐 나오리라는 것도, 그것이 지나가는 길에 파괴만을 남기리라는 것도 예언하지 못했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e66a977-b1b2-4c01-bcc8-0a437914b233\', \'multiverseId\': 477819}, \'multiverseid\': 477819}, {\'name\': \'Gigante da Salmoura\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada encantamento que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Os oráculos de Meletis não previram sua ascensão das profundezas, nem a destruição que ele deixaria em seu rastro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3552c122-7d3d-4ce6-a948-474c5d370dae\', \'multiverseId\': 478073}, \'multiverseid\': 478073}, {\'name\': \'Соленоводный Гигант\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {1} меньше за каждые чары под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': \'Оракулы Мелетиды не видели в своих пророчествах ни его выхода из морских глубин, ни разрушений, что он за собой оставил.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abed8a6b-2af4-4504-8a59-45f316fa7010\', \'multiverseId\': 478327}, \'multiverseid\': 478327}, {\'name\': \'海洋巨人\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个结界，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'迈勒提斯的先知既没有预见到会有巨人从深洋现身，更没料想到它会留下满目疮痍。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d2a8612-ca85-4a1b-94bb-e7511094f992\', \'multiverseId\': 478581}, \'multiverseid\': 478581}, {\'name\': \'海洋巨人\', \'text\': \'你每操控一個結界，此咒語便減少{1}來施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'邁勒提斯的先知既沒有預見到會有巨人從深洋現身，更沒料想到它會留下滿目瘡痍。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ad55601-75b5-47cc-b370-aa34847dbe69\', \'multiverseId\': 478835}, \'multiverseid\': 478835}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bresche in der Unterwelt\', \'text\': \'Nichtland-Karten in deinem Friedhof haben Befreiung. Die Befreiungskosten sind gleich den Manakosten der Karte plus „Schicke drei andere Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil." (Du kannst Karten aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Befreiungskosten wirken.)\\nZu Beginn des Endsegments opferst du die Bresche in der Unterwelt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476666&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4aedc9a-dd5d-4937-a5eb-da43a39eabc1\', \'multiverseId\': 476666}, \'multiverseid\': 476666}, {\'name\': \'Brecha al Inframundo\', \'text\': \'Cada carta que no sea tierra en tu cementerio tiene la habilidad de escapatoria. El coste de escapatoria es igual al coste de maná de la carta más exiliar otras tres cartas de tu cementerio. (Puedes lanzar cartas desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de escapatoria.)\\nAl comienzo del paso final, sacrifica la Brecha al Inframundo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c967222-6d59-4669-9da2-7764c97aae31\', \'multiverseId\': 476920}, \'multiverseid\': 476920}, {\'name\': \'Brèche du Monde souterrain\', \'text\': "Chaque carte non-terrain dans votre cimetière a l\'échappée. Le coût d\'échappée est égal au coût de mana de la carte plus l\'exil de trois autres cartes de votre cimetière. (Vous pouvez lancer des cartes depuis votre cimetière pour leur coût d\'échappée.)\\nAu début de l\'étape de fin, sacrifiez la Brèche du Monde souterrain.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477174&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1940169e-b013-4863-b7a6-0dd872280250\', \'multiverseId\': 477174}, \'multiverseid\': 477174}, {\'name\': "Breccia dell\'Ade", \'text\': \'Ogni carta non terra nel tuo cimitero ha fuga. Il costo di fuga è pari al costo di mana della carta più "Esilia altre tre carte dal tuo cimitero". (Puoi lanciare carte dal tuo cimitero pagando il loro costo di fuga.)\\nAll\\\'inizio della sottofase finale, sacrifica la Breccia dell\\\'Ade.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22a31c83-ddfc-4c7f-a9d7-969e6d3924aa\', \'multiverseId\': 477428}, \'multiverseid\': 477428}, {\'name\': \'死の国からの脱出\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあり土地でない各カードはそれぞれ脱出を持つ。脱出コストは、そのカードのマナ・コストに「あなたの墓地から他のカード３枚を追放する。」を追加したものに等しい。（あなたはあなたの墓地から、カードをそれの脱出コストで唱えてもよい。）\\n終了ステップの開始時に、死の国からの脱出を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c14c943d-7887-41f9-95ae-7008a03c211d\', \'multiverseId\': 477682}, \'multiverseid\': 477682}, {\'name\': \'저승의 틈\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 대지가 아닌 각 카드는 탈출을 가진다. 탈출 비용은 그 카드의 마나 비용에 더해 당신의 무덤에서 다른 카드 세 장을 추방하는 것과 같다. (당신은 카드들의 탈출 비용을 지불해 카드들을 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.)\\n종료단 시작에, 저승의 틈을 희생한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03fa5093-7b0b-4888-879b-5aff40024e23\', \'multiverseId\': 477936}, \'multiverseid\': 477936}, {\'name\': \'Ruptura do Submundo\', \'text\': \'Cada card em seu cemitério que não seja um terreno tem escapatória. O custo de escapatória é igual ao custo de mana do card mais "exile três outros cards de seu cemitério". (Você pode conjurar cards de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de escapatória.)\\nNo início da etapa final, sacrifique Ruptura do Submundo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3f19be1-1bf4-400e-a661-4a836bc0c3a5\', \'multiverseId\': 478190}, \'multiverseid\': 478190}, {\'name\': \'Брешь в Подземное Царство\', \'text\': \'Каждая не являющаяся землей карта на вашем кладбище имеет способность Побега. Стоимость Побега равна мана-стоимости той карты плюс изгоните три другие карты из вашего кладбища. (Вы можете разыгрывать карты из вашего кладбища за их стоимость Побега.)\\nВ начале заключительного шага пожертвуйте Брешь в Подземное Царство.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'800b1046-19d9-42d3-96e8-b05d35efd528\', \'multiverseId\': 478444}, \'multiverseid\': 478444}, {\'name\': \'冥界裂隙\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中的每张非地牌都具有逸脱异能。其逸脱费用等同于该牌的法术力费用加上从你的坟墓场放逐三张其他牌。（你可以从你的坟墓场施放牌，并支付其逸脱费用。）\\n在结束步骤开始时，牺牲冥界裂隙。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ffc1e0b-7cb4-4126-b2ee-ad0607bca706\', \'multiverseId\': 478698}, \'multiverseid\': 478698}, {\'name\': \'冥界裂隙\', \'text\': \'你墳墓場中的每張非地牌都具有逸脫異能。其逸脫費用等同於該牌的魔法力費用加上從你的墳墓場放逐三張其他牌。（你可以從你的墳墓場施放牌，並支付其逸脫費用。）\\n在結束步驟開始時，犧牲冥界裂隙。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e38cea1-1e07-43be-885a-159ae3cdea67\', \'multiverseId\': 478952}, \'multiverseid\': 478952}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bronzehaut-Löwe\', \'text\': \'{G}{W}: Der Bronzehaut-Löwe erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nWenn der Bronzehaut-Löwe stirbt, bringe ihn ins Spiel zurück. Er ist eine Aura-Verzauberung mit „Verzaubert eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst" und „{G}{W}: Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges" und er verliert alle anderen Fähigkeiten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476715&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6af34b28-8b71-483f-8d96-15c16973eec7\', \'multiverseId\': 476715}, \'multiverseid\': 476715}, {\'name\': \'León pelaje de bronce\', \'text\': \'{G}{W}: El León pelaje de bronce gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\nCuando el León pelaje de bronce muera, regrésalo al campo de batalla. Es un encantamiento Aura con la habilidad de encantar criatura que controlas y "{G}{W}: La criatura encantada gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno" y pierde todas las otras habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'335cb487-e65f-4bb6-8166-e53fcfcb8a30\', \'multiverseId\': 476969}, \'multiverseid\': 476969}, {\'name\': \'Lion bronzepeau\', \'text\': "{G}{W} : Le Lion bronzepeau acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nQuand le Lion bronzepeau meurt, renvoyez-le sur le champ de bataille. C\'est un enchantement Aura avec enchanter : une créature que vous contrôlez et « {G}{W} : La créature enchantée acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour », et elle perd toutes ses autres capacités.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477223&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf80855a-185a-4b1b-84b5-ea0bc5340827\', \'multiverseId\': 477223}, \'multiverseid\': 477223}, {\'name\': \'Leone dal Manto di Bronzo\', \'text\': \'{G}{W}: Il Leone dal Manto di Bronzo ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\nQuando il Leone dal Manto di Bronzo muore, rimettilo sul campo di battaglia. È un incantesimo Aura con incanta creatura che controlli e "{G}{W}: La creatura incantata ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno" e perde tutte le altre abilità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02c09609-aed5-467e-96af-090f06ceda43\', \'multiverseId\': 477477}, \'multiverseid\': 477477}, {\'name\': \'青銅皮ライオン\', \'text\': \'{G}{W}：ターン終了時まで、青銅皮ライオンは破壊不能を得る。\\n青銅皮ライオンが死亡したとき、これを戦場に戻す。これはエンチャント（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー）と「{G}{W}：ターン終了時まで、エンチャントしているクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。」を持つオーラ・エンチャントであり、他のすべての能力を失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82163baf-58a6-4ed8-9cad-06a884239e0b\', \'multiverseId\': 477731}, \'multiverseid\': 477731}, {\'name\': \'황동가죽 사자\', \'text\': \'{G}{W}: 황동가죽 사자는 턴종료까지 무적을 얻는다.\\n황동가죽 사자가 죽을 때, 황동가죽 사자를 전장으로 되돌린다. 황동가죽 사자는 당신이 조종하는 생물에게 부여 및 "{G}{W}: 부여된 생물은 턴종료까지 무적을 얻는다."를 가진 마법진 부여마법이며, 자신의 다른 모든 능력을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12366865-68de-4530-aac5-60a17934ddf2\', \'multiverseId\': 477985}, \'multiverseid\': 477985}, {\'name\': \'Leão-de-pele-brônzea\', \'text\': \'{G}{W}: Leão-de-pele-brônzea ganha indestrutível até o final do turno.\\nQuando Leão-de-pele-brônzea morrer, devolva-o ao campo de batalha. Ele é um encantamento do tipo Aura com encantar criatura que você controla e "{G}{W}: A criatura encantada ganha indestrutível até o final do turno", e ele perde todas as outras habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8513f8cf-f9ef-4a92-a9b9-124a32be2acc\', \'multiverseId\': 478239}, \'multiverseid\': 478239}, {\'name\': \'Бронзовошкурый Лев\', \'text\': \'{G}{W}: Бронзовошкурый Лев получает Неразрушимость до конца хода.\\nКогда Бронзовошкурый Лев умирает, верните его на поле битвы. Это чары-Аура со способностями «Зачаровать существо под вашим контролем» и «{G}{W}: зачарованное существо получает Неразрушимость до конца хода», и они теряют все другие способности.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2226faf2-5a87-49e0-9f0d-727037b7213f\', \'multiverseId\': 478493}, \'multiverseid\': 478493}, {\'name\': \'铜皮狮\', \'text\': \'{G}{W}：铜皮狮获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\\n当铜皮狮死去时，将它移回战场。它是灵气结界，且具有「结附于由你操控的生物」与「{G}{W}：所结附的生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束」，并失去所有其他异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71ae0845-6cc1-435f-8df8-0df2e1f1afab\', \'multiverseId\': 478747}, \'multiverseid\': 478747}, {\'name\': \'銅皮獅\', \'text\': \'{G}{W}：銅皮獅獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。\\n當銅皮獅死去時，將它移回戰場。它是靈氣結界，且具有「結附於由你操控的生物」與「{G}{W}：所結附的生物獲得不滅異能直到回合結束」，並失去所有其他異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～貓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'565a61b8-eada-4bfe-be54-3e4551e7ec1d\', \'multiverseId\': 479001}, \'multiverseid\': 479001}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bronzeschwert\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0.\\nAusrüsten {3} ({3}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder Schlag des Schmiedehammers flößt einem Schwert die Entschlossenheit seines Schöpfers ein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476737&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58c2e5aa-65df-458e-8f1f-8e3a27a6b3bf\', \'multiverseId\': 476737}, \'multiverseid\': 476737}, {\'name\': \'Espada de bronce\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+0.\\nEquipar {3}. ({3}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Cada golpe del martillo del herrero infunde a una espada la determinación de su creador.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b2f21e3-e62f-4f6a-a815-0a61d744f7fc\', \'multiverseId\': 476991}, \'multiverseid\': 476991}, {\'name\': \'Épée de bronze\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+0.\\nÉquipement {3} ({3} : Attachez à la créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Chaque coup de marteau du forgeron imprègne l\'épée de la détermination de son créateur.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477245&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec013124-6a03-4505-9b29-74d10e8eb625\', \'multiverseId\': 477245}, \'multiverseid\': 477245}, {\'name\': \'Spada di Bronzo\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0.\\nEquipaggiare {3} ({3}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni colpo di martello del fabbro infonde in una spada la determinazione del suo creatore.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57dd68aa-cd83-4202-b461-6d8bf952242c\', \'multiverseId\': 477499}, \'multiverseid\': 477499}, {\'name\': \'青銅の剣\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n装備{3}（{3}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'鍛冶が振る鎚の一打ちごとに、剣に造り手の決意が注ぎ込まれる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bea674d3-a7db-481c-be1f-2b8ab46d0742\', \'multiverseId\': 477753}, \'multiverseid\': 477753}, {\'name\': \'황동 검\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +2/+0을 받는다.\\n장착 {3} ({3}: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 이 장비를 부착한다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'대장장이가 망치를 내려칠 때마다 검에는 그 창조자의 결심이 주입된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6ce8899-a759-4cae-896f-2f6c39c12ef2\', \'multiverseId\': 478007}, \'multiverseid\': 478007}, {\'name\': \'Espada de Bronze\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+0.\\nEquipar {3} ({3}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Cada martelada do ferreiro infunde na espada a determinação de seu criador.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'852052a4-73de-4cf3-ae29-b97bf7956615\', \'multiverseId\': 478261}, \'multiverseid\': 478261}, {\'name\': \'Бронзовый Меч\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +2/+0.\\nСнарядить {3} ({3}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Каждый удар кузнечного молота наделяет меч целеустремленностью его создателя.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d670e841-a22b-4db9-a799-960ef10e8d07\', \'multiverseId\': 478515}, \'multiverseid\': 478515}, {\'name\': \'青铜剑\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+0。\\n佩带{3}（{3}：装备在目标由你操控的生物上。佩带的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'铁匠每次敲击手中锤子，都为所铸宝剑注入一分信念。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1d6efbc-65bc-4fff-8982-11511dd3ee1e\', \'multiverseId\': 478769}, \'multiverseid\': 478769}, {\'name\': \'青銅劍\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+2/+0。\\n佩帶{3}（{3}：裝備在目標由你操控的生物上。佩帶的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'鐵匠每次敲擊手中鎚子，都為所鑄寶劍注入一分信念。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ce1c9eb-a8d2-46d2-b727-05b9ecf3bbef\', \'multiverseId\': 479023}, \'multiverseid\': 479023}]', '[{\'name\': \'Calix, Hand des Schicksals\', \'text\': \'+1: Schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Verzauberungskarte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\n−3: Schicke eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, ins Exil, bis eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, das Spiel verlässt.\\n−7: Bringe alle Verzauberungskarten aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Calix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476716&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11103d74-92c7-4013-b5a9-d292067c3486\', \'multiverseId\': 476716}, \'multiverseid\': 476716}, {\'name\': \'Cálix, la Mano del Destino\', \'text\': \'+1: Mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de encantamiento que se encuentre entre ellas y poner esa carta en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\n−3: Exilia la criatura o encantamiento objetivo que no controlas hasta que el encantamiento objetivo que controlas deje el campo de batalla.\\n−7: Regresa todas las cartas de encantamiento de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Cálix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fb259ee-5c50-4bb9-9ee2-19f731bb38b6\', \'multiverseId\': 476970}, \'multiverseid\': 476970}, {\'name\': \'Calix, main de la destinée\', \'text\': "+1 : Regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'enchantement parmi elles et mettre cette carte dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\n-3 : Exilez une créature ciblée ou un enchantement ciblé que vous ne contrôlez pas jusqu\'à ce qu\'un enchantement ciblé que vous contrôlez quitte le champ de bataille.\\n-7 : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille toutes les cartes d\'enchantement de votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Calix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477224&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b497bb0-3b0e-4504-8132-dfc97912ce57\', \'multiverseId\': 477224}, \'multiverseid\': 477224}, {\'name\': \'Calix, Mano del Destino\', \'text\': \'+1: Guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta incantesimo scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\n-3: Esilia una creatura o un incantesimo bersaglio che non controlli finché un incantesimo bersaglio che controlli non lascia il campo di battaglia.\\n-7: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte incantesimo dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Calix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94904d16-ae9c-4ab8-bb75-eceff0ae9d78\', \'multiverseId\': 477478}, \'multiverseid\': 477478}, {\'name\': \'運命の手、ケイリクス\', \'text\': \'+1：あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚見る。あなたはその中からエンチャント・カード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\n-3：あなたがコントロールしていない、クリーチャー１体かエンチャント１つと、あなたがコントロールしているエンチャント１つを対象とする。その後者が戦場を離れるまでその前者を追放する。\\n-7：あなたの墓地からエンチャント・カードをすべて戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ケイリクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2646a05-a3b4-438b-afe3-6746cd090044\', \'multiverseId\': 477732}, \'multiverseid\': 477732}, {\'name\': \'운명의 손, 칼릭스\', \'text\': \'+1: 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 네 장을 본다. 당신은 그중에서 부여마법 카드 한 장을 공개하고 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 무작위 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\\n−3: 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물 또는 부여마법을 목표로 정하고 당신이 조종하는 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 두 번째 목표가 전장을 떠날 때까지 첫 번째 목표를 추방한다.\\n−7: 당신의 무덤에 있는 모든 부여마법 카드들을 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 칼릭스\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'243ca332-f260-4391-ae1f-49dde301e756\', \'multiverseId\': 477986}, \'multiverseid\': 477986}, {\'name\': \'Calix, a Mão do Destino\', \'text\': \'+1: Olhe os quatro cards do topo do seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de encantamento dentre eles e colocar aquele card em sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\\n−3: Exile a criatura ou o encantamento alvo que você não controla até que o encantamento alvo que você controla deixe o campo de batalha.\\n−7: Devolva todos os cards de encantamento de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Calix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'518169fc-3423-4de1-97b0-0fef62fdc418\', \'multiverseId\': 478240}, \'multiverseid\': 478240}, {\'name\': \'Каликс, Десница Судьбы\', \'text\': \'+1: посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них карту чар и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\\n−3: изгоните целевое существо или чары не под вашим контролем до тех пор, пока целевые чары под вашим контролем не покинут поле битвы.\\n—7: верните все карты чар из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Каликс\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7aa234a-e1f4-45d6-86eb-ee9104022034\', \'multiverseId\': 478494}, \'multiverseid\': 478494}, {\'name\': \'命运之手凯利斯\', \'text\': \'+1：检视你牌库顶的四张牌。你可以展示其中的一张结界牌，并将该牌置于你手上。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\\n−3：放逐目标不由你操控的生物或结界，直到目标由你操控的结界离开战场为止。\\n−7：将所有结界牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～凯利斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04ff2bce-3532-4a50-9bcc-c4007d90303d\', \'multiverseId\': 478748}, \'multiverseid\': 478748}, {\'name\': \'命運之手凱利斯\', \'text\': \'+1：檢視你牌庫頂的四張牌。你可以展示其中的一張結界牌，並將該牌置於你手上。將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\\n−3：放逐目標不由你操控的生物或結界，直到目標由你操控的結界離開戰場為止。\\n−7：將所有結界牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～凱利斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90c1259a-e8f0-4588-9a3c-1a5e0e36368d\', \'multiverseId\': 479002}, \'multiverseid\': 479002}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion der Setesser\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn eine Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Champion der Setesser und ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Segen ist kein Geschenk, sondern eine Pflicht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476703&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fbe2cee-185b-4eaf-b4f4-e260de7276e0\', \'multiverseId\': 476703}, \'multiverseid\': 476703}, {\'name\': \'Campeona setessana\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que un encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Campeona setessana y roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Una bendición no es un don. Es un deber".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1a148da-6feb-4a4f-a951-6190a9301ab1\', \'multiverseId\': 476957}, \'multiverseid\': 476957}, {\'name\': \'Championne setessienne\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Championne setessienne et piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Une bénédiction n\'est pas un cadeau. C\'est un devoir. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477211&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a115c294-89a8-40b3-b7cd-7a142e320097\', \'multiverseId\': 477211}, \'multiverseid\': 477211}, {\'name\': \'Campionessa di Setessa\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta un incantesimo entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Campionessa di Setessa e pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Una benedizione non è un dono, è un dovere."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e12a95d-473c-45b8-9ba4-b036b7e38357\', \'multiverseId\': 477465}, \'multiverseid\': 477465}, {\'name\': \'セテッサの勇者\', \'text\': \'星座 ― エンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、セテッサの勇者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置き、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「恩寵は贈り物ではありません。これは義務なのです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13626b46-c134-4ea0-a1ed-2145725891be\', \'multiverseId\': 477719}, \'multiverseid\': 477719}, {\'name\': \'세테사 용사\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 부여마법이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 세테사 용사에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓고 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"축복은 선물이 아니다. 그것은 의무다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fff84a26-7552-483b-8d95-958c487bf4b9\', \'multiverseId\': 477973}, \'multiverseid\': 477973}, {\'name\': \'Campeã Setessana\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que um encantamento entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Campeã Setessana e compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma bênção não é um presente. Ela é um dever."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0395eceb-49a3-4ab4-8830-dcf78c35fdf0\', \'multiverseId\': 478227}, \'multiverseid\': 478227}, {\'name\': \'Сетесская Поборница\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Сетесскую Поборницу и возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Благословение — это не дар. Это долг».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af91139b-43dc-4201-8458-256f8cbd38f6\', \'multiverseId\': 478481}, \'multiverseid\': 478481}, {\'name\': \'瑟特萨斗士\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，在瑟特萨斗士上放置一个+1/+1指示物且抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「蒙神赐福并非领受赠礼，而是承担责任。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'100fbec7-0852-4096-b44d-6d4d803b6b3e\', \'multiverseId\': 478735}, \'multiverseid\': 478735}, {\'name\': \'瑟特薩鬥士\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，在瑟特薩鬥士上放置一個+1/+1指示物且抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「蒙神賜福並非領受贈禮，而是承擔責任。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'667525e7-d3f5-47bd-ae13-6d3d533866b9\', \'multiverseId\': 478989}, \'multiverseid\': 478989}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chimäre des Tagesanbruchs\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich deiner Hingabe zu Weiß ist. (Jedes {W} in den Manakosten von bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhöht deine Hingabe zu Weiß um eins.)\\nFliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Chimäre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476515&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'850dd2c5-29aa-421c-a579-16aa85aed903\', \'multiverseId\': 476515}, \'multiverseid\': 476515}, {\'name\': \'Quimera del alba\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {X} menos lanzar este hechizo, donde X es tu devoción al blanco. (Cada {W} en los costes de maná de los permanentes que controlas cuenta para tu devoción al blanco.)\\nVuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Quimera\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d385f5c9-d3c4-45f2-ac43-d1e9b2e1f204\', \'multiverseId\': 476769}, \'multiverseid\': 476769}, {\'name\': \'Chimère du point du jour\', \'text\': \'Ce sort coûte {X} de moins à lancer, X étant votre dévotion au blanc. (Chaque {W} dans les coûts de mana des permanents que vous contrôlez compte pour votre dévotion au blanc.)\\nVol\', \'type\': \'Créature : chimère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477023&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de20080f-a474-4081-bd04-e98b12476dfb\', \'multiverseId\': 477023}, \'multiverseid\': 477023}, {\'name\': "Chimera dell\'Aurora", \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {X} in meno per essere lanciata, dove X è pari alla tua devozione al bianco. (La tua devozione al bianco è la somma dei {W} nel costo di mana dei permanenti che controlli.)\\nVolare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chimera\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4b0818d-caa5-4f51-9eae-4f3238da237b\', \'multiverseId\': 477277}, \'multiverseid\': 477277}, {\'name\': \'夜明けのキマイラ\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘはあなたの白への信心に等しい。（あなたの白への信心とは、あなたがコントロールしているパーマネントのマナ・コストに含まれる{W}の総数である。）\\n飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — キマイラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b91b11d8-3de4-424e-ba15-2aa77bd515c7\', \'multiverseId\': 477531}, \'multiverseid\': 477531}, {\'name\': \'여명의 키메라\', \'text\': \'이 주문은 발동하는 데 {X}가 덜 든다. X는 당신의 백색 신앙심이다. (당신이 조종하는 지속물의 마나 비용에 있는 각 {W}마다 당신의 백색 신앙심이 1씩 증가한다.)\\n비행\', \'type\': \'생물 — 키메라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61ab1f0b-2eb8-49ec-aae4-3b3d59be1c0c\', \'multiverseId\': 477785}, \'multiverseid\': 477785}, {\'name\': \'Quimera do Raiar do Dia\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {X} a menos para ser conjurada, sendo X sua devoção ao branco. (Cada {W} nos custos de mana de permanentes que você controla conta para sua devoção ao branco.)\\nVoar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Quimera\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ead942b-3aa3-4fb3-8c12-f6186b7c78e3\', \'multiverseId\': 478039}, \'multiverseid\': 478039}, {\'name\': \'Химера Рассвета\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {X} меньше, где Х — ваша Преданность белому. (Каждый символ {W} в мана-стоимости перманентов под вашим контролем идет в счет вашей Преданности белому.)\\nПолет\', \'type\': \'Существо — Химера\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0a1046d-417f-459a-a32b-1f00eae7c226\', \'multiverseId\': 478293}, \'multiverseid\': 478293}, {\'name\': \'破晓盖美拉\', \'text\': \'此咒语减少{X}来施放，X为你的白色献力。（由你操控之永久物的法术力费用当中每含有一个{W}，你的白色献力就加一。）\\n飞行\', \'type\': \'生物 ～盖美拉\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b46c7b3d-d20c-40e2-a5e3-4d4e1137dc0f\', \'multiverseId\': 478547}, \'multiverseid\': 478547}, {\'name\': \'破曉蓋美拉\', \'text\': \'此咒語減少{X}來施放，X為你的白色獻力。（由你操控之永久物的魔法力費用當中每含有一個{W}，你的白色獻力就加一。）\\n飛行\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蓋美拉\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8d3b862-dfcd-4386-b735-d230737de17c\', \'multiverseId\': 478801}, \'multiverseid\': 478801}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dalakos der Wunderwerker\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}. Verwende dieses Mana nur, um Artefaktzauber zu wirken oder Fähigkeiten von Artefakten zu aktivieren.\\nAusgerüstete Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Flugfähigkeit und Eile.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Meervolk, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Seine Fantasie steigt aus den Tiefen des Meeres hinauf bis in den Himmel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476717&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af51ebf8-2290-4a60-9c2c-50710ac96413\', \'multiverseId\': 476717}, \'multiverseid\': 476717}, {\'name\': \'Dalakos, creador de maravillas\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}. Usa este maná solo para lanzar hechizos de artefacto o activar habilidades de artefactos.\\nLas criaturas equipadas que controlas tienen las habilidades de volar y prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice tritón\', \'flavor\': \'Su imaginación se eleva desde las profundidades del mar hasta las alturas de los cielos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'779ed822-d0d3-46aa-831d-a5d63ea753a8\', \'multiverseId\': 476971}, \'multiverseid\': 476971}, {\'name\': \'Dalakos, façonneur de merveilles\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts d\'artefact ou activer des capacités d\'artefact.\\nLes créatures équipées que vous contrôlez ont le vol et la célérité.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ondin et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Son imagination s\'étend des profondeurs de la mer à l\'immensité des cieux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477225&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5311940-28df-4b40-a06e-7d80299c12ef\', \'multiverseId\': 477225}, \'multiverseid\': 477225}, {\'name\': \'Dalakos, Creatore di Meraviglie\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare magie artefatto o attivare abilità di artefatti.\\nLe creature equipaggiate che controlli hanno volare e rapidità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'La sua immaginazione si libra dalle profondità del mare fino alle sommità dei cieli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44d52d74-518c-40af-bf49-84e21d0b6ea5\', \'multiverseId\': 477479}, \'multiverseid\': 477479}, {\'name\': \'驚異の造り手、ダラコス\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。このマナは、アーティファクト・呪文を唱えるためか、アーティファクトの能力を起動するためにのみ使用できる。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて装備しているクリーチャーは飛行と速攻を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'彼の創造力は海の深みから天界の頂点まで上昇する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4eb2a521-3635-451a-9bd0-882bd3a76bae\', \'multiverseId\': 477733}, \'multiverseid\': 477733}, {\'name\': \'신비 제작자, 달라코스\', \'text\': \'{T}: {C}{C}를 추가한다. 이 마나는 마법물체 주문을 발동하거나 마법물체의 능력을 활성화하는 데에만 사용할 수 있다.\\n당신이 조종하는 장착된 생물들은 비행 및 신속을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인어 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'그의 상상력은 바닷속 깊은 곳에서부터 하늘 높이까지 치솟는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a766a340-3283-48fc-b1a4-933abfb1323f\', \'multiverseId\': 477987}, \'multiverseid\': 477987}, {\'name\': \'Dálaco, Construtor de Maravilhas\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}{C}. Gaste este mana somente para conjurar mágicas de artefato ou ativar habilidades de artefatos.\\nAs criaturas equipadas que você controla têm voar e ímpeto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Tritão Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'A imaginação dele voa, das profundezas do oceano às alturas celestes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'733edb93-c22f-45d3-9298-14223c2c1247\', \'multiverseId\': 478241}, \'multiverseid\': 478241}, {\'name\': \'Далак, Мастеровой Чудес\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}{C}. Тратьте эту ману только на разыгрывание заклинаний артефактов или на активацию способностей артефактов.\\nСнаряженные существа под вашим контролем имеют Полет и Ускорение.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Мерфолк Механик\', \'flavor\': \'Его воображение взмывает из морских глубин в небесную высь.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05717919-54fb-4034-8e7a-02b453b5c679\', \'multiverseId\': 478495}, \'multiverseid\': 478495}, {\'name\': \'奇械巧匠达拉科斯\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}{C}。此法术力只能用来施放神器咒语，或是起动神器的异能。\\n由你操控且佩带武具的生物具有飞行与敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人鱼／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'他的丰富想象从海底深渊直冲天际云霄。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc53975c-106b-4fee-8147-bab88bf1b10e\', \'multiverseId\': 478749}, \'multiverseid\': 478749}, {\'name\': \'奇械巧匠達拉科斯\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}{C}。此魔法力只能用來施放神器咒語，或是起動神器的異能。\\n由你操控且佩帶武具的生物具有飛行與敏捷異能。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人魚／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'他的豐富想像從海底深淵直衝天際雲霄。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6f79c85-0d3e-49e6-881a-3c326487789a\', \'multiverseId\': 479003}, \'multiverseid\': 479003}]', '[{\'name\': \'Daxos der Sonnengesegnete\', \'text\': "Daxos\' Widerstandskraft ist gleich deiner Hingabe zu Weiß. (Jedes {W} in den Manakosten von bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhöht deine Hingabe zu Weiß um eins.)\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, ins Spiel kommt oder stirbt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.", \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Halbgott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476514&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32662440-d693-4c8f-8912-ea9aed456a3d\', \'multiverseId\': 476514}, \'multiverseid\': 476514}, {\'name\': \'Daxos, bendecido por el sol\', \'text\': \'La resistencia de Daxos es igual a tu devoción al blanco. (Cada {W} en los costes de maná de los permanentes que controlas cuenta para tu devoción al blanco.)\\nSiempre que otra criatura que controlas entre al campo de batalla o muera, ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento legendaria — Semidiós\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44984fd3-b43f-4628-b52f-ed548fc4cb0c\', \'multiverseId\': 476768}, \'multiverseid\': 476768}, {\'name\': \'Daxos, béni par le soleil\', \'text\': "L\'endurance de Daxos est égale à votre dévotion au blanc. (Chaque {W} dans les coûts de mana des permanents que vous contrôlez compte pour votre dévotion au blanc.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez arrive sur le champ de bataille ou meurt, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : demi-dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477022&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c4f79d6-ae6b-49b3-b76a-8a9390de25fb\', \'multiverseId\': 477022}, \'multiverseid\': 477022}, {\'name\': \'Daxos, Benedetto dal Sole\', \'text\': "La costituzione di Daxos è pari alla tua devozione al bianco. (La tua devozione al bianco è la somma dei {W} nel costo di mana dei permanenti che controlli.)\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura che controlli entra nel campo di battaglia o muore, guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo Leggendaria — Semidio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a168ee1-adf6-4c66-9994-cb6c174b0eac\', \'multiverseId\': 477276}, \'multiverseid\': 477276}, {\'name\': \'太陽に祝福されしダクソス\', \'text\': \'太陽に祝福されしダクソスのタフネスは、あなたの白への信心に等しい。（あなたの白への信心とは、あなたがコントロールしているパーマネントのマナ・コストに含まれる{W}の総数である。）\\n他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体、戦場に出るか死亡するたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 亜神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbbeeab4-193e-46c9-930d-1aaa1941bd76\', \'multiverseId\': 477530}, \'multiverseid\': 477530}, {\'name\': \'태양의 축복을 받은 자, 닥소스\', \'text\': \'닥소스의 방어력은 당신의 백색 신앙심과 같다. (당신이 조종하는 지속물의 마나 비용에 있는 각 {W}마다 당신의 백색 신앙심이 1씩 증가한다.)\\n당신이 조종하는 다른 생물이 전장에 들어오거나 죽을 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 부여마법 생물 — 반신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'295fda77-2651-4390-a57e-023d61c0c4f0\', \'multiverseId\': 477784}, \'multiverseid\': 477784}, {\'name\': \'Daxos, Abençoado pelo Sol\', \'text\': \'A resistência de Daxos é igual a sua devoção ao branco. (Cada {W} nos custos de mana de permanentes que você controla conta para sua devoção ao branco.)\\nToda vez que outra criatura que você controla entra no campo de batalha ou morre, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento Lendária — Semideus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82047584-4e60-43c8-b1ae-8285340352da\', \'multiverseId\': 478038}, \'multiverseid\': 478038}, {\'name\': \'Дакс, Благословленный Солнцем\', \'text\': \'Выносливость Дакса равна вашей Преданности белому. (Каждый символ {W} в мана-стоимости перманентов под вашим контролем идет в счет вашей Преданности белому.)\\nКаждый раз, когда другое существо под вашим контролем выходит на поле битвы или умирает, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары Существо — Полубог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83341527-957a-4cb8-a2c1-d42e55a97e8b\', \'multiverseId\': 478292}, \'multiverseid\': 478292}, {\'name\': \'阳神祝佑的达克索斯\', \'text\': \'达克索斯的防御力等同于你的白色献力。（由你操控之永久物的法术力费用当中每含有一个{W}，你的白色献力就加一。）\\n每当另一个由你操控的生物进战场或死去时，你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界生物 ～半神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3580be96-2b72-41c5-85b8-7d22a9744f18\', \'multiverseId\': 478546}, \'multiverseid\': 478546}, {\'name\': \'陽神祝佑的達克索斯\', \'text\': \'達克索斯的防禦力等同於你的白色獻力。（由你操控之永久物的魔法力費用當中每含有一個{W}，你的白色獻力就加一。）\\n每當另一個由你操控的生物進戰場或死去時，你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'傳奇結界生物 ～半神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cf00a64-9ae7-4af3-a04a-3b21843f1ad4\', \'multiverseId\': 478800}, \'multiverseid\': 478800}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Akroische Krieg\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Übernimm die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, solange der Akroische Krieg im Spiel bleibt.\\nII — Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greifen Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\\nIII — Jede getappte Kreatur fügt sich selbst Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476629&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45ec9ff5-af1a-4938-ae55-79f628efa725\', \'multiverseId\': 476629}, \'multiverseid\': 476629}, {\'name\': \'La Guerra Akroniense\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Gana el control de la criatura objetivo mientras La Guerra Akroniense permanezca en el campo de batalla.\\nII — Hasta tu próximo turno, las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes atacan cada combate si pueden.\\nIII — Cada criatura girada se hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a sí misma.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55d168ff-eadc-491b-bdc5-a4d9e3876054\', \'multiverseId\': 476883}, \'multiverseid\': 476883}, {\'name\': "La Guerre d\'Akros", \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature ciblée tant que La Guerre d\'Akros reste sur le champ de bataille.\\nII — Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent attaquent à chaque combat si possible.\\nIIII — Chaque créature engagée s\'inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477137&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2bc6b8b-5988-4f35-9990-961ddf597667\', \'multiverseId\': 477137}, \'multiverseid\': 477137}, {\'name\': \'La Guerra di Akros\', \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Prendi il controllo di una creatura bersaglio fintanto che La Guerra di Akros rimane sul campo di battaglia.\\nII — Fino al tuo prossimo turno, le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari attaccano in ogni combattimento, se possono farlo.\\nIII — Ogni creatura TAPpata infligge a se stessa danno pari alla propria forza.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ecdb9db-cfd7-44a3-9bec-761cb5bfb3d7\', \'multiverseId\': 477391}, \'multiverseid\': 477391}, {\'name\': \'アクロス戦争\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンターを１個加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI ― クリーチャー１体を対象とする。アクロス戦争が戦場に残り続けているかぎり、それのコントロールを得る。\\nII ― あなたの次のターンまで、各戦闘で、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーは可能なら攻撃する。\\nIII ― タップ状態の各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、自身にそれのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b009970-693c-47f1-b961-641d31c77dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 477645}, \'multiverseid\': 477645}, {\'name\': \'아크로스 전쟁\', \'text\': \'(이 서사시가 들어오면서 그리고 당신의 뽑기단 후에, 전승 카운터 한 개를 추가한다. III 이후에 희생한다.)\\nI — 생물을 목표로 정한다. 아크로스 전쟁이 전장에 남아 있는 한 그 생물의 조종권을 얻는다.\\nII — 당신의 다음 턴까지, 당신의 상대들이 조종하는 생물들은 가능하면 매 전투마다 공격한다.\\nIII — 각 탭된 생물은 자신에게 자신의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 서사시\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94e79b2f-9d71-48d6-830e-43228ff85742\', \'multiverseId\': 477899}, \'multiverseid\': 477899}, {\'name\': \'A Guerra Acrosana\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Ganhe o controle da criatura alvo enquanto A Guerra Acrosana permanecer no campo de batalha.\\nII — Até seu próximo turno, as criaturas que seus oponentes controlam atacam a cada combate se estiverem aptas.\\nIII — Cada criatura virada causa a si mesma uma quantidade de dano igual ao próprio poder.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8ee2dd3-7663-4a31-a0ab-de9c6d8b4906\', \'multiverseId\': 478153}, \'multiverseid\': 478153}, {\'name\': \'Акросская Война\', \'text\': \'(При выходе этой Саги и после вашего шага взятия карты добавьте один жетон знаний. Пожертвуйте после III.)\\nI — Получите контроль над целевым существом до тех пор, пока Акросская Война остается на поле битвы.\\nII — До вашего следующего хода существа под контролем ваших оппонентов атакуют в каждом бою, если могут.\\nIII — Каждое повернутое существо наносит самому себе повреждения, равные своей силе.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Сага\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a631d299-3040-4303-8cf0-cb4be75fa308\', \'multiverseId\': 478407}, \'multiverseid\': 478407}, {\'name\': \'阿喀洛斯战记\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 于阿喀洛斯战记仍在战场上时段内，获得目标生物的操控权。\\nII — 直到你的下一个回合，由对手操控的生物每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击。\\nIII — 每个已横置的生物各对本身造成等同于其力量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c84fe6f1-7c6b-48bb-9521-89e88ae7ae7b\', \'multiverseId\': 478661}, \'multiverseid\': 478661}, {\'name\': \'阿喀洛斯戰記\', \'text\': \'（於此傳紀進戰場時及於你抽牌步驟後，加一個學問指示物。到III後犧牲之。）\\nI — 於阿喀洛斯戰記仍在戰場上的時段內，獲得目標生物的操控權。\\nII — 直到你的下一個回合，由對手操控的生物每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊。\\nIII — 每個已橫置的生物各對本身造成等同於其力量的傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～傳紀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ecfd636-c186-477d-b01b-ad5c8729ec45\', \'multiverseId\': 478915}, \'multiverseid\': 478915}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Triumph des Anax\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach IV.)\\nI, II, III — Bis zum Ende des Zuges verursacht eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, Trampelschaden und erhält +X/+0, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Sagenmarken auf dem Triumph des Anax ist.\\nIV — Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, kämpft gegen bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. (Jede der Kreaturen fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476665&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a876e5e-0328-4aa7-b0c3-a1d932f4bd2a\', \'multiverseId\': 476665}, \'multiverseid\': 476665}, {\'name\': \'El triunfo de Anax\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de IV.)\\nI, II, III — Hasta el final del turno, la criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de arrollar y obtiene +X/+0, donde X es la cantidad de contadores de sabiduría sobre El triunfo de Anax.\\nIV — La criatura objetivo que controlas lucha contra hasta una criatura objetivo que no controlas. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bf89109-e13d-4ec4-9570-4bb2fe4171e2\', \'multiverseId\': 476919}, \'multiverseid\': 476919}, {\'name\': "Le triomphe d\'Anax", \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après IV.)\\nI,II, III — Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, la créature ciblée acquiert le piétinement et gagne +X/+0, X étant le nombre de marqueurs « sapience » sur Le triomphe d\'Anax.\\nIV — La créature ciblée que vous contrôlez se bat contre jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477173&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'812fd9fe-7096-4156-9cfa-18dd80035717\', \'multiverseId\': 477173}, \'multiverseid\': 477173}, {\'name\': \'Il Trionfo di Anax\', \'text\': "(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo IV.)\\nI, II, III — Fino alla fine del turno, una creatura bersaglio ha travolgere e prende +X/+0, dove X è il numero di segnalini sapere su Il Trionfo di Anax.\\nIV — Una creatura bersaglio che controlli lotta con fino a una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a7cde67-69db-4847-9c6b-d51c0790528c\', \'multiverseId\': 477427}, \'multiverseid\': 477427}, {\'name\': \'アナックスの勝利\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンターを１個加える。IVの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI, II, III ― クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはトランプルを得て＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはアナックスの勝利の上に置かれている伝承カウンターの個数に等しい。\\nIV ― あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f0ee9f5-71a2-48e5-804c-3c11d992d0a2\', \'multiverseId\': 477681}, \'multiverseid\': 477681}, {\'name\': \'아낙스의 승리\', \'text\': \'(이 서사시가 들어오면서 그리고 당신의 뽑기단 후에, 전승 카운터 한 개를 추가한다. IV 이후에 희생한다.)\\nI, II, III — 생물을 목표로 정한다. 턴종료까지, 그 생물은 돌진을 얻고 +X/+0을 받는다. X는 아낙스의 승리에 놓여 있는 전승 카운터의 수이다.\\nIV — 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정하고 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 첫 번째 목표는 두 번째 목표와 싸운다. (각 생물은 서로에게 각자의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 서사시\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11352114-e6d6-4573-85fa-0dad6afa96eb\', \'multiverseId\': 477935}, \'multiverseid\': 477935}, {\'name\': \'O Triunfo de Anax\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após IV.)\\nI, II, III — Até o final do turno, a criatura alvo ganha atropelar e recebe +X/+0, sendo X o número de marcadores de conhecimento em O Triunfo de Anax.\\nIV — A criatura alvo que você controla luta com até uma criatura alvo que você não controla. (Cada uma causa dano igual ao seu poder à outra.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9c290ee-d33c-4a36-a015-c17cccdec26c\', \'multiverseId\': 478189}, \'multiverseid\': 478189}, {\'name\': \'Триумф Анакса\', \'text\': \'(При выходе этой Саги и после вашего шага взятия карты добавьте один жетон знаний. Пожертвуйте после IV.)\\nI, II, III — До конца хода целевое существо получает Пробивной удар и +X/+0, где X — количество жетонов знаний на Триумфе Анакса.\\nIV — Целевое существо под вашим контролем дерется не более чем с одним целевым существом не под вашим контролем. (Они наносят друг другу повреждения, равные своей силе.)\', \'type\': \'Чары — Сага\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd55944d-57c0-4482-8483-bc7c42d72450\', \'multiverseId\': 478443}, \'multiverseid\': 478443}, {\'name\': \'阿纳克斯凯旋志\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到IV后牺牲之。）\\nI, II, III — 直到回合结束，目标生物获得践踏异能且得+X/+0，X为阿纳克斯凯旋志上的学问指示物数量。\\nIV — 目标由你操控的生物与至多一个目标不由你操控的生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6720e49-b89e-406a-a151-c7227adc6584\', \'multiverseId\': 478697}, \'multiverseid\': 478697}, {\'name\': \'阿那克斯凱旋誌\', \'text\': \'（於此傳紀進戰場時及於你抽牌步驟後，加一個學問指示物。到IV後犧牲之。）\\nI, II, III — 直到回合結束，目標生物獲得踐踏異能且得+X/+0，X為阿那克斯凱旋誌上的學問指示物數量。\\nIV — 目標由你操控的生物與至多一個目標不由你操控的生物互鬥。（它們各向對方造成等同於本身力量的傷害。）\', \'type\': \'結界 ～傳紀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f668332-88fc-49fc-ae56-6ca9ed780499\', \'multiverseId\': 478951}, \'multiverseid\': 478951}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Fesselung der Titanen\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Jeder Spieler legt die obersten drei Karten seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.\\nII — Schicke bis zu zwei Karten deiner Wahl aus Friedhöfen ins Exil. Für jede Kreaturenkarte, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wird, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\nIII — Bringe eine Kreaturen- oder Länderkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476671&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b65d79dc-b907-4535-9837-437b9a3e969d\', \'multiverseId\': 476671}, \'multiverseid\': 476671}, {\'name\': \'La captura de los titanes\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Cada jugador pone las tres primeras cartas de su biblioteca en su cementerio.\\nII — Exilia hasta dos cartas objetivo de los cementerios. Por cada carta de criatura exiliada de esta manera, ganas 1 vida.\\nIII — Regresa la carta de criatura o tierra objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e82d4bcd-b04c-4a7d-b5ad-a581f206ce91\', \'multiverseId\': 476925}, \'multiverseid\': 476925}, {\'name\': "L\'emprisonnement des Titans", \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Chaque joueur met les trois cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.\\nII — Exilez jusqu\'à deux cartes ciblées depuis des cimetières. Pour chaque carte de créature exilée de cette manière, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\nIII — Renvoyez une carte de créature ou de terrain ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477179&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ba6dfa9-7ce0-4126-b625-47044bbb0534\', \'multiverseId\': 477179}, \'multiverseid\': 477179}, {\'name\': \'La Sottomissione dei Titani\', \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Ogni giocatore mette nel proprio cimitero le prime tre carte del proprio grimorio.\\nII — Esilia fino a due carte bersaglio dai cimiteri. Per ogni carta creatura esiliata in questo modo, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\nIII — Riprendi in mano una carta creatura o terra bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d12c5d93-7697-4678-aab8-d07493353988\', \'multiverseId\': 477433}, \'multiverseid\': 477433}, {\'name\': \'タイタンたちの軛\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンターを１個加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI ― 各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚自分の墓地に置く。\\nII ― 墓地からカード最大２枚を対象とし、それらを追放する。あなたは、これにより追放されたクリーチャー・カード１枚につき１点のライフを得る。\\nIII ― あなたの墓地からクリーチャーか土地であるカード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2f97ad0-b850-4b27-a789-89bd1a14b2b1\', \'multiverseId\': 477687}, \'multiverseid\': 477687}, {\'name\': \'거신들의 구속\', \'text\': \'(이 서사시가 들어오면서 그리고 당신의 뽑기단 후에, 전승 카운터 한 개를 추가한다. III 이후에 희생한다.)\\nI — 각 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다.\\nII — 무덤들에 있는 카드들을 최대 두 장까지 목표로 정한다. 그 카드들을 추방한다. 이런 식으로 추방된 각 생물 카드마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\\nIII — 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 또는 대지 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 서사시\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d46add4a-a20c-413f-9cb7-8c57e370e95d\', \'multiverseId\': 477941}, \'multiverseid\': 477941}, {\'name\': \'O Aprisionamento dos Titãs\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Cada jogador coloca os três cards do topo do próprio grimório no próprio cemitério.\\nII — Exile até dois cards alvo de cemitérios. Para cada card de criatura exilado dessa forma, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\nIII — Devolva o card de criatura ou terreno alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e64b9440-910e-4929-84ac-f2300f74f413\', \'multiverseId\': 478195}, \'multiverseid\': 478195}, {\'name\': \'Подчинение Титанов\', \'text\': \'(При выходе этой Саги и после вашего шага взятия карты добавьте один жетон знаний. Пожертвуйте после III.)\\nI — Каждый игрок кладет три верхние карты своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.\\nII — Изгоните не более двух целевых карт из кладбищ. За каждую карту существа, изгнанную таким образом, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\\nIII — Верните целевую карту существа или земли из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Сага\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5c1a1cf-c053-459e-a2d7-08de9632059f\', \'multiverseId\': 478449}, \'multiverseid\': 478449}, {\'name\': \'链缚泰坦录\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 每位牌手各将其牌库顶的三张牌置入其坟墓场。\\nII — 将至多两张目标牌从坟墓场放逐。每以此法放逐一张生物牌，你便获得1点生命。\\nIII — 将目标生物或地牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7727537-803a-40dd-b330-05cfc41caba3\', \'multiverseId\': 478703}, \'multiverseid\': 478703}, {\'name\': \'鏈縛泰坦錄\', \'text\': \'（於此傳紀進戰場時及於你抽牌步驟後，加一個學問指示物。到III後犧牲之。）\\nI — 每位玩家各將其牌庫頂的三張牌置入其墳墓場。\\nII — 將至多兩張目標牌從墳墓場放逐。每以此法放逐一張生物牌，你便獲得1點生命。\\nIII — 將目標生物或地牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～傳紀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'478acfc7-2765-4223-bde2-9ff56e868a3a\', \'multiverseId\': 478957}, \'multiverseid\': 478957}]', "[{'name': 'Die Gründung von Meletis', 'text': '(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Standardlandkarte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\\nII — Erzeuge einen 0/4 farblosen Mauer-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Verteidiger.\\nIII — Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Sage', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476510&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '485094bc-478a-45a5-aaf8-93ae47ca15cc', 'multiverseId': 476510}, 'multiverseid': 476510}, {'name': 'El nacimiento de Meletis', 'text': '(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura básica, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\\nII — Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Muro incolora 0/4 con la habilidad de defensor.\\nIII — Ganas 2 vidas.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476764&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2fb3020a-3929-406d-8b94-99442239d692', 'multiverseId': 476764}, 'multiverseid': 476764}, {'name': 'La naissance de Mélétis', 'text': '(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\nII — Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 0/4 incolore Mur avec le défenseur.\\nIII — Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.', 'type': 'Enchantement : saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477018&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb3d814e-643d-44d9-a7e7-b509f9dac512', 'multiverseId': 477018}, 'multiverseid': 477018}, {'name': 'La Nascita di Meletis', 'text': '(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\\nII — Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Muro 0/4 incolore con difensore.\\nIII — Guadagni 2 punti vita.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477272&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3fb326e0-4af0-4674-8c19-c20c5a7246c2', 'multiverseId': 477272}, 'multiverseid': 477272}, {'name': 'メレティス誕生', 'text': '（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンターを１個加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI ― あなたのライブラリーから基本平地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\\nII ― 防衛を持つ無色の０/４の壁・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\nIII ― あなたは２点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'エンチャント — 英雄譚', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477526&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '914b70d4-a822-4bb3-bb4a-75a9c826fd55', 'multiverseId': 477526}, 'multiverseid': 477526}, {'name': '멜레티스의 탄생', 'text': '(이 서사시가 들어오면서 그리고 당신의 뽑기단 후에, 전승 카운터 한 개를 추가한다. III 이후에 희생한다.)\\nI — 당신의 서고에서 기본 들 카드 한 장을 찾아, 공개하고, 당신의 손으로 가져간 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\\nII — 수비태세를 가진 0/4 무색 벽 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\nIII — 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.', 'type': '부여마법 — 서사시', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477780&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14bbf8cc-ad28-4dd1-8e6f-b64bbf41615d', 'multiverseId': 477780}, 'multiverseid': 477780}, {'name': 'O Nascimento de Meletis', 'text': '(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Procure um card de Planície básica em seu grimório, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e, depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\\nII — Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 0/4 do tipo Barreira com defensor.\\nIII — Você ganha 2 pontos de vida.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478034&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5a434f2-cdf9-4ab8-98bd-5fad6c3efad1', 'multiverseId': 478034}, 'multiverseid': 478034}, {'name': 'Рождение Мелетиды', 'text': '(При выходе этой Саги и после вашего шага взятия карты добавьте один жетон знаний. Пожертвуйте после III.)\\nI — Найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой Равнины, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\\nII — Создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 0/4 бесцветная Стена со способностью Защитника.\\nIII — Вы получаете 2 жизни.', 'type': 'Чары — Сага', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478288&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb7fc9a6-4219-4c9c-ad1d-b1b2cb4340f3', 'multiverseId': 478288}, 'multiverseid': 478288}, {'name': '迈勒提斯创城史', 'text': '（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本的平原牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\\nII — 派出一个0/4无色，具守军异能的墙衍生神器生物。\\nIII — 你获得2点生命。', 'type': '结界 ～传纪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478542&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f10a6bc6-4f04-4caf-8025-7a23fa14cd09', 'multiverseId': 478542}, 'multiverseid': 478542}, {'name': '邁勒提斯創城史', 'text': '（於此傳紀進戰場時及於你抽牌步驟後，加一個學問指示物。到III後犧牲之。）\\nI — 從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本的平原牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\\nII — 派出一個0/4無色，具守軍異能的牆衍生神器生物。\\nIII — 你獲得2點生命。', 'type': '結界 ～傳紀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478796&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '824c73b5-8635-44ed-81db-f770f61e9a88', 'multiverseId': 478796}, 'multiverseid': 478796}]", "[{'name': 'Die ersten Iroanischen Spiele', 'text': '(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach IV.)\\nI — Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nII — Lege drei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\nIII — Falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst, ziehe zwei Karten.\\nIV — Erzeuge einen Gold-Spielstein.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Sage', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476675&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aafbc278-08e9-493d-ace1-bcb847e769e9', 'multiverseId': 476675}, 'multiverseid': 476675}, {'name': 'Los primeros Juegos Iroanianos', 'text': '(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de IV.)\\nI — Crea una ficha de criatura Soldado Humano blanca 1/1.\\nII — Pon tres contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\nIII — Si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más, roba dos cartas.\\nIV — Crea una ficha de Oro.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476929&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb2e3f1e-f550-4c64-aa24-f18d2ccac052', 'multiverseId': 476929}, 'multiverseid': 476929}, {'name': 'Les premiers Jeux iroassiques', 'text': '(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après IV.)\\nI — Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.\\nII — Mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nIII — Si vous contrôlez une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4, piochez deux cartes.\\nIV — Créez un jeton Or.', 'type': 'Enchantement : saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477183&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'adc55fdc-107a-455b-a3db-4ce6e0badc27', 'multiverseId': 477183}, 'multiverseid': 477183}, {'name': 'I Primi Giochi di Iroas', 'text': '(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo IV.)\\nI — Crea una pedina creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianca.\\nII — Metti tre segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\nIII — Se controlli una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4, pesca due carte.\\nIV — Crea una pedina Oro.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477437&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9fb4ca8-009d-4b11-af7e-d21c9f6d635c', 'multiverseId': 477437}, 'multiverseid': 477437}, {'name': '第１回イロアス競技会', 'text': '（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンターを１個加える。IVの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI ― 白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\nII ― あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置く。\\nIII ― あなたがパワーが４以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、カードを２枚引く。\\nIV ― 金・トークンを１つ生成する。', 'type': 'エンチャント — 英雄譚', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477691&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da67a43c-c6d0-4141-8bb5-00d68363068f', 'multiverseId': 477691}, 'multiverseid': 477691}, {'name': '최초의 이로아스 경기', 'text': '(이 서사시가 들어오면서 그리고 당신의 뽑기단 후에, 전승 카운터 한 개를 추가한다. IV 이후에 희생한다.)\\nI — 1/1 백색 인간 병사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\nII — 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 올려놓는다.\\nIII — 당신이 공격력이 4 이상인 생물을 조종한다면, 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\\nIV — 금 토큰 한 개를 만든다.', 'type': '부여마법 — 서사시', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477945&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5729ca2-e2e6-4d21-bb9d-3a2a0e12074e', 'multiverseId': 477945}, 'multiverseid': 477945}, {'name': 'Os Primeiros Jogos Iroanos', 'text': '(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após IV.)\\nI — Crie uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Humano Soldado.\\nII — Coloque três marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla.\\nIII — Se você controlar uma criatura com poder igual ou superior a 4, compre dois cards.\\nIV — Crie uma ficha de Ouro.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478199&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2fcd1939-8d8d-47c3-a4e7-e9605ed84e5f', 'multiverseId': 478199}, 'multiverseid': 478199}, {'name': 'Первые Иройские Игры', 'text': '(При выходе этой Саги и после вашего шага взятия карты добавьте один жетон знаний. Пожертвуйте после IV.)\\nI — Создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Человек Солдат.\\nII — Положите три жетона +1/+1 на целевое существо под вашим контролем.\\nIII — Если вы контролируете существо с силой 4 или больше, возьмите две карты.\\nIV — Создайте одну фишку Золота.', 'type': 'Чары — Сага', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478453&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea6f85cf-cf36-4e3b-9ef5-404792c21097', 'multiverseId': 478453}, 'multiverseid': 478453}, {'name': '第一届伊洛安斯竞技会', 'text': '（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到IV后牺牲之。）\\nI — 派出一个1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物。\\nII — 在目标由你操控的生物上放置三个+1/+1指示物。\\nIII — 如果你操控力量等于或大于4的生物，则抓两张牌。\\nIV — 派出一个黄金衍生物。', 'type': '结界 ～传纪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478707&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0edcc3a0-b412-409c-9c14-cb6080d83c18', 'multiverseId': 478707}, 'multiverseid': 478707}, {'name': '第一屆伊洛安斯競技會', 'text': '（於此傳紀進戰場時及於你抽牌步驟後，加一個學問指示物。到IV後犧牲之。）\\nI — 派出一個1/1白色人類／士兵衍生生物。\\nII — 在目標由你操控的生物上放置三個+1/+1指示物。\\nIII — 如果你操控力量等於或大於4的生物，則抽兩張牌。\\nIV — 派出一個黃金衍生物。', 'type': '結界 ～傳紀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478961&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '133edf05-5fbb-4f34-bb31-2eb1f6374c32', 'multiverseId': 478961}, 'multiverseid': 478961}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dissonanter Flöter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Dissonante Flöter stirbt, erzeuge einen 0/1 weißen Ziege-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Satyr\', \'flavor\': \'Das Ende des Festes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476593&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b28c39a9-ee32-4759-a6b4-892755e4e3c1\', \'multiverseId\': 476593}, \'multiverseid\': 476593}, {\'name\': \'Flautista disonante\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Flautista disonante muera, crea una ficha de criatura Cabra blanca 0/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro zombie\', \'flavor\': \'El fin de fiesta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac01ecbe-efd7-4c76-9ef9-371cca39db75\', \'multiverseId\': 476847}, \'multiverseid\': 476847}, {\'name\': \'Joueur de flûte discordant\', \'text\': \'Quand le Joueur de flûte discordant meurt, créez un jeton de créature 0/1 blanche Chèvre.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et satyre\', \'flavor\': \'La fête est finie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477101&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d80326e-0b53-4e8f-9ecb-9441ffe005b8\', \'multiverseId\': 477101}, \'multiverseid\': 477101}, {\'name\': \'Pifferaio Discordante\', \'text\': \'Quando il Pifferaio Discordante muore, crea una pedina creatura Capra 0/1 bianca.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Satiro Zombie\', \'flavor\': "L\'anima spenta della festa.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4f14fb6-ad85-4224-a3fd-c13f4928e35d\', \'multiverseId\': 477355}, \'multiverseid\': 477355}, {\'name\': \'不協和音の笛吹き\', \'text\': \'不協和音の笛吹きが死亡したとき、白の０/１のヤギ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・サテュロス\', \'flavor\': \'パーティーの終わり。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc5689f0-dcd6-474f-8553-b31d308e42ae\', \'multiverseId\': 477609}, \'multiverseid\': 477609}, {\'name\': \'불협화음 피리꾼\', \'text\': \'불협화음 피리꾼이 죽을 때, 0/1 백색 염소 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 사티로스\', \'flavor\': \'파티의 죽음.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c07f5007-12b4-4fb5-8a8d-778b19cfed5c\', \'multiverseId\': 477863}, \'multiverseid\': 477863}, {\'name\': \'Flautista Dissonante\', \'text\': \'Quando Flautista Dissonante morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 0/1 do tipo Bode.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'Matando a festa...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d506a06e-72de-4098-8b96-70ee4483b2df\', \'multiverseId\': 478117}, \'multiverseid\': 478117}, {\'name\': \'Дудочник Дисгармонии\', \'text\': \'Когда Дудочник Дисгармонии умирает, создайте одну фишку существа 0/1 белая Коза.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Сатир\', \'flavor\': \'Смерть любой вечеринки.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37344236-45d8-4e9a-91dc-53929edfb38a\', \'multiverseId\': 478371}, \'multiverseid\': 478371}, {\'name\': \'走调吹笛手\', \'text\': \'当走调吹笛手死去时，派出一个0/1白色山羊衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／羊蹄人\', \'flavor\': \'盛宴死亡之源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'581da8fb-26f3-40b6-baac-28875454b087\', \'multiverseId\': 478625}, \'multiverseid\': 478625}, {\'name\': \'走調吹笛手\', \'text\': \'當走調吹笛手死去時，派出一個0/1白色山羊衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍／羊蹄人\', \'flavor\': \'盛宴死亡之源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ee385b6-6baa-40f4-b5bb-5ef38a4940bb\', \'multiverseId\': 478879}, \'multiverseid\': 478879}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnernder Streitwagen\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, verursacht Trampelschaden, Eile\\nBemannen 1 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 1 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': \'In Zeiten des Konflikts steigen die Philosophen von Meletis herab vom Podium und auf den Kriegswagen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476744&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b59acb1-ee81-454a-abcf-74e8b24be227\', \'multiverseId\': 476744}, \'multiverseid\': 476744}, {\'name\': \'Carro atronador\', \'text\': \'Daña primero, arrolla, prisa.\\nTripular 1. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 1 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': \'En épocas de conflicto, los filósofos de Meletis cambian los podios por transportes de guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4113a76-88d9-4b69-a02e-7645ce08f2c8\', \'multiverseId\': 476998}, \'multiverseid\': 476998}, {\'name\': \'Char fulminant\', \'text\': "Initiative, piétinement, célérité\\nPilotage 1 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 1 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': \'En période de conflit, les philosophes de Mélétis troquent leurs estrades contre des véhicules de guerre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477252&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7646e9d8-78fd-43b0-9f10-58934754d855\', \'multiverseId\': 477252}, \'multiverseid\': 477252}, {\'name\': \'Biga Tonante\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso, travolgere, rapidità\\nManovrare 1 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 1: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': \'In tempi di conflitti, i filosofi di Meletis barattano i loro podi con veicoli da guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf3e0a85-d748-4cb8-a3b9-858f2f35c54b\', \'multiverseId\': 477506}, \'multiverseid\': 477506}, {\'name\': \'轟く戦車\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃、トランプル、速攻\\n搭乗１（あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が１以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': \'対立の時代には、メレティスの哲人たちは戦時輸送のために演壇を提供する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b3ffb96-0b16-4876-a599-a46b80ab4920\', \'multiverseId\': 477760}, \'multiverseid\': 477760}, {\'name\': \'지축을 울리는 전차\', \'text\': \'선제공격, 돌진, 신속\\n탑승 1 (당신이 조종하는 생물을 공격력 총합이 1 이상이 되도록 원하는 수만큼 탭한다: 이 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 탑승물\', \'flavor\': \'멜레티스의 철학자들은 전쟁을 하게 되면 그들의 연단을 전쟁용 수송 수단으로 사용한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10a77b9d-dda6-4d14-8403-250ee41c2681\', \'multiverseId\': 478014}, \'multiverseid\': 478014}, {\'name\': \'Biga Trovejante\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa, atropelar, ímpeto\\nTripular 1 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 1: Este Veículo torna-se uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': \'Em tempo de conflito, os filósofos de Meletis trocam seus pódiuns por plataformas de guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8d6ffaa-8d21-4708-8c48-2fe4c87471e9\', \'multiverseId\': 478268}, \'multiverseid\': 478268}, {\'name\': \'Громыхающая Колесница\', \'text\': \'Первый удар, Пробивной удар, Ускорение\\nЭкипаж 1 (Поверните любое количество существ под вашим контролем с суммарной силой 1 или более: эта Машина становится артефактом существом до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Машина\', \'flavor\': \'Во времена войны философы Мелетиды меняют свои кафедры на боевые колесницы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99d8ebc2-f1af-498b-a006-eb3162a615f1\', \'multiverseId\': 478522}, \'multiverseid\': 478522}, {\'name\': \'雷鸣战车\', \'text\': \'先攻，践踏，敏捷\\n搭载1（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于1的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～载具\', \'flavor\': \'战争期间，迈勒提斯的哲人将讲坛换成作战载具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'846030b2-bde5-4a48-9928-8c8d77583f3b\', \'multiverseId\': 478776}, \'multiverseid\': 478776}, {\'name\': \'雷鳴戰車\', \'text\': \'先攻，踐踏，敏捷\\n搭載1（橫置任意數量由你操控且力量總和等於或大於1的生物：此載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～載具\', \'flavor\': \'戰爭期間，邁勒提斯的哲人將講壇換成作戰載具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd611b66-8188-44ce-9da1-acd99885c60e\', \'multiverseId\': 479030}, \'multiverseid\': 479030}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dryade des Ilysischen Hains\', \'text\': \'Du darfst in jedem deiner Züge ein zusätzliches Land spielen.\\nLänder, die du kontrollierst, haben zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen alle Standardlandtypen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Nymphe\', \'flavor\': \'„Mit Ranken bekränzt, nährt er das Leben unter den Toten."\\n—Psemilla, meletische Poetin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476674&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a94022c-556e-4c42-a091-c8c15c784e6c\', \'multiverseId\': 476674}, \'multiverseid\': 476674}, {\'name\': \'Dríada de los Bosques Ilyseos\', \'text\': \'Puedes jugar una tierra adicional en cada uno de tus turnos.\\nLas tierras que controlas son de todos los tipos de tierra básica además de sus otros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': \'"Cubierto de ramas e injertos, / crea vida de entre los muertos".\\n—Psemila, poeta meletiana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'421d5882-47d0-463d-af4e-22151cbe1da4\', \'multiverseId\': 476928}, \'multiverseid\': 476928}, {\'name\': \'Dryade du bosquet ilyséen\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez jouer un terrain supplémentaire pendant chacun de vos tours.\\nLes terrains que vous contrôlez ont chaque type de terrain de base en plus de leurs autres types.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : nymphe\', \'flavor\': \'« Couronné de lierre, il cultive la vie chez les morts. »\\n—Psémilla, poétesse mélétisienne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477182&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5007b2c2-459f-473e-97b5-32d068d34e36\', \'multiverseId\': 477182}, \'multiverseid\': 477182}, {\'name\': \'Driade del Boschetto di Ilysia\', \'text\': \'Puoi giocare una terra addizionale in ognuno dei tuoi turni.\\nLe terre che controlli hanno tutti i tipi di terra base in aggiunta ai loro altri tipi.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': \'"Avvolto in spire di rampicanti, alimenta la vita tra i morti."\\n—Psemilla, poetessa di Meletis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d4e4b67-78c2-4834-bba0-66367eb8af6a\', \'multiverseId\': 477436}, \'multiverseid\': 477436}, {\'name\': \'イリーシア木立のドライアド\', \'text\': \'あなたの各ターンに、あなたは追加の土地を１つプレイしてもよい。\\nあなたがコントロールしている土地は、それの他のタイプに加えてすべての基本土地タイプでもある。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ニンフ\', \'flavor\': \'「蔓で飾りし者、彼は死者の中から命を育む。」\\n――メレティスの詩人、プセミラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'453e8e62-c0c0-4d5d-a387-faea2c5e3280\', \'multiverseId\': 477690}, \'multiverseid\': 477690}, {\'name\': \'일리시아 수풀의 드라이어드\', \'text\': \'당신은 당신의 각 턴에 대지 한 개를 추가로 플레이할 수 있다.\\n당신이 조종하는 대지들은 자신의 다른 유형에 더불어 모든 기본 대지 유형이다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 님프\', \'flavor\': \'"덩굴 화관을 쓴 그는 망자들 가운데에서 삶을 기른다네."\\n—멜레티스 시인, 세밀라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e01da212-98f0-4b54-b1f5-97c2225ff9d0\', \'multiverseId\': 477944}, \'multiverseid\': 477944}, {\'name\': \'Dríade do Bosque Ilisiano\', \'text\': \'Você pode jogar um terreno adicional em cada um de seus turnos.\\nOs terrenos que você controla têm todos os tipos de terreno básico além de seus outros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': \'"Coroado de vinhas, ele nutre a vida em meio aos mortos."\\n— Psemília, poetisa meletiana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad934213-6150-4552-b349-f0a728b2073b\', \'multiverseId\': 478198}, \'multiverseid\': 478198}, {\'name\': \'Дриад Илизийской Рощи\', \'text\': \'Вы можете разыгрывать одну дополнительную землю в каждом из ваших ходов.\\nЗемли под вашим контролем обладают каждым типом базовой земли в дополнение к своим другим типам.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Нимфа\', \'flavor\': \'«Он, опутанный лозами, вскармливает жизнь среди смерти».\\n— Псемилла, мелетидская поэтесса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4697d795-1568-42b3-8570-de552eafa8d6\', \'multiverseId\': 478452}, \'multiverseid\': 478452}, {\'name\': \'依吕夏林地树灵\', \'text\': \'你在自己的每个回合中可以额外使用一个地。\\n由你操控的地均额外具有所有基本地类别。\', \'type\': \'结界生物 ～宁芙\', \'flavor\': \'「他遍身碧蔓，培育冥界新生。」\\n～迈勒提斯诗人普塞弥拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8096cb3-0d18-40ef-b89e-753b98ae54fb\', \'multiverseId\': 478706}, \'multiverseid\': 478706}, {\'name\': \'依呂夏林地樹靈\', \'text\': \'你在自己的每個回合中可以額外使用一個地。\\n由你操控的地均額外具有所有基本地類別。\', \'type\': \'結界生物 ～寧芙\', \'flavor\': \'「他遍身碧蔓，培育冥界新生。」\\n～邁勒提斯詩人普塞彌拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52edf18d-3551-499d-be63-238cd59bc7f6\', \'multiverseId\': 478960}, \'multiverseid\': 478960}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämon des Abscheus\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn der Dämon des Abscheus einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, opfert der Spieler eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Hass ist ein mächtiger Verbündeter, aber auch ein unersättlicher Gebieter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479060&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51129009-fedc-4402-b5ec-cd1454c7bc8a\', \'multiverseId\': 479060}, \'multiverseid\': 479060}, {\'name\': \'Demonio del odio\', \'text\': \'Vuela, arrolla.\\nSiempre que el Demonio del odio haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador sacrifica una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'El odio es un poderoso aliado, pero también un amo insaciable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f80fcd82-29f7-4c11-b22f-bf46fb2d6304\', \'multiverseId\': 479070}, \'multiverseid\': 479070}, {\'name\': \'Démon de répugnance\', \'text\': \'Vol, piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que le Démon de répugnance inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur sacrifie une créature.\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': \'La haine est une puissante alliée, mais une maîtresse insatiable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479080&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2257494e-8cc4-4667-9fc1-12015d3321aa\', \'multiverseId\': 479080}, \'multiverseid\': 479080}, {\'name\': "Demone dell\'Avversione", \'text\': "Volare, travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta il Demone dell\'Avversione infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore sacrifica una creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': "L\'odio è un alleato potente, ma un padrone insaziabile.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6b23d50-e7e9-4623-a26e-29252e3486e8\', \'multiverseId\': 479090}, \'multiverseid\': 479090}, {\'name\': \'嫌悪の悪魔\', \'text\': \'飛行、トランプル\\n嫌悪の悪魔がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーはクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'憎悪は強力な仲間である一方、貪欲な支配者でもある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d9383c4-da02-49bb-8187-2b5568a0f035\', \'multiverseId\': 479100}, \'multiverseid\': 479100}, {\'name\': \'혐오의 악마\', \'text\': \'비행, 돌진\\n혐오의 악마가 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어는 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': \'증오는 강력한 동맹이지만, 만족할 줄 모르는 주인이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a272749f-2b55-4588-9142-0113e26e02f5\', \'multiverseId\': 479110}, \'multiverseid\': 479110}, {\'name\': \'Demônio da Repugnância\', \'text\': \'Voar, atropelar\\nToda vez que Demônio da Repugnância causa dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador sacrifica uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'O ódio é um aliado poderoso, mas um mestre insaciável.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9396e1b4-067c-4322-8cb8-4dbb1af61ef6\', \'multiverseId\': 479120}, \'multiverseid\': 479120}, {\'name\': \'Демон Отвращения\', \'text\': \'Полет, Пробивной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда Демон Отвращения наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок жертвует существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': \'Ненависть — могучая союзница, но ненасытная госпожа.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'758d9694-1b19-4fcd-b932-4e649758752a\', \'multiverseId\': 479130}, \'multiverseid\': 479130}, {\'name\': \'仇世恶魔\', \'text\': \'飞行，践踏\\n每当仇世恶魔对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手牺牲一个生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'仇恨虽能为你达成目标提供助力，但也会令你屈从其间无法自拔。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8260be9e-8666-430d-b1c5-682cc10b1077\', \'multiverseId\': 479140}, \'multiverseid\': 479140}, {\'name\': \'仇世惡魔\', \'text\': \'飛行，踐踏\\n每當仇世惡魔對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，該玩家犧牲一個生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～惡魔\', \'flavor\': \'仇恨雖能為你達成目標提供助力，但也會令你屈從其間無法自拔。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'363d334d-3ccf-4a09-b605-d56912d67693\', \'multiverseId\': 479150}, \'multiverseid\': 479150}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476755&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '410599cd-a58f-4c9f-914a-fa4227fa0d0d', 'multiverseId': 476755}, 'multiverseid': 476755}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477009&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2762b74-8c4c-4434-9f5a-83128d0539dd', 'multiverseId': 477009}, 'multiverseid': 477009}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477263&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ca30850-b7bc-4b51-8c8c-4a68a68d896f', 'multiverseId': 477263}, 'multiverseid': 477263}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477517&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4993bf54-a260-40bc-b728-c324fa096ae1', 'multiverseId': 477517}, 'multiverseid': 477517}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477771&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '921f6e9a-4cfb-4454-9db5-a74ec2b877b6', 'multiverseId': 477771}, 'multiverseid': 477771}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478025&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11248a0b-caa0-4c37-9d15-0853a0da3ba5', 'multiverseId': 478025}, 'multiverseid': 478025}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478279&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cdf4e4f4-0b6d-4340-8773-6ac35dc02952', 'multiverseId': 478279}, 'multiverseid': 478279}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478533&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f4ca9df-088d-429d-9ff9-7f9f4d7e5453', 'multiverseId': 478533}, 'multiverseid': 478533}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478787&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e28a2d5-cd86-4939-9b17-8f3c512e2137', 'multiverseId': 478787}, 'multiverseid': 478787}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479041&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b75e689-29ed-4704-af70-4f505dcc25cf', 'multiverseId': 479041}, 'multiverseid': 479041}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479193&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c80ad442-d658-4376-a097-fead3cef015c', 'multiverseId': 479193}, 'multiverseid': 479193}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479211&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '978e9a8a-72cd-411c-90d3-1e803960e11f', 'multiverseId': 479211}, 'multiverseid': 479211}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479229&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8a5dc51-ec97-4e98-81d2-c5cde22bb9b0', 'multiverseId': 479229}, 'multiverseid': 479229}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479247&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '852fec43-2ca9-4e1e-8e09-317e0bfd4354', 'multiverseId': 479247}, 'multiverseid': 479247}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479265&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3fda17f-d899-432b-8488-3b15fb8b9b2d', 'multiverseId': 479265}, 'multiverseid': 479265}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479283&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd3ca653-34ca-4f0f-baaf-7316480b4810', 'multiverseId': 479283}, 'multiverseid': 479283}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479301&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '418de17f-e5f9-45ca-88d7-df36c1c07c1c', 'multiverseId': 479301}, 'multiverseid': 479301}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479319&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ca32e01-8973-4be6-9acc-789e6b17cdfc', 'multiverseId': 479319}, 'multiverseid': 479319}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479337&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3b29324-4821-4c36-a1c9-564856cd045a', 'multiverseId': 479337}, 'multiverseid': 479337}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479355&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fbc03c2d-c91d-4931-8bff-769b5f8f354a', 'multiverseId': 479355}, 'multiverseid': 479355}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479194&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0111610b-8163-499d-9cc2-c1ff9873788a', 'multiverseId': 479194}, 'multiverseid': 479194}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479212&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05fbcfaf-cf33-44c4-9e50-fc6a73540660', 'multiverseId': 479212}, 'multiverseid': 479212}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479230&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '892c6870-f6e7-495e-882b-1288d34cd316', 'multiverseId': 479230}, 'multiverseid': 479230}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479248&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04d0660e-114d-47c5-994c-b20c9fd9ac6c', 'multiverseId': 479248}, 'multiverseid': 479248}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479266&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41eee78a-ad6b-4772-9120-50791dc384fd', 'multiverseId': 479266}, 'multiverseid': 479266}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479284&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a1116a4-63bd-45b0-8bb0-a02a1cf2a8d7', 'multiverseId': 479284}, 'multiverseid': 479284}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479302&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3bf09d3d-d806-4046-af4f-7f692c90d04c', 'multiverseId': 479302}, 'multiverseid': 479302}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479320&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eca453ad-3e28-4307-b790-c8d942b8dd36', 'multiverseId': 479320}, 'multiverseid': 479320}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479338&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '147ace7e-a7ad-4073-91cc-ee83a4cb93cc', 'multiverseId': 479338}, 'multiverseid': 479338}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479356&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05e5bb13-d2b1-41fa-9cdf-70efa40455d4', 'multiverseId': 479356}, 'multiverseid': 479356}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ehrerbietige Hoplitin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Ehrerbietige Hoplitin ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge so viele 1/1 weiße Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine, wie deine Hingabe zu Weiß beträgt. (Jedes {W} in den Manakosten von bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhöht deine Hingabe zu Weiß um eins.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Eifer ist die schärfste Klinge und Frömmigkeit der stärkste Schild."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476538&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dce743ac-494b-4bd6-aa77-8fa8f9077bf5\', \'multiverseId\': 476538}, \'multiverseid\': 476538}, {\'name\': \'Hoplita reverencial\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Hoplita reverencial entre al campo de batalla, crea una cantidad de fichas de criatura Soldado Humano blancas 1/1 igual a tu devoción al blanco. (Cada {W} en los costes de maná de los permanentes que controlas cuenta para tu devoción al blanco.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"El fervor es el arma más afilada, y la piedad, el escudo más impenetrable".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44ce8524-dd70-466b-a9cb-15ec6c81081f\', \'multiverseId\': 476792}, \'multiverseid\': 476792}, {\'name\': \'Hoplite révérende\', \'text\': \'Quand la Hoplite révérende arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un nombre de jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat égal à votre dévotion au blanc. (Chaque {W} dans les coûts de mana des permanents que vous contrôlez compte pour votre dévotion au blanc.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Le zèle est l\'épée la plus tranchante, et la piété le bouclier le plus solide. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477046&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2ed814d-5f72-49d8-b2e6-1e63daeab50e\', \'multiverseId\': 477046}, \'multiverseid\': 477046}, {\'name\': \'Oplita Riverente\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Oplita Riverente entra nel campo di battaglia, crea un numero di pedine creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianche pari alla tua devozione al bianco. (La tua devozione al bianco è la somma dei {W} nel costo di mana dei permanenti che controlli.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo zelo è la lama più affilata, la devozione lo scudo più resistente."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0950f9e1-aa8f-4e99-b458-7f8beb699f58\', \'multiverseId\': 477300}, \'multiverseid\': 477300}, {\'name\': \'恭しき重装歩兵\', \'text\': \'恭しき重装歩兵が戦場に出たとき、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを、あなたの白への信心に等しい数生成する。（あなたの白への信心とは、あなたがコントロールしているパーマネントのマナ・コストに含まれる{W}の総数である。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「熱意こそが鋭い剣、敬虔こそが強い盾。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92f74e60-cf7a-40e4-8a22-21cd9fc12b7d\', \'multiverseId\': 477554}, \'multiverseid\': 477554}, {\'name\': \'숭배하는 중장보병\', \'text\': \'숭배하는 중장보병이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 백색 신앙심만큼의 1/1 백색 인간 병사 생물 토큰을 만든다. (당신이 조종하는 지속물의 마나 비용에 있는 각 {W}마다 당신의 백색 신앙심이 1씩 증가한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"열성이야말로 가장 날카로운 칼날이고, 경건함이야말로 가장 강력한 방패다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edd002e0-c881-40e9-b27d-b991948dbdf0\', \'multiverseId\': 477808}, \'multiverseid\': 477808}, {\'name\': \'Hoplita Reverente\', \'text\': \'Quando Hoplita Reverente entrar no campo de batalha, crie um número de fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Humano Soldado igual a sua devoção ao branco. (Cada {W} nos custos de mana de permanentes que você controla conta para sua devoção ao branco.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"O zelo é a mais afiada das lâminas. E a piedade é o mais forte dos escudos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efc3b7b7-c056-4412-b550-ba6329deaf4e\', \'multiverseId\': 478062}, \'multiverseid\': 478062}, {\'name\': \'Благочестивый Гоплит\', \'text\': \'Когда Благочестивый Гоплит выходит на поле битвы, создайте фишки существа 1/1 белый Человек Солдат, количество которых равно вашей Преданности белому. (Каждый символ {W} в мана-стоимости перманентов под вашим контролем идет в счет вашей Преданности белому.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Рвение — самый острый из клинков, а набожность — крепчайший щит».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc5d305f-8379-46c0-b638-433ebb5e17f4\', \'multiverseId\': 478316}, \'multiverseid\': 478316}, {\'name\': \'虔诚重装步兵\', \'text\': \'当虔诚重装步兵进战场时，派出若干1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物，其数量等同于你的白色献力。（由你操控之永久物的法术力费用当中每含有一个{W}，你的白色献力就加一。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「热诚是最锋利的尖刀，虔敬是最坚实的护盾。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf813cec-52f9-411e-b49d-6da29011faea\', \'multiverseId\': 478570}, \'multiverseid\': 478570}, {\'name\': \'虔誠重裝步兵\', \'text\': \'當虔誠重裝步兵進戰場時，派出若干1/1白色人類／士兵衍生生物，其數量等同於你的白色獻力。（由你操控之永久物的魔法力費用當中每含有一個{W}，你的白色獻力就加一。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「熱誠是最鋒利的尖刀，虔敬是最堅實的護盾。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cb24eed-ea86-45a1-911e-f13f16fade81\', \'multiverseId\': 478824}, \'multiverseid\': 478824}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ehrfurcht gebieten\', \'text\': \'Verhindere allen Kampfschaden, der in diesem Zug zugefügt würde, außer Kampfschaden, der von verzauberten Kreaturen und Verzauberungskreaturen zugefügt würde. Hellsicht 2.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Nylea erschien, begleitet vom Geheul hunderter Bestien.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476680&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02aade89-7a3c-4e64-8888-4d07974f35f5\', \'multiverseId\': 476680}, \'multiverseid\': 476680}, {\'name\': \'Impresionar\', \'text\': \'Prevén todo el daño de combate que se fuera a hacer este turno, excepto el daño de combate que fueran a hacer criaturas encantadas y criaturas encantamiento. Adivina 2.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Nylea apareció entre los aullidos de cientos de bestias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d80773f7-ee0d-4f76-ba1b-21b7d3b89e8f\', \'multiverseId\': 476934}, \'multiverseid\': 476934}, {\'name\': \'Inspirer le respect\', \'text\': \'Prévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées ce tour-ci excepté les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées par des créatures enchantées et des créatures-enchantements. Regard 2.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Nyléa apparut au milieu des hurlements d\'une centaine de bêtes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477188&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26697608-ca0a-4abf-8d40-9e4919d6166c\', \'multiverseId\': 477188}, \'multiverseid\': 477188}, {\'name\': \'Incutere Soggezione\', \'text\': \'Previeni tutto il danno da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto in questo turno tranne il danno da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto da creature incantate e creature incantesimo. Profetizza 2.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Nylea comparve tra gli ululati di centinaia di belve.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41ccc0c8-15f7-44c4-97aa-ae0964eb95c9\', \'multiverseId\': 477442}, \'multiverseid\': 477442}, {\'name\': \'沸き起こる畏怖\', \'text\': \'このターン、クリーチャー・エンチャントやエンチャントされているクリーチャーから受けるものを除き、戦闘ダメージをすべて軽減する。占術２を行う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'無数の野獣が吠える中、ナイレア神が顕現した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53bef74b-7c8f-41e1-bf46-0dcb9c4ffd19\', \'multiverseId\': 477696}, \'multiverseid\': 477696}, {\'name\': \'경외심 고취\', \'text\': \'부여된 생물 및 부여마법 생물이 입히려는 전투피해를 제외한 이번 턴에 입혀질 모든 전투피해를 방지한다. 점술 2를 한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'닐리아는 짐승들 수백 마리의 포효 속에서 나타났다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23d50779-f876-4c67-a4f0-1b0f4edeae8b\', \'multiverseId\': 477950}, \'multiverseid\': 477950}, {\'name\': \'Inspirar Temor\', \'text\': \'Previna todo dano de combate que seria causado este turno, exceto dano de combate que seria causado por criaturas encantadas e criaturas encantamento. Use vidência 2.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Nileia apareceu em meio ao uivo de cem feras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87851d68-e555-4baf-a2e8-640845aa360a\', \'multiverseId\': 478204}, \'multiverseid\': 478204}, {\'name\': \'Повергнуть в Трепет\', \'text\': \'Предотвратите все боевые повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены в этом ходу, кроме боевых повреждений, которые должны быть нанесены зачарованными существами и чарами существами. Предскажите 2.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Нилея явилась в хоре завываний сотни зверей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2606e22f-5f01-4197-a6f1-2066cdc64e58\', \'multiverseId\': 478458}, \'multiverseid\': 478458}, {\'name\': \'引致敬畏\', \'text\': \'防止本回合中将造成的所有战斗伤害，但结界生物或受有灵气的生物造成的战斗伤害除外。占卜2。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'百兽齐鸣，倪勒娅现身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f67f4801-060c-4ce1-9ffb-194ba25a64a7\', \'multiverseId\': 478712}, \'multiverseid\': 478712}, {\'name\': \'引致敬畏\', \'text\': \'防止本回合中將造成的所有戰鬥傷害，但由結界生物和受有靈氣的生物造成的戰鬥傷害除外。占卜2。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'百獸齊鳴，倪勒婭現身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'252cb3f9-561c-4dc0-8ea1-38eb31e02afd\', \'multiverseId\': 478966}, \'multiverseid\': 478966}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ehrfurchtslose Zecher\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Ehrfurchtslosen Zecher ins Spiel kommen, bestimme eines —\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\\n• Die Ehrfurchtslosen Zecher erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Satyr\', \'flavor\': \'Einigen Satyrn ist nur die Blasphemie heilig.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476648&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74b6d041-2590-45e0-b931-1c1900c52003\', \'multiverseId\': 476648}, \'multiverseid\': 476648}, {\'name\': \'Juerguistas irreverentes\', \'text\': \'Cuando los Juerguistas irreverentes entren al campo de batalla, elige uno:\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\\n• Los Juerguistas irreverentes ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'Para algunos sátiros, lo único sagrado es la blasfemia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74d49eb6-4887-4dd0-bc29-460d8dbd391e\', \'multiverseId\': 476902}, \'multiverseid\': 476902}, {\'name\': \'Fêtards irrévérencieux\', \'text\': "Quand les Fêtards irrévérencieux arrivent sur le champ de bataille, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé.\\n• Les Fêtards irrévérencieux acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : satyre\', \'flavor\': \'Pour certains satyres, seul le blasphème est sacré.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477156&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'556568cc-7e01-49ef-a980-d8a89a98169a\', \'multiverseId\': 477156}, \'multiverseid\': 477156}, {\'name\': \'Dissoluti Irriverenti\', \'text\': \'Quando i Dissoluti Irriverenti entrano nel campo di battaglia, scegli uno —\\n• Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.\\n• I Dissoluti Irriverenti hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Satiro\', \'flavor\': \'Per alcuni satiri, solo la blasfemia è sacra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee3fe7ee-9b64-4174-b6a7-02d780c7b5a8\', \'multiverseId\': 477410}, \'multiverseid\': 477410}, {\'name\': \'不遜な歓楽者\', \'text\': \'不遜な歓楽者が戦場に出たとき、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n• ターン終了時まで、不遜な歓楽者は速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サテュロス\', \'flavor\': \'一部のサテュロスにとっては、冒涜のみが神聖である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a7c6677-3592-4bc4-964e-3ba2da7ca989\', \'multiverseId\': 477664}, \'multiverseid\': 477664}, {\'name\': \'불경한 난봉꾼들\', \'text\': \'불경한 난봉꾼들이 전장에 들어올 때, 하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 마법물체를 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체를 파괴한다.\\n• 불경한 난봉꾼들은 턴종료까지 신속을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 사티로스\', \'flavor\': \'몇몇 사티로스들에게는, 신성 모독만이 신성하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce74edb4-2b28-4e20-922c-fd32a6c92d09\', \'multiverseId\': 477918}, \'multiverseid\': 477918}, {\'name\': \'Farristas Irreverentes\', \'text\': \'Quando Farristas Irreverentes entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um —\\n• Destrua o artefato alvo.\\n• Farristas Irreverentes ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'Para alguns sátiros, só a blasfêmia é sagrada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1529da9f-e7ea-488b-9af6-182ebb095d3c\', \'multiverseId\': 478172}, \'multiverseid\': 478172}, {\'name\': \'Непочтительные Гуляки\', \'text\': \'Когда Непочтительные Гуляки выходят на поле битвы, выберите одно —\\n• Уничтожьте целевой артефакт.\\n• Непочтительные Гуляки получают Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сатир\', \'flavor\': \'Для некоторых сатиров священно лишь богохульство.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7562e931-064f-48c9-9336-6e4fb5c3bfe4\', \'multiverseId\': 478426}, \'multiverseid\': 478426}, {\'name\': \'无拘狂欢人\', \'text\': \'当无拘狂欢人进战场时，选择一项～\\n•消灭目标神器。\\n•无拘狂欢人获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～羊蹄人\', \'flavor\': \'对部分羊蹄人而言，只有亵渎神明才是致敬。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27dd9f27-64e3-45b1-b33b-c941c79cbbb2\', \'multiverseId\': 478680}, \'multiverseid\': 478680}, {\'name\': \'無拘狂歡人\', \'text\': \'當無拘狂歡人進戰場時，選擇一項～\\n•消滅目標神器。\\n•無拘狂歡人獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～羊蹄人\', \'flavor\': \'對部分羊蹄人而言，只有褻瀆神明才是致敬。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c5e98a1-1b82-45fa-9047-48f7c9305300\', \'multiverseId\': 478934}, \'multiverseid\': 478934}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eidolon der Inspiration\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Agios wurde von der Klinge eines Minotauren tödlich getroffen, aber ich schwöre, ich habe ihn danach im größten Kampfgetümmel gesehen, immer da, wo Hilfe am nötigsten gebraucht wurde."\\n—Phrokos, Soldat aus Akros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479186&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac6b6fd5-2563-4a64-9ae2-9cfa4046e85f\', \'multiverseId\': 479186}, \'multiverseid\': 479186}, {\'name\': \'Eidolón de la inspiración\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, la criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"La hoja de un minotauro hizo caer a Agios, pero juro que lo he vuelto a ver en medio de la batalla, cuando más necesitábamos ayuda".\\n—Frokos, soldado de Akros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b68bb812-9730-46b7-958b-ecb116c9939b\', \'multiverseId\': 479204}, \'multiverseid\': 479204}, {\'name\': "Eidôlon de l\'inspiration", \'text\': "Au début du combat pendant votre tour, une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : esprit\', \'flavor\': "« Agios a été tué par la lame d\'un minotaure, mais je jure l\'avoir revu depuis, au cœur des combats, quand on a désespérément besoin d\'aide. »\\n—Phrokos, soldat d\'Akros", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479222&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fc9feac-aaa4-4474-871d-5e57a08572bc\', \'multiverseId\': 479222}, \'multiverseid\': 479222}, {\'name\': "Apparizione dell\'Ispirazione", \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Agios venne trucidato dalla lama di un minotauro, ma giuro che da allora l\\\'ho visto, nel tumulto della battaglia, ovunque ci fosse più bisogno di aiuto."\\n—Fryokos, soldato di Akros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c711925-4bcb-4858-bee7-45cb9e418cb8\', \'multiverseId\': 479240}, \'multiverseid\': 479240}, {\'name\': \'発想の幻霊\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「アギオスはミノタウルスの刃にかかって倒れた。だが、誓って言うが、その後も確かに彼を見るのだ。戦闘中に、最も助けが必要なときに。」\\n――アクロスの兵士、フロコス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e41e3234-3d7b-41ba-8658-bc398061e61a\', \'multiverseId\': 479258}, \'multiverseid\': 479258}, {\'name\': \'영감의 에이돌론\', \'text\': \'당신의 턴 전투 시작에, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': \'"아기오스는 미노타우로스의 검에 쓰러졌지만, 그 후에도 그를 본 적이 있다고 맹세해—그는 전투 중에 도움이 가장 필요한 곳마다 그곳에 있었지."\\n—아크로스 병사, 프로코스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20dc17dd-86dc-424f-8c3a-4b7f875621e6\', \'multiverseId\': 479276}, \'multiverseid\': 479276}, {\'name\': \'Eidolon da Inspiração\', \'text\': \'No início do combate no seu turno, a criatura alvo que você controla recebe +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'"Ágio caiu pela lâmina de um minotauro, mas juro que o vi desde então... em batalha, onde quer que sua ajuda seja necessária."\\n— Frocos, soldado de Ácros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdfefdba-738b-4032-8e79-b3b842deb874\', \'multiverseId\': 479294}, \'multiverseid\': 479294}, {\'name\': \'Эйдолон Вдохновения\', \'text\': \'В начале боя во время вашего хода целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +2/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'«Агий пал от клинка минотавра, но, клянусь, я видел его с тех пор живым — в гуще битвы, там, где нужна была помощь».\\n— Фрок, солдат из Акроса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdf21cef-6b27-434c-88d0-171b4e3fde41\', \'multiverseId\': 479312}, \'multiverseid\': 479312}, {\'name\': \'壮志幻灵\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，目标由你操控的生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「虽然阿伊奥斯死在牛头怪刀下，但我发誓在那之后还见过他的身影～在战况最激烈、同袍最需要帮助的时刻。」\\n～阿喀洛斯士兵佛罗科斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a25ca88-89d1-4e39-bf8f-6e7ae22dfbf1\', \'multiverseId\': 479330}, \'multiverseid\': 479330}, {\'name\': \'壯志幻靈\', \'text\': \'在你回合的戰鬥開始時，目標由你操控的生物得 +2/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'結界生物 ～精靈\', \'flavor\': \'「雖然阿伊奧斯死在牛頭怪刀下，但我發誓在那之後還見過他的身影～在戰況最激烈、同袍最需要幫助的時刻。」\\n～阿喀洛斯士兵佛羅科斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ecbc88f-b0ae-4a7f-b1a7-de82e26d6846\', \'multiverseId\': 479348}, \'multiverseid\': 479348}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eidolon der Philosophie\', \'text\': \'{6}{U}, opfere das Eidolon der Philosophie: Ziehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Und was hat uns Erekastos über das Wesen der Seele gelehrt?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476553&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e916554-350b-4317-a4e5-d254d1d09601\', \'multiverseId\': 476553}, \'multiverseid\': 476553}, {\'name\': \'Eidolón de la filosofía\', \'text\': \'{6}{U}, sacrificar el Eidolón de la filosofía: Roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué nos enseñó Erekastos sobre la naturaleza del alma?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9a23c25-f460-4e49-bd63-ed238fe8d0c8\', \'multiverseId\': 476807}, \'multiverseid\': 476807}, {\'name\': \'Eidôlon de philosophie\', \'text\': "{6}{U}, sacrifiez l\'Eidôlon de philosophie : Piochez trois cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : esprit\', \'flavor\': "« Et qu\'est-ce qu\'Érêkastos nous a enseigné sur la nature de l\'âme ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477061&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69a0e5b7-f815-43c7-86c5-2dc6e2a6ccc6\', \'multiverseId\': 477061}, \'multiverseid\': 477061}, {\'name\': \'Apparizione della Filosofia\', \'text\': "{6}{U}, Sacrifica l\'Apparizione della Filosofia: Pesca tre carte.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"E secondo gli insegnamenti di Erekastos, qual è la natura dell\\\'anima?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89c7edb5-a01c-4a18-aac5-42447f023525\', \'multiverseId\': 477315}, \'multiverseid\': 477315}, {\'name\': \'哲学の幻霊\', \'text\': \'{6}{U}, 哲学の幻霊を生け贄に捧げる：カードを３枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「さて、エレカストスは魂の性質について何を述べたのか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'433f15d7-c4c6-4e09-96d8-d00e688eabb7\', \'multiverseId\': 477569}, \'multiverseid\': 477569}, {\'name\': \'철학의 에이돌론\', \'text\': \'{6}{U}, 철학의 에이돌론을 희생한다: 카드 세 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': \'"에레카스토스가 우리에게 가르쳐준 것이 영혼의 본질이란 말인가?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a317d2d1-8e39-4084-99ed-a77feb71aa7e\', \'multiverseId\': 477823}, \'multiverseid\': 477823}, {\'name\': \'Eidolon da Filosofia\', \'text\': \'{6}{U}, sacrifique Eidolon da Filosofia: Compre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'"E o que nos ensina Erecasto sobre a natureza da alma?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42fc7b2c-e4ce-4f7c-96db-df2932d1b241\', \'multiverseId\': 478077}, \'multiverseid\': 478077}, {\'name\': \'Эйдолон Философии\', \'text\': \'{6}{U}, пожертвуйте Эйдолона Философии: возьмите три карты.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'«И чему нас учит Эрекаст, говоря о природе души?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7fb70f1-95b0-4348-85a4-c97201f2683b\', \'multiverseId\': 478331}, \'multiverseid\': 478331}, {\'name\': \'哲理幻灵\', \'text\': \'{6}{U}，牺牲哲理幻灵：抓三张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「难道厄勒卡托斯教导我们的，真是灵魂本质？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09c779f0-49b4-41ed-8f5e-609071409baa\', \'multiverseId\': 478585}, \'multiverseid\': 478585}, {\'name\': \'哲理幻靈\', \'text\': \'{6}{U}，犧牲哲理幻靈：抽三張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界生物 ～精靈\', \'flavor\': \'「難道厄勒卡托斯教導我們的，真是靈魂本質？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c41a3713-770f-48dc-95e8-ce17ebaf2c8b\', \'multiverseId\': 478839}, \'multiverseid\': 478839}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eidolon der Vereitelung\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nLoyalitätsfähigkeiten von Planeswalkern, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, kosten beim Aktivieren {1} mehr.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Der Tod verwandelte bewundernswerte Überzeugung in sinnlose Unnachgiebigkeit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476517&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf000df9-c6b3-41fc-87c6-1014593e40a7\', \'multiverseId\': 476517}, \'multiverseid\': 476517}, {\'name\': \'Eidolón de la obstrucción\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nCuesta {1} más activar las habilidades de lealtad de los planeswalkers que controlan tus oponentes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'La muerte transformó las convicciones dignas de admiración en intransigencias vanas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'709b2832-6583-4fe3-8484-664f17dc3f5c\', \'multiverseId\': 476771}, \'multiverseid\': 476771}, {\'name\': "Eidôlon de l\'obstruction", \'text\': \'Initiative\\nLes capacités de loyauté des planeswalkers que vos adversaires contrôlent coûtent {1} de plus à activer.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : esprit\', \'flavor\': "La mort transformait l\'admirable conviction en vaine intransigeance.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477025&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dff602e-c770-4caa-845f-c44fc88c6869\', \'multiverseId\': 477025}, \'multiverseid\': 477025}, {\'name\': "Apparizione dell\'Ostruzione", \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nLe abilità di fedeltà dei planeswalker controllati dai tuoi avversari costano {1} in più per essere attivate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Spirito\', \'flavor\': "La morte ha trasformato un\'ammirevole convinzione in inutile intransigenza.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b8fae1a-8ff0-47ee-9bcb-fe4d61c25838\', \'multiverseId\': 477279}, \'multiverseid\': 477279}, {\'name\': \'障害の幻霊\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーの忠誠度能力を起動するためのコストは{1}多くなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'死は、称賛に値する信念を無意味な執着に変えた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2f8a2ff-bd1b-4553-b0d2-4abb9aea1f5e\', \'multiverseId\': 477533}, \'multiverseid\': 477533}, {\'name\': \'방해의 에이돌론\', \'text\': \'선제공격\\n당신의 상대들이 조종하는 플레인즈워커들의 충성 능력은 활성화하는 데 {1}이 더 든다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': \'죽음이 존경할만한 신념을 무의미한 고집으로 바꿔 놓았다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'419908a6-3d2f-4be7-879c-468bfa58c5c6\', \'multiverseId\': 477787}, \'multiverseid\': 477787}, {\'name\': \'Eidolon da Obstrução\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nAs habilidades de lealdade dos planeswalkers que seus oponentes controlam custam {1} a mais para serem ativadas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'A morte transformou uma convicção admirável em intransigência despropositada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a312e0d4-27f3-4112-bc5c-132757f490d0\', \'multiverseId\': 478041}, \'multiverseid\': 478041}, {\'name\': \'Эйдолон Воспрещения\', \'text\': "Первый удар\\nАктивация способностей верности planeswalker\'ов под контролем ваших оппонентов стоит на {1} больше.", \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'Смерть превратила достойную уважения убежденность в бессмысленную бескомпромиссность.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13191ad1-51dd-4362-bc87-cb663c449381\', \'multiverseId\': 478295}, \'multiverseid\': 478295}, {\'name\': \'扰生幻灵\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n由对手操控之鹏洛客的忠诚异能增加{1}来起动。\', \'type\': \'结界生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'令人钦佩的虔诚信念，在死后就变成了毫无意义的固执坚持。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5dff812-8651-42ed-bc02-ae9dd8fb363b\', \'multiverseId\': 478549}, \'multiverseid\': 478549}, {\'name\': \'擾生幻靈\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n由對手操控之鵬洛客的忠誠異能增加{1}來起動。\', \'type\': \'結界生物 ～精靈\', \'flavor\': \'令人欽佩的虔誠信念，在死後就變成了毫無意義的固執堅持。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be0d2eda-f886-4b67-a198-36ef613e5af9\', \'multiverseId\': 478803}, \'multiverseid\': 478803}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eins mit den Sternen\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung\\nDie verzauberte bleibende Karte ist eine Verzauberung und verliert alle anderen Kartentypen. (Sie hat weiterhin ihre Fähigkeiten, ist jedoch keine Kreatur mehr.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Nimm deinen Platz in den Sternen ein."\\n—Kruphix, Gott der Horizonte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476564&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06be8dc6-b30f-4702-a1f4-78bf0a4b71e4\', \'multiverseId\': 476564}, \'multiverseid\': 476564}, {\'name\': \'Ser uno con las estrellas\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura o encantamiento.\\nEl permanente encantado es un encantamiento y pierde todos los otros tipos de carta. (Sigue teniendo sus habilidades, pero ya no es una criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Ocupa tu lugar junto a las estrellas".\\n—Krufix, dios de los horizontes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffabd5a2-044a-445c-a8f1-210fd802d887\', \'multiverseId\': 476818}, \'multiverseid\': 476818}, {\'name\': \'En harmonie avec les étoiles\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature ou enchantement\\nLe permanent enchanté est un enchantement et perd tous ses autres types de carte. (Il a toujours ses capacités, mais ce n\'est plus une créature.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Prends ta place parmi les étoiles. »\\n—Kruphix, dieu des Horizons\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477072&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e254249a-e377-43ee-afdd-bef4377e9ee9\', \'multiverseId\': 477072}, \'multiverseid\': 477072}, {\'name\': \'Comunione con le Stelle\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura o incantesimo\\nIl permanente incantato è un incantesimo e perde tutti gli altri tipi di carta. (Ha ancora le sue abilità, ma non è più una creatura.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Occupa il tuo posto tra le stelle."\\n—Krufix, dio degli orizzonti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3185471e-eab7-4938-b291-c37853da52ae\', \'multiverseId\': 477326}, \'multiverseid\': 477326}, {\'name\': \'星々とあるもの\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャーかエンチャント）\\nエンチャントしているパーマネントはエンチャントであり、他のカード・タイプをすべて失う。（それは能力を持ったまま、クリーチャーではなくなる。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「星々の中に座を得よ。」\\n――彼方の神、クルフィックス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75cc628b-e078-4e09-8286-8bd66cecf2f9\', \'multiverseId\': 477580}, \'multiverseid\': 477580}, {\'name\': \'별들과 함께하는 자\', \'text\': \'생물 또는 부여마법에 부여\\n부여된 지속물은 부여마법이며 다른 모든 카드 유형을 잃는다. (여전히 능력은 가지지만, 더 이상 생물이 아니다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"별들 사이에서 네 자리를 차지해라."\\n—지평선의 신, 크루픽스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c0e5b8b-3ac5-4f26-8253-17503d5ed15b\', \'multiverseId\': 477834}, \'multiverseid\': 477834}, {\'name\': \'União às Estrelas\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura ou encantamento\\nA permanente encantada é um encantamento e perde todos os outros tipos de card. (Ela ainda tem as próprias habilidades, mas não é mais uma criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Assuma seu lugar entre as estrelas."\\n— Crufix, deus dos horizontes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4226b260-b4c7-4794-a7b3-e6656d0141e2\', \'multiverseId\': 478088}, \'multiverseid\': 478088}, {\'name\': \'Единство со Звездами\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо или чары\\nЗачарованный перманент является чарами и теряет все другие типы карты. (У него остаются его способности, но он больше не является существом.)\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Займи свое место среди звезд».\\n— Круфикс, бог горизонтов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cde06326-6d4d-4905-9889-0f6d6c8dc921\', \'multiverseId\': 478342}, \'multiverseid\': 478342}, {\'name\': \'星辰加身\', \'text\': \'结附于生物或结界\\n所结附的永久物是结界且失去所有其他牌张类别。（它依然具有原本异能，但不再是生物。）\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「安身于群星之位。」\\n～天际神克罗芬斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7fc229b-8935-46fb-acf9-5866ff5e210c\', \'multiverseId\': 478596}, \'multiverseid\': 478596}, {\'name\': \'星辰加身\', \'text\': \'結附於生物或結界\\n所結附的永久物是結界且失去所有其他牌張類別。（它依然具有原本異能，但不再是生物。）\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「安身於群星之位。」\\n～天際神克羅芬斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92679652-9bc4-4b7a-b59e-1588c1309ca2\', \'multiverseId\': 478850}, \'multiverseid\': 478850}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eisenschuppenhydra\', \'text\': \'Falls eine Kreatur der Eisenschuppenhydra Kampfschaden zufügen würde, verhindere den Schaden und lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Eisenschuppenhydra.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': \'„Senkt eure Bögen, ihr Narren! Pfeile machen sie nur zornig"\\n—Kallia, Späherin vom Hyrax-Turm\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479064&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea713d80-e1c8-4ecd-b002-bc39b6483a99\', \'multiverseId\': 479064}, \'multiverseid\': 479064}, {\'name\': \'Hidra escamas de hierro\', \'text\': \'Si una criatura fuera a hacer daño de combate a la Hidra escamas de hierro, prevén ese daño y pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Hidra escamas de hierro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Bajad los arcos, insensatos! ¡Las flechas no hacen más que enfurecerla!".\\n—Callia, exploradora de la Torre de Hyrax\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebca52c5-3bcb-460d-99aa-e3dffb5748bc\', \'multiverseId\': 479074}, \'multiverseid\': 479074}, {\'name\': \'Hydre à écailles de fer\', \'text\': "Si une créature devait infliger des blessures de combat à l\'Hydre à écailles de fer, prévenez ces blessures et mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Hydre à écailles de fer.", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre\', \'flavor\': "« Baissez vos arcs, imbéciles ! Les flèches ne servent qu\'à l\'énerver ! »\\n—Callia, éclaireuse de la tour d\'Hyrax", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479084&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cb2dc70-2cfd-48e6-8d7a-ff544bf21a51\', \'multiverseId\': 479084}, \'multiverseid\': 479084}, {\'name\': \'Idra dalle Scaglie di Ferro\', \'text\': "Se una creatura sta per infliggere danno da combattimento all\'Idra dalle Scaglie di Ferro, previeni quel danno e metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Idra dalle Scaglie di Ferro.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra\', \'flavor\': \'"Abbassate gli archi, sciocchi! Le frecce la fanno solo arrabbiare!"\\n—Callia, esploratrice della Torre di Hyrax\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1dcc3bb-5e79-4a12-a9de-d75498150d0a\', \'multiverseId\': 479094}, \'multiverseid\': 479094}, {\'name\': \'鉄鱗のハイドラ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体が鉄鱗のハイドラに戦闘ダメージを与えるなら、そのダメージを軽減し、鉄鱗のハイドラの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': \'「弓を置け、愚か者ども！矢は奴を怒らせるだけだ！」\\n――ハイラックス塔の斥候、カリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5d9e0e6-ab1c-496e-ae41-1052e3d9319e\', \'multiverseId\': 479104}, \'multiverseid\': 479104}, {\'name\': \'무쇠비늘 히드라\', \'text\': \'생물이 무쇠비늘 히드라에게 전투피해를 입히려 한다면, 그 피해를 방지하고 무쇠비늘 히드라에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 히드라\', \'flavor\': \'"활을 내려놔, 이 바보들아! 화살은 저걸 화나게 만들 뿐이라고!"\\n—하이락스 탑 정찰병, 칼리어\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10b42e78-544c-49ab-8713-cc8a447e5b79\', \'multiverseId\': 479114}, \'multiverseid\': 479114}, {\'name\': \'Hidra Ferriscama\', \'text\': \'Se uma criatura causaria dano de combate a Hidra Ferriscama, previna aquele dano e coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Hidra Ferriscama.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': \'"Abaixem os arcos, seus tolos! As flechas só a deixam irritada!"\\n— Cália, batedora da Torre Hyrax\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5eb67d9-dfa9-40c4-9305-5f4db50455fb\', \'multiverseId\': 479124}, \'multiverseid\': 479124}, {\'name\': \'Железнокожая Гидра\', \'text\': \'Если существо должно нанести боевые повреждения Железнокожей Гидре, предотвратите те повреждения и положите один жетон +1/+1 на Железнокожую Гидру.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гидра\', \'flavor\': \'«Уберите луки, кретины! Стрелы ее только злят!»\\n— Каллия, дозорная башни Гиракс\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1458275-52dd-4c01-81c9-c76f80746f8b\', \'multiverseId\': 479134}, \'multiverseid\': 479134}, {\'name\': \'铁鳞多头龙\', \'text\': \'如果某生物将对铁鳞多头龙造成战斗伤害，则防止该伤害且在铁鳞多头龙上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～多头龙\', \'flavor\': \'「把弓放下，你们这些蠢货！箭矢只会激怒它！」\\n～许拉兹塔斥候卡莱娅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50781c11-70b8-404a-a9fb-f6ec8aa4a704\', \'multiverseId\': 479144}, \'multiverseid\': 479144}, {\'name\': \'鐵鱗多頭龍\', \'text\': \'如果某生物將對鐵鱗多頭龍造成戰鬥傷害，則防止該傷害且在鐵鱗多頭龍上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～多頭龍\', \'flavor\': \'「把弓放下，你們這些蠢貨！箭矢只會激怒它！」\\n～許拉茲塔斥候卡萊婭\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3622d017-f034-41f9-981e-da3d18cffe08\', \'multiverseId\': 479154}, \'multiverseid\': 479154}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elite-Ausbilderin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Elite-Ausbilderin ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Die brillantesten Köpfe in Meletis studieren unter den Meistern an der Dekatia, einer berühmten Schule für Magie und Philosophie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476554&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd14bf8e-b27b-4294-800f-30df3fd33da1\', \'multiverseId\': 476554}, \'multiverseid\': 476554}, {\'name\': \'Instructora de élite\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Instructora de élite entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Las mentes más brillantes de Meletis estudian bajo la tutela de los maestros de Dekatia, una escuela de magia y filosofía de renombre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'839c3233-18d1-44be-a5e5-516dd80ad6fa\', \'multiverseId\': 476808}, \'multiverseid\': 476808}, {\'name\': "Instructrice d\'élite", \'text\': "Quand l\'Instructrice d\'élite arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'Les esprits les plus brillants de Mélétis étudient sous la tutelle des maîtres de Dékatia, une école de magie et de philosophie renommée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477062&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7356160b-ad01-4be9-b816-dd4ac60d49a3\', \'multiverseId\': 477062}, \'multiverseid\': 477062}, {\'name\': "Istruttrice d\'Elite", \'text\': "Quando l\'Istruttrice d\'Elite entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Le menti più ingegnose di Meletis studiano presso i maestri della Decazia, una rinomata accademia di magia e filosofia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b88722f-f28f-4618-b8a7-31a108754a5b\', \'multiverseId\': 477316}, \'multiverseid\': 477316}, {\'name\': \'精鋭の教官\', \'text\': \'精鋭の教官が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'メレティスで最も優秀な者たちは高名な魔法と哲学の学院デカティアで学ぶ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'912c8bd6-6d88-4d1d-ba77-b11b9a976c3f\', \'multiverseId\': 477570}, \'multiverseid\': 477570}, {\'name\': \'정예 지도관\', \'text\': \'정예 지도관이 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑은 후, 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'멜레티스에서 가장 총명한 자들은 마법과 철학으로 저명한 학교인 데카티아의 스승들 밑에서 공부한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f23003f6-19e0-4fab-9092-6c346f1efaa6\', \'multiverseId\': 477824}, \'multiverseid\': 477824}, {\'name\': \'Instrutora de Elite\', \'text\': \'Quando Instrutora de Elite entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'As maiores mentes de Meletis estudam com os mestres da Decátia, uma renomada escola de magia e filosofia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00e74c41-4621-4e09-ba0a-180fcd8b6ec1\', \'multiverseId\': 478078}, \'multiverseid\': 478078}, {\'name\': \'Элитная Наставница\', \'text\': \'Когда Элитная Наставница выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту, затем сбросьте карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'Величайшие умы Мелетиды учатся у наставников в Декатии, знаменитой школе волшебства и философии.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b23e2684-d720-441b-9b05-c505f8bd753c\', \'multiverseId\': 478332}, \'multiverseid\': 478332}, {\'name\': \'精英讲师\', \'text\': \'当精英讲师进战场时，抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'得卡提亚学院是教导魔法与哲理的知名学府，迈勒提斯最顶尖的智者都云集于此拜师深造。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe66539c-cc8c-4986-aeaa-82c3a97701fa\', \'multiverseId\': 478586}, \'multiverseid\': 478586}, {\'name\': \'精英講師\', \'text\': \'當精英講師進戰場時，抽一張牌，然後棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'得卡提亞學院是教導魔法與哲理的知名學府，邁勒提斯最頂尖的智者都雲集於此拜師深造。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83a2f746-55be-4463-8ecc-1cc0fecc8a14\', \'multiverseId\': 478840}, \'multiverseid\': 478840}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elspeth bezwingt den Tod\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder mehr, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil.\\nII — Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug kosten Nichtkreatur-Zaubersprüche, die deine Gegner wirken, beim Wirken {2} mehr.\\nIII — Bringe eine Kreaturen- oder Planeswalkerkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Lege eine +1/+1-Marke bzw. eine Loyalitätsmarke darauf.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476518&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abc6926b-3a10-46b2-824b-8242e0eeff3b\', \'multiverseId\': 476518}, \'multiverseid\': 476518}, {\'name\': \'Elspeth vence a la muerte\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Exilia el permanente objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 3 o más que controla un oponente.\\nII — A tus oponentes les cuesta {2} más lanzar hechizos que no sean de criatura hasta tu próximo turno.\\nIII — Regresa la carta de criatura o planeswalker objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Pon un contador +1/+1 o un contador de lealtad sobre esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a942058-79c4-4762-aa2d-8b2e0f716d50\', \'multiverseId\': 476772}, \'multiverseid\': 476772}, {\'name\': \'Elspeth conquiert la Mort\', \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Exilez un permanent ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle avec un coût converti de mana supérieur ou égal à 3.\\nII — Les sorts non-créature que vos adversaires lancent coûtent {2} de plus à lancer jusqu\'à votre prochain tour.\\nIII — Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ou de planeswalker ciblée depuis votre cimetière. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 ou un marqueur « loyauté » sur elle.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477026&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81add879-7c3f-4236-b481-b2e7afe0781c\', \'multiverseId\': 477026}, \'multiverseid\': 477026}, {\'name\': \'Elspeth Vince la Morte\', \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Esilia un permanente bersaglio controllato da un avversario con costo di mana convertito pari o superiore a 3.\\nII — Le magie non creatura che lanciano i tuoi avversari costano {2} in più per essere lanciate fino al tuo prossimo turno.\\nIII — Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura o planeswalker bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 o un segnalino fedeltà su di essa.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51c639bf-563d-4772-bd8d-2df2c9530863\', \'multiverseId\': 477280}, \'multiverseid\': 477280}, {\'name\': \'エルズペス、死に打ち勝つ\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンターを１個加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI ― 対戦相手がコントロールしていて点数で見たマナ・コストが３以上のパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。\\nII ― あなたの次のターンまで、対戦相手がクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}多くなる。\\nIII ― あなたの墓地からクリーチャーかプレインズウォーカーであるカード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターか忠誠カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cad0972-81d6-40c0-abe8-381e8ab2f7c1\', \'multiverseId\': 477534}, \'multiverseid\': 477534}, {\'name\': \'엘스페스가 죽음을 정복하다\', \'text\': \'(이 서사시가 들어오면서 그리고 당신의 뽑기단 후에, 전승 카운터 한 개를 추가한다. III 이후에 희생한다.)\\nI — 상대가 조종하는 전환마나비용이 3 이상인 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 추방한다.\\nII — 당신의 다음 턴까지, 당신의 상대들이 조종하는 생물이 아닌 주문들은 발동하는데 {2}가 더 든다.\\nIII — 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 또는 플레인즈워커 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 전장으로 되돌린다. 그 카드에 +1/+1 카운터 또는 충성 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 서사시\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50990c37-8056-44b9-a30d-55365d09c818\', \'multiverseId\': 477788}, \'multiverseid\': 477788}, {\'name\': \'Elspeth Derrota a Morte\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Exile a permanente alvo que um oponente controla com custo de mana convertido igual ou superior a 3.\\nII — As mágicas que seus oponentes conjuram que não sejam de criatura custam {2} a mais para serem conjuradas até seu próximo turno.\\nIII — Devolva o card de criatura ou planeswalker alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Coloque um marcador +1/+1 ou um marcador de lealdade nele.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffcfecd3-9700-4abf-b162-8a6c0ff112b3\', \'multiverseId\': 478042}, \'multiverseid\': 478042}, {\'name\': \'Элспет Превозмогает Смерть\', \'text\': "(При выходе этой Саги и после вашего шага взятия карты добавьте один жетон знаний. Пожертвуйте после III.)\\nI — Изгоните целевой перманент под контролем оппонента с конвертированной мана-стоимостью 3 или больше.\\nII — До вашего следующего хода разыгрывание вашими оппонентами не являющихся существами заклинаний стоит на {2} больше.\\nIII — Верните целевую карту существа или planeswalker\'а из вашего кладбища на поле битвы. Положите на нее один жетон +1/+1 или жетон верности.", \'type\': \'Чары — Сага\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bd810d4-7a63-47e5-92ee-afb429bbdbe5\', \'multiverseId\': 478296}, \'multiverseid\': 478296}, {\'name\': \'艾紫培转生纪\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 放逐目标由对手操控且总法术力费用等于或大于3的永久物。\\nII — 直到你的下一个回合，对手施放的非生物咒语增加{2}来施放。\\nIII — 将目标生物或鹏洛客牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物或一个忠诚指示物。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4446be09-9ab2-4db5-afdb-20b2cffbffac\', \'multiverseId\': 478550}, \'multiverseid\': 478550}, {\'name\': \'艾紫培轉生紀\', \'text\': \'（於此傳紀進戰場時及於你抽牌步驟後，加一個學問指示物。到III後犧牲之。）\\nI — 放逐目標由對手操控且總魔法力費用等於或大於3的永久物。\\nII — 直到你的下一個回合，對手施放的非生物咒語增加{2}來施放。\\nIII — 將目標生物或鵬洛客牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物或一個忠誠指示物。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～傳紀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19c5b166-87cb-4427-984b-9bdf8c18a800\', \'multiverseId\': 478804}, \'multiverseid\': 478804}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elspeth, Nemesis der Sonne\', \'text\': \'−1: Bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n−2: Erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\n−3: Du erhältst 5 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nBefreiung — {4}{W}{W}, schicke vier andere Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Befreiungskosten wirken.)\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Elspeth\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476519&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4da8aaa-d9d1-49e2-9ccf-c51e7a4e8bea\', \'multiverseId\': 476519}, \'multiverseid\': 476519}, {\'name\': \'Elspeth, némesis del sol\', \'text\': \'−1: Hasta dos criaturas objetivo que controlas obtienen +2/+1 cada una hasta el final del turno.\\n−2: Crea dos fichas de criatura Soldado Humano blancas 1/1.\\n−3: Ganas 5 vidas.\\nEscapatoria—{4}{W}{W}, exiliar otras cuatro cartas de tu cementerio. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de escapatoria.)\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Elspeth\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'205cca0e-d09f-42b0-bb63-9013664686d0\', \'multiverseId\': 476773}, \'multiverseid\': 476773}, {\'name\': \'Elspeth, némésis du Soleil\', \'text\': "-1 : Jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées que vous contrôlez gagnent chacune +2/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n-2 : Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.\\n-3 : Vous gagnez 5 points de vie.\\nÉchappée — {4}{W}{W}, exilez quatre autres cartes de votre cimetière. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût d\'échappée.)", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Elspeth\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477027&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58630055-eff7-42c9-9c6c-17812998de11\', \'multiverseId\': 477027}, \'multiverseid\': 477027}, {\'name\': \'Elspeth, Nemesi del Sole\', \'text\': \'-1: Fino a due creature bersaglio che controlli prendono +2/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\\n-2: Crea due pedine creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianche.\\n-3: Guadagni 5 punti vita.\\nFuga—{4}{W}{W}, Esilia altre quattro carte dal tuo cimitero. (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di fuga.)\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Elspeth\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07c72203-9f31-469e-a5a5-cc8391c93a98\', \'multiverseId\': 477281}, \'multiverseid\': 477281}, {\'name\': \'太陽の宿敵、エルズペス\', \'text\': \'-1：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それらはそれぞれ＋２/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n-2：白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。\\n-3：あなたは５点のライフを得る。\\n脱出―{4}{W}{W}, あなたの墓地から他のカード４枚を追放する。（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれの脱出コストで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — エルズペス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d864c86f-bfa9-48a6-9264-7cebd2f6cc0a\', \'multiverseId\': 477535}, \'multiverseid\': 477535}, {\'name\': \'태양의 숙적, 엘스페스\', \'text\': \'−1: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들은 턴종료까지 각각 +2/+1을 받는다.\\n−2: 1/1 백색 인간 병사 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.\\n−3: 당신은 생명 5점을 얻는다.\\n탈출—{4}{W}{W}, 당신의 무덤에서 다른 카드 네 장을 추방한다. (당신은 이 카드의 탈출 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 엘스페스\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'941be0bf-74d9-4a87-9803-fa0105b01fc6\', \'multiverseId\': 477789}, \'multiverseid\': 477789}, {\'name\': \'Elspeth, Nêmese do Sol\', \'text\': \'−1: Até duas criaturas alvo que você controla recebem +2/+1 cada uma até o final do turno.\\n−2: Crie duas fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Humano Soldado.\\n−3: Você ganha 5 pontos de vida.\\nEscapatória — {4}{W}{W}, exile quatro outros cards de seu cemitério. (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de escapatória.)\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Elspeth\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'968e3a06-4431-4843-92e2-795291d5e90c\', \'multiverseId\': 478043}, \'multiverseid\': 478043}, {\'name\': \'Элспет, Противница Солнца\', \'text\': \'−1: не более двух целевых существ под вашим контролем получают по +2/+1 до конца хода.\\n−2: создайте две фишки существа 1/1 белый Человек Солдат.\\n−3: вы получаете 5 жизней.\\nПобег — {4}{W}{W}, изгоните четыре другие карты из вашего кладбища. (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Побега.)\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Элспет\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edc09c70-4fca-4c0b-bb7c-5df01c16a66d\', \'multiverseId\': 478297}, \'multiverseid\': 478297}, {\'name\': \'破日死敌艾紫培\', \'text\': \'−1：至多两个目标由你操控的生物各得+2/+1直到回合结束。\\n−2：派出两个1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物。\\n−3：你获得5点生命。\\n逸脱～{4}{W}{W}，从你的坟墓场放逐四张其他牌。（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其逸脱费用。）\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～艾紫培\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6437f618-e14f-48b1-ad67-b84cd5ea4387\', \'multiverseId\': 478551}, \'multiverseid\': 478551}, {\'name\': \'破日死敵艾紫培\', \'text\': \'−1：至多兩個目標由你操控的生物各得+2/+1直到回合結束。\\n−2：派出兩個1/1白色人類／士兵衍生生物。\\n−3：你獲得5點生命。\\n逸脫～{4}{W}{W}，從你的墳墓場放逐四張其他牌。（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其逸脫費用。）\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～艾紫培\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dc4341c-34ef-4de7-b11d-30f26a564767\', \'multiverseId\': 478805}, \'multiverseid\': 478805}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elspeth, todesmutige Heldin\', \'text\': \'+2: Lege je eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl.\\n−2: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek und/oder deinen Friedhof nach einer Karte namens Sonnenlicht-Hoplit und bringe sie ins Spiel. Falls du auf diese Weise deine Bibliothek durchsuchst, mische sie danach.\\n−8: Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Flugfähigkeit und +X/+X, wobei X gleich deiner Hingabe zu weiß ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Elspeth\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479185&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13325e40-ac79-4505-b4b1-3eb6e6958d0a\', \'multiverseId\': 479185}, \'multiverseid\': 479185}, {\'name\': \'Elspeth, heroína impertérrita\', \'text\': \'+2: Elige hasta dos criaturas objetivo y pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una.\\n−2: Busca en tu biblioteca y/o cementerio una carta llamada Hoplita iluminado y ponla en el campo de batalla. Si buscas en tu biblioteca de esta manera, barájala.\\n−8: Hasta el final del turno, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de volar y obtienen +X/+X, donde X es tu devoción al blanco.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Elspeth\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d97161a-6899-41c4-adda-87530ace554e\', \'multiverseId\': 479203}, \'multiverseid\': 479203}, {\'name\': \'Elspeth, héroïne intrépide\', \'text\': "+2 : Ciblez jusqu\'à deux créatures. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.\\n-2 : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque et/ou votre cimetière une carte appelée Hoplite baigné de soleil et mettez-la sur le champ de bataille. Si vous cherchez dans votre bibliothèque de cette manière, mélangez-la.\\n-8 : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le vol et gagnent +X/+X, X étant votre dévotion au blanc.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Elspeth\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479221&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a376080-a431-4d50-8a76-d470f40f1add\', \'multiverseId\': 479221}, \'multiverseid\': 479221}, {\'name\': \'Elspeth, Eroina Intrepida\', \'text\': \'+2: Scegli fino a due creature bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ciascuna di esse.\\n-2: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio e/o il tuo cimitero per una carta chiamata Oplita Illuminato dal Sole e mettila sul campo di battaglia. Se passi in rassegna il tuo grimorio in questo modo, rimescolalo.\\n-8: Fino alla fine del turno, le creature che controlli hanno volare e prendono +X/+X, dove X è la tua devozione al bianco.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Elspeth\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb5b140b-040b-4449-9682-4b79e1ef712b\', \'multiverseId\': 479239}, \'multiverseid\': 479239}, {\'name\': \'不屈の英雄、エルズペス\', \'text\': \'+2：クリーチャー最大２体を対象とし、それらの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\\n-2：あなたのライブラリーや墓地から、「栄光の重装歩兵」という名前のカード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。これによりあなたがあなたのライブラリーからカードを探したなら、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\\n-8：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは飛行を得て＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたの白への信心に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — エルズペス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd24c045-7344-45da-a96b-fe3acb3aedac\', \'multiverseId\': 479257}, \'multiverseid\': 479257}, {\'name\': \'의연한 영웅, 엘스페스\', \'text\': \'+2: 생물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들에 각각 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n−2: 당신의 서고 및/또는 무덤에서 태양빛 중장보병이라는 이름을 가진 카드 한 장을 찾아 전장에 놓는다. 당신이 이런 식으로 당신의 서고를 찾아보았다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\\n−8: 턴종료까지, 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 비행을 얻고 +X/+X를 받는다. X는 당신의 백색 신앙심이다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 엘스페스\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a1fc24a-35fc-4a60-8e25-0a685e7297da\', \'multiverseId\': 479275}, \'multiverseid\': 479275}, {\'name\': \'Elspeth, Heroína Inabalável\', \'text\': \'+2: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada uma de até duas criaturas alvo.\\n−2: Procure um card com o nome Hoplita Iluminado pelo Sol em seu cemitério e/ou grimório e coloque-o no campo de batalha. Se procurar em seu grimório desta maneira, embaralhe-o.\\n−8: Até o final do turno, as criaturas que você controla ganham voar e recebem +X/+X, sendo X sua devoção ao branco.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Elspeth\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d21d79a-ba4a-4b73-af64-3080a000e63a\', \'multiverseId\': 479293}, \'multiverseid\': 479293}, {\'name\': \'Элспет, Бесстрашная Героиня\', \'text\': \'+2: положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое из не более двух целевых существ.\\n−2: найдите в вашей библиотеке и (или) на вашем кладбище карту с именем Солнечный Гоплит и положите ее на поле битвы. Если вы ищете таким образом в вашей библиотеке, перетасуйте ее.\\n−8: до конца хода существа под вашим контролем получают Полет и +X/+X, где X — ваша Преданность белому.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Элспет\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5c401bd-5a11-425e-bb34-8d06e4d7e453\', \'multiverseId\': 479311}, \'multiverseid\': 479311}, {\'name\': \'无畏英雄艾紫培\', \'text\': \'+2：在至多两个目标生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n−2：从你的牌库和／或坟墓场中搜寻一张名称为阳辉重装步兵的牌，并将之放进战场。如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则将它洗牌。\\n−8：直到回合结束，由你操控的生物获得飞行异能且得+X/+X，X为你的白色献力。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～艾紫培\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e97ddfdd-5ded-4cb4-926a-17f804b369de\', \'multiverseId\': 479329}, \'multiverseid\': 479329}, {\'name\': \'無畏英雄艾紫培\', \'text\': \'+2：在至多兩個目標生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n−2：從你的牌庫和／或墳墓場中搜尋一張名稱為陽輝重裝步兵的牌，並將之放進戰場。如果你以此法搜尋你的牌庫，則將它洗牌。\\n−8：直到回合結束，由你操控的生物獲得飛行異能且得+X/+X，X為你的白色獻力。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～艾紫培\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f65f7bc-7052-4899-9269-f34eda3c0fdb\', \'multiverseId\': 479347}, \'multiverseid\': 479347}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elspeths Albtraum\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 2 oder weniger, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\\nII — Ein Gegner deiner Wahl zeigt die Karten auf seiner Hand offen vor. Du bestimmst davon eine Karte, die weder eine Kreatur noch ein Land ist. Der Spieler wirft die bestimmte Karte ab.\\nIII — Schicke den Friedhof eines Gegners deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476596&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2758bee9-6d8c-41aa-b8bc-744cc8975e14\', \'multiverseId\': 476596}, \'multiverseid\': 476596}, {\'name\': \'Pesadilla de Elspeth\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Destruye la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 2 o menos que controla un oponente.\\nII — El oponente objetivo muestra su mano. Tú eliges de ahí una carta que no sea tierra ni criatura. Ese jugador descarta esa carta.\\nIII — Exilia el cementerio del oponente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ef8f814-dc94-432e-83de-1642e089d324\', \'multiverseId\': 476850}, \'multiverseid\': 476850}, {\'name\': "Cauchemar d\'Elspeth", \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Détruisez une créature ciblée de force inférieure ou égale à 2 qu\'un adversaire contrôle.\\nII — L\'adversaire ciblé révèle sa main. Vous y choisissez une carte non-créature non-terrain. Ce joueur se défausse de cette carte.\\nIII — Exilez le cimetière de l\'adversaire ciblé.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477104&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f2adc10-61f7-4f25-8373-c453a70e5d55\', \'multiverseId\': 477104}, \'multiverseid\': 477104}, {\'name\': \'Incubo di Elspeth\', \'text\': \'(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Distruggi una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario con forza pari o inferiore a 2.\\nII — Un avversario bersaglio rivela la sua mano. Scegli una carta non terra, non creatura da quella mano. Quel giocatore scarta quella carta.\\nIII — Esilia il cimitero di un avversario bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d25866b-a8a6-4778-8f62-7b0008c51d45\', \'multiverseId\': 477358}, \'multiverseid\': 477358}, {\'name\': \'エルズペスの悪夢\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンターを１個加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI ― 対戦相手がコントロールしていてパワーが２以下のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\\nII ― 対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開する。あなたはその中からクリーチャーでも土地でもないカード１枚を選ぶ。そのプレイヤーはそのカードを捨てる。\\nIII ― 対戦相手１人を対象とし、そのプレイヤーの墓地を追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8201e98e-7d9c-4259-8d63-fee86d584bef\', \'multiverseId\': 477612}, \'multiverseid\': 477612}, {\'name\': \'엘스페스의 악몽\', \'text\': \'(이 서사시가 들어오면서 그리고 당신의 뽑기단 후에, 전승 카운터 한 개를 추가한다. III 이후에 희생한다.)\\nI — 상대가 조종하는 공격력이 2 이하인 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\\nII — 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 자신의 손을 공개한다. 당신은 그중 생물이 아니고 대지가 아닌 카드 한 장을 선택한다. 그 플레이어는 그 카드를 버린다.\\nIII — 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대의 무덤을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 서사시\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7abdadc0-7d67-47a8-be9a-23bb13b7857f\', \'multiverseId\': 477866}, \'multiverseid\': 477866}, {\'name\': \'O Pesadelo de Elspeth\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Destrua a criatura alvo que um oponente controla com poder igual ou inferior a 2.\\nII — O oponente alvo revela a própria mão. Você escolhe um card que não seja um terreno nem uma criatura da mão dele. Aquele jogador descarta aquele card.\\nIII — Exile o cemitério do oponente alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84afc748-475c-4262-90e1-7694d1fca8ef\', \'multiverseId\': 478120}, \'multiverseid\': 478120}, {\'name\': \'Кошмар Элспет\', \'text\': \'(При выходе этой Саги и после вашего шага взятия карты добавьте один жетон знаний. Пожертвуйте после III.)\\nI — Уничтожьте целевое существо под контролем оппонента с силой не более 2.\\nII — Целевой оппонент показывает свою руку. Вы выбираете из нее карту, не являющуюся ни существом, ни землей. Тот игрок сбрасывает ту карту.\\nIII — Изгоните кладбище целевого оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Сага\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6efd56e-c6f5-4146-98eb-427305de24b5\', \'multiverseId\': 478374}, \'multiverseid\': 478374}, {\'name\': \'艾紫培的梦魇\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 消灭目标由对手操控且力量等于或小于2的生物。\\nII — 目标对手展示其手牌。你选择其中一张非生物且非地的牌。该牌手弃掉该牌。\\nIII — 放逐目标对手的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b720990-3256-4878-8e3a-b53fa1d75da5\', \'multiverseId\': 478628}, \'multiverseid\': 478628}, {\'name\': \'艾紫培的夢魘\', \'text\': \'（於此傳紀進戰場時及於你抽牌步驟後，加一個學問指示物。到III後犧牲之。）\\nI — 消滅目標由對手操控且力量等於或小於2的生物。\\nII — 目標對手展示其手牌。你選擇其中一張非生物且非地的牌。該玩家棄掉該牌。\\nIII — 放逐目標對手的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～傳紀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f0e9592-960b-4b0e-bbb5-f931d82cb110\', \'multiverseId\': 478882}, \'multiverseid\': 478882}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elspeths Anhängerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn Elspeths Anhängerin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek und/oder deinen Friedhof nach einer Karte namens Elspeth, todesmutige Heldin, durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du auf diese Weise deine Bibliothek durchsuchst, mische sie danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Für sie würde ich mit Freude erneut in den Tod gehen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479187&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed80b512-5f51-455a-a5f1-bf3f8f58c4f9\', \'multiverseId\': 479187}, \'multiverseid\': 479187}, {\'name\': \'Devota de Elspeth\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Devota de Elspeth entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca y/o cementerio una carta llamada Elspeth, heroína impertérrita, mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano. Si buscas en tu biblioteca de esta manera, barájala.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Moriría otra vez con mucho gusto si es por ella".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cd7a317-0efb-43e4-9c87-4fcc5f6c435f\', \'multiverseId\': 479205}, \'multiverseid\': 479205}, {\'name\': "Dévôte d\'Elspeth", \'text\': "Quand la Dévôte d\'Elspeth arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque et/ou votre cimetière une carte appelée Elspeth, héroïne intrépide, la révéler et la mettre dans votre main. Si vous cherchez dans votre bibliothèque de cette manière, mélangez-la.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Pour elle, je serais prête à mourir à nouveau. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479223&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d782a1f3-97fa-4040-a2ee-bccc0570695f\', \'multiverseId\': 479223}, \'multiverseid\': 479223}, {\'name\': \'Devota di Elspeth\', \'text\': \'Quando la Devota di Elspeth entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio e/o il tuo cimitero per una carta chiamata Elspeth, Eroina Intrepida, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Se passi in rassegna il tuo grimorio in questo modo, rimescolalo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Per lei, sarei felice di morire di nuovo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f7d406e-7229-41e8-bef2-78481b68eeac\', \'multiverseId\': 479241}, \'multiverseid\': 479241}, {\'name\': \'エルズペスの信奉者\', \'text\': \'エルズペスの信奉者が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーや墓地から「不屈の英雄、エルズペス」という名前のカード１枚を探し、公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。これによりあなたがあなたのライブラリーからカードを探したなら、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「彼女のためなら私は喜んで死ぬわ。もう一度ね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'179e557e-6d23-4c65-b5a5-7d026ffc762f\', \'multiverseId\': 479259}, \'multiverseid\': 479259}, {\'name\': \'엘스페스의 추종자\', \'text\': \'엘스페스의 추종자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고 및/또는 무덤에서 의연한 영웅, 엘스페스인 카드 한 장을 찾아, 공개한 후, 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 당신이 이런 식으로 당신의 서고를 찾아보았다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"그녀를 위해서라면, 기꺼이 다시 죽으리라."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61364968-8136-47a9-b37b-928931924263\', \'multiverseId\': 479277}, \'multiverseid\': 479277}, {\'name\': \'Devota de Elspeth\', \'text\': \'Quando Devota de Elspeth entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar em seu grimório e/ou cemitério um card com o nome Elspeth, Heroína Inabalável, revelá-lo e colocá-lo em sua mão. Se procurar em seu grimório desta maneira, embaralhe-o.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Por ela, eu ficaria feliz em morrer de novo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76b846b7-a982-4c0f-a50f-405d74164161\', \'multiverseId\': 479295}, \'multiverseid\': 479295}, {\'name\': \'Последовательница Элспет\', \'text\': \'Когда Последовательница Элспет выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке и (или) на вашем кладбище карту с именем Элспет, Бесстрашная Героиня, показать ее и положить в вашу руку. Если вы ищете таким образом в вашей библиотеке, перетасуйте ее.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Ради нее я охотно пойду на новую смерть».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f398916c-362c-4cd1-b4e9-dd552e34fa46\', \'multiverseId\': 479313}, \'multiverseid\': 479313}, {\'name\': \'艾紫培的信徒\', \'text\': \'当艾紫培的信徒进战场时，你可以从你的牌库和／或坟墓场中搜寻一张名称为无畏英雄艾紫培的牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上。如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则将它洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「为了她，我愿再度赴死。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e37a1edc-c562-47ce-a254-4de829d4e620\', \'multiverseId\': 479331}, \'multiverseid\': 479331}, {\'name\': \'艾紫培的信徒\', \'text\': \'當艾紫培的信徒進戰場時，你可以從你的牌庫和／或墳墓場中搜尋一張名稱為無畏英雄艾紫培的牌，展示該牌，並將它置於你手上。如果你以此法搜尋你的牌庫，則將它洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「為了她，我願再度赴死。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88c479a8-a5be-4b01-bb6e-6f1a0158fc28\', \'multiverseId\': 479349}, \'multiverseid\': 479349}]', '[{\'name\': \'Endgültiger Tod\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Unterwelt erodiert Gedächtnis, Identität und schließlich auch die körperliche Gestalt und hinterlässt nur bröckelnde Statuen namens Misera, hohle Denkmäler der sterblichen Nutzlosigkeit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476600&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42410603-2416-452a-a2d0-a52dfd3a7c57\', \'multiverseId\': 476600}, \'multiverseid\': 476600}, {\'name\': \'Muerte final\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El Inframundo merma los recuerdos, la identidad y, al final, la forma física. Solo deja unas estatuas desmoronadas: las míseras, unos monumentos vacíos a la futilidad de los mortales.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5449b8a8-d631-4d01-a2fe-a45013203f94\', \'multiverseId\': 476854}, \'multiverseid\': 476854}, {\'name\': \'Ultime mort\', \'text\': \'Exilez la créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Le Monde souterrain érode la mémoire, l\'identité, et finalement la forme physique, ne laissant que des statues croulantes qu\'on appelle des miséries, témoignages creux de la futilité de la mort.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477108&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed5b6174-54d7-472b-870a-c086e2094bdd\', \'multiverseId\': 477108}, \'multiverseid\': 477108}, {\'name\': \'Morte Definitiva\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "L\'Ade erode la memoria, l\'identità e infine la forma fisica, lasciando solo statue in rovina chiamate miserabilia, vacui monumenti alla futilità dei mortali.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f863b028-72f6-4396-b453-e4aa832f004d\', \'multiverseId\': 477362}, \'multiverseid\': 477362}, {\'name\': \'最後の死\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'死の国は記憶と自我を蝕み、ついには肉体をも蝕む。後に残るのはミゼラと呼ばれる崩れやすい像。それは定命の者の虚ろな記念碑。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d43302d7-e510-4947-9d83-9f4dfe7789ca\', \'multiverseId\': 477616}, \'multiverseid\': 477616}, {\'name\': \'최종적인 죽음\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'저승은 기억과 정체성, 그리고 끝내는 물리적인 형체를 침식해 나가, 미세라라고 불리는 부서져내리는 조각상—필멸의 허무함에 대한 공허한 기념비—만을 남긴다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf8925a0-642c-42cc-904d-c27a6a1b96f4\', \'multiverseId\': 477870}, \'multiverseid\': 477870}, {\'name\': \'Morte Final\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O Submundo erode a memória, a identidade e, com o tempo, a forma física, deixando apenas estátuas em ruínas chamadas míseras, vazios monumentos à futilidade mortal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67ec4648-f049-412f-9797-98162ed84b44\', \'multiverseId\': 478124}, \'multiverseid\': 478124}, {\'name\': \'Окончательная Смерть\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Подземное царство стирает память, личность, а со временем лишает и физического облика, оставляя от умерших лишь мизеры — пустотелые разваливающиеся статуи, напоминающие о бренности смертных.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae66376b-8423-4788-9434-32096477ea07\', \'multiverseId\': 478378}, \'multiverseid\': 478378}, {\'name\': \'终极死亡\', \'text\': \'放逐目标生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'冥界会逐渐侵蚀亡者的记忆、身分乃至实体，最终只留下一尊脆弱悲像，作为凡人徒劳求生的空洞纪念。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2c450f7-754c-43b7-8391-d6cabdc636e3\', \'multiverseId\': 478632}, \'multiverseid\': 478632}, {\'name\': \'終極死亡\', \'text\': \'放逐目標生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'冥界會逐漸侵蝕亡者的記憶、身分乃至實體，最終只留下一尊脆弱悲像，作為凡人徒勞求生的空洞紀念。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98c7d17e-2628-435d-9b17-b9f65cf481df\', \'multiverseId\': 478886}, \'multiverseid\': 478886}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erbosen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Renata schoss ein Dutzend Pfeile in die dicke Haut des Minotaurus, doch das Monster verlangsamte seinen Ansturm nicht. Der Zorn des Mogis lag auf ihm."\\n—Luphea von Setessa, *Chroniken*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476646&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba08687b-e0c3-449c-a6e0-e8237c96cc58\', \'multiverseId\': 476646}, \'multiverseid\': 476646}, {\'name\': \'Enfurecer\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Renata disparó una decena de flechas que se clavaron en el duro pellejo del minotauro, pero aquello no lo detuvo. Lo movía la furia misma de Mogis".\\n—Lufea de Setessa, *Historias*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f521f0e8-c47e-4f53-9c82-2ed7fb76313b\', \'multiverseId\': 476900}, \'multiverseid\': 476900}, {\'name\': \'Exacerbation\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +3/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Rénata décocha une dizaine de flèches dans l\'épaisse peau du minotaure, mais le monstre ne ralentit pas sa charge. La furie de Mogis l\'habitait. »\\n—Luphéa de Setessa, *Histoires*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477154&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf1e1e35-80d6-4571-9721-f32100567da9\', \'multiverseId\': 477154}, \'multiverseid\': 477154}, {\'name\': \'Adirare\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Renata scagliò una decina di frecce nella spessa pelle del minotauro, ma il mostro non rallentò la carica. Era sostenuto dalla furia di Mogis."\\n—Lufea di Setessa, *Storie*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3165a1fa-0835-4ec2-a17d-6b1347ccb5ae\', \'multiverseId\': 477408}, \'multiverseid\': 477408}, {\'name\': \'立腹\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「レナータはあるだけの矢をミノタウルスの厚い皮に射込んだが、その怪物の突進が緩むことはなかった。モーギス神の怒りが支えていたからである。」\\n――セテッサのルフェア、「*歴史*」より\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b07e971-c81a-4df5-85ea-fcd1c906a309\', \'multiverseId\': 477662}, \'multiverseid\': 477662}, {\'name\': \'격앙\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +3/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"레나타는 십여 개의 화살을 발사해 미노타우로스의 두꺼운 가죽을 꿰뚫었지만, 그 괴물은 전혀 속도를 늦추지 않았다. 모기스의 분노가 그에게 서려 있었다."\\n—세테사의 루피아, *역사서*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83d928cd-e61a-477b-9502-44c3ddf79684\', \'multiverseId\': 477916}, \'multiverseid\': 477916}, {\'name\': \'Embravecer\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +3/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Renata disparou uma dúzia de flechas contra o espesso couro do minotauro, mas o monstro não desacelerou na carga. Ele estava sob a fúria de Mogis."\\n— Lufeia de Setessa, *Histórias*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'176e1b1a-f092-44e4-8c58-1bf6027fe8b1\', \'multiverseId\': 478170}, \'multiverseid\': 478170}, {\'name\': \'Привести в Ярость\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +3/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Рената выпустила десяток стрел; те вонзились в толстую шкуру минотавра, но монстр даже не замедлил шага. Ярость Могия вела его вперед».\\n— Луфея из Сетессы, *«Истории»*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1e32719-d10b-4639-87f2-b2c0869a20ee\', \'multiverseId\': 478424}, \'multiverseid\': 478424}, {\'name\': \'触怒\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+3/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「瑞娜塔接连向牛头怪射出十余支箭。虽然每箭都准确命中牛头怪的躯体，但其冲锋速度丝毫未减。此刻它正有墨癸斯怒火加身。」\\n～瑟特萨的吕菲娅，《史典》**\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e984bb4-88de-4412-994e-c52a6ce29ed0\', \'multiverseId\': 478678}, \'multiverseid\': 478678}, {\'name\': \'觸怒\', \'text\': \'目標生物得+3/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「瑞娜塔接連向牛頭怪射出十餘支箭。雖然每箭都準確命中牛頭怪的軀體，但其衝鋒速度絲毫未減。此刻它正有墨癸斯怒火加身。」\\n～瑟特薩的呂菲婭，《史典》**\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0441f6fa-0b0a-43cd-8573-cbec8958440c\', \'multiverseId\': 478932}, \'multiverseid\': 478932}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erebos der Trostlose\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nSolange deine Hingabe zu Schwarz weniger als fünf beträgt, ist Erebos keine Kreatur.\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, kannst du 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{1}{B}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -2/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476598&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b09aa658-0743-4edf-a812-778b653421c1\', \'multiverseId\': 476598}, \'multiverseid\': 476598}, {\'name\': \'Erebos, Alma Lúgubre\', \'text\': \'Indestructible.\\nMientras tu devoción al negro sea menor que cinco, Erebos no es una criatura.\\nSiempre que otra criatura que controlas muera, puedes pagar 2 vidas. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\\n{1}{B}, sacrificar otra criatura: La criatura objetivo obtiene -2/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento legendaria — Deidad\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36c1e0a5-06a9-405e-b50a-68c05c68ea14\', \'multiverseId\': 476852}, \'multiverseid\': 476852}, {\'name\': \'Érébos, Cœur lugubre\', \'text\': "Indestructible\\nTant que votre dévotion au noir est inférieure à cinq, Érébos n\'est pas une créature.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez meurt, vous pouvez payer 2 points de vie. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.\\n{1}{B}, sacrifiez une autre créature : La créature ciblée gagne -2/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477106&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccbc2479-1a41-4d7f-b7a7-ddc9463ae90f\', \'multiverseId\': 477106}, \'multiverseid\': 477106}, {\'name\': \'Erebos dal Cuore Tetro\', \'text\': "Indistruttibile\\nFintanto che la tua devozione al nero è inferiore a cinque, Erebos non è una creatura.\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura che controlli muore, puoi pagare 2 punti vita. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\\n{1}{B}, Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: Una creatura bersaglio prende -2/-1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo Leggendaria — Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca8b1138-848b-4930-8ffb-03e9c8bcac43\', \'multiverseId\': 477360}, \'multiverseid\': 477360}, {\'name\': \'荒涼とした心のエレボス\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\nあなたの黒への信心が５未満であるかぎり、荒涼とした心のエレボスはクリーチャーではない。\\n他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、あなたは２点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚引く。\\n{1}{B}, 他のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3100f4f8-3f93-4c2d-8341-237c05e3f0d3\', \'multiverseId\': 477614}, \'multiverseid\': 477614}, {\'name\': \'음울한 마음을 가진 자, 에레보스\', \'text\': \'무적\\n당신의 흑색 신앙심이 5 미만인 한, 에레보스는 생물이 아니다.\\n당신이 조종하는 다른 생물이 죽을 때마다, 당신은 생명 2점을 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n{1}{B}, 다른 생물 한 개를 희생한다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -2/-1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 부여마법 생물 — 신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56e7bd49-386a-4311-aa97-7f8d9b215703\', \'multiverseId\': 477868}, \'multiverseid\': 477868}, {\'name\': \'Érebo, Coração Sombrio\', \'text\': \'Indestrutível\\nEnquanto sua devoção ao preto for menor que cinco, Érebo não será uma criatura.\\nToda vez que outra criatura que você controla morre, você pode pagar 2 pontos de vida. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\\n{1}{B}, sacrifique outra criatura: A criatura alvo recebe -2/-1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento Lendária — Deus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c13241e-88b6-4bb2-aab8-a5b28ffd53b9\', \'multiverseId\': 478122}, \'multiverseid\': 478122}, {\'name\': \'Эреб, Жестокосердный\', \'text\': \'Неразрушимость\\nПока ваша Преданность черному меньше пяти, Эреб не является существом.\\nКаждый раз, когда другое существо под вашим контролем умирает, вы можете заплатить 2 жизни. Если вы это делаете, возьмите карту.\\n{1}{B}, пожертвуйте другое существо: целевое существо получает -2/-1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары Существо — Бог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a656373-373d-44b7-8716-2df17b1f9d90\', \'multiverseId\': 478376}, \'multiverseid\': 478376}, {\'name\': \'冥黯厄睿柏斯\', \'text\': \'不灭\\n只要你的黑色献力小于五，厄睿柏斯便不是生物。\\n每当另一个由你操控的生物死去时，你可以支付2点生命。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\\n{1}{B}，牺牲另一个生物：目标生物得-2/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界生物 ～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c3d4c7b-09f5-44a2-9fdc-657325f88fa6\', \'multiverseId\': 478630}, \'multiverseid\': 478630}, {\'name\': \'冥黯厄睿柏斯\', \'text\': \'不滅\\n只要你的黑色獻力小於五，厄睿柏斯便不是生物。\\n每當另一個由你操控的生物死去時，你可以支付2點生命。若你如此作，則抽一張牌。\\n{1}{B}，犧牲另一個生物：目標生物得-2/-1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'傳奇結界生物 ～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43e80522-0493-44c2-ae6a-e0c429684194\', \'multiverseId\': 478884}, \'multiverseid\': 478884}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erinnerungsentzug\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Hellsicht 2.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Alythos saß da und starrte mit leerem Blick auf die spiegelglatten Ozeane von Nerono. Er versuchte vergeblich, sich an das zu erinnern, von dem er wusste, dass er es vergessen hatte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476559&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb5238fa-0ac3-4bbe-8296-7b7edf7bfe2b\', \'multiverseId\': 476559}, \'multiverseid\': 476559}, {\'name\': \'Vaciar la memoria\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo. Adivina 2.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Alythos se sentó e intentó, en vano, recordar aquello que sabía que había olvidado mientras su mirada vagaba por los océanos cristalinos de Nerono.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e47ce14c-1a68-43ff-862d-62835f7a8a5b\', \'multiverseId\': 476813}, \'multiverseid\': 476813}, {\'name\': \'Drain de mémoire\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé. Regard 2.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Alythos, assis, fixait les océans limpides de Nérono, essayant en vain de se souvenir de ce qu\'il savait avoir oublié.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477067&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'130ff8d3-f4f8-4228-8d26-b6e21fb76236\', \'multiverseId\': 477067}, \'multiverseid\': 477067}, {\'name\': \'Prosciugare la Memoria\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio. Profetizza 2.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Elytos si sedette e osservò con sguardo assente gli oceani cristallini di Nerono, tentando invano di ricordare ciò che sapeva di aver dimenticato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98653735-7bed-4b3d-8e50-f131d7659961\', \'multiverseId\': 477321}, \'multiverseid\': 477321}, {\'name\': \'記憶流出\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。占術２を行う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'アリートスは腰を下ろすと、ネロノの平坦な海を空虚に見つめながら、忘れてしまった知識を思い出そうと虚しい努力を続けた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75db282d-7121-4a58-945e-c6bf923cd04b\', \'multiverseId\': 477575}, \'multiverseid\': 477575}, {\'name\': \'기억 고갈\', \'text\': \'주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다. 점술 2를 한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'알리토스는 주저앉아 네로노의 유리 같은 바다 위를 멍하니 바라보면서 자신이 잊은 것을 기억해내려 애썼지만 모두 헛수고였다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b4a06f0-a3f1-41ad-936d-060222c874d4\', \'multiverseId\': 477829}, \'multiverseid\': 477829}, {\'name\': \'Drenagem da Memória\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo. Use vidência 2.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Alito sentou e olhou catatonicamente os vítreos oceanos de Nérono, tentando em vão lembrar-se daquilo que sabia haver esquecido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42c76958-4bdf-4fb6-a65b-826444e65e9b\', \'multiverseId\': 478083}, \'multiverseid\': 478083}, {\'name\': \'Осушение Памяти\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание. Предскажите 2.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Алитос сидел и пустыми глазами глядел на зеркальные океаны Нероно, тщетно пытаясь вспомнить то, что, — знал он, — было забыто.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab84e2fc-d80e-44f7-9593-c5227d5fef5a\', \'multiverseId\': 478337}, \'multiverseid\': 478337}, {\'name\': \'汲取记忆\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。占卜2。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'阿吕托斯呆坐着，无神目光投向奈洛诺的平静汪洋。他明知自己已遗忘一切，却仍徒劳地想要唤醒回忆。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cb72c4a-4d87-48d9-869b-0b4ee3a87a79\', \'multiverseId\': 478591}, \'multiverseid\': 478591}, {\'name\': \'汲取記憶\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。占卜2。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'阿呂托斯呆坐著，無神目光投向奈洛諾的平靜汪洋。他明知自己已遺忘一切，卻仍徒勞地想要喚醒回憶。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ab11818-59cd-482e-af40-0569437858e1\', \'multiverseId\': 478845}, \'multiverseid\': 478845}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eutropia, die zweifach Begünstigte\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn eine Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Die Kreatur erhält Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Nylea spricht zu ihr aus den im Wind raschelnden Blättern, Thassa aus den wogenden Gezeiten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476721&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ae64752-3762-424a-9450-656b2ec5919d\', \'multiverseId\': 476721}, \'multiverseid\': 476721}, {\'name\': \'Eutropia, la Doble Favorita\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que un encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo. Esa criatura gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Oye los susurros de Nylea en las hojas arrastradas por el viento, y la voz de Tassa en las olas que rompen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a1b5d2b-456f-443e-ae06-74434447aa1f\', \'multiverseId\': 476975}, \'multiverseid\': 476975}, {\'name\': \'Eutropie, deux fois protégée\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée. Cette créature acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'Nyléa lui parle dans le bruissement des feuilles, Thassa dans le rugissement des marées.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477229&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aa66a52-c816-4a6e-93f3-ddddb9c12375\', \'multiverseId\': 477229}, \'multiverseid\': 477229}, {\'name\': \'Eutropya, Favorita Due Volte\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta un incantesimo entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio. Quella creatura ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Nylea le parla nel fruscio delle foglie soffiate dal vento, Thassa nel fragore delle maree impetuose.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55d5892f-f077-4e4e-be37-f725e7c79681\', \'multiverseId\': 477483}, \'multiverseid\': 477483}, {\'name\': \'二柱に愛されしユートロピア\', \'text\': \'星座 ― エンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'ナイレアの声は風に揺れる葉から。テッサの声は押し寄せる高波から。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8329e6ec-707a-457a-ba66-e8cc1b773552\', \'multiverseId\': 477737}, \'multiverseid\': 477737}, {\'name\': \'두 번 은혜 받은 자 유트로피아\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 부여마법이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 비행을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'닐리아는 바람에 흩날리는 잎사귀로 그녀에게 말하며, 타사는 급류를 통해 그녀에게 이야기한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee941dcf-3e50-4312-b33e-ba9a77bd39e6\', \'multiverseId\': 477991}, \'multiverseid\': 477991}, {\'name\': \'Eutropia, Duplamente Protegida\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que um encantamento entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo. Aquela criatura ganha voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Ela ouve Nileia nas folhas ao vento, e Tassa, no fluxo das marés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfa699f7-2851-4be4-b7e4-d99eb0ea1dca\', \'multiverseId\': 478245}, \'multiverseid\': 478245}, {\'name\': \'Эвтропия, Дважды Избранная\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо. То существо получает Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'Нилея разговаривает с ней шорохом листьев на ветру, Тасса — шумом волн.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17557f79-1afa-425d-ade0-dafb4e057926\', \'multiverseId\': 478499}, \'multiverseid\': 478499}, {\'name\': \'双神眷恩尤托皮娅\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。该生物获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'倪勒娅借清风拂叶向她传话；塔萨则靠汹涌洪流对她发声。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1d4080a-a986-41b2-8554-e03c95396018\', \'multiverseId\': 478753}, \'multiverseid\': 478753}, {\'name\': \'雙神眷恩尤托皮婭\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，在目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。該生物獲得飛行異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'倪勒婭借清風拂葉向她傳話；塔薩則靠洶湧洪流對她發聲。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73092e19-7b21-4c3d-b876-f20fd9d69a85\', \'multiverseId\': 479007}, \'multiverseid\': 479007}]', '[{\'name\': \'Evangelist der Morgenröte\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur stirbt und falls eine Aura, die du kontrolliert hast, an sie angelegt war, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 2 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Gibt es eine größere Verheißung als den glorreichen Sonnenaufgang?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476513&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'815c6298-8cea-4744-999f-866fab46d755\', \'multiverseId\': 476513}, \'multiverseid\': 476513}, {\'name\': \'Evangelista del amanecer\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura muera, si un Aura que controlabas estaba anexada a ella, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 2 o menos de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'¿Acaso hay un vaticinio mejor que la gloria del amanecer?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f8712e8-6d9c-43d6-bebe-925bd7103f67\', \'multiverseId\': 476767}, \'multiverseid\': 476767}, {\'name\': "Prédicateur de l\'aube", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature meurt, si une aura que vous contrôliez lui était attachée, renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 2 depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "Y a-t-il promesse plus importante que celle de la gloire de l\'aube ?", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477021&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf42251f-842f-4996-9231-cf4d8b6b8f39\', \'multiverseId\': 477021}, \'multiverseid\': 477021}, {\'name\': "Evangelista dell\'Alba", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una creatura muore, se era assegnata ad essa un\'Aura che controllavi, riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 2 dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Esiste forse una promessa più grande che la gloria del sole nascente?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'326000c2-81d3-4855-9ff5-ae07048f2dd7\', \'multiverseId\': 477275}, \'multiverseid\': 477275}, {\'name\': \'暁の福音者\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、あなたがコントロールしていたオーラがそれにつけられていた場合、あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが２以下のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'日の出の栄光よりも良い兆しがあるだろうか？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b08538fe-e344-4761-908b-31b4b912bd5d\', \'multiverseId\': 477529}, \'multiverseid\': 477529}, {\'name\': \'새벽의 전도사\', \'text\': \'생물이 죽을 때마다, 당신이 조종한 마법진이 그 생물에 부착되어 있었다면, 당신의 무덤에 있는 전환마나비용이 2 이하인 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 인간 성직자\', \'flavor\': \'아침 해가 떠오르는 영광보다 더 위대한 약속이 있는가?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33e399ac-4b44-4e47-9cfa-72f9a34fa85c\', \'multiverseId\': 477783}, \'multiverseid\': 477783}, {\'name\': \'Evangelho da Aurora\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura morrer, se uma Aura que você controlava estava anexada a ela, devolva o card de criatura alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 2 de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'Há promessa melhor que a glória do nascer do sol?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19b5dae8-7b1b-4bda-a2cb-bbe2aebc43d1\', \'multiverseId\': 478037}, \'multiverseid\': 478037}, {\'name\': \'Проповедник Зари\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда умирает существо, если к нему была прикреплена Аура под вашим контролем, верните целевую карту существа с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 2 из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': \'Есть ли более сладостное обещание, чем рассвет во всем его великолепии?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c53ef52-c0a3-47f3-bf96-75dc36651d88\', \'multiverseId\': 478291}, \'multiverseid\': 478291}, {\'name\': \'黎明福音师\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物死去时，若其上结附有由你操控的灵气，则将目标总法术力费用等于或小于2的生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'结界生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'还有什么承诺，比许你日升之耀更伟大？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cd9867d-0533-4612-b0be-93db14db33ab\', \'multiverseId\': 478545}, \'multiverseid\': 478545}, {\'name\': \'黎明福音師\', \'text\': \'每當一個生物死去時，若其上結附有由你操控的靈氣，則將目標總魔法力費用等於或小於2的生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'結界生物 ～人類／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'還有什麼承諾，比許你日昇之耀更偉大？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b89ee76-7b66-4b21-8feb-a02d7eec18df\', \'multiverseId\': 478799}, \'multiverseid\': 478799}]', '[{\'name\': \'Existenz aberkennen\', \'text\': \'Schicke ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Für uns ist die Zeit gekommen, die Ketten tyrannischer Götter und antiquierten Aberglaubens abzuwerfen."\\n—Tikaia, Schülerin des Uremides\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476539&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e5e9a57-6a33-487d-9ec8-90142b8c7041\', \'multiverseId\': 476539}, \'multiverseid\': 476539}, {\'name\': \'Revocar la existencia\', \'text\': \'Exilia el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Es el momento de liberarnos de las cadenas de los dioses tiránicos y de las supersticiones obsoletas".\\n—Tikaia, discípula de Uremides\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ac0c068-f8a1-4ad2-9dbb-f8e69a30aa92\', \'multiverseId\': 476793}, \'multiverseid\': 476793}, {\'name\': "Révocation de l\'existence", \'text\': "Exilez l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Le temps est venu de nous libérer du joug des dieux tyranniques et des superstitions poussiéreuses. »\\n—Tikaia, disciple d\'Urémidès", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477047&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fed5d70-4a47-4658-9b6b-536b6448d4d9\', \'multiverseId\': 477047}, \'multiverseid\': 477047}, {\'name\': \'Revocare Esistenza\', \'text\': \'Esilia un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"È giunto il momento di liberarci dalle catene di divinità tiranne e antiquate superstizioni."\\n—Tikaia, discepola di Uremide\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3546fcd-a696-416e-a375-78f57aa5270b\', \'multiverseId\': 477301}, \'multiverseid\': 477301}, {\'name\': \'存在の破棄\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「横暴な神々の束縛や時代遅れの迷信を投げ捨てる日がついに来たのだ。」\\n――ユレミデスの弟子、ティカイア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34895a1c-c657-41f4-9242-7e5175d6c68f\', \'multiverseId\': 477555}, \'multiverseid\': 477555}, {\'name\': \'존재 폐기\', \'text\': \'마법물체나 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"폭압적인 신들과 오래된 미신들의 사슬을 벗어던질 때가 왔다."\\n—유레미디스의 사도, 티카이아\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e11692ef-0658-43a6-930f-7fdc85ff4ce1\', \'multiverseId\': 477809}, \'multiverseid\': 477809}, {\'name\': \'Revogar Existência\', \'text\': \'Exile o artefato ou encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Chegou a hora de nos livrarmos dos grilhões de deuses tirânicos e superstições antiquadas."\\n— Ticaia, discípula de Uremidas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d024aa64-557e-4887-8db6-65435719b0d0\', \'multiverseId\': 478063}, \'multiverseid\': 478063}, {\'name\': \'Отзыв Бытия\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевой артефакт или чары.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Пришло время отбросить цепи деспотичных богов и застарелых предрассудков».\\n— Тикайя, ученица Юремида\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a94ec925-6419-4dfa-bc6e-acf21f150d22\', \'multiverseId\': 478317}, \'multiverseid\': 478317}, {\'name\': \'撤销存在\', \'text\': \'放逐目标神器或结界。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这天已经到来：吾辈苦于专横神明与陈腐迷信的桎梏，如今该挺身破除这一切。」\\n～乌瑞弥得斯学徒提卡伊亚\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cec68ac0-27bd-4626-9058-702d7083f6b5\', \'multiverseId\': 478571}, \'multiverseid\': 478571}, {\'name\': \'撤銷存在\', \'text\': \'放逐目標神器或結界。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「這天已經到來：吾輩苦於專橫神明與陳腐迷信的桎梏，如今該挺身破除這一切。」\\n～烏瑞彌得斯學徒提卡伊亞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4640f4ef-4a16-4cc0-bb8d-5e5963014852\', \'multiverseId\': 478825}, \'multiverseid\': 478825}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feind der Erleuchtung\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDer Feind der Erleuchtung erhält -1/-1 für jede Karte auf der Hand deiner Gegner.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments wirft jeder Spieler eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Böse blüht auf, wo Unkenntnis gedeiht."\\n—Perisophia die Philosophin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476597&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef282988-f909-4419-ae23-a8b145c710e6\', \'multiverseId\': 476597}, \'multiverseid\': 476597}, {\'name\': \'Enemigo de la ilustración\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nEl Enemigo de la ilustración obtiene -1/-1 por cada carta que haya en las manos de tus oponentes.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, cada jugador descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'"El mal crece donde triunfa la ignorancia".\\n—Perisofia, la filósofa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10702a97-fb57-4a39-abce-7df4aa1925ca\', \'multiverseId\': 476851}, \'multiverseid\': 476851}, {\'name\': "Ennemi de l\'illumination", \'text\': "Vol\\nL\'Ennemi de l\'illumination gagne -1/-1 pour chaque carte dans les mains de vos adversaires.\\nAu début de votre entretien, chaque joueur se défausse d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : démon\', \'flavor\': "« Le mal prospère là où l\'ignorance règne. »\\n—Périsophia la philosophe", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477105&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8745cc69-632d-4ade-bf7e-f4033c59a18b\', \'multiverseId\': 477105}, \'multiverseid\': 477105}, {\'name\': "Nemico dell\'Illuminazione", \'text\': "Volare\\nIl Nemico dell\'Illuminazione prende -1/-1 per ogni carta nelle mani dei tuoi avversari.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, ogni giocatore scarta una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'"Il male fiorisce dove prospera l\\\'ignoranza."\\n—Perisofia la filosofa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'518942c1-2d99-4418-b8fe-7cf15878441a\', \'multiverseId\': 477359}, \'multiverseid\': 477359}, {\'name\': \'啓蒙の敵\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n啓蒙の敵は、すべての対戦相手の手札にあるカード１枚につき－１/－１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'「無知の茂る所には邪悪が花咲く。」\\n――哲人ペリソフィア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e929821-85a5-4358-81c7-44fa8b11d816\', \'multiverseId\': 477613}, \'multiverseid\': 477613}, {\'name\': \'계몽의 적\', \'text\': \'비행\\n계몽의 적은 당신의 상대의 손에 있는 각 카드마다 -1/-1을 받는다.\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 각 플레이어는 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': \'"악은 무지가 번성하는 곳에서 융성한다."\\n—철학자 페리소피아\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52e60e38-ef94-4170-a94f-71104de7e942\', \'multiverseId\': 477867}, \'multiverseid\': 477867}, {\'name\': \'Inimigo da Iluminação\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nInimigo da Iluminação recebe -1/-1 para cada card na mão de seus oponentes.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, cada jogador descarta um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'"O mal floresce onde a ignorância prospera."\\n— Perisofia, a filósofa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba717e41-7194-4e8b-8342-df2518cc681f\', \'multiverseId\': 478121}, \'multiverseid\': 478121}, {\'name\': \'Враг Просвещения\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nВраг Просвещения получает -1/-1 за каждую карту в руках ваших оппонентов.\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки каждый игрок сбрасывает одну карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': \'«Зло процветает там, где растет невежество».\\n— философ Перисофия\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4513eb7b-0eb8-46cd-8b61-3d914d27576b\', \'multiverseId\': 478375}, \'multiverseid\': 478375}, {\'name\': \'启蒙天敌\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n所有对手每有一张手牌，启蒙天敌便得-1/-1。\\n在你的维持开始时，每位牌手各弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'「无知遍行之处，邪恶随之昌盛。」\\n～哲人珀里索菲娅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80f5b945-6a3d-4ecf-92a7-fa81f89286ef\', \'multiverseId\': 478629}, \'multiverseid\': 478629}, {\'name\': \'啟蒙天敵\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n所有對手每有一張手牌，啟蒙天敵便得-1/-1。\\n在你的維持開始時，每位玩家各棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界生物 ～惡魔\', \'flavor\': \'「無知遍行之處，邪惡隨之昌盛。」\\n～哲人珀里索菲婭\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f559a694-7da7-407b-9d2b-0f4c581a8aea\', \'multiverseId\': 478883}, \'multiverseid\': 478883}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuer der Unterwelt\', \'text\': \'Die Feuer der Unterwelt fügen jeder Kreatur und jedem Planeswalker 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Falls eine bleibende Karte, der auf diese Weise Schaden zugefügt wurde, in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Unterwelt ist alles andere als eine Ruhestätte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476667&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b002b41-ea30-4c18-9078-dca18669a3fd\', \'multiverseId\': 476667}, \'multiverseid\': 476667}, {\'name\': \'Fuegos del Inframundo\', \'text\': \'Los Fuegos del Inframundo hacen 1 punto de daño a cada criatura y a cada planeswalker. Si un permanente que recibió daño de esta manera fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El Inframundo es cualquier cosa menos un lugar de descanso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a98b224-1103-4d27-9fb3-79f58dd94493\', \'multiverseId\': 476921}, \'multiverseid\': 476921}, {\'name\': \'Feux du Monde souterrain\', \'text\': \'Les Feux du Monde souterrain infligent 1 blessure à chaque créature et à chaque planeswalker. Si un permanent ayant subi des blessures de cette manière devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-le à la place.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Le Monde souterrain n\'est pas un lieu de dernier repos.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477175&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57591f4b-3abb-47b2-83e7-1fb0c2403fed\', \'multiverseId\': 477175}, \'multiverseid\': 477175}, {\'name\': "Fuochi dell\'Ade", \'text\': "I Fuochi dell\'Ade infliggono 1 danno a ogni creatura e a ogni planeswalker. Se un permanente a cui è stato inflitto danno in questo modo sta per morire in questo turno, invece esilialo.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "L\'Ade è tutto fuorché un luogo di riposo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14b0b055-1323-4f7a-b3f1-8261e8c11ee7\', \'multiverseId\': 477429}, \'multiverseid\': 477429}, {\'name\': \'死の国の火\', \'text\': \'死の国の火は各クリーチャーと各プレインズウォーカーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。このターン、これによりダメージを受けたパーマネントが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'死の国は安息の地などではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3b98969-6b23-48d5-9348-394b0c0c05e8\', \'multiverseId\': 477683}, \'multiverseid\': 477683}, {\'name\': \'저승의 불길\', \'text\': \'저승의 불길은 각 생물과 각 플레인즈워커에게 피해 1점을 입힌다. 이렇게 피해를 입은 지속물이 이 턴에 죽으려고 하면, 대신에 그 지속물을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'저승은 결코 휴식처는 아니다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1bc0878-61b0-4547-a503-cefaf48cfa6c\', \'multiverseId\': 477937}, \'multiverseid\': 477937}, {\'name\': \'Fogos do Submundo\', \'text\': \'Fogos do Submundo causa 1 ponto de dano a cada criatura e a cada planeswalker. Se uma permanente que sofreu dano dessa maneira for morrer neste turno, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O Submundo é tudo, menos um lugar de descanso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77eaedfd-94d2-4a89-8ee3-31c660720f6b\', \'multiverseId\': 478191}, \'multiverseid\': 478191}, {\'name\': \'Огни Подземного Царства\', \'text\': "Огни Подземного Царства наносят 1 повреждение каждому существу и каждому planeswalker\'у. Если перманент, которому таким образом были нанесены повреждения, должен умереть в этом ходу, изгоните его вместо этого.", \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Подземное царство — это что угодно, только не место вечного покоя.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a7dd5c5-7547-41fc-b0e7-462f451e27ad\', \'multiverseId\': 478445}, \'multiverseid\': 478445}, {\'name\': \'冥界业火\', \'text\': \'冥界业火对每个生物和每个鹏洛客各造成1点伤害。如果本回合中曾以此法受到伤害的永久物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'冥界唯独不是安息之所。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bb7a747-20b5-43a3-ae62-c2d236326e56\', \'multiverseId\': 478699}, \'multiverseid\': 478699}, {\'name\': \'冥界業火\', \'text\': \'冥界業火對每個生物和每個鵬洛客各造成1點傷害。如果本回合中曾以此法受到傷害的永久物將死去，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'冥界唯獨不是安息之所。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35127a21-e5b6-49e2-998f-89948b174aa2\', \'multiverseId\': 478953}, \'multiverseid\': 478953}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammenorakel\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: Das Flammenorakel erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nFalls eine Kreatur, der in diesem Zug vom Flammenorakel Schaden zugefügt wurde, sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Die Flammenseher von Akros leben leidenschaftlich, geben sich Purphoros und dem Kreislauf der zerstörerischen Schöpfung hin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476645&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'958bc226-ecbc-42b3-b898-ed0127474a2c\', \'multiverseId\': 476645}, \'multiverseid\': 476645}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo incendiario\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: El Oráculo incendiario obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\nSi una criatura que recibió daño del Oráculo incendiario este turno fuera a morir, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los portavoces ígneos de Akros viven una vida apasionada, consagrados a Purforos y al ciclo de creación destructiva.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'153c0509-eaba-4405-89b1-a7e2d909c409\', \'multiverseId\': 476899}, \'multiverseid\': 476899}, {\'name\': \'Oracle incendiaire\', \'text\': "{1}{R} : L\'Oracle incendiaire gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nSi une créature blessée par l\'Oracle incendiaire ce tour-ci devait mourir, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Les orateurs de feu d\'Akros vivent avec passion, dévoués à Purphoros et au cycle de création destructrice.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477153&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c89a42a7-3295-4812-a890-87f1914bd5c4\', \'multiverseId\': 477153}, \'multiverseid\': 477153}, {\'name\': \'Oracolo Incendiario\', \'text\': "{1}{R}: L\'Oracolo Incendiario prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nSe una creatura a cui l\'Oracolo Incendiario ha inflitto danno in questo turno sta per morire, invece esiliala.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Gli oratori delle fiamme di Akros vivono con passione, devoti a Purforos e al ciclo della creazione distruttiva.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0928f9ac-5988-4d63-86ce-fa78e503414b\', \'multiverseId\': 477407}, \'multiverseid\': 477407}, {\'name\': \'焼夷神託者\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}：ターン終了時まで、焼夷神託者は＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\nこのターン、焼夷神託者からダメージを受けたクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'アクロスの炎語りは情熱的な生を送り、パーフォロスの破壊と創造の循環を信奉している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c51d7962-8186-4d02-8f6a-8dae3264d714\', \'multiverseId\': 477661}, \'multiverseid\': 477661}, {\'name\': \'방화의 예언자\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: 방화의 예언자는 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다.\\n방화의 예언자에게 피해를 입은 생물이 이 턴에 죽게 된다면, 대신 그 생물을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'아크로스의 불꽃예언자들은 퍼포로스와 파괴적인 창조의 순환에 헌신하며 열정적으로 살아간다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f5a66ef-88a3-45af-aefa-61e6d5de0678\', \'multiverseId\': 477915}, \'multiverseid\': 477915}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo Incendiário\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: Oráculo Incendiário recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\\nSe uma criatura que sofreu dano causado por Oráculo Incendiário neste turno morreria, em vez disso exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'Os flamividentes de Ácros vivem passionalmente, devotos de Púrforo e do ciclo da criação destrutiva.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79982142-d58d-4633-906b-9a8f3cf280dc\', \'multiverseId\': 478169}, \'multiverseid\': 478169}, {\'name\': \'Оракул Воспламенения\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}: Оракул Воспламенения получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\\nЕсли существо, которому в этом ходу нанес повреждения Оракул Воспламенения, должно умереть, изгоните его вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'Огнеречивцы Акроса исполнены страсти и посвящают свою жизнь Пирфору и циклу разрушительного творения.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbbc02d8-41ce-465a-a047-ad907dbefefb\', \'multiverseId\': 478423}, \'multiverseid\': 478423}, {\'name\': \'焰相先知\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}：焰相先知得+1/+0直到回合结束。\\n如果本回合中曾受到焰相先知伤害的生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'阿喀洛斯的焰语者生性热情，将身心都献给了普罗烽斯与创灭循环。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73709b5e-2ca2-4a93-a7f7-d94087ccc76e\', \'multiverseId\': 478677}, \'multiverseid\': 478677}, {\'name\': \'焰相先知\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}：焰相先知得+1/+0直到回合結束。\\n如果本回合中曾受到焰相先知傷害的生物將死去，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'阿喀洛斯的焰語者生性熱情，將身心都獻給了普羅烽斯與創滅循環。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9382dad4-8253-4f4c-90ae-41beadd17f24\', \'multiverseId\': 478931}, \'multiverseid\': 478931}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frommer Wandersmann\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn eine Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder Schritt ist ein Gebet, jede Straße ein Tempel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476537&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f2ffc1c-07b0-4239-893e-04374c18250d\', \'multiverseId\': 476537}, \'multiverseid\': 476537}, {\'name\': \'Viajero piadoso\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que un encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': \'Cada paso es una plegaria, y cada camino, un templo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20c8a106-3b83-44c2-a15b-c1de5612bc23\', \'multiverseId\': 476791}, \'multiverseid\': 476791}, {\'name\': \'Voyageur pieux\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, la créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': \'Chaque pas est une prière, et chaque route un temple.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477045&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb055925-306f-4bf3-95f8-3bc791dc3aff\', \'multiverseId\': 477045}, \'multiverseid\': 477045}, {\'name\': \'Viandante Devoto\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta un incantesimo entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni passo è una preghiera, ogni strada un tempio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0057649b-7bf6-44e9-bbbe-a0e9a000f8fe\', \'multiverseId\': 477299}, \'multiverseid\': 477299}, {\'name\': \'敬虔な旅人\', \'text\': \'星座 ― エンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'一歩一歩が祈りであり、すべての道が神殿である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f034575-30fa-4f16-be94-a96d970134ac\', \'multiverseId\': 477553}, \'multiverseid\': 477553}, {\'name\': \'경건한 여행자\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 부여마법이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 정찰병\', \'flavor\': \'모든 발걸음이 기도이며, 모든 길은 사원이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7a80f9b-518a-446c-a1bc-13c3b4ed0abd\', \'multiverseId\': 477807}, \'multiverseid\': 477807}, {\'name\': \'Viajante Pio\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que um encantamento entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, a criatura alvo recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'Cada passo é uma oração, cada estrada é um templo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8641ce05-2c9c-453d-98b6-16841c3bb1d9\', \'multiverseId\': 478061}, \'multiverseid\': 478061}, {\'name\': \'Набожный Путник\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, целевое существо получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Разведчик\', \'flavor\': \'Каждый его шаг — молитва, каждая дорога — храм.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'181b419f-2ea6-47a6-9b55-2c8bb9a79136\', \'multiverseId\': 478315}, \'multiverseid\': 478315}, {\'name\': \'虔敬旅人\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，目标生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'每步一诵拜，路路皆神庙。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'919a7e45-48b3-4c22-9acb-5bd476dcfc57\', \'multiverseId\': 478569}, \'multiverseid\': 478569}, {\'name\': \'虔敬旅人\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，目標生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'每步一誦拜，路路皆神廟。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d2c1480-58e7-4ff2-afb4-cd2416b1bd46\', \'multiverseId\': 478823}, \'multiverseid\': 478823}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frucht aus Tizerus\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl verliert 2 Lebenspunkte.\\nBefreiung — {3}{B}, schicke drei andere Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Befreiungskosten wirken.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ein dorniger Baum mit bitteren Früchten wächst im Reich Tizerus, beim Palast des Erebos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476601&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4818eee8-c002-48c7-af5e-8ba56e0ae744\', \'multiverseId\': 476601}, \'multiverseid\': 476601}, {\'name\': \'Fruto de Tizerus\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo pierde 2 vidas.\\nEscapatoria—{3}{B}, exiliar otras tres cartas de tu cementerio. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de escapatoria.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'En el reino de Tizerus, fuera del palacio de Erebos, crece un árbol cubierto de espinas que da un fruto amargo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaf4c3cb-be67-4908-ade9-83c89f819c47\', \'multiverseId\': 476855}, \'multiverseid\': 476855}, {\'name\': \'Fruit du Tizère\', \'text\': "Le joueur ciblé perd 2 points de vie.\\nÉchappée — {3}{B}, exilez trois autres cartes de votre cimetière. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût d\'échappée.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Au royaume du Tizère, à l\'extérieur du palais d\'Érébos, pousse un arbre aux fruits amers hérissé d\'épines.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477109&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a31cf53a-356d-40ad-9aaf-1c25b501105f\', \'multiverseId\': 477109}, \'multiverseid\': 477109}, {\'name\': \'Frutto di Tizerus\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio perde 2 punti vita.\\nFuga—{3}{B}, Esilia altre tre carte dal tuo cimitero. (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di fuga.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Nel reame di Tizerus, fuori dal palazzo di Erebos, cresce un solo albero spinoso carico di frutti amari.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12ba215d-9ed7-4e98-bd48-d4992de58947\', \'multiverseId\': 477363}, \'multiverseid\': 477363}, {\'name\': \'ティゼルスの果実\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。\\n脱出―{3}{B}, あなたの墓地から他のカード３枚を追放する。（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれの脱出コストで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ティゼルスにあるエレボスの宮殿の近くには、棘のある木が生えていて苦い果実をつける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de1038d7-5f65-4e3e-8df3-0faff1ad749b\', \'multiverseId\': 477617}, \'multiverseid\': 477617}, {\'name\': \'티제루스의 열매\', \'text\': \'플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 생명 2점을 잃는다.\\n탈출—{3}{B}, 당신의 무덤에서 다른 카드 세 장을 추방한다. (당신은 이 카드의 탈출 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'에레보스의 궁전 밖 티제루스의 영역에는, 쓰디쓴 열매를 맺는 가시나무 한 그루가 자란다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26ec67e0-f16d-4ae6-b628-9c92170b8986\', \'multiverseId\': 477871}, \'multiverseid\': 477871}, {\'name\': \'Fruto de Tízero\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo perde 2 pontos de vida.\\nEscapatória — {3}{B}, exile três outros cards de seu cemitério. (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de escapatória.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Uma árvore espinhosa com um fruto amargo cresce no reino do Tízero, fora do palácio de Érebo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12cc6971-e7de-40d5-9a92-09b575f6c54a\', \'multiverseId\': 478125}, \'multiverseid\': 478125}, {\'name\': \'Плод Тизерия\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок теряет 2 жизни.\\nПобег — {3}{B}, изгоните три другие карты из вашего кладбища. (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Побега.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'В Тизерии, близ дворца Эреба, растет одинокое колючее дерево с горькими плодами.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f17f43f6-7293-4494-b1ac-ff21041239c5\', \'multiverseId\': 478379}, \'multiverseid\': 478379}, {\'name\': \'提泽拉司境果实\', \'text\': \'目标牌手失去2点生命。\\n逸脱～{3}{B}，从你的坟墓场放逐三张其他牌。（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其逸脱费用。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'在提泽拉斯境内、厄睿柏斯宫殿之外，长着一棵多刺果树，结出苦涩果实。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61899f97-46b6-43e8-a24e-aaf48465c4a6\', \'multiverseId\': 478633}, \'multiverseid\': 478633}, {\'name\': \'提澤拉司境果實\', \'text\': \'目標玩家失去2點生命。\\n逸脫～{3}{B}，從你的墳墓場放逐三張其他牌。（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其逸脫費用。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'在提澤拉斯境內、厄睿柏斯宮殿之外，長著一棵多刺果樹，結出苦澀果實。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'173c5152-3182-440e-82a5-a87439487d88\', \'multiverseId\': 478887}, \'multiverseid\': 478887}]', '[{\'name\': \'Furioser Aufstieg\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst, schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst die Karte spielen, bis du eine andere Karte mit dem Furiosen Aufstieg ins Exil schickst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Klothys zog aus, das Schicksal von Theros zu flicken, ihre Nadel von Zorn geführt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476641&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a329d22-f31a-41e5-8733-9eabc6bacbdc\', \'multiverseId\': 476641}, \'multiverseid\': 476641}, {\'name\': \'Alzamiento furioso\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta hasta que exilies otra carta con el Alzamiento furioso.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Klothys comenzó a tejer de nuevo el destino de Theros, y la furia dirigía todas y cada una de sus puntadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'188ab057-d7fe-41dd-a98d-4c13a0a78c9e\', \'multiverseId\': 476895}, \'multiverseid\': 476895}, {\'name\': \'Ascension furieuse\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous contrôlez une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une autre carte avec l\'Ascension furieuse.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Klothys entreprit de raccommoder la destinée de Theros, sa furie guidant chaque point de couture.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477149&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6521d5b-71b5-4345-92ac-491b2e816f24\', \'multiverseId\': 477149}, \'multiverseid\': 477149}, {\'name\': \'Ascesa Furiosa\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se controlli una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4, esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quella carta finché non esili un\'altra carta con l\'Ascesa Furiosa.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Klotys decise di ricucire il destino di Theros, lasciandosi guidare dalla furia in ogni punto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0accc608-5267-4cdb-ab5d-02d2e356d0e9\', \'multiverseId\': 477403}, \'multiverseid\': 477403}, {\'name\': \'猛然たる顕現\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがパワーが４以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。あなたが猛然たる顕現によって他のカードを追放するまで、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'クローティスはテーロスの運命を繕い始めた。その縫い目は怒りに導かれていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73d9eeb0-c50a-4bb2-9ee4-f7989fd3faed\', \'multiverseId\': 477657}, \'multiverseid\': 477657}, {\'name\': \'분노에 찬 봉기\', \'text\': \'당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신이 공격력이 4 이상인 생물을 조종한다면, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 추방한다. 당신은 당신이 분노에 찬 봉기로 다른 카드를 추방하기 전까지 그 카드를 플레이할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'클로티스는 테로스의 운명을 수복하기 시작했고, 그녀의 분노가 한 땀 한 땀을 이끌었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac797de9-5b3a-49ae-bc03-516df3348935\', \'multiverseId\': 477911}, \'multiverseid\': 477911}, {\'name\': \'Escalada Furiosa\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, se você controlar uma criatura com poder igual ou superior a 4, exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogar aquele card até exilar outro card com Escalada Furiosa.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Clotis partiu para consertar o destino de Theros, com sua fúria como guia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37f4899d-9914-4df5-a04a-0690024d5983\', \'multiverseId\': 478165}, \'multiverseid\': 478165}, {\'name\': \'Яростное Вознесение\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего заключительного шага, если вы контролируете существо с силой 4 или больше, изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть ту карту, пока не изгоните другую карту с помощью Яростного Вознесения.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Клотис штопала изорванную судьбу Тероса, и ее ярость направляла каждый стежок.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b55e26c5-46fe-42d2-87f0-dbcc86cb5996\', \'multiverseId\': 478419}, \'multiverseid\': 478419}, {\'name\': \'怒火昂扬\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，若你操控力量等于或大于4的生物，则放逐你的牌库顶牌。你可以使用该牌，直到你以怒火昂扬放逐另一张牌为止。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'克洛缇丝着手修补塞洛斯的命运，每针都由怒火引线。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'318ef91a-1240-4261-9bea-98860091b3b3\', \'multiverseId\': 478673}, \'multiverseid\': 478673}, {\'name\': \'怒火昂揚\', \'text\': \'在你的結束步驟開始時，若你操控力量等於或大於4的生物，則放逐你的牌庫頂牌。你可以使用該牌，直到你以怒火昂揚放逐另一張牌為止。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'克洛緹絲著手修補塞洛斯的命運，每針都由怒火引線。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0304fb83-c34e-4922-ab32-97c518290265\', \'multiverseId\': 478927}, \'multiverseid\': 478927}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fäuleatem-Katoblepas\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Fäuleatem-Katoblepas ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, bis zum Ende des Zuges -X/-X, wobei X gleich deiner Hingabe zu Schwarz ist. (Jedes {B} in den Manakosten von bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhöht deine Hingabe zu Schwarz um eins.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Auf Schritt und Tritt folgt ihm die Hungersnot.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476591&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8331890-ad4d-48d9-a8e5-896c7fee2cd8\', \'multiverseId\': 476591}, \'multiverseid\': 476591}, {\'name\': \'Catóblepon alientopútrido\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Catóblepon alientopútrido entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno, donde X es tu devoción al negro. (Cada {B} en los costes de maná de los permanentes que controlas cuenta para tu devoción al negro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Deja un rastro de hambruna a su paso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e06582b1-599a-4b31-91d4-647ecdbc93da\', \'multiverseId\': 476845}, \'multiverseid\': 476845}, {\'name\': \'Catoblépas au souffle gangrené\', \'text\': "Quand le Catoblépas au souffle gangrené arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle gagne -X/ X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant votre dévotion au noir. (Chaque {B} dans les coûts de mana des permanents que vous contrôlez compte pour votre dévotion au noir.)", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Où qu\'il aille, la famine le suit de près.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477099&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f4f8c3a-7206-44fa-855e-9a6fcf34520c\', \'multiverseId\': 477099}, \'multiverseid\': 477099}, {\'name\': \'Catoblepa dal Soffio Avvizzente\', \'text\': \'Quando il Catoblepa dal Soffio Avvizzente entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è pari alla tua devozione al nero. (La tua devozione al nero è la somma dei {B} nel costo di mana dei permanenti che controlli.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Ovunque vada, lo segue la carestia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'634679af-27f1-4cbc-9d93-96c5f67929e6\', \'multiverseId\': 477353}, \'multiverseid\': 477353}, {\'name\': \'枯れ息吹のカトブレパス\', \'text\': \'枯れ息吹のカトブレパスが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたの黒への信心に等しい。（あなたの黒への信心とは、あなたがコントロールしているパーマネントのマナ・コストに含まれる{B}の総数である。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'それが歩いた後には飢饉が続く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08e8b48d-4d34-4b12-9f36-829c2b4f176e\', \'multiverseId\': 477607}, \'multiverseid\': 477607}, {\'name\': \'역병호흡 카토블리파스\', \'text\': \'역병호흡 카토블리파스가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -X/-X를 받는다. X는 당신의 흑색 신앙심이다. (당신이 조종하는 지속물의 마나 비용에 있는 각 {B}마다 당신의 흑색 신앙심이 1씩 증가한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'그것이 걷는 곳이 어디든, 기아가 그 뒤를 따른다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'510a2a5b-bb15-4e0c-a83d-635e915dc531\', \'multiverseId\': 477861}, \'multiverseid\': 477861}, {\'name\': \'Catoblepas Hálito-de-praga\', \'text\': \'Quando Catoblepas Hálito-de-praga entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo que um oponente controla recebe -X/-X até o final do turno, sendo X sua devoção ao preto. (Cada {B} nos custos de mana de permanentes que você controla conta para sua devoção ao preto.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Por onde quer que ele vague, a fome o segue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04d61711-5b41-402d-800d-99017b876cf9\', \'multiverseId\': 478115}, \'multiverseid\': 478115}, {\'name\': \'Катоблепас Гибельного Дыхания\', \'text\': \'Когда Катоблепас Гибельного Дыхания выходит на поле битвы, целевое существо под контролем оппонента получает -X/-X до конца хода, где X — ваша Преданность черному. (Каждый символ {B} в мана-стоимости перманентов под вашим контролем идет в счет вашей Преданности черному.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Где бы он ни прошел, за ним следует голод.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8491a584-d600-4970-b841-4031888fbc77\', \'multiverseId\': 478369}, \'multiverseid\': 478369}, {\'name\': \'荒息牛身妖瞳\', \'text\': \'当荒息牛身妖瞳进战场时，目标由对手操控的生物得-X/-X直到回合结束，X为你的黑色献力。（由你操控之永久物的法术力费用当中每含有一个{B}，你的黑色献力就加一。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'所到之处，饥荒随行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30826543-5d54-47b2-b6cb-4812b5139c0b\', \'multiverseId\': 478623}, \'multiverseid\': 478623}, {\'name\': \'荒息牛身妖瞳\', \'text\': \'當荒息牛身妖瞳進戰場時，目標由對手操控的生物得-X/-X直到回合結束，X為你的黑色獻力。（由你操控之永久物的魔法力費用當中每含有一個{B}，你的黑色獻力就加一。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'所到之處，飢荒隨行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f911de0d-cf96-4417-9ed2-5c52c73d56fc\', \'multiverseId\': 478877}, \'multiverseid\': 478877}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gabe der Stärke\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+3 und Reichweite bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Der Nessische Wald ist niemals ohne Verteidiger.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476676&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2086ac5-d07f-4aca-8a46-2fba909395ee\', \'multiverseId\': 476676}, \'multiverseid\': 476676}, {\'name\': \'Don de la fuerza\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+3 y gana la habilidad de alcance hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El Bosque Nessiano siempre tiene defensores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9a04ee6-7f55-49a1-991a-cf888f019b45\', \'multiverseId\': 476930}, \'multiverseid\': 476930}, {\'name\': \'Don de force\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +3/+3 et acquiert la portée jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Le Bois nessian n\'est jamais dénué de protecteurs.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477184&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e955c2bc-e543-4e3c-866d-8e244575cdbd\', \'multiverseId\': 477184}, \'multiverseid\': 477184}, {\'name\': \'Dono della Forza\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+3 e ha raggiungere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Il Bosco Nessian non è mai incustodito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'923ff31c-dcf6-4a79-9a80-966f3c666823\', \'multiverseId\': 477438}, \'multiverseid\': 477438}, {\'name\': \'活力の贈り物\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋３の修整を受け到達を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ネシアンの森に守護者がいないことはない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d319a9ec-a111-48d2-ad4a-c69a7bcc4268\', \'multiverseId\': 477692}, \'multiverseid\': 477692}, {\'name\': \'힘의 선물\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +3/+3을 받고 대공을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'네시안 숲에는 수호자가 없었던 적이 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'292338ae-d2b5-4047-b815-0b304b0d55d6\', \'multiverseId\': 477946}, \'multiverseid\': 477946}, {\'name\': \'Dádiva da Força\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +3/+3 e ganha alcance até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'À Mata Nessiana jamais faltam defensores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66884248-e919-4b1c-b580-68bef559a2b3\', \'multiverseId\': 478200}, \'multiverseid\': 478200}, {\'name\': \'Дар Силы\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +3/+3 и Захват до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'У Нессийского леса всегда есть защитники.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61b7f6b2-0e79-4b25-852d-d6ad0acd25af\', \'multiverseId\': 478454}, \'multiverseid\': 478454}, {\'name\': \'力量赋礼\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+3/+3且获得延势异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'奈西安树林从缺少守卫者。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b8d0d99-c945-4d58-a53f-3aa7b4949840\', \'multiverseId\': 478708}, \'multiverseid\': 478708}, {\'name\': \'力量賦禮\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標生物得+3/+3且獲得延勢異能。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'奈西安樹林從不缺少守衛者。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff286202-025b-4366-9c23-f9d7085cd0fc\', \'multiverseId\': 478962}, \'multiverseid\': 478962}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gallia, unermüdliche Tänzerin\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nAndere Satyrn, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und haben Eile.\\nImmer wenn du mit drei oder mehr Kreaturen angreifst, kannst du eine per Zufall bestimmte Karte abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Satyr\', \'flavor\': \'„Nichts steht so für Erfolg wie Überfluss!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476722&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e952a8d7-08be-4e45-b802-ab06fb66c5c0\', \'multiverseId\': 476722}, \'multiverseid\': 476722}, {\'name\': \'Galia de la Danza Infinita\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nLos otros Sátiros que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y tienen la habilidad de prisa.\\nSiempre que ataques con tres o más criaturas, puedes descartar una carta al azar. Si lo haces, roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡El éxito está en el exceso!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'194afd11-38f7-46ce-8f6a-8b4457e5f3f2\', \'multiverseId\': 476976}, \'multiverseid\': 476976}, {\'name\': \'Galléa de la danse perpétuelle\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nLes autres satyres que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et ont la célérité.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous attaquez avec au moins trois créatures, vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte au hasard. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : satyre\', \'flavor\': "« Le vrai succès, c\'est l\'excès ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477230&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6e53c7e-d924-4d7b-b4e3-c1664c0dd033\', \'multiverseId\': 477230}, \'multiverseid\': 477230}, {\'name\': \'Galya della Danza Interminabile\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nGli altri Satiri che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno rapidità.\\nOgniqualvolta attacchi con tre o più creature, puoi scartare una carta a caso. Se lo fai, pesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Satiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Non c\\\'è successo paragonabile all\\\'eccesso!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa842e63-5929-4823-9577-725f8d5a1bf7\', \'multiverseId\': 477484}, \'multiverseid\': 477484}, {\'name\': \'終わりなき踊りのガリア\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n他の、あなたがコントロールしているサテュロスは、＋１/＋１の修整を受け速攻を持つ。\\nあなたがクリーチャー３体以上で攻撃するたび、あなたはカード１枚を無作為に選んで捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、カードを２枚引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — サテュロス\', \'flavor\': \'「やり過ぎ無くして成功無し！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00da234f-c647-47f4-9a29-2ac00211cc5d\', \'multiverseId\': 477738}, \'multiverseid\': 477738}, {\'name\': \'끝없는 춤의 갈리아\', \'text\': \'신속\\n당신이 조종하는 다른 사티로스들은 +1/+1을 받고 신속을 가진다.\\n당신이 생물 세 개 이상으로 공격할 때마다, 당신은 무작위로 카드 한 장을 버릴 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 사티로스\', \'flavor\': \'"차고 넘치는 것 보다 나은 성공은 없지!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d49caa2-a610-42f0-ae95-19fbd5b8ded1\', \'multiverseId\': 477992}, \'multiverseid\': 477992}, {\'name\': \'Gália da Dança Infinita\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nOs outros Sátiros que você controla recebem +1/+1 e têm ímpeto.\\nToda vez que você ataca com três ou mais criaturas, você pode descartar um card aleatoriamente. Se fizer isso, compre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Não há sucesso como o excesso!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'630b1981-3b4c-48aa-ad66-f9d75b7b197b\', \'multiverseId\': 478246}, \'multiverseid\': 478246}, {\'name\': \'Гэллия Бесконечной Пляски\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\nДругие Сатиры под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 и имеют Ускорение.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы атакуете тремя или более существами, вы можете сбросить карту случайным образом. Если вы это делаете, возьмите две карты.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Сатир\', \'flavor\': \'«Излишества — залог успеха!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'837ee6f6-c368-4f7c-9567-65dac14e3579\', \'multiverseId\': 478500}, \'multiverseid\': 478500}, {\'name\': \'不休欢舞伽利娅\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n由你操控的其他羊蹄人得+1/+1且具有敏捷异能。\\n每当你以三个或更多生物攻击时，你可以随机弃一张牌。若你如此作，则抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～羊蹄人\', \'flavor\': \'「没有最欢乐，只有太欢乐！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4da3c97d-05f5-4b34-abe5-88e323888e97\', \'multiverseId\': 478754}, \'multiverseid\': 478754}, {\'name\': \'不休歡舞伽利婭\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n由你操控的其他羊蹄人得+1/+1且具有敏捷異能。\\n每當你以三個或更多生物攻擊時，你可以隨機棄一張牌。若你如此作，則抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～羊蹄人\', \'flavor\': \'「沒有最歡樂，只有太歡樂！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83fa0e87-ce4e-44f7-90c7-8b74a873c9f1\', \'multiverseId\': 479008}, \'multiverseid\': 479008}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gebieterische Ausstrahlung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und hat Erstschlag und „Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„In jedem von euch schlägt das Herz eines Helden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476512&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21c34131-ba96-4ce6-a19d-a1f121acc3f8\', \'multiverseId\': 476512}, \'multiverseid\': 476512}, {\'name\': \'Presencia de liderazgo\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene la habilidad de dañar primero y "Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado Humano blanca 1/1".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Veo el corazón de un héroe en cada uno de ustedes".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'930f131b-b788-4bd8-bb6b-5a92fbea0a9e\', \'multiverseId\': 476766}, \'multiverseid\': 476766}, {\'name\': \'Présence impérieuse\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et a l\'initiative et « À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat. »", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« En chacun de vous, je vois le cœur d\'un héros. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477020&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3875610-fe6c-4d00-b19d-33bcfd761e15\', \'multiverseId\': 477020}, \'multiverseid\': 477020}, {\'name\': \'Presenza Dominante\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 e ha attacco improvviso e "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crea una pedina creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianca".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"In ognuno di voi vedo il cuore di un eroe."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5afaf2fd-e792-46f1-9ae9-3eb1ab3fc097\', \'multiverseId\': 477274}, \'multiverseid\': 477274}, {\'name\': \'威厳ある存在\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、先制攻撃と「このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「私にはお前たち全員の中にある英雄の心が見える。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec1dfa33-b7e3-4833-9cec-40b74bde9ead\', \'multiverseId\': 477528}, \'multiverseid\': 477528}, {\'name\': \'당당한 풍채\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +2/+2를 받고 선제공격 및 "이 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 1/1 백색 인간 병사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"너희들 모두에게서 영웅의 마음가짐이 보인다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08308854-d825-4c45-8936-40f5071149ff\', \'multiverseId\': 477782}, \'multiverseid\': 477782}, {\'name\': \'Presença Dominante\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e tem iniciativa e "Toda vez que esta criatura causar dano de combate a um jogador, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Humano Soldado."\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Em cada um de vocês eu vejo o coração de um herói."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c692705-e3eb-4ace-9707-f3d09e4968c2\', \'multiverseId\': 478036}, \'multiverseid\': 478036}, {\'name\': \'Присутствие Командира\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2 и имеет Первый удар и способность «Каждый раз, когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Человек Солдат».\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«В каждом из вас я вижу сердце героя».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0991af1a-4c86-46d6-ac80-4771f85a0a13\', \'multiverseId\': 478290}, \'multiverseid\': 478290}, {\'name\': \'指挥存形\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2且具有先攻异能与「每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物。」\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「我看出你们人人都有一颗英勇雄心。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c406e8e-9bf0-4137-9b94-d61cbde67730\', \'multiverseId\': 478544}, \'multiverseid\': 478544}, {\'name\': \'指揮存形\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+2/+2且具有先攻異能與「每當此生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，派出一個1/1白色人類／士兵衍生生物。」\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「我看出你們人人都有一顆英勇雄心。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=478798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c866d67b-9897-4d7c-83ae-988c33797b97\', \'multiverseId\': 478798}, \'multiverseid\': 478798}]', "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=476758&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '290cd4ac-5bdc-44a8-9ae7-b5f1b7f836f4', 'multiverseId': 476758}, 'multiverseid': 476758}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=477012&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5937ad6f-78e4-4d4d-ae93-cdfbf0b6296d', 'multiverseId': 477012}, 'multiverseid': 477012}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flav